#: src/preface.md
msgid ""
"The proxy ecosystem is broad and fragmented. Proxy Wiki exists to document "
"the Chimera projects as one coherent stack and to make their relationships "
"easier to understand."
msgstr ""
"代理生态庞大且较为分散。Proxy Wiki 的目标是将 Chimera 各项目作为一个完整技术"
"栈进行记录，并帮助读者更清晰地理解它们之间的关系。"

#: src/preface.md
msgid ""
"The projects draw inspiration from several established open-source projects:"
msgstr "这些项目借鉴了多个成熟的开源项目："

#: src/preface.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Client` builds on ideas from [clash-rs](https://github.com/ibigbug/"
"clash-rs), with broader Clash/Mihomo-style compatibility as a long-term "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera_Client` 借鉴了 [clash-rs](https://github.com/ibigbug/clash-rs) 的设"
"计思路，并将更广泛的 Clash/Mihomo 风格兼容性作为长期发展方向。"

#: src/preface.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera` is inspired by [clash-nyanpasu](https://github.com/libnyanpasu/"
"clash-nyanpasu), while prioritizing first-class support for the "
"`Chimera_Client` engine and related cores."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera` 受到 [clash-nyanpasu](https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-"
"nyanpasu) 启发，同时优先为 `Chimera_Client` 引擎及相关核心提供一等支持。"

#: src/preface.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Server` explores a Rust server stack influenced by [xray-core]"
"(https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core) and [shoes](https://github.com/cfal/"
"shoes), with xray-core compatibility as a long-term goal."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera_Server` 探索以 Rust 构建服务端技术栈，其设计受到 [xray-core]"
"(https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core) 与 [shoes](https://github.com/cfal/"
"shoes) 的影响，并以兼容 xray-core 作为长期目标。"

#: src/preface.md
msgid ""
"These statements describe project direction, not a guarantee that every "
"upstream feature is already implemented. Current gaps and unresolved "
"compatibility questions are tracked in [Open Questions](./open-questions.md)."
msgstr ""
"以上内容描述的是项目的发展方向，并不表示所有上游功能都已经实现。当前缺口以及"
"尚未解决的兼容性问题记录在 [Open Questions](./open-questions.md) 中。"

