#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"This documentation set covers the Chimera proxy ecosystem as implemented "
"across the local source repositories:"
msgstr "本文档集覆盖本地源码仓库中实际实现的 Chimera 代理生态："

#: src/introduction.md
msgid "`Chimera_Client`: the Rust Clash-family client core."
msgstr "`Chimera_Client`：Rust 实现的 Clash 系客户端核心。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid "`Chimera`: the Tauri + React desktop control application."
msgstr "`Chimera`：基于 Tauri + React 的桌面控制应用。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Service`: the privileged local service used for service-mode core "
"lifecycle and selected privileged operations."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera_Service`：用于服务模式核心生命周期管理及部分特权操作的本地特权服务。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"`AChimera`: the Android application that owns the Android VPN/TUN lifecycle "
"and embeds the Chimera client core through UniFFI."
msgstr ""
"`AChimera`：负责 Android VPN/TUN 生命周期，并通过 UniFFI 嵌入 Chimera 客户端"
"核心的 Android 应用。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Server`: the Rust server core focused on Xray-style inbound "
"configuration, transports, security wrappers, and protocol handlers."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera_Server`：聚焦 Xray 风格入站配置、传输层、安全封装与协议处理器的 "
"Rust 服务端核心。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"These projects target different layers of the system. A configuration or "
"protocol feature should therefore be attributed to the component that "
"actually parses and executes it rather than to the GUI that exposes the "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"这些项目各自面向系统中的不同层级。因此，配置项或协议能力应归属于实际负责解析"
"和执行它的组件，而不是仅提供该设置入口的 GUI。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid "How to Use This Wiki"
msgstr "如何使用本 Wiki"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid "There are three complementary reading paths:"
msgstr "本文档提供三条互补的阅读路径："

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"**Architecture and operators**: start with [System Topology](./system-"
"topology.md), then read the component pages for desktop, Android, service "
"mode, client, and server behavior."
msgstr ""
"**架构与运维**：先阅读[系统拓扑](./system-topology.md)，再查看桌面端、"
"Android、服务模式、客户端和服务端的组件说明。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"**Implementation and compatibility**: use [Implementation Status and Source "
"Evidence](./implementation-status.md) to see which capabilities are parsed, "
"implemented, feature-gated, tested, or explicitly rejected in the current "
"source."
msgstr ""
"**实现与兼容性**：通过[实现状态与源码证据](./implementation-status.md)，查看"
"当前源码中哪些能力仅被解析、已经实现、受构建 feature 控制、经过测试或被明确拒"
"绝。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"**Proxy protocols**: use [Proxy Protocol Reference](./protocol.md) for proxy "
"handshakes, destination requests, wire formats, and TCP/UDP relay semantics. "
"See [Transport Reference](./transport.md) for byte-stream delivery and "
"[Transport Security Reference](./transport-security.md) for TLS/REALITY "
"handshakes; each layer has its own configuration and failure boundaries."
msgstr ""

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"Protocol specification and implementation status are deliberately separate. "
"An upstream protocol can define a field that Chimera does not yet implement, "
"while Chimera can also parse compatibility fields that are not applied by "
"its runtime."
msgstr ""
"协议规范与实现状态在本文档中刻意分开。上游协议可能定义了 Chimera 尚未实现的字"
"段；反过来，Chimera 也可能为了兼容而接受某些字段，但运行时并不会应用它们。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid "Documentation Source Policy"
msgstr "文档来源策略"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"For current implementation claims, this Wiki uses the following evidence "
"order:"
msgstr "描述当前实现情况时，本 Wiki 按以下顺序采信证据："

#: src/introduction.md src/implementation-status.md
msgid "executable/runtime path,"
msgstr "实际执行的运行时路径；"

#: src/introduction.md src/implementation-status.md
msgid "integration or interoperability tests,"
msgstr "集成测试或互操作测试，"

#: src/introduction.md src/implementation-status.md
msgid "typed configuration and validation,"
msgstr "类型化配置及其校验逻辑；"

#: src/introduction.md src/implementation-status.md
msgid "repository README or planning text."
msgstr "仓库 README 或规划说明。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"This prevents a broad README statement such as “Xray compatible” or “Clash "
"compatible” from hiding an explicit runtime rejection or a parsed-only field."
msgstr ""
"这样可以避免 README 中“兼容 Xray”或“兼容 Clash”之类的宽泛表述掩盖运行时明确拒"
"绝的配置，或仅解析但不生效的字段。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"For public protocol wire behavior, protocol specifications, RFCs, and "
"current upstream implementations remain the preferred sources."
msgstr "对于公开协议的线上行为，应优先参考协议规范、RFC 和当前上游实现。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid "Documentation Status"
msgstr "文档状态"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"The low-level protocol reference is mature for the currently documented core "
"protocols, but the wider project documentation is maintained continuously "
"against source changes. The implementation-status page records the audited "
"source snapshot so readers can tell when a capability table may need to be "
"rechecked."
msgstr ""
"当前已记录的核心协议，其底层协议参考已经较为成熟；但更广泛的项目文档仍会持续"
"跟随源码变化维护。实现状态页面记录了审计时的源码快照，便于读者判断能力表何时"
"需要重新核验。"

#: src/introduction.md
msgid ""
"Remaining source-verified documentation and implementation gaps are tracked "
"in [Open Questions](./open-questions.md). That page should contain real "
"unresolved work, not items that have already been answered by the source "
"tree."
msgstr ""
"经源码核实后仍未解决的文档或实现缺口，记录在[待确认问题](./open-questions.md)"
"中。该页面应只保留真正尚待解决的事项，不应继续列出源码已经给出答案的问题。"

#: src/system-topology.md
msgid ""
"The Chimera ecosystem is split across multiple repositories with different "
"runtime responsibilities. The desktop application, Android application, "
"client core, privileged service, and server core are related, but they are "
"not one shared process."
msgstr ""
"Chimera 生态由多个承担不同运行时职责的仓库组成。桌面应用、Android 应用、客户"
"端核心、特权服务和服务端核心彼此相关，但并不运行在同一个共享进程中。"

#: src/system-topology.md
msgid "Ecosystem Overview"
msgstr "生态总览"

#: src/system-topology.md
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    Apps[\"Desktop applications\"] --> Local[\"HTTP / SOCKS / mixed / TUN "
"entry\"]\n"
"    GUI[\"Chimera desktop\"] --> Core[\"Chimera_Client or another selected "
"Clash-family core\"]\n"
"    GUI --> Service[\"Chimera_Service\"]\n"
"    Service --> Core\n"
"    Local --> Core\n"
"\n"
"    AndroidApps[\"Android applications\"] --> ATun[\"Android VpnService / "
"TUN\"]\n"
"    AUI[\"AChimera\"] --> ATun\n"
"    ATun --> UniFFI[\"UniFFI bridge\"]\n"
"    UniFFI --> Embedded[\"embedded Chimera client core\"]\n"
"\n"
"    Core --> Remote[\"Remote proxy endpoint\"]\n"
"    Embedded --> Remote\n"
"    Remote --> Server[\"Chimera_Server or compatible server\"]\n"
"    Server --> Internet[\"Target services / internet\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    Apps[\"桌面应用\"] --> Local[\"HTTP / SOCKS / mixed / TUN 入口\"]\n"
"    GUI[\"Chimera 桌面端\"] --> Core[\"Chimera_Client 或其他选定的 Clash 系核"
"心\"]\n"
"    GUI --> Service[\"Chimera_Service\"]\n"
"    Service --> Core\n"
"    Local --> Core\n"
"\n"
"    AndroidApps[\"Android 应用\"] --> ATun[\"Android VpnService / TUN\"]\n"
"    AUI[\"AChimera\"] --> ATun\n"
"    ATun --> UniFFI[\"UniFFI 桥接\"]\n"
"    UniFFI --> Embedded[\"嵌入式 Chimera 客户端核心\"]\n"
"\n"
"    Core --> Remote[\"远程代理端点\"]\n"
"    Embedded --> Remote\n"
"    Remote --> Server[\"Chimera_Server 或兼容服务端\"]\n"
"    Server --> Internet[\"目标服务 / Internet\"]\n"
"```"

#: src/system-topology.md
