"The current default build enables core/TLS/TUN/port/REALITY functionality, "
"while `anytls`, `shadowsocks`, `trojan`, `hysteria`, and `ws` are separate "
"Cargo features. Documentation must distinguish “implemented in source” from "
"“present in this binary build”."
msgstr ""
"当前默认构建启用 core/TLS/TUN/port/REALITY 功能，而 `anytls`、`shadowsocks`、"
"`trojan`、`hysteria` 和 `ws` 是独立 Cargo feature。文档必须区分“源码中已实现”"
"和“当前二进制实际包含”。"

#: src/implementation-status.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_server_lib/src/config/mod.rs`: protocol and stream-setting schema."
msgstr ""
"`chimera_server_lib/src/config/mod.rs`：协议与 stream setting 配置结构。"

#: src/implementation-status.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_server_lib/src/config/server_config/`: validation and conversion "
"into runtime configuration."
msgstr ""
"`chimera_server_lib/src/config/server_config/`：配置校验以及向运行时配置的转"
"换。"

#: src/implementation-status.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_server_lib/src/beginning/`: socket/QUIC/XHTTP/gRPC transport entry "
"points."
msgstr "`chimera_server_lib/src/beginning/`：socket/QUIC/XHTTP/gRPC 传输入口。"

#: src/implementation-status.md
msgid "`chimera_server_lib/src/handler/`: protocol handlers."
msgstr "`chimera_server_lib/src/handler/`：协议处理器。"

#: src/implementation-status.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_server_lib/Cargo.toml`: feature matrix; the current default is "
"`full`."
msgstr "`chimera_server_lib/Cargo.toml`：feature 矩阵；当前默认是 `full`。"

#: src/implementation-status.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_server_app/tests/`: cross-implementation and matrix E2E coverage."
msgstr "`chimera_server_app/tests/`：跨实现与矩阵 E2E 覆盖。"

#: src/implementation-status.md
msgid ""
"Important explicit rejection points currently include unsupported SOCKS "
"fields, parts of Trojan/VLESS fallback behavior, XHTTP fields, gRPC "
"`multiMode`, HTTPUpgrade compatibility options, non-zero REALITY `xver`, and "
"selected Shadowsocks/Vision modes. These should remain visible in user-"
"facing docs rather than being hidden behind a blanket “Xray compatible” "
"statement."
msgstr ""
"当前重要的明确拒绝项包括：不支持的 SOCKS 字段、部分 Trojan/VLESS fallback 行"
"为、XHTTP 字段、gRPC `multiMode`、HTTPUpgrade 兼容选项、非零 REALITY `xver`，"
"以及部分 Shadowsocks/Vision 模式。用户文档应明确展示这些边界，而不是用一句笼"
"统的“兼容 Xray”掩盖。"

