msgstr "README 中的能力声明不能覆盖源码中明确拒绝字段或仅解析字段的事实。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"This page records **what has actually been exercised by tests**, not merely "
"what the parser or runtime can construct. It complements [Implementation "
"Status and Source Evidence](./implementation-status.md): implementation "
"status answers “does code exist?”, while this page answers “which peer/"
"direction/behavior has test evidence?”."
msgstr ""
"本页记录的是**测试真正覆盖过什么**，而不只是 parser 或 runtime 能构造什么。它"
"与 [实现状态与源码证据](./implementation-status.md) 互补：实现状态回答“代码是"
"否存在”，本页回答“哪个对端/方向/行为已有测试证据”。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"The matrix was audited from the current local `Chimera_Client` and "
"`Chimera_Server` source trees. Test names are deliberately included because "
"capability names are not always visible in filenames: several important "
"protocol interoperability cases live inside a shared "
"`xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs` suite."
msgstr ""
"该矩阵基于当前本地 `Chimera_Client` 与 `Chimera_Server` 源码树审计。这里刻意"
"记录测试名，因为能力名称并不总能从文件名看出来：多个重要协议互操作场景都位于"
"共享的 `xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs` 测试套件中。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Evidence Classes"
msgstr "证据分类"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "类别"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Unit"
msgstr "单元测试"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Exercises a parser, codec, state transition, or handler in-process."
msgstr "在进程内测试 parser、codec、状态迁移或 handler。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Self-integration"
msgstr "自集成"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"Starts Chimera components/instances on both sides without an independent "
"peer implementation."
msgstr "两端都启动 Chimera 组件/实例，不使用独立的第三方对端实现。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Cross-project"
msgstr "跨项目"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"Exercises two different Chimera repositories together, such as Chimera "
"Client → Chimera Server."
msgstr ""
"联合测试两个不同的 Chimera 仓库，例如 Chimera Client → Chimera Server。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "External interoperability"
msgstr "外部互操作"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Exercises Chimera against an independent implementation such as Xray."
msgstr "让 Chimera 与 Xray 等独立实现进行实际互操作测试。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Negative interoperability"
msgstr "负向互操作"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"Verifies expected rejection/fallback/failure against a real peer or full "
"process stack."
msgstr "针对真实对端或完整进程栈验证预期的拒绝、fallback 或失败行为。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Example/build validation"
msgstr "示例/构建验证"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"Proves a configuration example parses/builds, but does not prove network "
"interoperability."
msgstr "证明配置示例可以解析/构建，但不能证明网络互操作性。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"These levels are cumulative only when the specific path is actually covered. "
"A protocol with an external TCP test does not automatically have external "
"UDP, TLS, fallback, multiplexing, or every cipher/transport variant tested."
msgstr ""
"只有具体路径真正被覆盖时，这些等级才可以累积。某协议有外部 TCP 测试，并不意味"
"着 UDP、TLS、fallback、多路复用或所有密码算法/传输变体也都完成了外部测试。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "Default Tests vs Explicit E2E"
msgstr "默认测试与显式 E2E"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"Many `Chimera_Server` process-level interoperability tests carry `#[ignore]` "
"because they launch Chimera and another binary such as Xray. This means:"
msgstr ""
"许多 `Chimera_Server` 进程级互操作测试带有 `#[ignore]`，因为它们会启动 "
"Chimera 和 Xray 等另一个二进制。这意味着："

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "the test is real executable interoperability evidence;"
msgstr "该测试是真实可执行的互操作证据；"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid "it is not necessarily part of the default fast `cargo test` run;"
msgstr "它不一定属于默认的快速 `cargo test` 运行范围；"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"maintainers must run the ignored suite explicitly when changing the covered "
"protocol path."
msgstr "修改其覆盖的协议路径时，维护者必须显式运行 ignored 测试套件。"

#: src/test-evidence.md
msgid ""
"Do not translate “ignored” into “not useful” or “not implemented”. It means "
"the test belongs to an explicit, slower/environment-dependent verification "
"tier."
msgstr ""
"不要把“ignored”理解为“没用”或“未实现”。它表示该测试属于需要显式执行、速度更慢"
"或依赖环境的验证层级。"

