#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Proxy failures become much easier to diagnose when the Chimera stack is "
"treated as a sequence of independently testable layers. Do not start by "
"changing UUIDs, DNS, TLS fingerprints, routes, and transport modes at the "
"same time. First identify the **first layer that is observably wrong**."
msgstr ""
"把 Chimera 协议栈视为一系列可以独立验证的层次后，代理故障会更容易定位。不要一"
"开始就同时修改 UUID、DNS、TLS fingerprint、路由和传输模式；应先找出**第一处能"
"够观察到异常的层**。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "The practical path is:"
msgstr "实际数据路径为："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"A failure at one layer often produces symptoms in the layer above it. The "
"goal of this page is to stop at the first failing boundary instead of "
"debugging every layer at once."
msgstr ""
"某一层的故障经常会在上一层表现出症状。本页的目标是在第一处失败边界停下来，而"
"不是同时排查所有层。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"For implementation claims and concrete interoperability tests, use "
"[Implementation Status and Source Evidence](./implementation-status.md) and "
