msgstr "“代理不能用”还不是有用的诊断结论。先把它归入上表中的某一行。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Step 0: Validate Configuration Before Network Debugging"
msgstr "步骤 0：网络排障前先验证配置"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"A process that rejected configuration has no meaningful network path to "
"debug."
msgstr "如果进程已经拒绝配置，就没有值得继续排查的网络路径。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "For `Chimera_Server`, the current CLI has a validation-only mode:"
msgstr "对于 `Chimera_Server`，当前 CLI 提供只验证配置的模式："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"A successful check exits without starting the server. Validation can catch "
"unsupported fields such as Server gRPC `multiMode`, HTTPUpgrade "
"`acceptProxyProtocol`/`ed`, unsupported XHTTP fields, non-zero REALITY "
"`xver`, and other builder-level restrictions before any packet is sent."
msgstr ""
"验证成功后会直接退出而不启动服务端。这样可以在发送任何数据包前发现 Server "
"gRPC `multiMode`、HTTPUpgrade `acceptProxyProtocol`/`ed`、未支持的 XHTTP 字"
"段、非零 REALITY `xver` 等 builder 层限制。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "For `Chimera_Client`, distinguish these cases:"
msgstr "对于 `Chimera_Client`，应区分以下情况："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "YAML parses;"
msgstr "YAML 可以解析；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "the outbound/listener is constructible in the current build;"
msgstr "当前构建能够创建对应 outbound/listener；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "the required Cargo feature was compiled;"
msgstr "所需 Cargo feature 已编译；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "runtime initialization succeeds."
msgstr "运行时初始化成功。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"A field being accepted by serde does not prove that it is active runtime "
"behavior. AnyTLS currently has explicit Parsed-only compatibility fields, "
"and several Server Xray-shaped fields are deliberately rejected rather than "
"silently applied."
msgstr ""
"字段能被 serde 接受并不能证明它真正影响运行时。AnyTLS 当前有明确的 Parsed-"
"only 兼容字段，而 Server 中若干 Xray 风格字段会被主动拒绝，而不是静默应用。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Step 1: Prove the Local Ingress"
msgstr "步骤 1：先证明本地入口可用"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Before debugging a remote protocol, prove that the application can reach the "
"local Client ingress."
msgstr "排查远程协议前，先证明应用确实能够访问本地 Client 入口。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"For a SOCKS listener, test the exact listener address/port configured in the "
"active runtime. A useful external check is:"
msgstr ""
"对于 SOCKS listener，应测试当前运行时实际配置的 listener 地址/端口。一个有用"
"的外部检查方式是："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "For an HTTP proxy listener:"
msgstr "对于 HTTP proxy listener："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Use the actual configured ports rather than assuming Clash-family defaults."
msgstr "使用真实配置端口，不要假定 Clash 系默认端口。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "If the connection is refused, stay at the listener layer. Check:"
msgstr "如果连接被拒绝，就停留在 listener 层排查。检查："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "whether the current binary contains the required inbound feature;"
msgstr "当前二进制是否包含所需 inbound feature；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "whether another process already owns the port;"
msgstr "端口是否已被其他进程占用；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "whether the listener bound loopback, LAN, IPv4, or IPv6 as expected;"
msgstr "listener 是否按预期绑定 loopback、LAN、IPv4 或 IPv6；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "source-address/allow-LAN policy;"
msgstr "来源地址 / allow-LAN 策略；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "listener startup logs."
msgstr "listener 启动日志。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Current Client logs include messages such as `tcp listen failed`, `udp "
"listen failed`, listener stopped warnings, and source-address rejection. Do "
"not move to TLS or remote authentication until the local listener is "
"demonstrably reachable."
msgstr ""
"当前 Client 日志包含 `tcp listen failed`、`udp listen failed`、listener "
"stopped 警告以及来源地址拒绝等信息。在本地 listener 已经明确可达之前，不要继"
"续排查 TLS 或远程认证。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Step 2: Use the Chimera_Client Controller as an Observation Point"
msgstr "步骤 2：把 Chimera_Client Controller 作为观测点"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"When the Client controller is enabled, it is a much better observation point "
"than guessing from an application timeout."
msgstr "启用 Client controller 后，它比根据应用超时进行猜测更适合作为观测点。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "The current Client exposes controller surfaces including:"
msgstr "当前 Client 暴露的 controller 接口包括："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The TCP controller uses bearer-token authentication when a secret is "
"configured:"
msgstr "配置 secret 后，TCP controller 使用 bearer token 认证："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The current Client refuses an unsafe non-loopback TCP API configuration "
"without a secret, and also requires valid CORS origins for a non-loopback "
"API listener."
msgstr ""
"当前 Client 会拒绝没有 secret 的不安全非 loopback TCP API 配置，并要求非 "
"loopback API listener 配置有效的 CORS origin。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Useful questions are:"
msgstr "有价值的问题包括："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Does `/connections` show the application flow?"
msgstr "`/connections` 中是否能看到应用流量？"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Which proxy chain/group was selected?"
msgstr "实际选择了哪个代理链/group？"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Does `/proxies` show the expected selector state?"
msgstr "`/proxies` 是否显示预期的 selector 状态？"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Does `/configs` reflect the runtime configuration you think is active?"
msgstr "`/configs` 是否反映了你认为正在生效的运行时配置？"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Does `/dns/query` resolve the same name the application is using?"
msgstr "`/dns/query` 是否解析了应用实际使用的同一个名称？"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Do `/traffic` or connection counters move when the application sends data?"
msgstr "应用发送数据时，`/traffic` 或连接计数器是否发生变化？"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "What is the first warning/error on `/logs`?"
msgstr "`/logs` 中出现的第一条 warning/error 是什么？"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"If no connection appears at all, debug ingress. If a connection appears with "
"the wrong chain, debug DNS/rules/group selection. If the right chain appears "
"and then fails, move outward to the outbound/transport layer."
msgstr ""
"如果完全没有连接出现，就排查入口；如果连接出现但代理链错误，就排查 DNS/规则/"
"group 选择；如果代理链正确但随后失败，再向外排查 outbound/transport 层。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Step 3: Separate DNS from Rule Selection"
msgstr "步骤 3：把 DNS 与规则选择分开"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "DNS and routing are related but not interchangeable."
msgstr "DNS 与路由相关，但不能互相替代。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "A rule can behave differently depending on whether the Client sees:"
msgstr "规则行为可能取决于 Client 实际看到的是："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "the original domain name;"
msgstr "原始域名；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "a locally resolved IP;"
msgstr "本地解析得到的 IP；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "a Fake-IP address that can be reverse-mapped;"
msgstr "可以反向映射的 Fake-IP 地址；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "a failed/no DNS result."
msgstr "DNS 失败或没有结果。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Current Client logs have explicit paths for `failed to resolve destination` "
"and failed Fake-IP reverse lookup. Use the controller DNS query surface and "
"the DNS module page before blaming the remote protocol."
msgstr ""
"当前 Client 日志对 `failed to resolve destination` 和 Fake-IP 反向查找失败都"
"有明确路径。在怀疑远程协议之前，应先使用 controller DNS query 接口和 DNS 模块"
"页面。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "A useful isolation sequence is:"
msgstr "一个有用的隔离顺序是："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "resolve the destination through the Client's configured resolver path;"
msgstr "通过 Client 已配置的 resolver 路径解析目标；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "confirm the expected domain/IP reaches the rule engine;"
msgstr "确认预期域名/IP 到达规则引擎；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "confirm the selected rule and proxy group;"
msgstr "确认实际选择的规则和 proxy group；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "only then inspect the remote dial."
msgstr "之后才检查远程 dial。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"If a profile works with a literal IP but not a domain, that is strong "
"evidence to inspect DNS/rule behavior before protocol cryptography."
msgstr ""
"如果配置使用字面 IP 能工作、使用域名却失败，这是一个很强的信号：应先排查 DNS/"
"规则行为，再排查协议密码学。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"See [DNS Module](./chimera_client/dns.md) and [Rule Types and Their Effects]"
"(./chimera_client/rules.md)."
msgstr ""
"参见 [DNS 模块](./chimera_client/dns.md) 和 [规则类型及其效果](./"
"chimera_client/rules.md)。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Step 4: Confirm the Outbound Exists in This Binary"
msgstr "步骤 4：确认该 Outbound 确实存在于当前二进制"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"A common source of confusion is documentation/source support versus artifact "
"support."
msgstr "一个常见混淆点是“文档/源码支持”与“当前构建产物支持”之间的区别。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Current `Chimera_Client` source contains optional features such as:"
msgstr "当前 `Chimera_Client` 源码包含以下可选 feature："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"These are not all part of the default feature set. A valid profile can "
"therefore fail during handler construction when the distributed/local binary "
"was built without the required feature."
msgstr ""
"它们并非全部属于默认 feature 集。因此即便 profile 合法，如果发布/本地二进制没"
"有编译所需 feature，也可能在 handler 构造阶段失败。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Client outbound-manager logs identify failures such as:"
msgstr "Client outbound manager 日志会标识以下类型的失败："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Before packet capture, confirm the expected handler was actually "
"constructed. See [Chimera_Client](./chimera_client.md) for the current "
"feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"抓包之前，先确认预期 handler 确实已经构造成功。当前 feature 矩阵见 "
"[Chimera_Client](./chimera_client.md)。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Step 5: Prove Remote TCP/UDP Reachability Before Protocol Parsing"
msgstr "步骤 5：协议解析前先证明远程 TCP/UDP 可达"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"For TCP-based transports, determine whether a TCP connection to the remote "
"listener can be established at all."
msgstr "对于基于 TCP 的传输，先确定是否真的能与远程 listener 建立 TCP 连接。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"If SYN packets receive no response, proxy credentials are irrelevant. Check:"
msgstr "如果 SYN 包没有收到响应，代理凭据还没有意义。应检查："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "server process/listener state;"
msgstr "服务端进程/listener 状态；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "destination IP/port;"
msgstr "目标 IP/端口；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "local and server firewall;"
msgstr "本地和服务端 firewall；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "NAT/port forwarding;"
msgstr "NAT/端口转发；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "IPv4/IPv6 selection;"
msgstr "IPv4/IPv6 选择；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "cloud/security-group policy;"
msgstr "云平台/security-group 策略；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "routing to the server."
msgstr "到服务端的路由。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"On the Server, listener-level failures appear before protocol handlers. "
"Current Server logs include `Accept failed`, `TCP server stopped with "
"error`, `UDP server stopped with error`, `xhttp accept failed`, and `gRPC "
"transport accept failed`."
msgstr ""
"在 Server 上，listener 层失败发生在协议 handler 之前。当前 Server 日志包括 "
"`Accept failed`、`TCP server stopped with error`、`UDP server stopped with "
"error`、`xhttp accept failed` 和 `gRPC transport accept failed`。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"For QUIC protocols such as Hysteria 2 and TUIC, a successful TCP check on "
"the same port proves nothing about UDP reachability. Test the actual UDP "
"path and inspect both directions in a packet capture."
msgstr ""
"对于 Hysteria 2、TUIC 等 QUIC 协议，同一端口的 TCP 检查成功并不能证明 UDP 可"
"达。应测试真实 UDP 路径，并在抓包中检查双向流量。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Step 6: Split Security Handshake from Proxy Protocol Handshake"
msgstr "步骤 6：把安全握手与代理协议握手分开"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"TLS/REALITY success and proxy authentication success are distinct events."
msgstr "TLS/REALITY 成功与代理认证成功是两个独立事件。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "For TLS-based stacks, validate:"
msgstr "对于基于 TLS 的协议栈，应验证："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "SNI/server name;"
msgstr "SNI/server name；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "certificate chain/trust or intentional private CA;"
msgstr "证书链/信任，或有意使用的私有 CA；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"ALPN required by the transport (`h2` for the current Server gRPC/TLS path);"
msgstr "传输所要求的 ALPN（当前 Server gRPC/TLS 路径为 `h2`）；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "client certificate/key when mTLS is configured;"
msgstr "配置 mTLS 时的客户端证书/私钥；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "system clock where protocol/security checks depend on time."
msgstr "协议/安全检查依赖时间时的系统时钟。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "For REALITY, additionally verify:"
msgstr "对于 REALITY，还应额外验证："

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "public/private key pair;"
msgstr "公钥/私钥对；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "short ID;"
msgstr "short ID；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "accepted server name;"
msgstr "允许的 server name；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "client version bounds when configured;"
msgstr "配置后生效的客户端版本边界；"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "VLESS UUID/flow separately from the REALITY handshake."
msgstr "把 VLESS UUID/flow 与 REALITY 握手分开检查。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The Server test suite intentionally contains cases where REALITY/transport "
"state and VLESS account/flow state fail independently. Treat them as "
"separate layers in logs and captures."
msgstr ""
"Server 测试套件刻意包含 REALITY/传输状态与 VLESS 账户/flow 状态独立失败的场"
"景。日志和抓包分析中也应把它们视为不同层。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"See [REALITY](./transport-security/reality.md) and [Test Evidence and "
"Interoperability Matrix](./test-evidence.md)."
msgstr ""
"参见 [REALITY](./transport-security/reality.md) 和 [测试证据与互操作矩阵](./"
"test-evidence.md)。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Step 7: Validate the Transport Wrapper"
msgstr "步骤 7：验证传输封装"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"A transport can fail after TCP/TLS succeeds but before the inner proxy "
"parser sees a byte."
msgstr ""
"传输层可能在 TCP/TLS 已成功、但内层代理 parser 尚未看到任何字节之前失败。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Check mode, path, Host, session/sequence placement, upload method, data "
"placement, padding metadata, body/header size limits, and whether the "
"configured field is actually implemented by the Server."
msgstr ""
"检查 mode、path、Host、session/sequence 放置、upload method、data placement、"
"padding 元数据、body/header 大小限制，以及所配置字段是否真的被 Server 实现。"

