#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"A `grpc-status: 12` response usually means method/path/content-type "
"mismatch. Do not use management-gRPC API tests or endpoints to diagnose the "
"proxy gRPC transport; they are separate subsystems."
msgstr ""
"`grpc-status: 12` 通常意味着 method/path/content-type 不匹配。不要使用管理 "
"gRPC API 的测试或 endpoint 排查代理 gRPC 传输；它们是不同子系统。"

