msgstr "参见 [gRPC 传输](./transports/grpc-transport.md)。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The current Server expects HTTP/1.1 `GET`, matching path/optional Host, "
"`Connection: Upgrade`, and `Upgrade: websocket`, then returns `101` and "
"switches to a **raw byte stream**."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 要求 HTTP/1.1 `GET`、匹配的 path/可选 Host、`Connection: "
"Upgrade` 和 `Upgrade: websocket`，随后返回 `101` 并切换到**原始字节流**。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Do not apply WebSocket data framing after `101`. That mistake makes the "
"transport handshake look successful while the inner proxy parser receives "
"invalid bytes."
msgstr ""
"`101` 之后不要继续应用 WebSocket 数据分帧。否则传输握手表面看似成功，内层代"
"理 parser 实际却会收到无效字节。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "See [HTTPUpgrade Transport](./transports/httpupgrade.md)."
msgstr "参见 [HTTPUpgrade 传输](./transports/httpupgrade.md)。"

#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"WebSocket is a different transport. After its HTTP upgrade it still has "
"WebSocket frame boundaries, opcodes, masking rules, control frames, and "
"close semantics. Keep it separate from HTTPUpgrade in packet analysis."
msgstr ""
"WebSocket 是另一种传输。完成 HTTP upgrade 后，它仍然具有 WebSocket frame 边"
"界、opcode、masking 规则、控制帧和关闭语义。抓包分析时必须与 HTTPUpgrade 区"
"分。"

