#: src/troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"For encrypted transports, packet capture proves reachability, direction, "
"timing, retransmissions, close/reset behavior, and ciphertext sizes unless "
"you have session keys or in-process traces. Do not claim a UUID/password/"
"address is wrong merely because encrypted bytes are opaque."
