msgstr "QUIC/Hysteria 2 出站实现。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"VMess, TUIC, WireGuard, and SSH are not variants of the current outbound "
"enum. They must not be documented as current `Chimera_Client` outbound "
"capabilities until a runtime path actually exists."
msgstr ""
"VMess、TUIC、WireGuard 与 SSH 当前都不是出站枚举的变体。在真实运行时路径出现"
"之前，不应把它们写成 `Chimera_Client` 当前出站能力。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Current Local Inbound Surface"
msgstr "当前本地入站能力"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"The client also contains local inbound implementations, which are a "
"different capability from remote outbounds:"
msgstr "客户端还包含本地入站实现；这与远程出站是不同的能力维度："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "HTTP proxy inbound,"
msgstr "HTTP 代理入站，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "SOCKS inbound,"
msgstr "SOCKS 入站，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "mixed HTTP/SOCKS listener,"
msgstr "mixed HTTP/SOCKS 监听器，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Shadowsocks inbound behind `shadowsocks`,"
msgstr "由 `shadowsocks` feature 控制的 Shadowsocks 入站，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "AnyTLS inbound behind `anytls`,"
msgstr "由 `anytls` feature 控制的 AnyTLS 入站，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"TUN, redir, and TProxy paths according to Cargo features and platform "
"support."
msgstr "依据 Cargo feature 与平台支持提供 TUN、redir 和 TProxy 路径。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Known boundaries should be stated explicitly:"
msgstr "已知边界应明确写出："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "the current SOCKS inbound path reports UDP as unsupported,"
msgstr "当前 SOCKS 入站路径会报告 UDP 不支持，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "the mixed inbound path reports UDP as unsupported,"
msgstr "mixed 入站路径会报告 UDP 不支持，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"a protocol being implemented behind a Cargo feature does not mean it is "
"present in the default binary."
msgstr "某协议存在于 Cargo feature 后并不意味着默认二进制一定包含它。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Default Build vs Optional Features"
msgstr "默认构建与可选 Feature"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "The current default feature set enables:"
msgstr "当前默认 feature 集启用："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "`zero_copy`,"
msgstr "`zero_copy`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md src/chimera_server.md
msgid "`tls`,"
msgstr "`tls`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "`aws-lc-rs`,"
msgstr "`aws-lc-rs`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "`tun`,"
msgstr "`tun`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "`port`,"
msgstr "`port`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md src/chimera_server.md
msgid "`reality`,"
msgstr "`reality`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "`extended-health-check`."
msgstr "`extended-health-check`。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "The following protocol/transport implementations are separate features:"
msgstr "以下协议/传输实现是独立 feature："

#: src/chimera_client.md src/chimera_server.md
msgid "`ws`,"
msgstr "`ws`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "`anytls`,"
msgstr "`anytls`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md src/chimera_server.md
msgid "`shadowsocks`,"
msgstr "`shadowsocks`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md src/chimera_server.md
msgid "`trojan`,"
msgstr "`trojan`，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "`hysteria`."
msgstr "`hysteria`。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"This distinction matters operationally. A profile can be syntactically valid "
"for the project while a particular binary was built without the feature "
"needed to instantiate its handler."
msgstr ""
"这一差异在实际运行中很重要。某份配置可能在语法上对项目有效，但具体二进制可能"
"没有编译构造对应处理器所需的 feature。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Parsed Compatibility Is Not Runtime Support"
msgstr "可解析兼容性不等于运行时支持"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Some configuration fields intentionally exist only to accept ecosystem "
"configuration shapes. The AnyTLS configuration is a concrete example: "
"several fields are annotated in source as parsed for compatibility but "
"currently not applied by the runtime."
msgstr ""
"部分配置字段刻意只用于接受生态中的配置格式。AnyTLS 是一个明确例子：源码中若干"
"字段被标注为仅为兼容而解析，当前运行时并不会应用。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Documentation should therefore distinguish:"
msgstr "因此文档应区分："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Parsed** — serde accepts the field,"
msgstr "**Parsed** — serde 接受该字段，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Constructed** — a handler can be built,"
msgstr "**Constructed** — 能够构造处理器，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Implemented** — a forwarding path uses it,"
msgstr "**Implemented** — 转发路径真正使用它，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Tested** — integration or interoperability tests exercise it."
msgstr "**Tested** — 集成或互操作测试实际覆盖它。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Do not infer level 3 or 4 from level 1."
msgstr "不要从第 1 级直接推断第 3 或第 4 级。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Architecture Overview"
msgstr "架构概览"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Internally, the client is organized into four broad layers:"
msgstr "客户端内部大体分为四层："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Configuration layer**"
msgstr "**配置层**"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Parses Clash-style YAML into typed Rust structures."
msgstr "将 Clash 风格 YAML 解析为类型化的 Rust 结构。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Applies defaults and validation."
msgstr "应用默认值并执行校验。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Converts external configuration into runtime-specific forms."
msgstr "把外部配置转换为运行时内部形式。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Inbound/controller layer**"
msgstr "**入站 / 控制层**"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Owns local proxy listeners and TUN/transparent-entry paths."
msgstr "负责本地代理监听器以及 TUN/透明入口路径。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Exposes management APIs for status, switching, traffic, and diagnostics."
msgstr "提供状态、切换、流量与诊断管理 API。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Policy and DNS layer**"
msgstr "**策略与 DNS 层**"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Evaluates rules with first-match semantics."
msgstr "按首个匹配规则语义进行规则判定。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Provides system/enhanced DNS paths, Fake-IP behavior, resolver policy, and "
"DNS-rule dispatch hooks."
msgstr ""
"提供系统/增强 DNS 路径、Fake-IP 行为、解析器策略以及 DNS 规则分发钩子。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Outbound/transport layer**"
msgstr "**出站/传输层**"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Selects the outbound handler."
msgstr "选择出站处理器。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Applies transport/security wrappers such as WebSocket, XHTTP, TLS, and "
"REALITY where the selected protocol supports them."
msgstr "在所选协议支持时应用 WebSocket、XHTTP、TLS、REALITY 等传输/安全封装。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Executes protocol handshakes and forwarding."
msgstr "执行协议握手与转发。"

#: src/chimera_client.md src/protocols/hysteria2.md
#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "A useful mental model is:"
msgstr "可以用下面的模型来理解："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "VLESS as a Current Client Capability"
msgstr "VLESS 作为当前客户端能力"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"VLESS is a current outbound, not merely a planned target. The source "
"contains configuration fields for `network`, XHTTP options, REALITY options, "
"`flow`, client fingerprint, TLS settings, and UDP behavior, together with "
"concrete VLESS stream/datagram and Vision modules."
msgstr ""
"VLESS 是当前已经存在的出站，而不只是规划目标。源码包含 `network`、XHTTP 选"
"项、REALITY 选项、`flow`、客户端指纹、TLS 设置和 UDP 行为等配置字段，并有具体"
"的 VLESS stream/datagram 与 Vision 模块。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"When documenting a VLESS combination, keep the layers separate. For example:"
