#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Module Guide"
msgstr "模块指南"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"**Ports and listeners**: key mapping and local inbound support. See [Ports "
"and Listeners](./chimera_client/ports.md)."
msgstr ""
"**端口与监听器**：键映射和本地入站支持。参阅 [Ports and Listeners](./"
"chimera_client/ports.md)。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"**DNS module**: Fake-IP vs real-IP models, resolver policy, and "
"implementation status. See [DNS Module](./chimera_client/dns.md)."
msgstr ""
"**DNS 模块**：Fake-IP 与 real-IP 模型、解析器策略和实现状态。参阅 [DNS "
"Module](./chimera_client/dns.md)。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"**TUN module**: route-all/split-route semantics and platform considerations. "
"See [Tun Module](./chimera_client/tun.md)."
msgstr ""
"**TUN 模块**：全路由/分流语义及平台注意事项。参阅 [Tun Module](./"
"chimera_client/tun.md)。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"**Rules module**: rule taxonomy, ordering, and provider-based policy. See "
"[Rule Types and Their Effects](./chimera_client/rules.md)."
msgstr ""
"**规则模块**：规则分类、顺序以及基于 provider 的策略。参阅 [Rule Types and "
"Their Effects](./chimera_client/rules.md)。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Relationship to Clash-rs and Mihomo"
msgstr "与 Clash-rs 和 Mihomo 的关系"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"`clash-rs` and Mihomo remain important compatibility references, but they "
"are not proof that an option is implemented in `Chimera_Client`."
msgstr ""
"`clash-rs` 和 Mihomo 仍是重要兼容性参考，但不能证明某个选项已经在 "
"`Chimera_Client` 中实现。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**clash-rs** is a useful Rust architectural/configuration reference."
msgstr "**clash-rs** 是有价值的 Rust 架构/配置参考。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Mihomo** is a broad ecosystem compatibility reference."
msgstr "**Mihomo** 是覆盖较广的生态兼容性参考。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"**Chimera_Client source and tests** determine what the current Chimera "
"binary can actually do."
msgstr ""
"**Chimera_Client 的源码与测试** 才决定当前 Chimera 二进制实际能做什么。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Migration documentation should explicitly call out fields that are parsed-"
"only, feature-gated, rejected, or behaviorally different."
msgstr ""
"迁移文档应明确标出仅解析字段、受 feature 控制的字段、被拒绝的字段以及行为存在"
"差异的字段。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Deployment Guidance"
msgstr "部署建议"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "For a new deployment:"
msgstr "对于新部署："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "confirm the binary was built with the required Cargo features,"
msgstr "确认二进制启用了所需 Cargo feature，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "validate the profile,"
msgstr "校验配置档案，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "start with a local HTTP/SOCKS listener before adding TUN,"
msgstr "先从本地 HTTP/SOCKS 监听器开始，再加入 TUN，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "verify DNS/rule behavior,"
msgstr "验证 DNS/规则行为，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "add the remote protocol and transport/security layers one at a time,"
msgstr "逐层加入远程协议与传输/安全层，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "use integration/interop-tested combinations where possible."
msgstr "尽量使用已有集成/互操作测试覆盖的组合。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"For CI, keep both a minimal profile and profiles that exercise the optional "
"features enabled by the produced artifact."
msgstr "对于 CI，应同时保留最小配置，以及覆盖产物中已启用可选 feature 的配置。"

