#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Listeners define how local applications and operating-system traffic enter "
"`chimera_client`. They are the first boundary between an application and the "
"proxy core, so listener selection should be treated separately from outbound "
"protocol selection."
msgstr ""
"监听器决定本地应用和操作系统流量如何进入 `chimera_client`。它们是应用与代理核"
"心之间的第一层边界，因此监听器选择应与出站协议选择分开考虑。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"For most deployments, start with an application-level listener such as "
"SOCKS5 or HTTP before enabling transparent or TUN-based capture."
msgstr ""
"对于大多数部署，建议先从 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 这类应用层监听器开始，再启用透明代理"
"或基于 TUN 的流量捕获。"

