msgstr "通常与增强 DNS 或 TUN 配合使用"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Availability can depend on build features, platform support, and the exact "
"`chimera_client` revision. A configuration key being accepted does not by "
"itself guarantee that the corresponding runtime path is enabled."
msgstr ""
"具体能力是否可用可能取决于编译 feature、平台支持以及 `chimera_client` 的具体"
"版本。某个配置键能够被解析，并不代表对应的运行时路径一定已经启用。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Listener Selection"
msgstr "监听器选择"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5 is the safest starting point when validating a new profile. It does "
"not require route changes and is supported by a wide range of applications."
msgstr ""
"验证新配置时，SOCKS5 通常是最稳妥的起点。它不需要修改系统路由，而且受到大量应"
"用支持。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "bind_address"
msgstr "bind_address"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/protocols/socks5.md
#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "\"127.0.0.1\""
msgstr "\"127.0.0.1\""

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "allow_lan"
msgstr "allow_lan"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "socks_port"
msgstr "socks_port"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Use SOCKS5 first when you want to separate proxy-core behavior from "
"operating system routing and DNS interception issues."
msgstr ""
"如果希望把代理核心本身的问题与操作系统路由、DNS 拦截问题区分开，建议优先使用 "
"SOCKS5。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"The currently audited Client SOCKS inbound does **not** provide a complete "
"UDP ASSOCIATE relay path: UDP requests on this local inbound currently "
"return unsupported. Do not infer local SOCKS UDP support from the existence "
"of SOCKS outbound UDP handling elsewhere in the codebase."
msgstr ""
"当前审计的 Client SOCKS 入站**尚未**提供完整的 UDP ASSOCIATE 中继路径：该本地"
"入站收到 UDP 请求时会返回“不支持”。不能因为代码库其他位置存在 SOCKS 出站 UDP "
"处理，就推断本地 SOCKS 入站支持 UDP。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/protocols/http.md
msgid "HTTP Proxy"
msgstr "HTTP 代理"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"An HTTP proxy listener is convenient for browsers and operating-system proxy "
"settings. HTTPS traffic normally enters through HTTP `CONNECT` tunneling."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 代理监听器适合浏览器和操作系统代理设置。HTTPS 流量通常通过 HTTP "
"`CONNECT` 隧道进入代理核心。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vless.md
