msgid "port"
msgstr "port"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Mixed Listener"
msgstr "Mixed 监听器"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"A mixed listener accepts both HTTP-proxy and SOCKS-style clients on one "
"port. It is useful for desktop setups where exposing a single endpoint is "
"simpler than managing separate HTTP and SOCKS ports."
msgstr ""
"Mixed 监听器可以在同一个端口同时接受 HTTP 代理和 SOCKS 风格客户端连接。对于桌"
"面环境，如果暴露单一端点比同时管理 HTTP 与 SOCKS 端口更简单，这种模式会很方"
"便。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "mixed-port"
msgstr "mixed-port"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"The currently audited mixed listener is likewise a TCP-focused local entry "
"for HTTP/SOCKS use; its UDP path is explicitly unsupported. Use the protocol/"
"status matrix when a deployment requires local UDP ingress rather than "
"assuming a mixed port provides SOCKS UDP parity."
msgstr ""
"当前审计的 mixed 监听器同样是面向 HTTP/SOCKS 的 TCP 本地入口；其 UDP 路径明确"
"不受支持。部署需要本地 UDP 入站时，请参考协议/状态矩阵，不要默认 mixed 端口具"
"备与 SOCKS UDP 相同的能力。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Transparent Listeners"
msgstr "透明代理监听器"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"`redir-port` and `tproxy-port` are intended for routing-level interception, "
"primarily on Linux. They should not be treated as drop-in replacements for "
"SOCKS5 or HTTP listeners."
msgstr ""
"`redir-port` 和 `tproxy-port` 面向路由层流量拦截，主要用于 Linux。它们不应被"
"视为 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 监听器的直接替代品。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Transparent proxying normally also requires:"
msgstr "透明代理通常还需要："

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "firewall rules,"
msgstr "防火墙规则；"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "loop-prevention rules,"
msgstr "防止代理环路的规则；"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "policy routing for TProxy deployments,"
msgstr "TProxy 部署所需的策略路由；"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"and a DNS strategy that preserves enough domain information for rule "
"matching."
msgstr "以及能够保留足够域名信息用于规则匹配的 DNS 策略。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "For host-wide interception, also see [Tun Module](./tun.md)."
msgstr "如果需要主机级全局流量拦截，另请参阅 [TUN 模块](./tun.md)。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Controller and DNS Bindings"
msgstr "Controller 与 DNS 绑定"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Management and DNS listeners deserve stricter exposure rules than ordinary "
"local proxy listeners."
msgstr "管理接口和 DNS 监听器应采用比普通本地代理监听器更严格的暴露策略。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "During development, prefer loopback-only bindings:"
msgstr "开发阶段建议只绑定到回环地址："

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "external-controller"
msgstr "external-controller"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "127.0.0.1:9090"
msgstr "127.0.0.1:9090"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "dns"
msgstr "dns"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/chimera_client/dns.md
#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "enable"
msgstr "enable"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "listen"
msgstr "listen"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "127.0.0.1:1053"
msgstr "127.0.0.1:1053"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Do not expose the controller or DNS listener to a LAN or public interface "
"unless you have intentionally configured access controls and understand the "
"security impact."
msgstr ""
"除非已经明确配置访问控制并理解安全影响，否则不要把 Controller 或 DNS 监听器暴"
"露到局域网或公网接口。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Example Local Profile"
msgstr "本地配置示例"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"The following layout keeps all application-facing services local while "
"making listener roles explicit:"
msgstr "下面的配置让所有面向应用的服务仅在本机提供，同时清楚区分各监听器职责："

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "mixed_port"
msgstr "mixed_port"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "external_controller"
msgstr "external_controller"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "\"127.0.0.1:9090\""
msgstr "\"127.0.0.1:9090\""

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Exact accepted key spelling can vary between compatibility layers. When "
"importing Clash/Mihomo profiles, preserve the original profile where "
"practical and verify the normalized runtime configuration produced by the "
"client."
msgstr ""
"不同兼容层实际接受的配置键写法可能存在差异。导入 Clash/Mihomo 配置时，应尽可"
"能保留原始配置，并核对客户端最终生成的规范化运行时配置。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Platform and Compatibility Notes"
msgstr "平台与兼容性说明"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Application-level HTTP and SOCKS listeners are the easiest paths to validate "
"across platforms."
msgstr "应用层 HTTP 与 SOCKS 监听器通常是最容易跨平台验证的路径。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Transparent redirect and TProxy workflows are platform-specific and require "
"operating-system network configuration outside the YAML file."
msgstr ""
"透明重定向与 TProxy 流程具有明显的平台特性，并且需要在 YAML 之外配置操作系统"
"网络环境。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"TUN support has its own privilege, routing, and DNS requirements; see [Tun "
"Module](./tun.md)."
msgstr "TUN 支持具有独立的权限、路由和 DNS 要求；请参阅 [TUN 模块](./tun.md)。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Listener availability may be gated by Cargo features or runtime build "
"choices."
msgstr "监听器是否可用可能受到 Cargo feature 或运行时构建选项限制。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Controller behavior should be treated as an API surface rather than a proxy "
"protocol endpoint."
msgstr "Controller 应被视为 API 接口，而不是代理协议端点。"

