#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"When a local application cannot connect through the core, check the listener "
"before debugging outbound protocols:"
msgstr "当本地应用无法通过核心连接时，应先检查监听器，再排查出站协议："

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Confirm the process is running and the expected port is listening."
msgstr "确认进程正在运行，并且预期端口已经处于监听状态。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Verify the application points to the correct listener type and port."
msgstr "确认应用指向正确的监听器类型和端口。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Confirm the listener is bound to the expected address (`127.0.0.1`, LAN IP, "
"or wildcard address)."
msgstr "确认监听器绑定到了预期地址（`127.0.0.1`、局域网 IP 或通配地址）。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Check whether `allow_lan` or equivalent exposure settings block remote "
"clients."
msgstr "检查 `allow_lan` 或同类暴露设置是否阻止了远程客户端。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"Test with a minimal SOCKS5 or HTTP profile before enabling TUN, Redir, or "
"TProxy."
msgstr ""
"启用 TUN、Redir 或 TProxy 前，先使用最小化 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 配置进行测试。"

#: src/chimera_client/ports.md
msgid ""
"If routing works by IP but domain rules fail, inspect the DNS path as well."
msgstr "如果按 IP 路由正常但域名规则失效，也要检查 DNS 路径。"

