#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"DNS is part of the routing pipeline, not just a name-to-address lookup "
"service. The resolver strategy affects whether domain rules remain usable, "
"whether TUN traffic can be classified correctly, and whether DNS requests "
"bypass the proxy unexpectedly."
msgstr ""
"DNS 是路由链路的一部分，而不只是把域名转换成地址的查询服务。解析策略会影响域"
"名规则是否仍可用、TUN 流量能否被正确分类，以及 DNS 请求是否会意外绕过代理。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "A stable DNS setup should answer three questions clearly:"
msgstr "一套稳定的 DNS 配置应当清楚回答三个问题："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Which resolver handles a query?"
msgstr "由哪个解析器处理查询？"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Does the client keep the original domain identity for later rule matching?"
msgstr "客户端是否保留原始域名信息，以便后续规则匹配？"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Does DNS traffic itself follow the intended proxy or direct path?"
msgstr "DNS 流量本身是否按照预期走代理或直连路径？"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Operating Modes"
msgstr "工作模式"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Best fit"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Advantages"
msgstr "优势"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Trade-offs"
msgstr "取舍"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "System / DNS disabled"
msgstr "系统解析 / 禁用 DNS 模块"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Simple app-level proxying"
msgstr "简单的应用层代理"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Least invasive, easiest to debug"
msgstr "侵入性最低，最容易排查"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Depends on OS resolver behavior"
msgstr "依赖操作系统解析器行为"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Real-IP / `redir-host` style"
msgstr "Real-IP / `redir-host` 风格"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Conservative enhanced DNS"
msgstr "较保守的增强 DNS"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Applications receive real addresses"
msgstr "应用获得真实地址"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Domain identity can be harder to retain in transparent flows"
msgstr "在透明代理流量中较难持续保留域名信息"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Fake-IP"
msgstr "Fake-IP"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "TUN and domain-heavy routing"
msgstr "TUN 与大量依赖域名的路由场景"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Preserves domain intent for later connection matching"
msgstr "保留域名意图，便于后续连接匹配"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Requires exclusions and careful DNS integration"
msgstr "需要合理的排除规则和谨慎的 DNS 集成"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Start with the system resolver or real-IP behavior when validating a new "
"setup. Introduce Fake-IP only when the routing model benefits from it."
msgstr ""
"验证新环境时，建议先使用系统解析器或 Real-IP 行为。只有当路由模型确实能从中受"
"益时，再引入 Fake-IP。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Resolver Pipeline"
msgstr "解析器流程"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"A Clash-style enhanced resolver generally follows this conceptual sequence:"
msgstr "Clash 风格的增强解析器通常遵循以下概念流程："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"The exact fallback and policy behavior depends on the current "
"`chimera_client` implementation and should not be assumed to match every "
"Mihomo edge case."
msgstr ""
"具体的 fallback 与 policy 行为取决于当前 `chimera_client` 实现，不应默认认为"
"它与 Mihomo 的所有边缘场景完全一致。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Conservative Configuration"
msgstr "保守配置"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"For application-level SOCKS5 or HTTP proxying, keeping enhanced DNS disabled "
"is a useful baseline:"
msgstr ""
"对于应用层 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 代理，先保持增强 DNS 关闭可以作为一个很有用的基线："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "ipv6"
msgstr "ipv6"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"If this works but an enhanced-DNS profile does not, the failure is probably "
"in the DNS interception/resolver path rather than the outbound proxy itself."
msgstr ""
"如果这种配置能够工作，而启用增强 DNS 后失败，那么问题更可能出在 DNS 拦截/解析"
"路径，而不是出站代理本身。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Local DNS Listener"
msgstr "本地 DNS 监听器"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"A local listener lets the operating system, TUN path, or other applications "
"send queries directly to `chimera_client`:"
msgstr ""
"本地 DNS 监听器可以让操作系统、TUN 路径或其他应用直接把查询发送给 "
"`chimera_client`："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"During development, keep the listener on loopback. Binding DNS to a LAN or "
"public interface can expose an unintended resolver service."
msgstr ""
"开发阶段应把监听器保持在回环地址。将 DNS 绑定到局域网或公网接口，可能会意外暴"
"露一个可供外部使用的解析服务。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Fake-IP Example"
msgstr "Fake-IP 示例"

