msgstr "tls://1.1.1.1:853"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Fake-IP exclusions should be kept small and understandable. Large copied "
"filter lists can hide routing mistakes and make failures difficult to "
"reproduce."
msgstr ""
"Fake-IP 排除项应尽量保持精简且易于理解。直接复制大量过滤规则可能掩盖路由错"
"误，并让问题难以复现。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Policy and Fallback Example"
msgstr "Policy 与 Fallback 示例"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "fallback"
msgstr "fallback"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "fallback-filter"
msgstr "fallback-filter"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "geoip"
msgstr "geoip"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "geoip-code"
msgstr "geoip-code"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "CN"
msgstr "CN"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"The schema and resolver hooks for policy/fallback behavior exist in the "
"current client documentation, but full behavioral parity with Mihomo should "
"be verified before relying on unusual edge cases."
msgstr ""
"当前客户端文档中已经包含 policy/fallback 行为相关的配置结构与解析钩子，但在依"
"赖少见边缘行为之前，应先验证是否真正与 Mihomo 完全一致。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS and Rules"
msgstr "DNS 与规则"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS mode directly affects the rule engine:"
msgstr "DNS 模式会直接影响规则引擎："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Domain-based rules need access to the original hostname or equivalent "
"metadata."
msgstr "基于域名的规则需要能够取得原始主机名或等价元数据。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "IP rules depend on the resolved destination address."
msgstr "IP 规则依赖最终解析得到的目标地址。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Fake-IP is most useful when an application resolves first and connects "
"later, because the client can map the synthetic address back to the original "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"当应用先解析域名、之后再建立连接时，Fake-IP 最有价值，因为客户端可以把合成地"
"址重新映射回原始域名。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"A DNS request that bypasses the intended resolver path can cause apparently "
"random rule mismatches."
msgstr "如果 DNS 请求绕过了预期解析路径，可能会造成看似随机的规则匹配错误。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "When debugging rules, inspect DNS before changing rule order blindly."
msgstr "排查规则问题时，应先检查 DNS，不要直接盲目调整规则顺序。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS and TUN"
msgstr "DNS 与 TUN"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "TUN deployments often combine three separate mechanisms:"
msgstr "TUN 部署通常会组合三种彼此独立的机制："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "host traffic capture,"
msgstr "主机流量捕获；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS interception or resolver redirection,"
msgstr "DNS 拦截或解析器重定向；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "enhanced DNS such as Fake-IP."
msgstr "以及 Fake-IP 等增强 DNS。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"`dns-hijack` in the TUN configuration does not replace a valid DNS "
"configuration. It only controls how captured DNS traffic is redirected into "
"the DNS path. See [Tun Module](./tun.md) for the routing side."
msgstr ""
"TUN 配置中的 `dns-hijack` 不能替代有效的 DNS 配置。它只控制被捕获的 DNS 流量"
"如何重定向到 DNS 处理路径。路由侧说明请参阅 [TUN 模块](./tun.md)。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Upstream Resolver Guidance"
msgstr "上游解析器建议"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "When choosing upstreams:"
msgstr "选择上游解析器时："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "keep at least one simple resolver path available while debugging;"
msgstr "排查期间至少保留一条简单可用的解析路径；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "verify that encrypted DNS endpoint hostnames can be bootstrapped;"
msgstr "确认加密 DNS 端点的主机名能够完成 bootstrap 解析；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "avoid mixing many upstreams until the basic path is known to work;"
msgstr "在基本路径确认可用之前，不要混用过多上游解析器；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "consider whether DNS itself should be proxied or sent directly;"
msgstr "明确 DNS 流量本身应该经过代理还是直接发送；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"treat resolver latency, failure, and blocking as routing signals, not just "
"DNS errors."
msgstr "把解析器延迟、失败和阻断视为路由信号，而不仅仅是普通 DNS 错误。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md src/chimera_client/tun.md
#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Compatibility Notes"
msgstr "兼容性说明"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "The current documentation describes support or runtime hooks for:"
msgstr "当前文档记录了以下支持或运行时钩子："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "the system resolver path,"
msgstr "系统解析器路径；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "a local DNS listener,"
msgstr "本地 DNS 监听器；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "enhanced/Fake-IP resolution,"
msgstr "增强/Fake-IP 解析；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "nameserver policy and fallback structures,"
msgstr "nameserver policy 与 fallback 配置结构；"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "and `respect-rules`\\-style DNS dialing hooks."
msgstr "以及 `respect-rules` 风格的 DNS 拨号钩子。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"These capabilities are aligned with the Clash family, but this Wiki should "
"not claim blanket Mihomo parity. Configuration syntax can also differ "
"between the external Clash-style form and the client's normalized internal "
"representation."
msgstr ""
"这些能力整体与 Clash 系生态保持一致，但本 Wiki 不应据此声称与 Mihomo 全面等"
"价。外部 Clash 风格配置形式与客户端规范化后的内部表示之间，也可能存在语法差"
"异。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Use this order when DNS-related behavior looks wrong:"
msgstr "当 DNS 行为异常时，建议按以下顺序排查："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Confirm ordinary network connectivity without enhanced DNS."
msgstr "先确认关闭增强 DNS 时普通网络连接正常。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Confirm the local DNS listener is actually reachable."
msgstr "确认本地 DNS 监听器确实可以访问。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Query the listener directly, for example:"
msgstr "直接向监听器发起查询，例如："

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Check whether the OS or TUN path really sends DNS to that listener."
msgstr "检查操作系统或 TUN 路径是否真的把 DNS 流量发送到了该监听器。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Temporarily use one simple upstream resolver to isolate DoH/DoT problems."
msgstr "临时只使用一个简单的上游解析器，以隔离 DoH/DoT 相关问题。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Inspect timeout, TLS, bootstrap, and validation errors in logs."
msgstr "检查日志中的超时、TLS、bootstrap 和响应验证错误。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"If Fake-IP is enabled, verify that the affected domain is not unexpectedly "
"included in the filter list."
msgstr "如果启用了 Fake-IP，确认出现问题的域名没有被意外包含在过滤列表中。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"If rules are wrong, compare the domain seen by the rule engine with the "
"final resolved IP."
msgstr "如果规则匹配异常，对比规则引擎看到的域名与最终解析得到的 IP。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md src/chimera_client/tun.md
#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "[Ports and Listeners](./ports.md)"
msgstr "[端口与监听器](./ports.md)"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"TUN mode captures IP traffic at the operating-system network layer and sends "
"it into the proxy pipeline without requiring each application to configure "
"an HTTP or SOCKS proxy."
msgstr ""
"TUN 模式在操作系统网络层捕获 IP 流量并送入代理处理链，因此不需要每个应用单独"
"配置 HTTP 或 SOCKS 代理。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"It is the closest `chimera_client` mode to a host-wide proxy, but it is also "
"the mode with the most external dependencies: interface creation, "
"privileges, routes, loop prevention, DNS handling, and platform-specific "
"behavior all need to work together."
msgstr ""
"这是 `chimera_client` 中最接近主机级全局代理的模式，同时也是外部依赖最多的模"
"式：接口创建、权限、路由、防环路、DNS 处理以及平台特定行为都必须协同正常工"
"作。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"For a new deployment, validate an application-level listener first. Only "
"enable TUN after the core, outbound protocol, and basic rule set are already "
"known to work."
msgstr ""
"对于新部署，应先验证应用层监听器。只有在核心、出站协议和基础规则集均确认正常"
"后，再启用 TUN。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Current Status"
msgstr "当前状态"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"The current client documentation exposes a `tun` configuration block and "
"carries TUN configuration into the internal runtime representation. Actual "
"behavior is still dependent on:"
msgstr ""
"当前客户端文档已经提供 `tun` 配置块，并会把 TUN 配置传入内部运行时表示。实际"
"行为仍取决于："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "whether the build includes the required TUN feature/runtime code,"
msgstr "构建是否包含所需的 TUN feature/运行时代码；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "the target operating system,"
msgstr "目标操作系统；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "sufficient privileges,"
msgstr "是否具有足够权限；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "route-management support,"
msgstr "路由管理支持；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "and a compatible DNS configuration."
msgstr "以及兼容的 DNS 配置。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"A successfully parsed `tun` block does not by itself prove that the host "
"routing setup is active."
msgstr "`tun` 配置块能够成功解析，并不能单独证明主机路由配置已经真正生效。"

