msgstr "`route-all`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Full-tunnel routing switch"
msgstr "全隧道路由开关"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Broadest and most invasive mode"
msgstr "覆盖范围最广、对系统网络影响最大的模式"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`routes`"
msgstr "`routes`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Prefix list for split routing"
msgstr "分流路由的网段前缀列表"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Used when only selected networks should enter TUN"
msgstr "仅希望指定网段进入 TUN 时使用"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`mtu`"
msgstr "`mtu`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Interface MTU"
msgstr "接口 MTU"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Useful when diagnosing fragmentation or PMTU problems"
msgstr "用于排查分片或 PMTU 问题"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`so-mark`"
msgstr "`so-mark`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux packet mark"
msgstr "Linux 数据包标记"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Helps integrate loop prevention and policy routing"
msgstr "用于配合防环路和策略路由"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`route-table`"
msgstr "`route-table`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux policy-routing table"
msgstr "Linux 策略路由表"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Avoid conflicts with existing host route tables"
msgstr "应避免与主机现有路由表冲突"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dns-hijack`"
msgstr "`dns-hijack`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Redirects captured DNS into the client DNS path"
msgstr "将捕获的 DNS 流量重定向到客户端 DNS 路径"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Requires a working DNS module configuration"
msgstr "要求 DNS 模块本身已经正确配置并可用"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Deployment Modes"
msgstr "部署模式"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Full Tunnel"
msgstr "全隧道"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"A full-tunnel profile attempts to route most host traffic through the TUN "
"interface:"
msgstr "全隧道配置会尝试让主机上的大部分流量都经过 TUN 接口："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Use this only after confirming that the core has a reliable path to its "
"remote proxy server. Otherwise the proxy's own outbound connection can be "
"captured by TUN and form a routing loop."
msgstr ""
"只有在确认核心能够稳定访问远程代理服务器后才应使用该模式，否则代理核心自身的"
"出站连接可能再次被 TUN 捕获，从而形成路由环路。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Split Tunnel"
msgstr "分流隧道"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "A split-tunnel profile limits TUN routing to selected prefixes:"
msgstr "分流隧道配置只让指定网段进入 TUN："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "routes"
msgstr "routes"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "1.1.1.1/32"
msgstr "1.1.1.1/32"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "8.8.8.8/32"
msgstr "8.8.8.8/32"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Split routing is useful for staged rollout because it changes less of the "
"host's network behavior."
msgstr "分流路由适合分阶段启用，因为它对主机整体网络行为的改动更小。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Device Selection"
msgstr "设备选择"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "The inherited configuration path documents device identifiers such as:"
msgstr "继承的配置路径记录了以下设备标识形式："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dev://tun0` — named TUN device,"
msgstr "`dev://tun0` — 指定名称的 TUN 设备；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`tun0` — plain device-name form,"
msgstr "`tun0` — 简写设备名形式；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dev://utun1989` — macOS-style `utun` device,"
msgstr "`dev://utun1989` — macOS 风格的 `utun` 设备；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"`fd://3` — advanced file-descriptor handoff where supported by the runtime."
msgstr "`fd://3` — 在运行时支持时使用的高级文件描述符交接方式。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Do not assume every form is meaningful on every operating system. In "
"ordinary desktop use, prefer the simplest platform-native device form "
"supported by the selected build."
msgstr ""
"不要假设所有形式在每个操作系统上都有意义。普通桌面使用场景应优先选择当前构建"
"所支持的、最简单的平台原生设备形式。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Routing Model"
msgstr "路由模型"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "TUN introduces two traffic directions that must stay distinct:"
msgstr "TUN 引入了两类必须明确区分的流量方向："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"The core's own outbound traffic must reach the physical network without "
"being captured back into the same TUN path. Linux deployments commonly use "
"packet marks and policy routing for this purpose; other platforms use their "
"own route management mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"核心自身的出站流量必须能够到达物理网络，而不能再次被捕获回同一条 TUN 路径。"
"Linux 部署通常通过数据包标记和策略路由实现这一点；其他平台则使用各自的路由管"
"理机制。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DNS Interaction"
msgstr "DNS 交互"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "TUN and DNS should be designed together."
msgstr "TUN 与 DNS 应当一起设计。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"A common failure mode is that application traffic enters TUN while DNS still "
"uses an unrelated system path. This can cause:"
msgstr ""
"一种常见故障是应用流量已经进入 TUN，但 DNS 仍然使用无关的系统解析路径。这可能"
"导致："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "domain rules to stop matching,"
msgstr "域名规则不再命中；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Fake-IP mappings to be bypassed,"
msgstr "Fake-IP 映射被绕过；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "DNS leaks,"
msgstr "DNS 泄漏；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "or traffic to appear to work inconsistently between applications."
msgstr "或者不同应用之间表现出不一致的联网行为。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"`dns-hijack` only controls interception of captured DNS traffic. It does not "
"replace a valid `dns:` configuration."
msgstr ""
"`dns-hijack` 只控制对已捕获 DNS 流量的拦截方式，不能替代有效的 `dns:` 配置。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"For domain-heavy rule sets, verify the DNS flow described in [DNS Module](./"
"dns.md) before assuming the TUN route itself is wrong."
msgstr ""
"对于大量依赖域名的规则集，在判断 TUN 路由本身有问题之前，应先验证 [DNS 模块]"
"(./dns.md) 中描述的 DNS 流程。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux Notes"
msgstr "Linux 注意事项"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Linux TUN deployments may require root-equivalent privileges or capabilities "
"such as `CAP_NET_ADMIN`, depending on how the process creates interfaces and "
"routes."
msgstr ""
"Linux TUN 部署可能需要 root 等效权限或 `CAP_NET_ADMIN` 等 capability，具体取"
"决于进程创建接口和路由的方式。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "When policy routing is involved, useful inspection commands include:"
msgstr "涉及策略路由时，可以使用以下命令进行检查："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"If `so-mark` or a dedicated route table is configured, make sure the values "
"do not conflict with rules installed by another VPN, container runtime, "
"firewall, or proxy application."
msgstr ""
"如果配置了 `so-mark` 或独立路由表，应确认这些值不会与其他 VPN、容器运行时、防"
"火墙或代理应用安装的规则冲突。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Windows and macOS Notes"
msgstr "Windows 与 macOS 注意事项"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"On Windows and macOS, TUN behavior is still sensitive to privileges, route "
"ownership, interface setup, and other networking software running on the "
"host."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 和 macOS 上，TUN 行为仍容易受到权限、路由归属、接口配置以及主机上"
"其他网络软件的影响。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "When troubleshooting these platforms:"
msgstr "排查这些平台时："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"check whether another VPN or proxy tool is already managing default routes;"
msgstr "检查是否已有其他 VPN 或代理工具在管理默认路由；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "verify the TUN interface was created successfully;"
msgstr "确认 TUN 接口已经成功创建；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "inspect route changes before and after enabling TUN;"
msgstr "对比启用 TUN 前后的路由变化；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"disable competing network-filter or VPN software temporarily when isolating "
"a problem;"
msgstr "隔离问题时，可临时停用可能冲突的网络过滤或 VPN 软件；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"and restore application-level SOCKS/HTTP proxying to confirm that the proxy "
"core itself remains healthy."
msgstr "并恢复应用层 SOCKS/HTTP 代理，以确认代理核心本身仍然工作正常。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "MTU"
msgstr "MTU"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"MTU problems often look like partial connectivity: small requests work while "
"larger TLS or QUIC transfers stall."
msgstr ""
"MTU 问题往往表现为部分可连接：小请求正常，而较大的 TLS 或 QUIC 传输发生停滞。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If that happens:"
msgstr "如果出现这种情况："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "keep the default MTU first;"
msgstr "首先保持默认 MTU；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "confirm the problem only appears through TUN;"
msgstr "确认问题只在经过 TUN 时出现；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "lower the MTU gradually if the network path requires it;"
msgstr "如果网络路径确实需要，逐步降低 MTU；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "re-test both TCP and UDP-based outbound protocols."
msgstr "重新测试基于 TCP 和 UDP 的出站协议。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Avoid treating an arbitrary low MTU as a permanent fix without identifying "
"the underlying path limitation."
msgstr "在没有确认底层路径限制之前，不要把随意设置的低 MTU 当作永久解决方案。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_client` inherits several TUN concepts from clash-rs, while Mihomo "
"uses some different key names and routing abstractions. Similar "
"functionality does not always mean configuration is interchangeable."
msgstr ""
"`chimera_client` 从 clash-rs 继承了多个 TUN 概念，而 Mihomo 使用了一些不同的"
"配置键名称和路由抽象。功能相似并不意味着配置可以直接互换。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Examples of potential differences include:"
msgstr "可能存在差异的方面包括："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "device naming and file-descriptor handoff,"
msgstr "设备命名与文件描述符交接；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "explicit `gateway` / `gateway-v6` fields,"
msgstr "显式的 `gateway` / `gateway-v6` 字段；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`route-all` and `routes` versus Mihomo-style auto-route controls,"
msgstr "`route-all`、`routes` 与 Mihomo 风格自动路由控制之间的差异；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "route-table naming,"
msgstr "路由表字段命名；"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "and Linux packet-mark configuration."
msgstr "以及 Linux 数据包标记配置。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"When migrating a Mihomo profile, translate TUN settings deliberately instead "
"of copying the entire block and assuming semantic parity."
msgstr ""
"迁移 Mihomo 配置时，应有意识地转换 TUN 设置，而不是直接复制整个配置块并假定语"
"义完全一致。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Recommended Bring-Up Sequence"
msgstr "推荐启用顺序"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Use this sequence to reduce the number of variables being debugged at once:"
msgstr "建议按以下顺序操作，减少同时需要排查的变量数量："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Start `chimera_client` with TUN disabled."
msgstr "先在禁用 TUN 的情况下启动 `chimera_client`。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Verify SOCKS5 or HTTP proxying works."
msgstr "确认 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 代理工作正常。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Verify the intended outbound proxy and rule group work."
msgstr "确认预期的出站代理与规则组工作正常。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Configure DNS and confirm direct queries to the client resolver succeed."
msgstr "配置 DNS，并确认直接查询客户端解析器可以成功。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Enable TUN without adding unnecessary custom routes or MTU overrides."
msgstr "启用 TUN，暂时不要添加不必要的自定义路由或 MTU 覆盖。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Confirm the interface is created."
msgstr "确认接口已经创建。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Confirm host routes changed as expected."
msgstr "确认主机路由按预期发生变化。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Confirm the core's own outbound traffic is not looping back into TUN."
msgstr "确认核心自身的出站流量没有重新进入 TUN 形成环路。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Enable DNS hijacking/Fake-IP only after ordinary TUN traffic works."
msgstr "普通 TUN 流量工作正常后，再启用 DNS 劫持/Fake-IP。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Add advanced split routes, packet marks, or custom route tables last."
msgstr "最后再添加高级分流路由、数据包标记或自定义路由表。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If TUN is enabled but traffic fails, inspect the layers in order:"
msgstr "如果 TUN 已启用但流量不通，按以下层级依次检查："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Interface** — was the TUN device created?"
msgstr "**接口** — TUN 设备是否已创建？"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Privileges** — did route/interface operations succeed?"
msgstr "**权限** — 路由和接口操作是否成功？"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Routes** — is traffic actually pointed at TUN?"
msgstr "**路由** — 流量是否真的被导向 TUN？"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Loop prevention** — can the proxy core still reach its remote server?"
msgstr "**防环路** — 代理核心是否仍能访问远程服务器？"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**DNS** — are queries using the intended resolver path?"
msgstr "**DNS** — 查询是否使用了预期解析路径？"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"**Rules** — does the captured flow contain enough metadata for the expected "
"rule?"
msgstr "**规则** — 被捕获的连接流中是否包含足够的元数据供预期规则匹配？"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**MTU** — do only large packets or particular transports fail?"
msgstr "**MTU** — 是否只有大数据包或特定传输方式失败？"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"**Platform conflicts** — is another VPN/proxy/firewall modifying the same "
"routes?"
msgstr "**平台冲突** — 是否有其他 VPN/代理/防火墙正在修改相同路由？"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"If the problem remains unclear, return to SOCKS5/HTTP mode and re-enable TUN "
"one piece at a time."
msgstr "如果问题仍不明确，回到 SOCKS5/HTTP 模式，再逐项重新启用 TUN 相关能力。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Rules decide which outbound policy handles a connection. In the Clash-style "
"model used by `chimera_client`, evaluation is ordered: rules are checked "
"from top to bottom and the first matching rule wins."
msgstr ""
"规则决定一条连接由哪个出站策略处理。在 `chimera_client` 使用的 Clash 风格模型"
"中，规则按顺序求值：从上到下检查，第一条匹配的规则生效。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"That makes rule order just as important as rule syntax. A valid rule placed "
"too late can be effectively unreachable because an earlier rule already "
"captured the flow."
msgstr ""
"因此规则顺序与规则语法同样重要。一条本身正确的规则如果放得太靠后，也可能永远"
"无法生效，因为前面的规则已经提前匹配了该流量。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Rule Evaluation Model"
msgstr "规则求值模型"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "A routing decision can use several kinds of metadata:"
msgstr "路由决策可以使用多种元数据："

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "domain name, SNI, or HTTP host,"
msgstr "域名、SNI 或 HTTP Host；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "resolved destination IP,"
msgstr "解析后的目标 IP，"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "source or destination port,"
msgstr "源端口或目标端口；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "source subnet,"
msgstr "源网段；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "process identity when supported by the platform,"
msgstr "平台支持时的进程身份信息；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "GeoIP/GeoSite datasets,"
msgstr "GeoIP / GeoSite 数据集，"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "and external rule-provider sets."
msgstr "以及外部 rule-provider 集合。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"The selected target is usually an outbound or policy group such as `DIRECT`, "
"`REJECT`, `Proxy`, or `Auto`."
msgstr ""
"最终目标通常是某个出站或策略组，例如 `DIRECT`、`REJECT`、`Proxy` 或 `Auto`。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Domain Rules"
msgstr "域名规则"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`DOMAIN`"
msgstr "`DOMAIN`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches one exact hostname."
msgstr "精确匹配一个主机名。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "rules"
msgstr "rules"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DOMAIN,api.github.com,Proxy"
msgstr "DOMAIN,api.github.com,Proxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Use this for the most precise domain-based exceptions."
msgstr "适合用于最精确的域名例外规则。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`DOMAIN-SUFFIX`"
msgstr "`DOMAIN-SUFFIX`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches a domain suffix and its subdomains."
msgstr "匹配域名后缀及其子域名。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com,Proxy"
msgstr "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com,Proxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"This is usually preferable to a broad keyword when an entire domain tree "
"should share the same policy."
msgstr ""
"如果整个域名树都应使用同一策略，通常应优先使用这种规则，而不是宽泛的关键字匹"
"配。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`DOMAIN-KEYWORD`"
msgstr "`DOMAIN-KEYWORD`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches a substring in the domain name."
msgstr "匹配域名中的子字符串。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DOMAIN-KEYWORD,openai,Proxy"
msgstr "DOMAIN-KEYWORD,openai,Proxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Keyword rules are easy to overmatch. Keep them below more precise domain "
"rules unless broad matching is intentional."
msgstr ""
"关键字规则很容易产生过度匹配。除非明确需要宽泛匹配，否则应把它放在更精确的域"
"名规则之后。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "IP and Network Rules"
msgstr "IP 与网络规则"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`IP-CIDR`"
msgstr "`IP-CIDR`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches an IPv4 destination prefix."
msgstr "匹配 IPv4 目标网段前缀。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "IP-CIDR,1.1.1.0/24,DIRECT"
msgstr "IP-CIDR,1.1.1.0/24,DIRECT"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`IP-CIDR6`"
msgstr "`IP-CIDR6`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches an IPv6 destination prefix."
msgstr "匹配 IPv6 目标网段前缀。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "IP-CIDR6,2606:4700::/32,DIRECT"
msgstr "IP-CIDR6,2606:4700::/32,DIRECT"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`SRC-IP-CIDR`"
msgstr "`SRC-IP-CIDR`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Matches the source subnet. This is most useful when the client is acting as "
"a router or gateway for multiple devices."
msgstr "匹配源网段。当客户端作为多台设备的路由器或网关时，这类规则尤其有用。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "SRC-IP-CIDR,192.168.50.0/24,GameProxy"
msgstr "SRC-IP-CIDR,192.168.50.0/24,GameProxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`GEOIP`"
msgstr "`GEOIP`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches an IP against a geographic database."
msgstr "根据地理位置数据库匹配 IP。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "GEOIP,CN,DIRECT"
msgstr "GEOIP,CN,DIRECT"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"GeoIP results are only as accurate as the installed dataset. Treat database "
"freshness as part of the routing configuration."
msgstr ""
"GeoIP 结果的准确度取决于已安装的数据集。应把数据库是否及时更新视为路由配置的"
"一部分。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`GEOSITE`"
msgstr "`GEOSITE`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches a domain against a maintained category/list dataset."
msgstr "根据维护好的分类/列表数据集匹配域名。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "GEOSITE,geolocation-!cn,Proxy"
msgstr "GEOSITE,geolocation-!cn,Proxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"As with GeoIP, behavior depends on the data files actually available to the "
"runtime."
msgstr "与 GeoIP 一样，实际行为取决于运行时真正可用的数据文件。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Port and Process Rules"
msgstr "端口与进程规则"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`DST-PORT`"
msgstr "`DST-PORT`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches the remote destination port."
msgstr "匹配远程目标端口。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DST-PORT,443,Proxy"
msgstr "DST-PORT,443,Proxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Port-only routing is broad. Place service-specific domain rules above it "
"when possible."
msgstr ""
"只按端口路由覆盖范围较广。条件允许时，应把针对具体服务的域名规则放在它之前。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`SRC-PORT`"
msgstr "`SRC-PORT`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches the local/source port."
msgstr "匹配本地/源端口。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "SRC-PORT,60000-60100,DIRECT"
msgstr "SRC-PORT,60000-60100,DIRECT"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`PROCESS-NAME`"
msgstr "`PROCESS-NAME`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches the executable name when process inspection is supported."
msgstr "在支持进程识别的平台上匹配可执行文件名。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "PROCESS-NAME,Telegram.exe,Proxy"
msgstr "PROCESS-NAME,Telegram.exe,Proxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`PROCESS-PATH`"
msgstr "`PROCESS-PATH`"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches a full executable path."
msgstr "匹配完整的可执行文件路径。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "PROCESS-PATH,/Applications/Discord.app/Contents/MacOS/Discord,Proxy"
msgstr "PROCESS-PATH,/Applications/Discord.app/Contents/MacOS/Discord,Proxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Process rules are platform-sensitive and can be affected by permissions, "
"application launchers, sandboxing, and executable path changes. Validate "
"them on every target operating system."
msgstr ""
"进程规则具有明显的平台差异，并可能受到权限、应用启动器、沙箱以及可执行文件路"
"径变化的影响。应在每个目标操作系统上分别验证。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Rule Providers"
msgstr "规则提供器"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`RULE-SET` delegates matching to a named rule provider."
msgstr "`RULE-SET` 把匹配工作交给指定名称的规则提供器。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "rule-providers"
msgstr "rule-providers"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "streaming"
msgstr "streaming"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vless.md
#: src/transports/xhttp.md src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "type"
msgstr "type"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "http"
msgstr "http"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "behavior"
msgstr "behavior"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "domain"
msgstr "domain"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "url"
msgstr "url"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "https://example.com/streaming.yaml"
msgstr "https://example.com/streaming.yaml"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "interval"
msgstr "interval"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "path"
msgstr "path"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "./ruleset/streaming.yaml"
msgstr "./ruleset/streaming.yaml"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "RULE-SET,streaming,Proxy"
msgstr "RULE-SET,streaming,Proxy"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Rule providers make large policy sets easier to maintain, but introduce "
"another runtime dependency. A stale, unavailable, or incompatible provider "
"can make a routing policy behave differently from its source configuration."
msgstr ""
"规则提供器可以让大型策略集更容易维护，但同时引入额外的运行时依赖。过期、不可"
"用或不兼容的 provider 都可能让实际路由行为偏离源配置。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"For important providers, keep the source, update interval, expected "
"behavior, and local cache path explicit."
msgstr ""
"对于重要 provider，应明确记录来源、更新间隔、预期行为以及本地缓存路径。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Final Fallback"
msgstr "最终回退"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`MATCH` is the catch-all rule and should normally be last."
msgstr "`MATCH` 是兜底规则，通常应放在最后。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "MATCH,DIRECT"
msgstr "MATCH,DIRECT"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Anything after `MATCH` is unreachable."
msgstr "任何位于 `MATCH` 之后的规则都无法被执行。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Recommended Ordering"
msgstr "推荐排序"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"A practical rule set usually moves from narrow/high-priority decisions to "
"broad fallbacks:"
msgstr "实用规则集通常从范围窄、优先级高的决策逐步过渡到宽泛的兜底规则："

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "explicit blocks and local/private bypass rules;"
msgstr "明确的阻断规则以及本地/私网直连规则；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "exact domain or process exceptions;"
msgstr "精确的域名或进程例外；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "specific IP and port rules;"
msgstr "具体 IP 和端口规则；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "provider/category rules such as `RULE-SET` and `GEOSITE`;"
msgstr "`RULE-SET`、`GEOSITE` 等 provider/分类规则；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "broad heuristics such as `DOMAIN-KEYWORD` and `GEOIP`;"
msgstr "`DOMAIN-KEYWORD`、`GEOIP` 等宽泛启发式规则；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "final `MATCH` fallback."
msgstr "最后的 `MATCH` 兜底。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"This is a guideline rather than a mandatory ordering. The important property "
"is that earlier rules intentionally take priority over later ones."
msgstr ""
"这是一种建议，而不是强制顺序。关键在于前面的规则应当是有意地优先于后面的规"
"则。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Example Policy"
msgstr "策略示例"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DOMAIN,internal.example.com,DIRECT"
msgstr "DOMAIN,internal.example.com,DIRECT"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,corp.example.com,DIRECT"
msgstr "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,corp.example.com,DIRECT"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "GEOSITE,category-ads-all,REJECT"
msgstr "GEOSITE,category-ads-all,REJECT"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "MATCH,Auto"
msgstr "MATCH,Auto"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Read the example from top to bottom: an exact corporate exception wins "
"before a broader geographic or provider rule can see the same connection."
msgstr ""
"应从上到下阅读该示例：精确的企业网络例外会先命中，因此更宽泛的地理位置或 "
"provider 规则不会再处理同一条连接。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Many apparent rule failures are actually DNS-context failures."
msgstr "许多看起来像规则失效的问题，实际上是 DNS 上下文丢失造成的。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Domain rules require the runtime to know the original hostname."
msgstr "域名规则要求运行时能够知道原始主机名。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "IP rules depend on the address returned by the resolver."
msgstr "IP 规则依赖解析器返回的地址。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Fake-IP can help preserve domain intent through a later connection attempt."
msgstr "Fake-IP 可以在后续连接阶段帮助保留原始域名意图。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Transparent and TUN traffic can lose domain context if DNS bypasses the "
"client's intended resolver path."
msgstr ""
"如果 DNS 绕过客户端预期的解析路径，透明代理和 TUN 流量可能失去域名上下文。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"When a domain rule works through SOCKS5 but fails through TUN, compare the "
"DNS path before changing the rule itself. See [DNS Module](./dns.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果域名规则通过 SOCKS5 时正常、通过 TUN 时却失效，应先比较 DNS 路径，再修改"
"规则本身。参阅 [DNS 模块](./dns.md)。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"The core first-match model and common Clash rule syntax are intended to "
"remain portable across `chimera_client`, clash-rs, and Mihomo. Exact support "
"still varies by runtime feature and platform."
msgstr ""
"核心的首条匹配模型以及常见 Clash 规则语法，目标是在 `chimera_client`、clash-"
"rs 与 Mihomo 之间保持较好的可移植性。具体支持范围仍会随运行时 feature 和平台"
"而变化。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "In particular:"
msgstr "尤其需要注意："

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "process matching is platform-dependent;"
msgstr "进程匹配依赖平台；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "GeoIP/GeoSite behavior depends on local datasets;"
msgstr "GeoIP/GeoSite 行为取决于本地数据集；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "provider behavior depends on provider format and refresh success;"
msgstr "provider 行为取决于 provider 格式以及刷新是否成功；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DNS mode and inbound type can change the metadata available to a rule;"
msgstr "DNS 模式和入站类型会改变规则可获取的元数据；"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"newer Mihomo-only rule types should not be assumed to work unless they are "
"explicitly implemented by the selected client core."
msgstr ""
"对于较新的 Mihomo 专有规则类型，除非当前客户端核心明确实现，否则不应假定其可"
"用。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"When a connection selects the wrong outbound, debug the decision in this "
"order:"
msgstr "当连接选择了错误的出站时，建议按以下顺序排查决策过程："

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Identify the first rule that actually matched, not the rule you expected to "
"match."
msgstr "先找出真正第一个命中的规则，而不是你原本预期会命中的规则。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Check whether an earlier broad rule shadows the intended one."
msgstr "检查前面是否有范围更宽的规则遮蔽了目标规则。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Confirm the policy/group named by the rule exists."
msgstr "确认规则指定的策略/组确实存在。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "For domain rules, verify that the runtime still knows the hostname."
msgstr "对于域名规则，确认运行时仍然掌握主机名信息。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "For IP/GeoIP rules, verify the resolved address and database state."
msgstr "对于 IP/GeoIP 规则，确认解析地址以及数据库状态。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"For process rules, confirm the observed executable name/path on that OS."
msgstr "对于进程规则，确认该操作系统上实际观察到的可执行文件名/路径。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "For `RULE-SET`, confirm the provider loaded and refreshed successfully."
msgstr "对于 `RULE-SET`，确认 provider 已成功加载并刷新。"

#: src/chimera_client/rules.md
msgid ""
"Temporarily reduce the rules to a few explicit entries plus `MATCH` to "
"isolate the problem."
msgstr "可以临时把规则缩减为少量明确条目加一个 `MATCH`，以便隔离问题。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Design Goals"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera` is the desktop control surface for the Chimera client ecosystem. "
"It is built with Tauri, Rust, and React, and its job is to make daily proxy "
"operation clearer: import profiles, switch nodes, select the proxy core, "
"inspect runtime state, manage system integration, and keep the core/app "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera` 是 Chimera 客户端生态的桌面控制界面。它基于 Tauri、Rust 和 React 构"
"建，用于简化日常代理操作，包括导入配置、切换节点、选择代理核心、查看运行状"
"态、管理系统集成，以及更新核心和应用。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "The core design priorities of Chimera are:"
msgstr "Chimera 的核心设计优先级包括："

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "stable cross-platform desktop behavior,"
msgstr "稳定的跨平台桌面行为；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "clear profile and subscription management,"
msgstr "清晰的配置文件与订阅管理；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"first-class support for `chimera-client` while retaining compatibility with "
"`clash-rs` and `mihomo`,"
msgstr ""
"优先为 `chimera-client` 提供一等支持，同时保留与 `clash-rs` 和 `mihomo` 的兼"
"容能力；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"reliable core lifecycle management through child-process and service-mode "
"paths,"
msgstr "通过子进程模式和服务模式提供可靠的核心生命周期管理；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"practical diagnostics through logs, connection views, core status, and "
"configuration-directory access."
msgstr "通过日志、连接视图、核心状态和配置目录访问提供实用的诊断能力。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Runtime Boundary"
msgstr "运行时边界"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera` is a control application, not a proxy protocol engine. Protocol "
"availability, transport behavior, and packet forwarding are provided by the "
"selected core. This distinction is important when comparing features: a "
"feature visible in the GUI is not necessarily implemented by every supported "
"core, and a core capability may require additional UI integration before it "
"is exposed in Chimera."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera` 是控制应用，而不是代理协议引擎。协议可用性、传输行为和数据包转发均"
"由当前选中的核心提供。比较功能时必须注意这一边界：GUI 中可见的功能不一定由所"
"有受支持核心实现，而某个核心已经具备的能力，也可能需要额外的 UI 集成后才会在 "
"Chimera 中暴露。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Runtime Responsibilities"
msgstr "运行时职责"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"Chimera manages local state and delegates packet/protocol handling to a "
"selected core. The main responsibilities visible in the companion codebase "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"Chimera 负责管理本地状态，并把数据包与协议处理交给选中的核心。配套代码库中可"
"以看到的主要职责包括："

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"profile import, update, deletion, viewing, editing, and runtime patching,"
msgstr "配置文件的导入、更新、删除、查看、编辑以及运行时补丁处理；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"Clash-style runtime YAML generation from app settings plus active profile,"
msgstr "根据应用设置与当前活动配置生成 Clash 风格的运行时 YAML；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"core selection among sidecars such as `mihomo`, `clash-rs`, and `chimera-"
"client`,"
msgstr ""
"在 `mihomo`、`clash-rs`、`chimera-client` 等 sidecar 核心之间进行选择；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "core start, stop, restart, recovery, version query, and update,"
msgstr "核心的启动、停止、重启、恢复、版本查询与更新；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"system proxy, deep link, notification, dialog, tray, and single-instance "
"integration,"
msgstr "系统代理、深链接、通知、对话框、托盘以及单实例集成；"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"service-mode install, uninstall, start, stop, restart, and status workflows."
msgstr "服务模式的安装、卸载、启动、停止、重启以及状态管理流程。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Currently Supported Platforms"
msgstr "当前支持的平台"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "First Tier"
msgstr "第一梯队"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Second Tier"
msgstr "第二梯队"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "NixOS"
msgstr "NixOS"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Core-Dependent Protocol Surface"
msgstr "由核心决定的协议能力"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"Chimera does not have one fixed protocol matrix of its own. The selected "
"core is an explicit runtime choice, and the desktop source maps several "
"Clash-family core types into the shared core-management layer, including "
"Mihomo, clash-rs, and Chimera Client variants."
msgstr ""
"Chimera 本身并没有一张固定的协议矩阵。所选核心是明确的运行时选择，桌面端源码"
"会把多种 Clash 系核心类型映射到共享核心管理层，其中包括 Mihomo、clash-rs 和 "
"Chimera Client 变体。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"A generated profile can therefore contain a field that one selected core "
"supports and another rejects or interprets differently. Protocol claims in "
"this Wiki should be attached to the core implementation rather than to the "
"desktop GUI."
msgstr ""
"因此，生成的配置档案中可能包含某个核心支持、而另一个核心拒绝或以不同方式解释"
"的字段。本 Wiki 中的协议能力声明应归属于核心实现，而不是桌面 GUI。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"For the current Chimera Client matrix, see [Chimera_Client](./"
"chimera_client.md). For a source-audited cross-project view, see "
"[Implementation Status and Source Evidence](./implementation-status.md)."
msgstr ""
"当前 Chimera Client 矩阵见 [Chimera_Client](./chimera_client.md)。经源码审计"
"的跨项目视图见 [Implementation Status and Source Evidence](./implementation-"
"status.md)。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Foreground and Service Runtime Paths"
msgstr "前台与服务模式运行路径"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "The desktop currently has two distinct core ownership paths:"
msgstr "桌面端当前有两种不同的核心所有权路径："

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"Both paths use the desktop-generated runtime configuration. Service mode "
"moves process ownership and privileged control into `Chimera_Service`; it "
"does not move profile merge/rule semantics into the service."
msgstr ""
"两条路径都使用桌面端生成的运行时配置。服务模式把进程所有权和特权控制移交给 "
"`Chimera_Service`，但不会把配置档案合并或规则语义移入服务。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"See [Service Mode Configuration](./chimera/service-mode.md) for the actual "
"IPC boundary and lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"实际 IPC 边界与生命周期见 [Service Mode Configuration](./chimera/service-"
"mode.md)。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Chimera Runtime Configuration: Inputs, Generation, and Loading"
msgstr "Chimera 运行时配置：输入、生成与加载"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"This page describes how Chimera prepares the configuration used by its core. "
"At startup and during hot reload, the core uses a generated runtime file "
"rather than reading `profiles.yaml` directly. The backend assembles the "
"runtime configuration in memory, writes it to disk, and provides it to the "
"core through startup arguments or the Clash API."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍 Chimera 如何准备核心使用的配置。核心在启动和热重载时使用后端生成的运"
"行时文件，而不是直接读取 `profiles.yaml`。后端会先在内存中组装运行时配置，再"
"写入磁盘，并通过启动参数或 Clash API 将其交给核心。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Upstream alignment: Needs assessment"
msgstr "上游对齐状态：待评估对齐"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Local maturity: In development"
msgstr "本地成熟度：开发中"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "1. Inputs and Initialization"
msgstr "1. 配置输入与初始化"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "The runtime configuration draws on four kinds of input:"
msgstr "运行时配置由以下四类输入共同构成："

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Application settings** — `chimera-config.yaml`, represented by `IVerge` "
"and loaded through `backend/tauri/src/config/chimera/mod.rs` → "
"`IVerge::new()`. These settings control field filtering, port strategy, TUN "
"behavior, and system-proxy behavior."
msgstr ""
"**应用设置** — `chimera-config.yaml`，对应 `IVerge`，由 `backend/tauri/src/"
"config/chimera/mod.rs` → `IVerge::new()` 加载。这些设置用于控制字段过滤、端口"
"策略、TUN 行为和系统代理行为。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Clash Guard overrides** — `clash-guard-overrides.yaml`, represented by "
"`IClashTemp` and loaded through `backend/tauri/src/config/clash/mod.rs` → "
"`IClashTemp::new()`. These values override selected fields such as `mode`, "
"`mixed-port`, `external-controller`, and `secret`."
msgstr ""
"**Clash Guard 覆盖项** — `clash-guard-overrides.yaml`，对应 `IClashTemp`，由 "
"`backend/tauri/src/config/clash/mod.rs` → `IClashTemp::new()` 加载。这些值会"
"覆盖 `mode`、`mixed-port`、`external-controller`、`secret` 等指定字段。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Profile metadata** — `profiles.yaml`, represented by `Profiles` and loaded "
"through `backend/tauri/src/config/profile/profiles.rs` → `Profiles::new()`. "
"It records the active profile (`current`) and the profile list (`items`)."
msgstr ""
"**配置元数据** — `profiles.yaml`，对应 `Profiles`，由 `backend/tauri/src/"
"config/profile/profiles.rs` → `Profiles::new()` 加载。它记录当前激活配置"
"（`current`）和配置列表（`items`）。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Profile content** — `app_config_dir/profiles/*.yaml`, read through "
"`Profiles::current_mappings()`. These files contain configuration such as "
"proxies, rules, DNS, and TUN settings."
msgstr ""
"**配置内容文件** — `app_config_dir/profiles/*.yaml`，通过 "
"`Profiles::current_mappings()` 读取。文件中包含代理、规则、DNS 和 TUN 等配"
"置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Startup initialization"
msgstr "启动初始化"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`backend/tauri/src/utils/init/mod.rs` → `init_config()` creates the "
"following files when they are missing:"
msgstr ""
"`backend/tauri/src/utils/init/mod.rs` → `init_config()` 会在以下文件缺失时创"
"建它们："

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`clash-guard-overrides.yaml`, using `IClashTemp::template()`"
msgstr "`clash-guard-overrides.yaml`，使用 `IClashTemp::template()` 生成"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`chimera-config.yaml`, using `IVerge::template()`"
msgstr "`chimera-config.yaml`，使用 `IVerge::template()` 生成"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`profiles.yaml`, with an empty or default configuration"
msgstr "`profiles.yaml`，初始内容为空或为默认配置"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`backend/tauri/src/config/core.rs` → `Config::global()` initializes "
"`Profiles::new()`, `IVerge::new()`, `IClashTemp::new()`, and "
"`IRuntime::new()`. `IRuntime` holds the in-memory runtime configuration; its "
"`config` field is an `Option<Mapping>`."
msgstr ""
"`backend/tauri/src/config/core.rs` → `Config::global()` 会初始化 "
"`Profiles::new()`、`IVerge::new()`、`IClashTemp::new()` 和 "
"`IRuntime::new()`。`IRuntime` 用于保存内存中的运行时配置，其 `config` 字段类"
"型为 `Option<Mapping>`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "2. Runtime Configuration Generation"
msgstr "2. 运行时配置生成"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"The documented entry point is `Config::generate()` in `backend/tauri/src/"
"config/core.rs`:"
msgstr ""
"文档所述的入口是 `backend/tauri/src/config/core.rs` 中的 "
"`Config::generate()`："

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TD\n"
"  A[\"Start Config::generate\"] --> B[\"Call enhance::enhance\"]\n"
"  B --> C[\"Read YAML(s) of current profile\"]\n"
"  C --> D[\"merge_profiles: merge configs\"]\n"
"  D --> E[\"(Optional) whitelist-based field filtering\"]\n"
"  E --> F[\"Override key fields (HANDLE_FIELDS)\"]\n"
"  F --> G[\"Write into in-memory runtime config\"]\n"
"  G --> H[\"Write out clash config YAML\"]\n"
"  H --> I[\"Load at startup or hot-reload via PUT /configs\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TD\n"
"  A[\"开始 Config::generate\"] --> B[\"调用 enhance::enhance\"]\n"
"  B --> C[\"读取当前配置的 YAML\"]\n"
"  C --> D[\"merge_profiles：合并配置\"]\n"
"  D --> E[\"（可选）基于白名单的字段过滤\"]\n"
"  E --> F[\"覆盖关键字段（HANDLE_FIELDS）\"]\n"
"  F --> G[\"写入内存中的运行时配置\"]\n"
"  G --> H[\"输出 clash 配置 YAML\"]\n"
"  H --> I[\"在启动时加载或通过 PUT /configs 热重载\"]\n"
"```"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`enhance::enhance()` in `backend/tauri/src/enhance/mod.rs` performs these "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"`backend/tauri/src/enhance/mod.rs` 中的 `enhance::enhance()` 依次执行以下步"
"骤："

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Loads Clash Guard settings from `Config::clash().latest().0.clone()`."
msgstr "从 `Config::clash().latest().0.clone()` 加载 Clash Guard 设置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Reads feature settings from `IVerge`, including `enable_clash_fields`."
msgstr "从 `IVerge` 读取功能设置，包括 `enable_clash_fields`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Loads the active profile content through `Profiles::current_mappings()`. "
"This iterates over `current`, reads each `profiles/<file>.yaml`, and "
"converts it to a `Mapping`."
msgstr ""
"通过 `Profiles::current_mappings()` 加载当前激活配置的内容。该方法遍历 "
"`current`，逐个读取 `profiles/<file>.yaml`，并将内容转换为 `Mapping`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Calls `process_chain(...)` for profile-chain scripts. In the implementation "
"described here, this is a placeholder and returns the original configuration "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"调用 `process_chain(...)` 执行配置链脚本。本文所述实现中，该步骤仍是占位逻"
"辑，会原样返回输入配置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Calls `merge_profiles(...)` to combine profile configurations. The first "
"configuration is merged in full with `extend`; later configurations append "
"only their `proxies` to the existing `proxies` list."
msgstr ""
"调用 `merge_profiles(...)` 合并多份配置。第一份配置通过 `extend` 完整合并；后"
"续配置只会将其中的 `proxies` 追加到现有 `proxies` 列表。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Optionally filters fields through `use_whitelist_fields_filter(...)`. When "
"`enable_clash_fields = true`, only keys in the valid and default field sets "
"are retained."
msgstr ""
"可选地通过 `use_whitelist_fields_filter(...)` 过滤字段。当 "
"`enable_clash_fields = true` 时，只保留有效字段集和默认字段集中的键。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Copies the fields in `HANDLE_FIELDS` from `IClashTemp` into the final "
"configuration so the client centrally controls these values."
msgstr ""
"将 `IClashTemp` 中 `HANDLE_FIELDS` 列出的字段复制到最终配置，由客户端集中管理"
"这些值。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`HANDLE_FIELDS`, defined in `backend/tauri/src/enhance/field.rs`, contains:"
msgstr "`HANDLE_FIELDS` 定义于 `backend/tauri/src/enhance/field.rs`，包含："

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "`mode`"
msgstr "`mode`"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "`port`"
msgstr "`port`"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`allow-lan`"
msgstr "`allow-lan`"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`log-level`"
msgstr "`log-level`"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`ipv6`"
msgstr "`ipv6`"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`secret`"
msgstr "`secret`"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"If a profile also defines one of these fields, the corresponding value from "
"`clash-guard-overrides.yaml` takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"即使配置文件也定义了这些字段，最终仍以 `clash-guard-overrides.yaml` 中对应的"
"值为准。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "3. Runtime File and Core Loading"
msgstr "3. 运行时文件与核心加载"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`Config::generate_file(ConfigType::Run)` in `backend/tauri/src/config/"
"core.rs` writes the runtime output to `app_config_dir()/clash-config.yaml`. "
"In `Check` mode, it writes to `temp_dir()/clash-config-check.yaml`. If "
"generation fails, `Config::init_config()` falls back to writing `IClashTemp` "
"directly as the runtime configuration."
msgstr ""
"`backend/tauri/src/config/core.rs` 中的 "
"`Config::generate_file(ConfigType::Run)` 会将运行时配置写入 "
"`app_config_dir()/clash-config.yaml`。在 `Check` 模式下，输出路径为 "
"`temp_dir()/clash-config-check.yaml`。如果生成失败，`Config::init_config()` "
"会直接将 `IClashTemp` 写入运行时配置，作为回退方案。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "At startup"
msgstr "启动时加载"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`CoreManager::run_core()` → `Instance::try_new()` in `backend/tauri/src/core/"
"clash/core.rs` calls `Config::generate_file(ConfigType::Run)` and passes the "
"resulting path to the core through "
"`CoreInstanceBuilder.config_path(config_path)`. The core then reads `clash-"
"config.yaml` at startup."
msgstr ""
"`backend/tauri/src/core/clash/core.rs` 中的 `CoreManager::run_core()` → "
"`Instance::try_new()` 会调用 `Config::generate_file(ConfigType::Run)`，并通"
"过 `CoreInstanceBuilder.config_path(config_path)` 将生成路径传给核心。核心随"
"后在启动时读取 `clash-config.yaml`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "During hot reload"
msgstr "运行时热重载"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`CoreManager::update_config()` follows this sequence:"
msgstr "`CoreManager::update_config()` 按以下顺序执行："

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`Config::generate().await?` rebuilds the in-memory configuration."
msgstr "`Config::generate().await?` 重新生成内存中的配置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`check_config().await?` validates it using the check file."
msgstr "`check_config().await?` 使用检查文件验证配置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "`generate_file(Run)` rewrites `clash-config.yaml`."
msgstr "`generate_file(Run)` 重写 `clash-config.yaml`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"The client sends `PUT /configs` with `{ \"path\": \"<absolute path>\" }` to "
"ask the core to reload it."
msgstr ""
"客户端发送 `PUT /configs`，请求体为 `{ \"path\": \"<absolute path>\" }`，通知"
"核心重新加载配置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Relevant code is in `backend/tauri/src/core/clash/core.rs` → "
"`update_config()` and `backend/tauri/src/core/clash/api.rs` → "
"`put_configs(...)`."
msgstr ""
"相关代码位于 `backend/tauri/src/core/clash/core.rs` → `update_config()`，以"
"及 `backend/tauri/src/core/clash/api.rs` → `put_configs(...)`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "4. Operations That Trigger a Rebuild"
msgstr "4. 会触发重建的操作"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Changing the active profile selection"
msgstr "切换当前激活配置"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"The frontend calls `commands.patchProfilesConfig`, which reaches "
"`patch_profiles_config(...)` in the backend. The backend applies a draft "
"with `Config::profiles().draft().apply(...)`, calls "
"`CoreManager::update_config()`, then saves the profile state with "
"`Config::profiles().apply()` and `save_file()` on success. On failure, it "
"calls `discard()` to roll back."
msgstr ""
"前端调用 `commands.patchProfilesConfig` 后会进入后端的 "
"`patch_profiles_config(...)`。后端先通过 "
"`Config::profiles().draft().apply(...)` 应用草稿，再调用 "
"`CoreManager::update_config()`。成功后，通过 `Config::profiles().apply()` 和 "
"`save_file()` 保存配置状态；失败时则调用 `discard()` 回滚。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Changing selected application settings"
msgstr "修改部分应用设置"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"The frontend calls `commands.patchVergeConfig`, which reaches "
"`feat::patch_verge(...)`. It first writes an `IVerge` draft. Depending on "
"the field, for example `enable_tun_mode`, the change may regenerate "
"configuration and restart the core through `Config::generate()` + "
"`run_core()`, or hot-update it through `update_core_config()`."
msgstr ""
"前端调用 `commands.patchVergeConfig` 后会进入 `feat::patch_verge(...)`，并先"
"写入一份 `IVerge` 草稿。根据字段不同（例如 `enable_tun_mode`），该变更可能通"
"过 `Config::generate()` + `run_core()` 重新生成配置并重启核心，也可能通过 "
"`update_core_config()` 热更新。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "Importing the first profile"
msgstr "导入第一份配置"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"After `import_profile(...)` succeeds, if no profile is active, Chimera sets "
"`ProfilesBuilder.current = [new_uid]` and reuses "
"`patch_profiles_config(...)` to trigger an update."
msgstr ""
"`import_profile(...)` 成功后，如果当前没有激活配置，Chimera 会将 "
"`ProfilesBuilder.current` 设为 `[new_uid]`，并复用 "
"`patch_profiles_config(...)` 触发更新。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "5. Runtime Details and Limitations"
msgstr "5. 运行时细节与限制"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`profiles.yaml` stores profile metadata and the `current` pointer; it is not "
"the final configuration consumed by the core."
msgstr ""
"`profiles.yaml` 保存配置元数据和 `current` 指针，并非核心最终使用的配置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Profile content files are not passed to the core verbatim. They become the "
"runtime configuration after merging, filtering, and Clash Guard overrides."
msgstr ""
"配置内容文件不会原样传给核心；它们要经过合并、过滤和 Clash Guard 覆盖后，才会"
"成为运行时配置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`prepare_external_controller_port()` checks port availability according to "
"policy and changes the `external-controller` port when necessary."
msgstr ""
"`prepare_external_controller_port()` 会按策略检查端口是否可用，并在必要时更"
"改 `external-controller` 端口。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`verge_mixed_port` is primarily used by system-proxy logic. It is not "
"written directly to the runtime YAML's `mixed-port`. System-proxy logic uses "
"`verge_mixed_port` first, then falls back to "
"`Config::clash().get_mixed_port()`."
msgstr ""
"`verge_mixed_port` 主要用于系统代理逻辑，不会直接写入运行时 YAML 的 `mixed-"
"port`。系统代理会优先使用 `verge_mixed_port`，没有该值时再回退到 "
"`Config::clash().get_mixed_port()`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"`get_runtime_yaml()` returns the in-memory `IRuntime.config`. It is usually "
"consistent with the recently written `clash-config.yaml`, but it does not "
"reread the file on each call."
msgstr ""
"`get_runtime_yaml()` 返回内存中的 `IRuntime.config`。它通常与最近写入的 "
"`clash-config.yaml` 一致，但每次调用时不会重新读取磁盘文件。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "The implementation limitations recorded here are:"
msgstr "本文记录的实现限制如下："

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Profile-chain script execution is a placeholder; `process_chain(...)` does "
"not yet rewrite the configuration."
msgstr "配置链脚本执行仍是占位实现；`process_chain(...)` 尚不会改写配置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Global chain processing remains commented out; only the scoped chain "
"framework is present."
msgstr "全局链处理代码仍被注释，目前只有带作用域的链处理框架。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"The `patch_clash_config` IPC is still `todo!()`, so the frontend will fail "
"if it uses that IPC path."
msgstr ""
"`patch_clash_config` IPC 仍为 `todo!()`；如果前端调用这条 IPC 路径，就会失"
"败。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"Editing a profile file directly does not automatically trigger hot reload. "
"`save_profile_file(...)` writes the file but does not call `update_config()`."
msgstr ""
"直接编辑配置文件不会自动触发热重载。`save_profile_file(...)` 只写入文件，不会"
"调用 `update_config()`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "6. Troubleshooting"
msgstr "6. 故障排查"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"If the core appears to be using the wrong configuration, check these items "
"in order:"
msgstr "如果核心似乎使用了错误的配置，请按以下顺序检查："

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid "**Active profile:** verify `current` in `profiles.yaml`."
msgstr "**当前配置：**检查 `profiles.yaml` 中的 `current`。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Profile content:** inspect the relevant file under `app_config_dir/"
"profiles/`."
msgstr "**配置内容：**检查 `app_config_dir/profiles/` 下对应的配置文件。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Clash Guard overrides:** check whether fields in `HANDLE_FIELDS` from "
"`clash-guard-overrides.yaml` replace the values you expected."
msgstr ""
"**Clash Guard 覆盖项：**检查 `clash-guard-overrides.yaml` 中的 "
"`HANDLE_FIELDS` 是否覆盖了预期值。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Generated configuration:** inspect `clash-config.yaml`, or call "
"`get_runtime_yaml()` to view the in-memory configuration."
msgstr ""
"**生成结果：**检查 `clash-config.yaml`，或调用 `get_runtime_yaml()` 查看内存"
"中的配置。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Reload or restart:** confirm that `patch_profiles_config`, "
"`patch_verge_config`, or `restart_sidecar` ran, and check the logs for the "
"result of `PUT /configs`."
msgstr ""
"**重载或重启：**确认是否执行了 `patch_profiles_config`、`patch_verge_config` "
"或 `restart_sidecar`，并查看日志中 `PUT /configs` 的结果。"

#: src/chimera/runtime_config.md
msgid ""
"**Port problems:** check whether the port strategy changed `external-"
"controller`."
msgstr "**端口问题：**检查端口策略是否修改了 `external-controller`。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"Service mode changes **who owns the client core process**. It does not add "
"proxy protocol features and it does not change rule, DNS, or outbound "
"semantics."
msgstr ""
"服务模式改变的是**谁拥有客户端核心进程**。它不会增加代理协议能力，也不会改变"
"规则、DNS 或出站语义。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"In foreground mode the desktop application starts and owns the selected core "
"process directly. In service mode the desktop application delegates core "
"lifecycle to `Chimera_Service` over local IPC."
msgstr ""
"前台模式下，桌面应用直接启动并拥有所选核心进程；服务模式下，桌面应用通过本地 "
"IPC 把核心生命周期委托给 `Chimera_Service`。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Source Boundaries"
msgstr "源码边界"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "The desktop-side integration lives primarily under:"
msgstr "桌面端集成主要位于："

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`Chimera/backend/tauri/src/core/clash/core.rs`,"
msgstr "`Chimera/backend/tauri/src/core/clash/core.rs`，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`Chimera/backend/tauri/src/core/service/`,"
msgstr "`Chimera/backend/tauri/src/core/service/`，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`Chimera/backend/tauri/src/config/chimera/mod.rs`."
msgstr "`Chimera/backend/tauri/src/config/chimera/mod.rs`。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"The privileged service implementation lives in the `Chimera_Service` "
"repository. Its IPC definitions and server routes are split between "
"`chimera_ipc` and `chimera_service`."
msgstr ""
"特权服务实现在 `Chimera_Service` 仓库中。其 IPC 定义与服务端路由分别位于 "
"`chimera_ipc` 和 `chimera_service`。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Current IPC Surface"
msgstr "当前 IPC 接口"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "The inspected service source exposes these core operations:"
msgstr "已检查的服务源码暴露以下核心操作："

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`GET /status`"
msgstr "`GET /status`"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Read service/runtime/core status."
msgstr "读取服务/运行时/核心状态。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`POST /core/start`"
msgstr "`POST /core/start`"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Start a selected core using a supplied config path."
msgstr "使用提供的配置路径启动所选核心。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`POST /core/stop`"
msgstr "`POST /core/stop`"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Stop the running core."
msgstr "停止正在运行的核心。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`POST /core/restart`"
msgstr "`POST /core/restart`"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Restart the managed core."
msgstr "重启受管理的核心。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`POST /network/set_dns`"
msgstr "`POST /network/set_dns`"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"Perform the supported privileged DNS operation on platforms where that path "
"is implemented."
msgstr "在已实现该路径的平台上执行受支持的特权 DNS 操作。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"The IPC crate also contains WebSocket event definitions and log-related API "
"surfaces. Treat these as local control-plane interfaces, not as remote proxy "
"protocols."
msgstr ""
"IPC crate 还包含 WebSocket 事件定义和日志相关 API。应把它们视为本地控制面接"
"口，而不是远程代理协议。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
