msgstr "`chimera-service`"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Lifecycle calls"
msgstr "生命周期调用"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Direct child-process management"
msgstr "直接管理子进程"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "IPC requests to the service"
msgstr "通过 IPC 请求服务"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Privilege boundary"
msgstr "权限边界"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Desktop/user process"
msgstr "桌面/用户进程"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Privileged service boundary"
msgstr "特权服务边界"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Config generation"
msgstr "配置生成"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "桌面端"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Proxy protocol implementation"
msgstr "代理协议实现"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Selected core"
msgstr "所选核心"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "GUI/controller role"
msgstr "GUI/控制器角色"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Directly manages core"
msgstr "直接管理核心"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Sends requests and observes service/core state"
msgstr "发送请求并观察服务/核心状态"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"The desktop still generates the runtime configuration in service mode. The "
"service receives the core type and config path; it does not independently "
"merge profiles or reinterpret proxy rules."
msgstr ""
"服务模式下运行时配置仍由桌面端生成。服务接收核心类型与配置路径，并不会自行合"
"并配置档案或重新解释代理规则。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Start Flow"
msgstr "启动流程"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "At a high level, service-mode startup is:"
msgstr "从高层看，服务模式启动流程为："

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Chimera selects the configured core type."
msgstr "Chimera 选择已配置的核心类型。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Chimera builds or refreshes the generated runtime configuration."
msgstr "Chimera 构建或刷新生成的运行时配置。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"The desktop converts its core selection into `chimera_utils::core::CoreType`."
msgstr "桌面端把核心选择转换为 `chimera_utils::core::CoreType`。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Chimera checks/uses the service IPC client."
msgstr "Chimera 检查并使用服务 IPC 客户端。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"A `/core/start` request is sent with the core type and generated config path."
msgstr "携带核心类型与生成配置路径发送 `/core/start` 请求。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`chimera-service` creates and supervises the child core process."
msgstr "`chimera-service` 创建并监管核心子进程。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"Status/events are used to reflect the resulting runtime state back to the "
"desktop application."
msgstr "通过状态/事件把最终运行状态反馈给桌面应用。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"The source also handles races where service/core status can change between a "
"status check and a start request. Documentation should therefore avoid "
"presenting service start as a single infallible toggle."
msgstr ""
"源码还处理了状态查询与启动请求之间服务/核心状态可能发生变化的竞态。因此文档不"
"应把服务启动描述成一次绝不会失败的简单开关。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Restart and Configuration Changes"
msgstr "重启与配置变更"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "A runtime setting can fall into one of three categories:"
msgstr "运行时设置可分为三类："

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "handled through the selected core's own controller/hot-reload path,"
msgstr "通过所选核心自身的 controller/热重载路径处理，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "written into generated configuration and requiring core restart,"
msgstr "写入生成配置并需要重启核心，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "owned by Chimera or the OS and not part of core config at all."
msgstr "由 Chimera 或操作系统负责，根本不属于核心配置。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"Service mode does not change this classification. It changes the restart "
"path from direct process management to `/core/restart` or a stop/start "
"sequence through the service."
msgstr ""
"服务模式不会改变这种分类；它只是把重启路径从直接进程管理改为通过服务执行 `/"
"core/restart` 或 stop/start 流程。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"When documenting an individual setting, verify its actual update path before "
"claiming that it is hot-reloadable."
msgstr "记录具体设置时，应先核实真实更新路径，再声称它支持热重载。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Service Installation and Platform Managers"
msgstr "服务安装与平台服务管理器"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Service` uses platform service-manager integration to install, "
"start, stop, query, and uninstall the privileged service. Windows also has "
"dedicated Windows-service control code."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera_Service` 通过平台 service-manager 集成安装、启动、停止、查询和卸载特"
"权服务；Windows 另外还有专门的 Windows Service 控制代码。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"The exact operating-system registration details are an implementation "
"concern of `Chimera_Service`; the desktop application should treat the "
"service as a managed local control endpoint."
msgstr ""
"具体的操作系统服务注册细节属于 `Chimera_Service` 的实现职责；桌面应用应把它视"
"为受管理的本地控制端点。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"Do not assume GUI settings such as “start at boot”, “auto recover”, or “keep "
"running after GUI exit” exist merely because they are common in other proxy "
"applications. They should be documented only when the corresponding Chimera "
"setting and service behavior are present in source."
msgstr ""
"不要因为“开机启动”“自动恢复”“GUI 退出后继续运行”等选项在其他代理应用中常见，"
"就假定 Chimera 也存在这些设置。只有当源码中确实存在对应设置与服务行为时才应写"
"入文档。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Failure Model"
msgstr "故障模型"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"Troubleshoot service mode by separating desktop, IPC, service, and core "
"failures:"
msgstr "排查服务模式时，应把桌面端、IPC、服务和核心故障分开："

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Service is not installed or cannot start"
msgstr "服务未安装或无法启动"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "OS service manager / installation privileges"
msgstr "操作系统服务管理器 / 安装权限"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "GUI cannot query status"
msgstr "GUI 无法查询状态"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "local IPC endpoint, ACL/permissions, service process"
msgstr "本地 IPC 端点、ACL/权限、服务进程"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "`/core/start` fails"
msgstr "`/core/start` 失败"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"core type, config path, executable availability, service-side process spawn"
msgstr "核心类型、配置路径、可执行文件是否存在、服务端进程创建"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Service is healthy but proxy traffic fails"
msgstr "服务正常但代理流量失败"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "selected core logs/config/protocol path"
msgstr "所选核心的日志/配置/协议路径"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Config change appears ignored"
msgstr "配置变更看起来未生效"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "determine whether the setting needs hot reload or core restart"
msgstr "确认该设置需要热重载还是核心重启"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Core exits unexpectedly"
msgstr "核心意外退出"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "service core-manager status and captured core output/logs"
msgstr "服务 core-manager 状态以及捕获的核心输出/日志"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"A healthy `chimera-service` process does not imply a healthy proxy core, and "
"a healthy proxy core does not imply successful remote protocol negotiation."
msgstr ""
"`chimera-service` 进程正常并不意味着代理核心正常；代理核心正常也不意味着远程"
"协议协商一定成功。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Security Boundary"
msgstr "安全边界"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"Service mode introduces a privileged local control plane. Operational "
"guidance should therefore emphasize:"
msgstr "服务模式引入了本地特权控制面，因此运维文档应强调："

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"restrict local IPC access with the repository's ACL/security mechanisms,"
msgstr "使用仓库提供的 ACL/安全机制限制本地 IPC 访问，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "do not treat a user-supplied config path as harmless input,"
msgstr "不要把用户提供的配置路径当作无害输入，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "keep the desktop, service, and shared IPC/types compatible,"
msgstr "保持桌面端、服务以及共享 IPC/types 的兼容性，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"inspect both service logs and core logs when diagnosing privilege-related "
"networking failures."
msgstr "排查权限相关网络故障时同时检查服务日志和核心日志。"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "Useful source-level checks are:"
msgstr "有用的源码级检查包括："

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "confirm `/status` reports the expected core state,"
msgstr "确认 `/status` 返回预期核心状态，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"exercise start/stop/restart through the same IPC client used by Chimera,"
msgstr "通过 Chimera 实际使用的同一 IPC 客户端测试启动/停止/重启，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "verify the generated config path exists and is readable by the service,"
msgstr "确认生成的配置路径存在且服务可读取，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid "verify the selected core executable matches the requested `CoreType`,"
msgstr "确认所选核心可执行文件与请求的 `CoreType` 匹配，"

#: src/chimera/service-mode.md
msgid ""
"test privileged networking operations separately from proxy connectivity."
msgstr "把特权网络操作与代理连通性分开测试。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "Role in the Ecosystem"
msgstr "在生态中的角色"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"`AChimera` is the Android application layer for the Chimera client "
"ecosystem. It is not a separate proxy protocol implementation. The Android "
"app owns the platform-specific VPN lifecycle, profile storage, user "
"interface, and telemetry presentation, while packet forwarding is delegated "
"to the embedded Rust core through UniFFI."
msgstr ""
"`AChimera` 是 Chimera 客户端生态的 Android 应用层，并不是独立的代理协议实现。"
"Android 应用负责平台特定的 VPN 生命周期、配置档案存储、用户界面和遥测展示，而"
"数据包转发通过 UniFFI 委托给嵌入式 Rust 核心。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "The core runtime shape is:"
msgstr "核心运行结构如下："

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "The Android repository is easiest to understand through these files:"
msgstr "理解 Android 仓库时，以下文件最关键："

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/backend/ChimeraBackend.kt`: "
"application backend contract."
msgstr ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/backend/ChimeraBackend.kt`：应用后端接"
"口约定。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/backend/ChimeraBackendImpl.kt`: "
"profile, runtime, controller, traffic, memory, and connection orchestration."
msgstr ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/backend/ChimeraBackendImpl.kt`：配置档"
"案、运行时、控制器、流量、内存与连接编排。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/service/TunService.kt`: Android "
"`VpnService` lifecycle and TUN ownership."
msgstr ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/service/TunService.kt`：Android "
"`VpnService` 生命周期与 TUN 所有权。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/ffi/ChimeraFfi.kt`: UniFFI "
"initialization and socket-protection bridge."
msgstr ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/ffi/ChimeraFfi.kt`：UniFFI 初始化与 "
"socket protection 桥接。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/ffi/Clash.kt`: Rust core startup "
"bridge."
msgstr ""
"`app/src/main/java/rs/chimera/android/ffi/Clash.kt`：Rust 核心启动桥接。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "VPN Startup Flow"
msgstr "VPN 启动流程"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "A normal Android VPN start follows this sequence:"
msgstr "正常的 Android VPN 启动顺序如下："

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "The backend verifies that an active profile exists."
msgstr "后端确认存在活动配置档案。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"Android `VpnService.prepare(...)` is used to request VPN permission when the "
"user has not granted it yet."
msgstr ""
"如果用户尚未授权 VPN，则通过 Android `VpnService.prepare(...)` 请求权限。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "`TunService` is started as the Android VPN service."
msgstr "以 Android VPN 服务的形式启动 `TunService`。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "The service resolves and validates the active profile path."
msgstr "服务解析并校验活动配置档案路径。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"Android creates the TUN interface and detaches the file descriptor used by "
"the Rust runtime."
msgstr "Android 创建 TUN 接口，并分离出供 Rust 运行时使用的文件描述符。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"The profile and runtime overrides are passed through the UniFFI bridge to "
"the Chimera client core."
msgstr "配置档案与运行时覆盖项通过 UniFFI 桥接传给 Chimera 客户端核心。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "The core starts its local listeners and networking runtime."
msgstr "核心启动本地监听器与网络运行时。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"The service publishes runtime state and keeps ownership of the VPN/TUN "
"lifecycle until shutdown."
msgstr "服务发布运行时状态，并在关闭前持续持有 VPN/TUN 生命周期。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"A failure before the Rust core starts should be treated differently from a "
"failure after the core starts: the former is normally an Android permission, "
"profile, or TUN setup problem, while the latter belongs to runtime config, "
"listener, DNS, rule, or outbound initialization."
msgstr ""
"Rust 核心启动前的失败应与启动后的失败分开处理：前者通常属于 Android 权限、配"
"置档案或 TUN 初始化问题；后者则通常属于运行时配置、监听器、DNS、规则或出站初"
"始化。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "Socket Protection"
msgstr "套接字保护"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"Android VPN applications must prevent their own outbound sockets from being "
"captured by the VPN again. `AChimera` exposes a bridge from Rust back to "
"`VpnService.protect(fd)`."
msgstr ""
"Android VPN 应用必须避免自身的出站套接字再次被 VPN 捕获。`AChimera` 提供了从 "
"Rust 回调到 `VpnService.protect(fd)` 的桥接。"

#: src/achimera.md src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/anytls.md
#: src/protocols/trojan/traffic-handling.md src/protocols/tuic.md
#: src/protocols/vless.md src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
#: src/transports/xhttp.md src/transports/grpc-transport.md
#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md
msgid "Conceptually:"
msgstr "概念上可以表示为："

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"Without this protection, a remote proxy connection can recursively enter the "
"same TUN path and fail or loop."
msgstr ""
"缺少这种保护时，远程代理连接可能递归进入同一 TUN 路径，从而失败或形成循环。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "Profile Lifecycle"
msgstr "配置档案生命周期"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "The current backend supports both local and remote profiles."
msgstr "当前后端同时支持本地与远程配置档案。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"For local profiles it tracks metadata such as profile ID, display name, file "
"path, active state, creation time, and size."
msgstr ""
"对于本地配置档案，会记录 ID、显示名称、文件路径、活动状态、创建时间和大小等元"
"数据。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"For remote profiles it additionally stores source URL and update metadata, "
"and uses the Rust-side download helper for retrieval. A downloaded profile "
"is not assumed valid merely because the HTTP request succeeded: "
"configuration verification is exposed separately through the UniFFI layer."
msgstr ""
"对于远程配置档案，还会保存来源 URL 与更新元数据，并使用 Rust 侧下载助手进行获"
"取。HTTP 请求成功并不意味着下载的配置一定有效；配置校验通过 UniFFI 层单独提"
"供。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"Profile deletion is deliberately defensive. The repository contains policy "
"objects for staging, persistence, deletion, and recovery so that an "
"interrupted or failed delete operation does not silently corrupt the profile "
"catalog."
msgstr ""
"配置档案删除采用防御式设计。仓库中包含暂存、持久化、删除与恢复策略对象，避免"
"删除被中断或失败时静默破坏配置目录。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "Relevant tests include:"
msgstr "相关测试包括："

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "`ProfileCatalogPolicyTest`"
msgstr "`ProfileCatalogPolicyTest`"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "`ProfileDeletionPolicyTest`"
msgstr "`ProfileDeletionPolicyTest`"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "`ProfileDeletionRecoveryPolicyTest`"
msgstr "`ProfileDeletionRecoveryPolicyTest`"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "`ProfileFilePolicyTest`"
msgstr "`ProfileFilePolicyTest`"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "`ProfilePersistencePolicyTest`"
msgstr "`ProfilePersistencePolicyTest`"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "`ProfileRemotePolicyTest`"
msgstr "`ProfileRemotePolicyTest`"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "Runtime Settings"
msgstr "运行时设置"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "The Android app currently exposes runtime listener overrides for:"
msgstr "Android 应用当前提供以下运行时监听端口覆盖："

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "mixed port,"
msgstr "mixed 端口，"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "HTTP port,"
msgstr "HTTP 端口，"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "SOCKS port."
msgstr "SOCKS 端口。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"These settings are application/runtime overrides. They do not define which "
"remote proxy protocols are compiled into the embedded core. Protocol "
"availability still follows the `Chimera_Client` build and configuration."
msgstr ""
"这些设置属于应用/运行时覆盖项，并不决定嵌入式核心编译了哪些远程代理协议。协议"
"可用性仍取决于 `Chimera_Client` 的构建与配置。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "Observability"
msgstr "可观测性"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"`ChimeraBackendImpl` polls the embedded controller and exposes application "
"state for:"
msgstr "`ChimeraBackendImpl` 轮询嵌入式控制器，并向应用暴露以下状态："

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "total traffic,"
msgstr "总流量，"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "memory usage,"
msgstr "内存使用量，"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "active connections,"
msgstr "活动连接，"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "service/runtime state,"
msgstr "服务/运行时状态，"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "runtime errors."
msgstr "运行时错误。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"The Android UI therefore consumes controller state from the Rust core rather "
"than maintaining a second independent accounting model."
msgstr ""
"因此 Android UI 使用 Rust 核心控制器提供的状态，而不是维护第二套独立的统计模"
"型。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid "Failure Boundaries"
msgstr "故障边界"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"When troubleshooting Android, identify the failing layer before changing "
"proxy protocol settings:"
