#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"`AChimera` and the desktop `Chimera` application are sibling control "
"surfaces, not two layers that normally run in one forwarding path."
msgstr ""
"`AChimera` 与桌面端 `Chimera` 是并列的控制界面，而不是通常会串联在一条转发路"
"径上的两层。"

#: src/achimera.md
msgid ""
"The desktop application can choose and manage external core processes or "
"`Chimera_Service`; Android embeds the client core in the application and "
"passes its TUN file descriptor through UniFFI. Both ultimately depend on "
"`Chimera_Client` behavior for Clash-style configuration and proxy forwarding."
msgstr ""
"桌面应用可以选择并管理外部核心进程或 `Chimera_Service`；Android 则把客户端核"
"心嵌入应用，并通过 UniFFI 传递 TUN 文件描述符。两者最终都依赖 "
"`Chimera_Client` 来实现 Clash 风格配置与代理转发。"

