#: src/chimera_server.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Server` is the inbound/server core of the Chimera ecosystem. Its "
"configuration model intentionally follows Xray-style `inbounds`, "
"`streamSettings`, transport wrappers, and security settings, but "
"compatibility must be evaluated field by field and path by path rather than "
"assumed from configuration shape alone."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera_Server` 是 Chimera 生态中的入站/服务端核心。其配置模型刻意遵循 Xray "
"风格的 `inbounds`、`streamSettings`、传输封装和安全设置，但兼容性必须逐字段、"
"逐路径判断，不能仅凭配置形状推断。"

