msgid "`UDP ASSOCIATE`"
msgstr "`UDP ASSOCIATE`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"UDP relay uses the TCP SOCKS connection as the lifetime/control channel. The "
"proxy returns an address and UDP port where the client sends SOCKS-framed "
"UDP datagrams. The association ends when the corresponding TCP control "
"connection ends."
msgstr ""
"UDP 转发使用 SOCKS TCP 连接作为生命周期与控制通道。代理会返回一个地址和 UDP "
"端口，客户端把带 SOCKS 封装的 UDP 数据报发送到该端点。对应 TCP 控制连接结束"
"时，这个关联也随之结束。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"UDP support is therefore a separate capability from basic SOCKS5 TCP "
"support; do not assume that every SOCKS5 implementation supports it equally "
"well."
msgstr ""
"因此 UDP 支持是独立于基础 SOCKS5 TCP 支持的能力；不要假设所有 SOCKS5 实现对 "
"UDP 的支持程度都相同。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Wire-Level Interaction and State Machine"
msgstr "线级交互与状态机"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The most important difference between SOCKS5 and many modern proxy protocols "
"is that SOCKS5 has a small explicit control protocol before raw forwarding "
"begins. After the handshake completes, the proxy normally stops interpreting "
"payload bytes."
msgstr ""
"SOCKS5 与许多现代代理协议最重要的区别之一，是它在开始裸数据转发之前有一套很小"
"但明确的控制协议。握手完成后，代理通常不再解释后续负载字节。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "TCP connection and negotiation"
msgstr "TCP 连接与协商"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The TCP session between application and SOCKS server starts with a method "
"selection exchange:"
msgstr "应用与 SOCKS 服务端之间的 TCP 会话首先进行认证方法选择："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`METHOD` determines the next state. Common values include:"
msgstr "`METHOD` 决定下一状态，常见取值包括："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0x00` — no authentication."
msgstr "`0x00` — 无需认证。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0x02` — username/password authentication defined by RFC 1929."
msgstr "`0x02` — RFC 1929 定义的用户名/密码认证。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0xff` — no acceptable method."
msgstr "`0xff` — 没有可接受的认证方法。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Username/password authentication"
msgstr "用户名/密码认证"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "When RFC 1929 authentication is selected, the exchange becomes:"
msgstr "选择 RFC 1929 认证后，交互过程变为："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The authentication layer only proves identity to the SOCKS server. It does "
"not encrypt the TCP stream."
msgstr "认证层只用于向 SOCKS 服务端证明身份，并不会加密 TCP 字节流。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Request command frame"
msgstr "请求命令帧"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "After authentication, the client sends:"
msgstr "认证完成后，客户端发送："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Important fields:"
msgstr "重要字段："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`CMD` selects `CONNECT`, `BIND`, or `UDP ASSOCIATE`."
msgstr "`CMD` 用于选择 `CONNECT`、`BIND` 或 `UDP ASSOCIATE`。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`ATYP` selects address encoding."
msgstr "`ATYP` 用于选择地址编码。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "IPv4 uses 4 bytes."
msgstr "IPv4 使用 4 字节。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "IPv6 uses 16 bytes."
msgstr "IPv6 使用 16 字节。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Domain names use one length byte followed by domain bytes."
msgstr "域名使用 1 字节长度，随后跟对应数量的域名字节。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`DST.PORT` is an unsigned 16-bit network-order value."
msgstr "`DST.PORT` 是一个无符号 16 位网络字节序数值。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Server reply"
msgstr "服务端响应"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "The server returns:"
msgstr "服务端返回："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`REP` communicates the result. RFC 1928 defines these one-byte values:"
msgstr "`REP` 用于表示请求结果。RFC 1928 定义了以下单字节取值："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`REP`"
msgstr "`REP`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`0x00`"
msgstr "`0x00`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "succeeded"
msgstr "成功"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/anytls.md
#: src/protocols/trojan.md src/protocols/trojan/wire-format.md
#: src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "`0x01`"
msgstr "`0x01`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "general SOCKS server failure"
msgstr "SOCKS 服务器常规故障"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/trojan.md src/protocols/tuic.md
#: src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "`0x02`"
msgstr "`0x02`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "connection not allowed by ruleset"
msgstr "规则集不允许该连接"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/anytls.md
#: src/protocols/trojan.md src/protocols/trojan/wire-format.md
#: src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "`0x03`"
msgstr "`0x03`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "network unreachable"
msgstr "网络不可达"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/anytls.md
#: src/protocols/trojan.md src/protocols/trojan/wire-format.md
#: src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "`0x04`"
msgstr "`0x04`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "host unreachable"
msgstr "主机不可达"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0x05`"
msgstr "`0x05`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "connection refused"
msgstr "连接被拒绝"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0x06`"
msgstr "`0x06`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "TTL expired"
msgstr "TTL 已过期"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0x07`"
msgstr "`0x07`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "command not supported"
msgstr "不支持该命令"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "`0x08`"
msgstr "`0x08`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "address type not supported"
msgstr "不支持该地址类型"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0x09`\\-`0xff`"
msgstr "`0x09`\\-`0xff`"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "unassigned"
msgstr "未分配"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"For a failed request, RFC 1928 requires the SOCKS server to close the TCP "
"connection shortly after sending the reply. A client should therefore treat "
"a non-zero `REP` as terminal for that request instead of waiting for a later "
"application payload."
msgstr ""
"对于失败请求，RFC 1928 要求 SOCKS 服务器在发送回复后不久关闭 TCP 连接。因此客"
"户端应把非零 `REP` 视为该请求的终止结果，而不是继续等待后续应用层负载。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"After a successful `CONNECT`, the state machine changes from **control "
"protocol** to **transparent byte relay**:"
msgstr ""
"`CONNECT` 成功后，状态机会从**控制协议阶段**切换到**透明字节转发阶段**："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The SOCKS server does not parse HTTP, TLS, SSH, or application protocols "
"after this transition."
msgstr ""
"完成这一转换后，SOCKS 服务端不会继续解析 HTTP、TLS、SSH 或其他应用层协议。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`BIND`: two replies, not one"
msgstr "`BIND`：不是一次，而是两次回复"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"`BIND` is unusual because one request can produce **two successful server "
"replies**. It was designed for protocols in which the proxied application "
"expects a peer to connect back to it."
msgstr ""
"`BIND` 的特殊之处在于，一个请求可能产生**两次成功的服务端回复**。它用于被代理"
"应用需要等待对端反向建立连接的协议场景。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The first `BND.ADDR/BND.PORT` is the listening endpoint created by the SOCKS "
"server. The second identifies the remote peer after the inbound connection "
"is accepted. This is materially different from `CONNECT`, where one success "
"reply is enough to enter the relay state."
msgstr ""
"第一次回复中的 `BND.ADDR/BND.PORT` 是 SOCKS 服务器创建的监听端点；第二次回复"
"则在入站连接被接受后标识实际连接进来的远端对端。这与 `CONNECT` 明显不同，后者"
"一次成功回复即可进入转发状态。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"An implementation state machine therefore needs a distinct `BIND_WAIT_PEER` "
"state rather than treating every `REP=0x00` as permission to begin "
"application relay immediately."
msgstr ""
"因此实现状态机需要单独的 `BIND_WAIT_PEER` 状态，不能把每个 `REP=0x00` 都理解"
"为可以立即开始应用数据转发。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`UDP ASSOCIATE` datagram wire format"
msgstr "`UDP ASSOCIATE` 数据报线格式"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"`UDP ASSOCIATE` uses the TCP SOCKS connection only as the control/lifetime "
"channel. UDP payloads themselves use a separate SOCKS5 UDP header:"
msgstr ""
"`UDP ASSOCIATE` 只把 TCP SOCKS 连接作为控制与生命周期通道；UDP 负载本身使用独"
"立的 SOCKS5 UDP 头："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Fields:"
msgstr "字段："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`RSV` is two zero bytes (`0x0000`)."
msgstr "`RSV` 为两个零字节（`0x0000`）。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`FRAG=0x00` means the datagram is not fragmented."
msgstr "`FRAG=0x00` 表示该数据报未分片。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"`ATYP`, `DST.ADDR`, and `DST.PORT` use the same destination-address model as "
"the TCP request command."
msgstr ""
"`ATYP`、`DST.ADDR` 和 `DST.PORT` 使用与 TCP 请求命令相同的目标地址模型。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`DATA` is exactly one application UDP datagram payload."
msgstr "`DATA` 恰好对应一个应用层 UDP 数据报的负载。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The important boundary property is that UDP itself already preserves "
"datagram boundaries. SOCKS5 therefore prepends routing metadata to **each "
"UDP datagram** instead of turning all UDP traffic into one byte stream."
msgstr ""
"一个关键的边界特性是 UDP 本身就保留数据报边界。因此 SOCKS5 会在**每个 UDP 数"
"据报**前附加路由元数据，而不是把所有 UDP 流量转换成单一字节流。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Fragmentation semantics"
msgstr "分片语义"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"RFC 1928 defines a SOCKS-layer fragmentation mechanism through `FRAG`, but "
"also states that an implementation may choose not to support it. An "
"implementation that does not support fragmentation must drop any datagram "
"whose `FRAG` field is not zero."
msgstr ""
"RFC 1928 通过 `FRAG` 定义了 SOCKS 层分片机制，但同时允许实现选择不支持该机"
"制。不支持分片的实现必须丢弃所有 `FRAG` 字段非零的数据报。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"When fragmentation is implemented, the low seven bits carry the fragment "
"sequence number and the high bit marks the final fragment. Reassembly has a "
"short expiration timer and a fragment arriving with a lower sequence number "
"than the highest already seen causes the reassembly queue to be discarded."
msgstr ""
"实现分片时，低七位携带分片序号，最高位用于标记最后一个分片。重组具有较短的过"
"期计时器；如果收到的分片序号低于此前见到的最高序号，应丢弃当前重组队列。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"This makes SOCKS5 fragmentation very different from protocols such as "
"Hysteria 2 or TUIC, whose fragment headers explicitly carry packet/session "
"identifiers and fragment counts."
msgstr ""
"这使 SOCKS5 分片与 Hysteria 2、TUIC 等协议明显不同：后者的分片头会显式携带数"
"据包/会话标识以及分片数量。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "UDP association lifecycle and source binding"
msgstr "UDP 关联生命周期与源端绑定"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The client first sends a normal TCP `UDP ASSOCIATE` request. A successful "
"reply returns `BND.ADDR/BND.PORT`, the UDP relay endpoint to which the "
"client sends SOCKS5 UDP datagrams."
msgstr ""
"客户端首先通过 TCP 发送普通的 `UDP ASSOCIATE` 请求。成功回复会返回 `BND.ADDR/"
"BND.PORT`，客户端随后把 SOCKS5 UDP 数据报发送到这个 UDP 中继端点。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The TCP connection is the association's lifetime anchor: once it closes, the "
"UDP association terminates. RFC 1928 also requires the server to restrict "
"relay traffic to the client associated with that TCP request rather than "
"behaving as an unrestricted public UDP forwarder."
msgstr ""
"TCP 连接是该关联的生命周期锚点：一旦 TCP 连接关闭，UDP 关联也随之终止。RFC "
"1928 还要求服务器只为与该 TCP 请求关联的客户端转发流量，而不能充当不受限制的"
"公共 UDP 转发器。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The client may put all-zero address/port values in the request when it does "
"not know the UDP source endpoint at request time. The server reply, not the "
"request, is the authoritative destination for the client's SOCKS-"
"encapsulated UDP traffic."
msgstr ""
"如果客户端在请求时还不知道自己的 UDP 源端点，可以在请求中填入全零地址/端口。"
"对于客户端封装后的 SOCKS UDP 流量，真正权威的发送目标是服务端回复，而不是请求"
"中的地址。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Control/data state machine"
msgstr "控制面/数据面状态机"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "The complete baseline state machine is therefore:"
msgstr "因此完整的基准状态机如下："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Packet-capture view"
msgstr "抓包视角"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5 is unencrypted unless the selected authentication method adds its own "
"encapsulation. A normal packet capture can therefore expose the protocol "
"phases directly:"
msgstr ""
"除非选定的认证方法额外提供封装，否则 SOCKS5 本身不加密。因此普通抓包通常可以"
"直接看到各协议阶段："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"For UDP, the capture additionally shows independent UDP packets beginning "
"with `00 00 FRAG ATYP ...`. This clear separation between a TCP control "
"association and a UDP data plane is one of the most useful reference points "
"when comparing SOCKS5 with QUIC-native proxy protocols."
msgstr ""
"对于 UDP，抓包还会看到以 `00 00 FRAG ATYP ...` 开头的独立 UDP 数据包。TCP 控"
"制关联与 UDP 数据面的这种明确分离，是比较 SOCKS5 与 QUIC 原生代理协议时最有价"
"值的基准之一。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "SOCKS5 Compared With Modern Proxy Protocols"
msgstr "SOCKS5 与现代代理协议对比"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5 is useful as a reference model because most modern proxy protocols "
"solve the same logical problems with additional layers:"
msgstr ""
"SOCKS5 很适合作为参考模型，因为大多数现代代理协议解决的是相同的逻辑问题，只是"
"增加了更多层："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Function"
msgstr "功能"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Modern protocols"
msgstr "现代协议"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "User selection"
msgstr "用户/认证选择"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "METHOD + authentication"
msgstr "METHOD + 认证"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "UUID/password/token systems"
msgstr "UUID/密码/token 体系"

