msgstr "目标地址"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "ATYP + DST.ADDR"
msgstr "ATYP + DST.ADDR"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Similar address structures or protocol-specific metadata"
msgstr "类似的地址结构或协议专用元数据"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "TCP forwarding"
msgstr "TCP 转发"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "CONNECT then raw stream"
msgstr "CONNECT 后进入裸字节流"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Usually stream multiplexing or framed transport"
msgstr "通常采用流多路复用或分帧传输"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "UDP forwarding"
msgstr "UDP 转发"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "UDP ASSOCIATE"
msgstr "UDP ASSOCIATE"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "QUIC datagrams, custom UDP framing, multiplexed channels"
msgstr "QUIC Datagram、自定义 UDP 分帧或多路复用通道"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "加密"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Not included"
msgstr "协议本身不提供"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Usually TLS, QUIC TLS, REALITY, or protocol-specific security"
msgstr "通常使用 TLS、QUIC TLS、REALITY 或协议专用安全层"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/anytls.md
#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Multiplexing"
msgstr "多路复用"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Not defined"
msgstr "未定义"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Common in QUIC/Xray transports"
msgstr "在 QUIC/Xray 传输中很常见"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "The conceptual mapping is:"
msgstr "概念上的映射关系是："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"Modern protocols generally did not replace the SOCKS5 idea; they expanded "
"the control plane and moved more functionality into the protocol itself."
msgstr ""
"现代协议通常并不是抛弃 SOCKS5 的基本思想，而是扩展控制面，并把更多能力下沉到"
"协议本身。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Minimal Configuration"
msgstr "最小配置"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "A local `chimera_client`\\-style profile can start with:"
msgstr "本地 `chimera_client` 风格配置可以从下面的最小配置开始："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "An application can then use:"
msgstr "应用随后可以使用："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"socks5://127.0.0.1:7891\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"socks5://127.0.0.1:7891\n"
"```"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"When DNS behavior matters, distinguish between applications that resolve the "
"domain locally and applications that pass the domain name to the SOCKS "
"proxy. That difference can affect domain rules."
msgstr ""
"当 DNS 行为会影响路由时，需要区分两类应用：一类先在本地解析域名，另一类把域名"
"直接交给 SOCKS 代理解析。两者的差异会影响域名规则。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vless.md
#: src/transports/xhttp.md src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Strengths"
msgstr "优势"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Generic TCP proxying without HTTP-specific assumptions."
msgstr "不依赖 HTTP 语义的通用 TCP 代理能力。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Domain-name, IPv4, and IPv6 destination forms."
msgstr "支持域名、IPv4 和 IPv6 三种目标地址形式。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Standardized UDP relay mechanism."
msgstr "标准化的 UDP 转发机制。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"Widely supported by developer tools, browsers, SSH tooling, and networking "
"libraries."
msgstr "被开发工具、浏览器、SSH 工具链以及网络库广泛支持。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Low protocol overhead and easy local debugging."
msgstr "协议开销低，本地调试简单。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vless.md
#: src/transports/xhttp.md src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "SOCKS5 itself does not provide transport encryption."
msgstr "SOCKS5 本身不提供传输加密。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"Application support is required unless traffic is captured by another layer."
msgstr "除非由其他层捕获流量，否则应用本身必须支持 SOCKS5。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"UDP relay behavior can vary among clients, NATs, and proxy implementations."
msgstr "不同客户端、NAT 环境和代理实现之间的 UDP 转发行为可能存在差异。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"Basic username/password authentication should not be treated as a substitute "
"for encrypted transport."
msgstr "基础用户名/密码认证不能替代加密传输。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "DNS and Rule Interaction"
msgstr "DNS 与规则交互"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5 can preserve a domain name all the way to the proxy when the "
"application uses remote resolution semantics. If the application resolves "
"locally first, the proxy may only see the resulting IP address."
msgstr ""
"当应用使用远程解析语义时，SOCKS5 可以一直把域名保留到代理端。如果应用先在本地"
"完成解析，代理可能只能看到解析后的 IP 地址。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "This matters for rules such as:"
msgstr "这会直接影响类似下面的规则："

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,example.com,Proxy"
msgstr "DOMAIN-SUFFIX,example.com,Proxy"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"If a domain rule unexpectedly stops matching, compare the application's DNS "
"behavior with the client DNS mode described in [DNS Module](../"
"chimera_client/dns.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果域名规则意外停止命中，应将应用的 DNS 行为与 [DNS 模块](../chimera_client/"
"dns.md) 中描述的客户端 DNS 模式进行对比。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
#: src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/trojan/wire-format.md src/protocols/hysteria2.md
#: src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md
#: src/transports/xhttp.md src/transports/grpc-transport.md
#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Security Notes"
msgstr "安全说明"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"For desktop use, bind SOCKS5 to loopback unless LAN access is intentional. "
"Publicly exposing an unauthenticated SOCKS listener creates an open-proxy "
"risk. If remote SOCKS access is required, place it behind a secure "
"authenticated channel rather than relying on SOCKS5 alone for "
"confidentiality."
msgstr ""
"桌面使用时，除非明确需要局域网访问，否则应把 SOCKS5 绑定到回环地址。把未认证"
"的 SOCKS 监听器暴露到公网会产生开放代理风险。如果确实需要远程 SOCKS 访问，应"
"将其置于安全且经过认证的通道之后，而不要只依赖 SOCKS5 本身提供机密性。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vmess.md
#: src/protocols/vless.md src/transports/xhttp.md
#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Chimera Status"
msgstr "Chimera 支持状态"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5 is documented as a current client-core inbound and is the recommended "
"starting point for validating proxy profiles. Treat TCP `CONNECT` as the "
"baseline capability; validate UDP association separately when an application "
"requires UDP."
msgstr ""
"当前文档将 SOCKS5 记录为客户端核心已有入站能力，并推荐将其作为验证代理配置的"
"起点。应把 TCP `CONNECT` 视为基础能力；当应用需要 UDP 时，应单独验证 UDP "
"association。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"Chimera configures the listener through the selected core. It does not "
"itself implement the SOCKS5 protocol."
msgstr "Chimera 通过当前选中的核心配置监听器，本身并不实现 SOCKS5 协议。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The current server capability map includes SOCKS-related inbound work. That "
"is an implementation map rather than a guarantee of complete RFC 1928 "
"parity, so server deployments should verify the commands and authentication "
"modes they actually require."
msgstr ""
"当前服务端能力地图包含 SOCKS 相关入站实现。它只是实现范围地图，并不保证完整达"
"到 RFC 1928 一致性，因此服务端部署应验证实际需要的命令与认证方式。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
#: src/protocols/trojan.md src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md
#: src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Test Evidence"
msgstr "测试证据"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"The current Server test index includes external-process SOCKS coverage in "
"`chimera_server_app/tests/socks_external_integration.rs` for both "
"unauthenticated TCP round trips and username/password TCP round trips. The "
"mixed-inbound process test also exercises SOCKS5 through a real mixed "
"listener."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 测试索引包含进程级 SOCKS 测试，位于 `chimera_server_app/tests/"
"socks_external_integration.rs`，覆盖无认证 TCP 往返以及用户名/密码认证 TCP 往"
"返。mixed 入站的进程级测试也通过真实的 mixed 监听器验证 SOCKS5。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"This evidence is TCP-focused. It must not be used to claim complete SOCKS5 "
"UDP ASSOCIATE support across every Chimera component; the currently audited "
"Client local SOCKS inbound explicitly has a UDP limitation. See [Test "
"Evidence and Interoperability Matrix](../test-evidence.md) and "
"[Implementation Status and Source Evidence](../implementation-status.md)."
msgstr ""
"这些证据聚焦于 TCP，不能据此宣称所有 Chimera 组件都完整支持 SOCKS5 UDP "
"ASSOCIATE；当前审计的 Client 本地 SOCKS 入站明确存在 UDP 限制。详见[测试证据"
"与互操作矩阵](../test-evidence.md)和[实现状态与源码证据](../implementation-"
"status.md)。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Confirm the listener is bound to the expected address and port."
msgstr "确认监听器绑定到预期地址和端口。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid "Test a simple TCP destination before testing UDP."
msgstr "测试 UDP 前先验证一个简单 TCP 目标。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"If domain rules fail, determine whether the application sends a domain name "
"or a pre-resolved IP address."
msgstr "如果域名规则失效，确认应用发送给代理的是域名还是预先解析好的 IP 地址。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"If authentication fails, test without authentication on loopback to isolate "
"protocol behavior from credential configuration."
msgstr ""
"如果认证失败，可以先在回环地址上关闭认证测试，以便把协议行为问题与凭据配置问"
"题分开。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"For UDP failures, verify that the TCP control connection remains open and "
"that local firewall/NAT rules allow the returned UDP relay endpoint."
msgstr ""
"如果 UDP 失败，确认 TCP 控制连接仍保持打开，并检查本地防火墙/NAT 规则是否允许"
"访问服务端返回的 UDP 转发端点。"

#: src/protocols/socks5.md
msgid ""
"If SOCKS works but TUN does not, debug TUN routing separately rather than "
"changing the proxy node configuration."
msgstr ""
"如果 SOCKS 正常但 TUN 不通，应单独排查 TUN 路由，而不是修改代理节点配置。"

