"parsing time, authentication retries, upstream-connect timeout, idle tunnel "
"lifetime, and half-closed TCP connections."
msgstr ""
"生产实现还需要限制请求头大小、解析耗时、认证重试次数、上游连接超时、空闲隧道"
"生命周期，并正确处理 TCP half-close。"

