#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"The final TLS arrows are logically end-to-end but their TCP bytes are "
"relayed through the proxy. If the proxy performs TLS interception instead, "
"that is a different architecture: two TLS sessions exist and the proxy is no "
"longer a blind CONNECT tunnel for that traffic."
msgstr ""
"最后的 TLS 交互在逻辑上是端到端的，但 TCP 字节由代理转发。如果代理执行 TLS "
"interception，则属于另一种架构：此时存在两条 TLS 会话，代理也不再是该流量的"
"盲 CONNECT 隧道。"

