msgstr "HTTP/1.1：原始字节；H2/H3：单条请求 Stream 的 DATA 帧内承载隧道字节"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Not defined by RFC 1928; normally one CONNECT per TCP control connection"
msgstr "RFC 1928 未定义多路复用；通常每条 TCP 控制连接对应一个 CONNECT"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "H2/H3 can carry many independent CONNECT streams on one HTTP connection"
msgstr "H2/H3 可以在一条 HTTP 连接上承载多条独立 CONNECT Stream"

#: src/protocols/http.md src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Reliable flow control"
msgstr "可靠数据流控"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "TCP receive window of that SOCKS connection"
msgstr "该 SOCKS 连接的 TCP 接收窗口"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"H1 inherits TCP; H2 adds connection/stream HTTP flow control; H3 uses QUIC "
"connection/stream flow control"
msgstr ""
"H1 继承 TCP 流控；H2 增加 HTTP 连接/Stream 流控；H3 使用 QUIC 连接/Stream 流"
"控"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Half-close"
msgstr "半关闭"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Inherited from the SOCKS TCP connection after reply"
msgstr "成功回复后继承 SOCKS TCP 连接的半关闭语义"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"H1 inherits TCP; H2 maps FIN to `END_STREAM`; H3 maps direction completion "
"to QUIC stream FIN"
msgstr ""
"H1 继承 TCP；H2 将 FIN 映射为 `END_STREAM`；H3 将方向完成映射为 QUIC Stream "
"FIN"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "General UDP relay"
msgstr "通用 UDP 转发"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "`UDP ASSOCIATE` is standardized"
msgstr "`UDP ASSOCIATE` 已标准化"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Basic CONNECT does not provide SOCKS-style UDP relay"
msgstr "基础 CONNECT 不提供 SOCKS 风格 UDP relay"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Control encoding"
msgstr "控制编码"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Compact binary"
msgstr "紧凑二进制"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"HTTP semantics; HTTP/1.1 text, H2 HPACK/framing, H3 QPACK/framing over QUIC"
msgstr ""
"HTTP 语义；HTTP/1.1 使用文本，H2 使用 HPACK/分帧，H3 在 QUIC 上使用 QPACK/分"
"帧"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "The most important conceptual correspondence is:"
msgstr "最重要的概念对应关系是："

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"The important differences are authentication timing and representation. "
"SOCKS5 negotiates an authentication method before its proxy command. HTTP "
"authentication is integrated into HTTP request/response semantics and can "
"require replaying the CONNECT request after a challenge."
msgstr ""
"关键差异在于认证时机与表示方式。SOCKS5 在代理命令之前协商认证方法；HTTP 认证"
"则整合进 HTTP 请求/响应语义，收到 challenge 后可能需要重新发送 CONNECT。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Edge Cases and Security Boundaries"
msgstr "边界情况与安全边界"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"A proxy must validate the CONNECT target before dialing it. RFC 9110 warns "
"specifically about unrestricted tunneling to arbitrary services; allowing "
"destinations such as SMTP ports can turn a web proxy into an abuse relay."
msgstr ""
"代理在拨号前必须校验 CONNECT 目标。RFC 9110 特别警告不要允许任意服务的无限制"
"隧道；例如允许连接 SMTP 端口可能把 Web 代理变成滥用中继。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"An empty or invalid CONNECT port is invalid. Policy should also restrict "
"destination ports where appropriate."
msgstr ""
"CONNECT 端口为空或无效时，请求本身无效；策略也应在适当场景限制目标端口。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Do not parse tunneled bytes as another HTTP request merely because they "
"arrive on the same client connection after a successful CONNECT. The "
"connection has changed semantic state."
msgstr ""
"不要仅因为隧道字节仍从同一客户端连接到达，就把它们解析成另一个 HTTP 请求。"
"CONNECT 成功后，连接语义状态已经改变。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Preserve bytes that arrive immediately after the CONNECT header boundary. "
"Implementations that over-read while parsing must pass those bytes into the "
"tunnel rather than discard them."
msgstr ""
"必须保留紧跟 CONNECT 头部边界到达的字节。解析过程中发生 over-read 的实现，应"
"把这些字节送入隧道，而不是丢弃。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Handle TCP half-close deliberately. When one side closes its sending "
"direction, already-received bytes still need a chance to drain to the peer."
msgstr ""
"应显式处理 TCP half-close。当一端关闭发送方向时，已经接收的数据仍应有机会完整"
"排空到另一端。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Authentication headers are hop-specific. `Proxy-Authorization` authenticates "
"to the relevant proxy, not to the final origin server."
msgstr ""
"认证头是逐跳（hop-specific）的。`Proxy-Authorization` 用于向当前代理认证，而"
"不是向最终源站认证。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Minimal Client-Side Configuration"
msgstr "最小客户端配置"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "A Clash-style local listener commonly looks like:"
msgstr "Clash 风格本地监听器通常类似："

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "bind-address"
msgstr "bind-address"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "allow-lan"
msgstr "allow-lan"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Applications can then use:"
msgstr "应用随后可以使用："

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"http://127.0.0.1:7890\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"http://127.0.0.1:7890\n"
"```"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "as their HTTP/HTTPS proxy endpoint."
msgstr "作为其 HTTP/HTTPS 代理端点。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"The exact key names depend on the selected Chimera core. See [Ports and "
"Listeners](../chimera_client/ports.md) for the current `chimera_client` "
"mapping."
msgstr ""
"具体配置键名称取决于当前选中的 Chimera 核心。`chimera_client` 的当前映射请参"
"阅 [端口与监听器](../chimera_client/ports.md)。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"HTTP proxies may add an authentication layer, but authentication support "
"varies by implementation. Common deployments use proxy-specific credentials "
"or place the proxy behind another authenticated control plane."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 代理可以增加认证层，但认证支持因实现而异。常见部署会使用代理专用凭据，或"
"将代理置于另一个经过认证的控制层之后。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Do not assume that authentication also encrypts the connection between the "
"application and the proxy. A plain local HTTP proxy has no transport "
"encryption unless TLS or another secure channel is explicitly added."
msgstr ""
"不要认为启用认证就等于加密应用与代理之间的连接。普通本地 HTTP 代理没有传输加"
"密，除非显式加入 TLS 或其他安全通道。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Broad support in browsers, package managers, CLI tools, and operating "
"systems."
msgstr "浏览器、包管理器、CLI 工具和操作系统广泛支持。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Simple to inspect and debug during local development."
msgstr "本地开发期间容易观察和调试。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"HTTPS traffic can be tunneled without terminating the application's TLS "
"session at the proxy."
msgstr "可以在不让代理终止应用 TLS 会话的情况下隧道转发 HTTPS 流量。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Well suited to local or trusted-LAN ingress into a proxy core."
msgstr "很适合作为本机或可信局域网进入代理核心的入站方式。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Primarily TCP-oriented; standard HTTP proxy behavior does not provide "
"general UDP relay."
msgstr "主要面向 TCP；标准 HTTP 代理行为不提供通用 UDP 转发。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"A clear-text proxy listener is unsuitable for direct exposure to the public "
"internet."
msgstr "明文代理监听器不适合直接暴露到公网。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Applications that ignore operating-system proxy settings will bypass it."
msgstr "忽略操作系统代理设置的应用会绕过它。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Authentication and header behavior vary across implementations."
msgstr "不同实现的认证和请求头行为可能不同。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"For a local desktop deployment, prefer binding the HTTP listener to "
"`127.0.0.1`. If LAN access is enabled, apply an explicit firewall policy and "
"understand which clients can reach the proxy."
msgstr ""
"本地桌面部署应优先把 HTTP 监听器绑定到 `127.0.0.1`。如果启用了局域网访问，应"
"配置明确的防火墙策略，并清楚哪些客户端可以访问代理。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Exposing an unauthenticated HTTP proxy publicly can turn the host into an "
"open proxy. Even when authentication is enabled, a plain HTTP connection can "
"expose credentials or metadata to observers on the local network."
msgstr ""
"把未认证 HTTP 代理公开暴露可能使主机变成开放代理。即使启用了认证，明文 HTTP "
"连接仍可能向本地网络观察者暴露凭据或元数据。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"The current Wiki documents an HTTP listener as part of the client-core "
"inbound surface. Availability can still depend on the selected build, "
"configuration, and runtime path. Validate HTTP `CONNECT` behavior with a "
"minimal profile before combining it with TUN, DNS hijacking, or complex "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"当前 Wiki 将 HTTP 监听器记录为客户端核心入站接口的一部分。是否实际可用仍可能"
"取决于构建版本、配置和运行时路径。在与 TUN、DNS 劫持或复杂规则组合之前，应先"
"使用最小配置验证 HTTP `CONNECT` 行为。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Chimera itself does not implement HTTP proxying. It configures and manages "
"the selected core, so listener behavior follows that core."
msgstr ""
"Chimera 本身不实现 HTTP 代理，而是配置和管理当前选中的核心，因此监听器行为由"
"该核心决定。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"HTTP proxying is mainly relevant as a local/client-side inbound. Server-side "
"HTTP capabilities should be treated separately from remote encrypted proxy "
"protocols such as Trojan, Hysteria 2, or VLESS."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 代理主要作为本地/客户端侧入站使用。服务端 HTTP 能力应与 Trojan、"
"Hysteria 2、VLESS 等远程加密代理协议分开理解。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"The current Server test index includes process-level HTTP and mixed-listener "
"coverage in `xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs::http_and_mixed_inbounds_proxy_tcp`. "
"That test exercises authenticated HTTP `CONNECT`, absolute-form HTTP "
"forwarding, transparent-style forwarding where enabled, HTTP through the "
"mixed inbound, and SOCKS5 through the same mixed listener."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 测试索引包含进程级 HTTP 和 mixed 监听器测试 "
"`xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs::http_and_mixed_inbounds_proxy_tcp`。该测试覆盖经过"
"认证的 HTTP `CONNECT`、absolute-form HTTP 转发、启用时的透明代理式转发、通过 "
"mixed 入站处理 HTTP，以及通过同一 mixed 监听器处理 SOCKS5。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"This is stronger than parser-only evidence, but it should not be generalized "
"to every HTTP version or every extended-CONNECT behavior described earlier "
"in this protocol reference. See [Test Evidence and Interoperability Matrix]"
"(../test-evidence.md) for the exact evidence classification."
msgstr ""
"这比仅有解析器测试的证据更充分，但不能将其泛化为对本协议参考前文所述所有 "
"HTTP 版本或 extended-CONNECT 行为的验证。具体证据分类请参阅[测试证据与互操作"
"矩阵](../test-evidence.md)。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "If a browser or CLI tool cannot connect:"
msgstr "如果浏览器或 CLI 工具无法连接："

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Verify the listener address and port."
msgstr "检查监听地址和端口。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Confirm the process is listening on the expected interface."
msgstr "确认进程正在预期网络接口上监听。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Test a simple HTTP request before testing HTTPS."
msgstr "测试 HTTPS 前先验证一个简单 HTTP 请求。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"For HTTPS failures, confirm that `CONNECT` reaches the proxy and that the "
"target host/port is allowed."
msgstr ""
"如果 HTTPS 失败，确认 `CONNECT` 已经到达代理，并且目标主机/端口被允许访问。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "Check authentication separately from routing rules."
msgstr "将认证问题与路由规则问题分开检查。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"If only some applications fail, verify that those applications actually use "
"the configured system proxy."
msgstr "如果只有部分应用失败，确认这些应用确实使用了已经配置的系统代理。"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "RFC 9110, HTTP Semantics: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110>"
msgstr "RFC 9110，HTTP Semantics：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110>"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "RFC 9112, HTTP/1.1: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9112>"
msgstr "RFC 9112，HTTP/1.1：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9112>"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "RFC 9113, HTTP/2: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9113>"
msgstr "RFC 9113，HTTP/2：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9113>"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid "RFC 9114, HTTP/3: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9114>"
msgstr "RFC 9114，HTTP/3：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9114>"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"RFC 8441, Bootstrapping WebSockets with HTTP/2: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/"
"rfc/rfc8441>"
msgstr ""
"RFC 8441，通过 HTTP/2 引导 WebSocket：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/"
"rfc8441>"

#: src/protocols/http.md
msgid ""
"Xray HTTP inbound reference: <https://xtls.github.io/en/config/inbounds/"
"http.html>"
msgstr ""
"Xray HTTP 入站参考：<https://xtls.github.io/en/config/inbounds/http.html>"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Shadowsocks is an encrypted proxy protocol rather than a SOCKS5 session "
"carried over an encrypted channel. Applications may enter `Chimera_Client` "
"through SOCKS/HTTP/TUN, but the remote Shadowsocks connection has its own "
"address header, key derivation, record framing, authentication tags, and UDP "
"packet format."
msgstr ""
"Shadowsocks 是一种加密代理协议，而不是“把 SOCKS5 会话放进加密通道”。应用可以"
"通过 SOCKS/HTTP/TUN 进入 `Chimera_Client`，但远端 Shadowsocks 连接拥有自己的"
"地址头、密钥派生、记录分帧、认证标签和 UDP 报文格式。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"This chapter separates two protocol families that must not be conflated:"
msgstr "本章将两个不能混为一谈的协议家族分开说明："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "classic Shadowsocks AEAD, commonly using AES-GCM or ChaCha20-Poly1305;"
msgstr "经典 Shadowsocks AEAD，常用 AES-GCM 或 ChaCha20-Poly1305；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Shadowsocks 2022 AEAD, which changes key material, replay protection, TCP "
"headers, UDP session identifiers, and multi-user identity handling."
msgstr ""
"Shadowsocks 2022 AEAD，它改变了密钥材料、重放保护、TCP 头、UDP 会话标识以及多"
"用户身份处理方式。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The implementation notes below were checked against the current "
"`Chimera_Client` and `Chimera_Server` source trees. Upstream Shadowsocks "
"specifications remain the authority for portable wire behavior; Chimera-"
"specific limitations are called out explicitly."
msgstr ""
"下文实现说明已对照当前 `Chimera_Client` 与 `Chimera_Server` 源码检查。可移植"
"的线协议行为仍以上游 Shadowsocks 规范为准；Chimera 特有的限制会明确标出。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/anytls.md
#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md src/transports/grpc-transport.md
#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md
msgid "Position in the Stack"
msgstr "在协议栈中的位置"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Unlike Trojan or VLESS + TLS, classic Shadowsocks AEAD does not first "
"establish a TLS session. Encryption and integrity are part of the "
"Shadowsocks record format itself. SIP003 plugins can add an outer transport/"
"camouflage layer, but that layer is separate from the Shadowsocks "
"cryptographic stream."
msgstr ""
"与 Trojan 或 VLESS + TLS 不同，经典 Shadowsocks AEAD 不会先建立 TLS 会话。加"
"密和完整性保护本身就是 Shadowsocks 记录格式的一部分。SIP003 插件可以再添加外"
"层传输/伪装，但该层与 Shadowsocks 密码流是分离的。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Address Encoding"
msgstr "地址编码"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The destination encoding uses the familiar SOCKS-style address tuple but "
"without SOCKS5's `VER`, `CMD`, `RSV`, or reply fields."
msgstr ""
"目标地址编码使用熟悉的 SOCKS 风格地址元组，但没有 SOCKS5 的 `VER`、`CMD`、"
"`RSV` 或响应字段。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Address type"
msgstr "地址类型"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Wire value"
msgstr "线值"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Remaining fields"
msgstr "后续字段"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/trojan/wire-format.md src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "IPv4"
msgstr "IPv4"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "4-byte IPv4 + 2-byte big-endian port"
msgstr "4 字节 IPv4 + 2 字节大端序端口"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Domain"
msgstr "域名"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "1-byte domain length + domain bytes + 2-byte big-endian port"
msgstr "1 字节域名长度 + 域名字节 + 2 字节大端序端口"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/trojan/wire-format.md src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "16-byte IPv6 + 2-byte big-endian port"
msgstr "16 字节 IPv6 + 2 字节大端序端口"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"So a domain destination such as `example.com:443` begins conceptually as:"
msgstr "因此 `example.com:443` 这类域名目标在概念上会以如下字节开始："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"03 0b 65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65 2e 63 6f 6d 01 bb\n"
"│  │  └──────────── \"example.com\" ───────────┘ │\n"
"│  domain length = 11                           port 443\n"
"└─ ATYP = domain\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"03 0b 65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65 2e 63 6f 6d 01 bb\n"
"│  │  └──────────── \"example.com\" ───────────┘ │\n"
"│  域名长度 = 11                                  端口 443\n"
"└─ ATYP = 域名\n"
"```"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"This address format is reused inside TCP and UDP plaintext structures before "
"encryption."
msgstr "该地址格式会在加密前的 TCP 与 UDP 明文结构中复用。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Classic AEAD Methods"
msgstr "经典 AEAD 方法"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "The current `Chimera_Server` classic AEAD path accepts these methods:"
msgstr "当前 `Chimera_Server` 的经典 AEAD 路径接受以下方法："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Key length"
msgstr "密钥长度"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Salt length"
msgstr "Salt 长度"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "AEAD tag"
msgstr "AEAD 标签"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "`aes-128-gcm`"
msgstr "`aes-128-gcm`"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "16 bytes"
msgstr "16 字节"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "`aes-256-gcm`"
msgstr "`aes-256-gcm`"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "32 bytes"
msgstr "32 字节"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "`chacha20-ietf-poly1305`"
msgstr "`chacha20-ietf-poly1305`"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Client` maps a wider set through the Rust `shadowsocks` crate, "
"including `xchacha20-ietf-poly1305`, AEAD-2022 method names, and `rc4-md5`. "
"Do not infer Server interoperability from the Client parser alone: the "
"current Server explicitly rejects classic `xchacha20-poly1305` and does not "
"expose `rc4-md5` in its inbound cipher parser."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera_Client` 通过 Rust `shadowsocks` crate 映射了更广泛的方法，包括 "
"`xchacha20-ietf-poly1305`、AEAD-2022 方法名以及 `rc4-md5`。不能只根据 Client "
"解析器推断 Server 互操作性：当前 Server 明确拒绝经典 `xchacha20-poly1305`，其"
"入站密码算法解析器也没有暴露 `rc4-md5`。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Classic AEAD Key Derivation"
msgstr "经典 AEAD 密钥派生"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "For the current Server legacy/classic path:"
msgstr "对于当前 Server 的 legacy/classic 路径："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"the textual password is converted into a master key using the traditional "
"iterative MD5-compatible derivation;"
msgstr "文本密码通过传统迭代 MD5 兼容派生转换为 master key；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"each TCP direction or UDP packet uses a random salt whose length equals the "
"cipher key length;"
msgstr "每个 TCP 方向或 UDP 报文使用随机 salt，其长度与密码算法密钥长度相同；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"HKDF-SHA1 with info string `ss-subkey` derives the per-session subkey from "
"`master_key` and `salt`;"
msgstr ""
"使用 info 字符串 `ss-subkey` 的 HKDF-SHA1 从 `master_key` 与 `salt` 派生每会"
"话 subkey；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"the AEAD nonce starts at zero and increments for each protected item in the "
"stream direction."
msgstr "AEAD nonce 从零开始，并在流的单个方向上每保护一个对象就递增。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The salt is therefore not merely decorative randomness: repeating it with "
"the same master key would repeat the derived session key. The Server keeps a "
"timed salt cache and rejects recently replayed salts."
msgstr ""
"因此 salt 并非无意义的随机填充：同一 master key 下重复 salt 会导致派生出的 "
"session key 重复。Server 维护带时效的 salt 缓存并拒绝近期重放的 salt。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Classic AEAD TCP Wire Format"
msgstr "经典 AEAD TCP 线格式"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The encrypted TCP direction starts with one salt followed by independently "
"authenticated length and payload records:"
msgstr "加密 TCP 单方向先发送一个 salt，之后是分别认证的长度和负载记录："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The current Server caps a classic plaintext record at `0x3fff` bytes. The "
"first decrypted plaintext bytes of a client-to-server stream are the "
"Shadowsocks destination address; application bytes follow immediately after "
"it."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 将经典明文记录限制为最多 `0x3fff` 字节。客户端到服务端方向解密出"
"的首批明文字节是 Shadowsocks 目标地址，应用数据紧随其后。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"This means the target is authenticated by the same AEAD stream as the "
"application data. There is no separate SOCKS-style request/reply exchange."
msgstr ""
"这意味着目标地址与应用数据由同一个 AEAD 流认证，不存在独立的 SOCKS 风格请求/"
"响应交换。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Client-to-server example shape"
msgstr "客户端到服务端示例形态"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Server-to-client direction"
msgstr "服务端到客户端方向"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The response direction creates its own random salt and its own nonce "
"sequence. It carries only relayed application bytes; there is no success "
"reply containing a bound address."
msgstr ""
"响应方向会创建自己的随机 salt 与 nonce 序列。它只承载转发的应用数据，不存在包"
"含绑定地址的成功响应。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Classic AEAD UDP Wire Format"
msgstr "经典 AEAD UDP 线格式"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Each UDP datagram is independently encrypted:"
msgstr "每个 UDP 数据报都独立加密："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The server response uses the same structure, but the address identifies the "
"remote source endpoint corresponding to the returned payload."
msgstr "服务端响应使用相同结构，但其中地址标识返回负载对应的远端源端点。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Because each packet contains a fresh salt and complete destination tuple, "
"classic Shadowsocks UDP is packet-oriented. It does not use SOCKS5's UDP "
"`RSV | FRAG | ATYP ...` header and has no SOCKS5 `FRAG` semantics."
msgstr ""
"由于每个包都包含新的 salt 和完整目标地址元组，经典 Shadowsocks UDP 是面向数据"
"报的。它不使用 SOCKS5 UDP 的 `RSV | FRAG | ATYP ...` 头，也没有 SOCKS5 "
"`FRAG` 语义。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The current Server also rejects a recently reused classic UDP salt, "
"providing a bounded replay check."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 还会拒绝近期重复使用的经典 UDP salt，从而提供有界的重放检查。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Shadowsocks 2022 Key Material"
msgstr "Shadowsocks 2022 密钥材料"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"A Shadowsocks 2022 method name begins with `2022-blake3-`. In the current "
"Server, the configured password field for such a user is interpreted as a "
"Base64-encoded raw pre-shared key rather than an arbitrary password phrase."
msgstr ""
"Shadowsocks 2022 方法名以 `2022-blake3-` 开头。在当前 Server 中，此类用户的 "
"password 字段会被解释为 Base64 编码的原始预共享密钥，而不是任意密码短语。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "The decoded key length must exactly match the selected cipher key size."
msgstr "解码后的密钥长度必须与所选密码算法的密钥长度完全一致。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Current Server method paths include:"
msgstr "当前 Server 方法路径包括："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "`2022-blake3-aes-128-gcm`;"
msgstr "`2022-blake3-aes-128-gcm`；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "`2022-blake3-aes-256-gcm`;"
msgstr "`2022-blake3-aes-256-gcm`；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "`2022-blake3-chacha20-ietf-poly1305`."
msgstr "`2022-blake3-chacha20-ietf-poly1305`。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Session subkeys are derived with BLAKE3's derive-key mode using the context "
"string `shadowsocks 2022 session subkey` over `PSK || salt/session-id "
"material`."
msgstr ""
"Session subkey 使用 BLAKE3 derive-key 模式派生，context string 为 "
"`shadowsocks 2022 session subkey`，输入材料为 `PSK || salt/session-id "
"material`。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Shadowsocks 2022 TCP Request"
msgstr "Shadowsocks 2022 TCP 请求"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "The current Server decodes the client direction in these stages:"
msgstr "当前 Server 按以下阶段解码客户端方向："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The variable request header is emitted into the plaintext stream and begins "
"with the destination address. Chimera then reads:"
msgstr "可变请求头被输出到明文流，其开头是目标地址。随后 Chimera 读取："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The current Server allows at most 900 bytes of this post-address padding and "
"rejects invalid or truncated values."
msgstr "当前 Server 允许地址后最多 900 字节 padding，并拒绝无效或截断的值。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The variable-header ciphertext length itself is bounded to 18 KiB by the "
"current implementation."
msgstr "当前实现还把可变头密文长度限制在 18 KiB。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Timestamp and replay checks"
msgstr "时间戳与重放检查"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The Server validates the 2022 timestamp against its local clock and keeps a "
"timed salt replay cache. A valid AEAD tag is therefore insufficient on its "
"own: stale/future timestamps or recently reused salts can still cause the "
"request to be rejected."
msgstr ""
"Server 会根据本地时钟验证 2022 时间戳，并维护带时效的 salt 重放缓存。因此仅有"
"有效 AEAD tag 还不够：过旧/未来时间戳或近期复用的 salt 仍会导致请求被拒绝。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Clock synchronization matters more for Shadowsocks 2022 than for classic "
"AEAD."
msgstr "相比经典 AEAD，Shadowsocks 2022 更依赖时钟同步。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Shadowsocks 2022 TCP Response"
msgstr "Shadowsocks 2022 TCP 响应"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"After validating the request salt, the Server creates a distinct response "
"salt. Its first protected response header contains:"
msgstr "验证请求 salt 后，Server 会创建独立的响应 salt。首个受保护响应头包含："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"That header is AEAD-protected, followed by the separately protected first "
"response payload. Later application bytes use the normal encrypted length + "
"payload record sequence."
msgstr ""
"该头经过 AEAD 保护，随后是单独受保护的首个响应负载。之后的应用数据使用常规的"
"加密长度 + 负载记录序列。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Binding the original request salt into the response header lets the client "
"associate the response with the validated request direction."
msgstr ""
"把原始请求 salt 绑定进响应头，可以让客户端把响应与已验证的请求方向关联起来。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The current 2022 stream path allows payload records up to `0xffff` bytes."
msgstr "当前 2022 流路径允许最大 `0xffff` 字节的负载记录。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "AEAD-2022 Multi-user Identity / EIH"
msgstr "AEAD-2022 多用户身份 / EIH"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The current Server supports an identity-header path for multi-user "
"Shadowsocks 2022 with AES methods."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 支持基于 AES 方法的多用户 Shadowsocks 2022 identity-header 路径。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Important constraints in the current implementation are:"
msgstr "当前实现的重要约束包括："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"the identity method must be `2022-blake3-aes-128-gcm` or `2022-blake3-"
"aes-256-gcm`;"
msgstr ""
"identity 方法必须是 `2022-blake3-aes-128-gcm` 或 `2022-blake3-aes-256-gcm`；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "users behind an identity must use the same AES method;"
msgstr "同一 identity 后的用户必须使用相同 AES 方法；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "multi-user AEAD-2022 without an identity is rejected;"
msgstr "没有 identity 的多用户 AEAD-2022 会被拒绝；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"the identity layer derives a BLAKE3 identity subkey and decrypts a 16-byte "
"user hash to select the actual user PSK."
msgstr ""
"identity 层会派生 BLAKE3 identity subkey，并解密 16 字节用户哈希来选择实际用"
"户 PSK。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Conceptually, EIH adds a user-selection layer before the selected user's "
"normal 2022 session keys are used. It should not be described as a SOCKS "
"username/password negotiation."
msgstr ""
"从概念上看，EIH 在使用所选用户的普通 2022 session key 之前增加了一层用户选"
"择。它不应被描述为 SOCKS 用户名/密码协商。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Shadowsocks 2022 UDP: AES Variant"
msgstr "Shadowsocks 2022 UDP：AES 变体"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"For the current Server AES-2022 path, the datagram starts with a 16-byte "
"separately encrypted header:"
msgstr "对于当前 Server 的 AES-2022 路径，数据报以 16 字节独立加密头开始："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The decrypted values are then used to derive the UDP session key. The "
"remaining AEAD body contains, for a client request:"
msgstr ""
"解密出的值随后用于派生 UDP session key。对客户端请求而言，剩余 AEAD body 包"
"含："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"A server response uses its own server session ID and packet ID and includes "
"the client session ID in the protected body so the peer can correlate the "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"服务端响应使用自己的 server session ID 和 packet ID，并在受保护 body 中包含 "
"client session ID，以便对端关联方向。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Shadowsocks 2022 UDP: ChaCha Variant"
msgstr "Shadowsocks 2022 UDP：ChaCha 变体"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The current Server's 2022 ChaCha UDP path uses a 24-byte XChaCha20-Poly1305 "
"nonce prefix. The protected client body contains:"
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 的 2022 ChaCha UDP 路径使用 24 字节 XChaCha20-Poly1305 nonce 前"
"缀。受保护的客户端 body 包含："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The response body carries the server session ID and packet ID, response "
"type, timestamp, client session ID, padding length, source address, and "
"payload."
msgstr ""
"响应 body 携带 server session ID 与 packet ID、响应类型、时间戳、client "
"session ID、padding 长度、源地址和负载。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"This is one reason not to document “Shadowsocks UDP” as one universal packet "
"layout: classic AEAD and AEAD-2022, and even the AES/ChaCha 2022 paths, "
"differ materially."
msgstr ""
"这正是不能把“Shadowsocks UDP”写成一种统一报文布局的原因之一：经典 AEAD 与 "
"AEAD-2022 不同，甚至 2022 的 AES/ChaCha 路径本身也有显著差异。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "UDP Replay Window in Current Chimera_Server"
msgstr "当前 Chimera_Server 的 UDP 重放窗口"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The Server tracks AEAD-2022 UDP packets by session ID and packet ID. The "
"current replay state:"
msgstr ""
"Server 按 session ID 与 packet ID 跟踪 AEAD-2022 UDP 报文。当前重放状态会："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "rejects an already-seen packet ID;"
msgstr "拒绝已见过的 packet ID；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"rejects packet IDs that fall more than 1024 behind the highest accepted ID;"
msgstr "拒绝比当前最高已接受 ID 落后超过 1024 的 packet ID；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"expires inactive replay sessions on the same roughly one-minute time scale "
"used by the current salt cache."
msgstr "按与当前 salt 缓存近似相同的一分钟时间尺度过期不活跃重放会话。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"This is protocol-level anti-replay state. It is separate from operating-"
"system UDP NAT/session timeouts."
msgstr "这是协议层防重放状态，与操作系统 UDP NAT/会话超时相互独立。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "TCP Close and Error Behavior"
msgstr "TCP 关闭与错误行为"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Shadowsocks does not define a SOCKS5-style `REP` status byte after the "
"destination request. Errors therefore surface differently:"
msgstr ""
"Shadowsocks 在目标请求后没有定义 SOCKS5 风格的 `REP` 状态字节，因此错误表现方"
"式不同："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"invalid password/key material usually manifests as AEAD authentication "
"failure;"
msgstr "无效密码/密钥材料通常表现为 AEAD 认证失败；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "a replayed salt/session packet is rejected locally;"
msgstr "重放的 salt/session packet 会被本地拒绝；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"malformed address or length fields terminate the affected stream/datagram;"
msgstr "格式错误的地址或长度字段会终止受影响的流/数据报；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"target connection failure closes the relayed stream rather than returning a "
"SOCKS5 connection-status frame;"
msgstr "目标连接失败会关闭转发流，而不是返回 SOCKS5 连接状态帧；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "normal TCP EOF propagates through the encrypted stream shutdown."
msgstr "正常 TCP EOF 会通过加密流关闭过程传播。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Applications using a local SOCKS5 listener may still receive a SOCKS-layer "
"failure from `Chimera_Client`, but that is generated by the local inbound "
"and is not a Shadowsocks wire reply from the remote server."
msgstr ""
"使用本地 SOCKS5 监听器的应用仍可能收到 `Chimera_Client` 生成的 SOCKS 层失败响"
"应，但那是本地入站生成的，并不是远端服务端发出的 Shadowsocks 线协议响应。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "State Machine"
msgstr "状态机"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "A simplified classic TCP state machine is:"
msgstr "简化的经典 TCP 状态机如下："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"For Shadowsocks 2022, insert `VALIDATE_TIMESTAMP`, `CHECK_REPLAY`, and "
"request-header parsing before destination dispatch."
msgstr ""
"对于 Shadowsocks 2022，需要在目标分发前插入 `VALIDATE_TIMESTAMP`、"
"`CHECK_REPLAY` 和请求头解析阶段。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Packet-capture Anchors"
msgstr "抓包锚点"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Without keys, an on-path capture normally exposes only outer transport "
"metadata:"
msgstr "没有密钥时，链路上的抓包通常只能看到外层传输元数据："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "TCP or UDP server endpoint;"
msgstr "TCP 或 UDP 服务端端点；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "direction, timing, and encrypted record/datagram sizes;"
msgstr "方向、时序以及加密记录/数据报大小；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "random-looking salt/nonce prefixes;"
msgstr "看起来随机的 salt/nonce 前缀；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "plugin/TLS/WebSocket metadata if an optional outer plugin is used."
msgstr "如果使用可选外层插件，还会看到 plugin/TLS/WebSocket 元数据。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "With keys and an implementation-aware decoder, useful anchors are:"
msgstr "拥有密钥和了解实现的解码器时，有用锚点包括："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "classic TCP: `salt | encrypted length+tag | encrypted payload+tag`;"
msgstr "经典 TCP：`salt | encrypted length+tag | encrypted payload+tag`；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "classic UDP: `salt | encrypted address+payload+tag`;"
msgstr "经典 UDP：`salt | encrypted address+payload+tag`；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "2022 TCP: salt followed by fixed/variable authenticated headers;"
msgstr "2022 TCP：salt 后跟固定/可变认证头；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"2022 UDP: session ID / packet ID / timestamp and address fields after "
"successful decryption."
msgstr "2022 UDP：成功解密后可看到 session ID / packet ID / 时间戳与地址字段。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"A capture cannot identify the target address from ciphertext alone under a "
"working AEAD cipher."
msgstr "在 AEAD 正常工作时，仅凭密文抓包无法识别目标地址。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "SIP003 Plugins"
msgstr "SIP003 插件"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
