"`Chimera_Client` supports a plugin hook around the raw stream before the "
"Shadowsocks protocol stream is created. The repository contains paths for "
"plugin-style transports such as simple-obfs and v2ray-plugin/WebSocket when "
"the needed build features are present."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera_Client` 在创建 Shadowsocks 协议流之前支持对原始流应用 plugin hook。"
"启用所需构建 feature 时，仓库中包含 simple-obfs、v2ray-plugin/WebSocket 等插"
"件式传输路径。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "Layering is conceptually:"
msgstr "概念上的分层为："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"The remote side must run the matching plugin layer. Pointing a plugin-"
"wrapped client directly at a plain Shadowsocks server makes the server see "
"plugin bytes where it expects a Shadowsocks salt/record."
msgstr ""
"远端必须运行匹配的插件层。若把插件封装后的客户端直接指向纯 Shadowsocks 服务"
"端，服务端会在本应看到 Shadowsocks salt/record 的位置看到插件字节。"

