#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Protect Shadowsocks passwords/PSKs as credentials. For AEAD-2022 the Base64 "
"string represents raw key material in the current Server configuration path."
msgstr ""
"应把 Shadowsocks 密码/PSK 当作凭据保护。对于 AEAD-2022，当前 Server 配置路径"
"中的 Base64 字符串代表原始密钥材料。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Reusing salts/nonces or disabling replay checks can destroy the assumptions "
"of the AEAD construction."
msgstr "重复使用 salt/nonce 或关闭重放检查会破坏 AEAD 构造的安全前提。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Keep system clocks reasonably synchronized for AEAD-2022 timestamp "
"validation."
msgstr "为 AEAD-2022 时间戳验证保持系统时钟合理同步。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"A plugin can camouflage or reshape transport traffic, but it does not "
"replace correct Shadowsocks authentication and AEAD validation."
msgstr ""
