"UDP, and UDP session isolation in `shadowsocks_integration_tests.rs`. These "
"tests exercise real local socket paths within Chimera Client implementations."
msgstr ""
"当前 Client 侧集成测试覆盖 TCP、UDP、多目标 UDP，以及 "
"`shadowsocks_integration_tests.rs` 中的 UDP 会话隔离。这些测试通过 Chimera "
"Client 实现中的真实本地套接字路径进行验证。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"Current Server external interoperability coverage in "
"`xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs` includes classic AEAD TCP, multiple legacy users, "
"AEAD-2022 EIH multi-user selection, and AEAD-2022 TCP plus AES UDP against "
"an Xray client."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 外部互操作测试 `xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs` 覆盖经典 AEAD TCP、多个"
"旧版用户、AEAD-2022 EIH 多用户选择，以及针对 Xray 客户端的 AEAD-2022 TCP 与 "
"AES UDP。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"These tests do not prove that every cipher accepted by the Client is also "
"accepted by the Server. In particular, keep the explicit Server cipher and "
"configuration rejections above visible when describing compatibility. See "
"[Test Evidence and Interoperability Matrix](../test-evidence.md)."
msgstr ""
"这些测试不能证明 Client 接受的每种密码套件也都被 Server 接受。描述兼容性时，"
"尤其应明确保留上文列出的 Server 密码套件和配置拒绝项。详见[测试证据与互操作矩"
"阵](../test-evidence.md)。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "When a Shadowsocks connection fails, check in this order:"
msgstr "Shadowsocks 连接失败时按以下顺序检查："

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"confirm the client and server agree on classic AEAD versus `2022-blake3-*`;"
msgstr "确认客户端与服务端对经典 AEAD 还是 `2022-blake3-*` 达成一致；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "confirm the exact cipher name and key length;"
msgstr "确认精确的密码算法名称和密钥长度；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"for 2022, confirm the configured value is the expected Base64 raw key and "
"clocks are synchronized;"
msgstr "对于 2022，确认配置值是预期的 Base64 原始密钥，并确认时钟同步；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "confirm any SIP003 plugin exists on both sides with matching options;"
msgstr "确认任何 SIP003 插件都在两端存在且选项匹配；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid "verify TCP versus UDP is enabled in the actual Client build/config;"
msgstr "确认实际 Client 构建/配置中启用了所需 TCP 或 UDP；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"inspect logs for tag failure, replay rejection, timestamp failure, unknown "
"EIH user, or unsupported cipher;"
msgstr ""
"检查日志中是否有 tag 失败、重放拒绝、时间戳失败、未知 EIH 用户或不支持的密码"
"算法；"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"only after the cryptographic layer succeeds, debug destination DNS/routing/"
"target reachability."
msgstr "只有密码层成功后，再排查目标 DNS、路由和目标可达性。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md src/protocols/anytls.md
