msgstr "`Chimera_Server/chimera_server_lib/src/config/server_config/`。"

#: src/protocols/shadowsocks.md
msgid ""
"For portable protocol behavior, compare the relevant Shadowsocks "
"specification/SIP with the version implemented by the selected peer rather "
"than assuming all Shadowsocks generations share one wire format."
msgstr ""
"为了获得可移植的协议行为，应将相关 Shadowsocks 规范/SIP 与所选对端实际实现版"
"本进行对照，而不是假设所有 Shadowsocks 代际共享同一种线格式。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"AnyTLS is a TLS-carried proxy protocol with its own authentication prefix "
"and framed stream commands. It is not “arbitrary traffic inside TLS”: after "
"the TLS handshake, the peer still has to authenticate, negotiate protocol "
"metadata, open a logical stream, provide a destination, and exchange framed "
"payloads."
msgstr ""
"AnyTLS 是承载在 TLS 上、拥有独立认证前缀与流分帧命令的代理协议。它并不是“把任"
"意流量塞进 TLS”：TLS 握手完成后，对端仍需完成认证、协商协议元数据、打开逻辑"
"流、提供目标地址并交换分帧负载。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"This chapter documents the current AnyTLS wire behavior implemented by "
"`Chimera_Client`. The current `Chimera_Server` protocol enum does not "
"contain an AnyTLS inbound, so Client-side AnyTLS interoperability should be "
"evaluated against a compatible AnyTLS server implementation rather than "
"inferred from Chimera Server support."
msgstr ""
"本章记录 `Chimera_Client` 当前实现的 AnyTLS 线协议行为。当前 "
"`Chimera_Server` 协议枚举中没有 AnyTLS 入站，因此 Client 侧 AnyTLS 的互操作性"
"应针对兼容的 AnyTLS 服务端实现验证，不能从 Chimera Server 的能力中推断。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The TLS layer provides transport confidentiality and server authentication "
"when certificate verification is enabled. The AnyTLS password hash is a "
"separate protocol authentication layer inside the established TLS "
"application-data stream."
msgstr ""
"启用证书验证时，TLS 层提供传输机密性和服务端身份验证；AnyTLS 密码哈希则是已建"
"立 TLS Application Data 流内部的独立协议认证层。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Current Chimera Connection Sequence"
msgstr "当前 Chimera 连接序列"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "The current outbound path performs these stages:"
msgstr "当前出站路径依次执行以下阶段："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The implementation deliberately builds the initial AnyTLS authentication "
"bytes and first frames into one write so compatible servers that expect the "
"first TLS application-data record as one authentication packet do not "
"observe an incomplete password/padding structure."
msgstr ""
"当前实现会刻意把初始 AnyTLS 认证字节和首批帧合并为一次写入，避免那些把首个 "
"TLS Application Data record 作为完整认证包读取的兼容服务端看到不完整的密码/填"
"充结构。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Authentication Prefix"
msgstr "认证前缀"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Immediately after TLS, the current Chimera client writes:"
msgstr "TLS 建立后，当前 Chimera 客户端立即写入："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current outbound advertises no initial padding, so `padding_len = 0`."
msgstr "当前出站不发送初始填充，因此 `padding_len = 0`。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The inbound implementation builds an O(1) lookup map from `SHA256(password)` "
"to the configured user identity. In multi-user mode the hash selects the "
"user; in single-password fallback mode the user identity is empty."
msgstr ""
"入站实现会建立从 `SHA256(password)` 到配置用户身份的 O(1) 查找表。多用户模式"
"下由哈希选择用户；单密码 fallback 模式下用户身份为空。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"This is not RFC 1929 username/password authentication. The password itself "
"is not sent directly; the fixed 32-byte SHA-256 digest is the lookup/"
"authentication token inside TLS."
msgstr ""
"这不是 RFC 1929 的用户名/密码认证。密码本身不会直接发送；固定 32 字节的 "
"SHA-256 摘要才是 TLS 内部用于查找和认证的令牌。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Authentication Failure and Fallback"
msgstr "认证失败与 Fallback"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current Client inbound can be configured with a fallback backend. If the "
"32-byte password hash is unknown:"
msgstr "当前 Client 入站可配置 fallback 后端。如果 32 字节密码哈希未知："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "the AnyTLS parser stops;"
msgstr "AnyTLS 解析器停止；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"the already consumed 32 bytes are prepended back into the decrypted TLS "
"application stream;"
msgstr "已经消耗的 32 字节会重新前置到解密后的 TLS 应用数据流；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"the remaining decrypted stream is bidirectionally proxied to the fallback "
"backend;"
msgstr "剩余解密流会双向代理到 fallback 后端；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"the inbound sends a TLS `close_notify` on clean shutdown where possible."
msgstr "在条件允许时，入站会在正常关闭时发送 TLS `close_notify`。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Without a fallback, the connection is rejected."
msgstr "未配置 fallback 时，连接会被拒绝。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"This fallback occurs **after TLS termination** in the current "
"implementation. It is therefore different from a raw TCP fallback that "
"forwards the original encrypted ClientHello/application records untouched."
msgstr ""
"当前实现中的 fallback 发生在 **TLS 终止之后**。因此它不同于原样转发加密 "
"ClientHello/应用记录的原始 TCP fallback。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Initial Padding Field"
msgstr "初始填充字段"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"After the 32-byte hash, the server reads a 2-byte big-endian padding length "
"and skips exactly that many bytes."
msgstr ""
"32 字节哈希之后，服务端读取 2 字节大端序填充长度，并精确跳过对应字节数。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Malformed/truncated padding terminates the handshake. The current outbound "
"sends zero bytes here even though later protocol metadata can advertise a "
"padding scheme."
msgstr ""
"格式错误或截断的填充会终止握手。当前出站在这里发送零长度填充，即便后续协议元"
"数据可以声明 padding scheme。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Frame Format"
msgstr "帧格式"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Every AnyTLS frame in the current implementation uses this header:"
msgstr "当前实现中的每个 AnyTLS 帧都使用以下帧头："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The fixed frame header is therefore 7 bytes. A single frame payload cannot "
"exceed 65535 bytes."
msgstr "因此固定帧头长度为 7 字节，单个帧负载不能超过 65535 字节。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Command Values"
msgstr "命令值"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "The current implementation recognizes these command numbers:"
msgstr "当前实现识别以下命令编号："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/trojan.md src/protocols/tuic.md
#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/trojan.md
#: src/protocols/trojan/wire-format.md src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "Current meaning"
msgstr "当前含义"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`WASTE`"
msgstr "`WASTE`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Padding/noise frame; ignored by the current inbound handshake parser."
msgstr "填充/噪声帧；当前入站握手解析器会忽略它。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`SYN`"
msgstr "`SYN`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Opens/selects a logical stream ID."
msgstr "打开/选择一个逻辑 stream ID。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`PSH`"
msgstr "`PSH`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`2`"
msgstr "`2`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Carries destination bytes during setup and application bytes during relay."
msgstr "建立阶段承载目标地址字节，转发阶段承载应用数据。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`FIN`"
msgstr "`FIN`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`3`"
msgstr "`3`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Ends the logical stream."
msgstr "结束逻辑流。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`SETTINGS`"
msgstr "`SETTINGS`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Client metadata/settings."
msgstr "客户端元数据/设置。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`ALERT`"
msgstr "`ALERT`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`5`"
msgstr "`5`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Error/alert text from peer."
msgstr "来自对端的错误/告警文本。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`UPDATE_PADDING_SCHEME`"
msgstr "`UPDATE_PADDING_SCHEME`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`6`"
msgstr "`6`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Padding-scheme update; current outbound reads and discards it."
msgstr "padding scheme 更新；当前出站读取后直接丢弃。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`SERVER_SETTINGS`"
msgstr "`SERVER_SETTINGS`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "`10`"
msgstr "`10`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Server settings; current outbound reads and discards it."
msgstr "服务端设置；当前出站读取后直接丢弃。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Unknown commands are ignored by the current outbound receive loop after a "
"valid stream is established."
msgstr "有效流建立后，当前出站接收循环会忽略未知命令。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "SETTINGS Frame"
msgstr "SETTINGS 帧"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current Chimera client sends a `SETTINGS` frame on stream ID `0`. Its "
"payload is UTF-8 metadata with the current shape:"
msgstr ""
"当前 Chimera 客户端在 stream ID `0` 上发送 `SETTINGS` 帧，其负载是 UTF-8 元数"
"据，当前格式如下："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The advertised MD5 corresponds to the current fixed client padding scheme "
"`stop=0`, meaning Chimera does not actively add AnyTLS protocol padding to "
"data packets in this implementation."
msgstr ""
"声明的 MD5 对应当前固定客户端 padding scheme `stop=0`，意味着此实现不会主动向"
"数据包添加 AnyTLS 协议填充。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current inbound accepts `SETTINGS` during the handshake but does not use "
"its metadata for routing/authentication."
msgstr ""
"当前入站会在握手期间接受 `SETTINGS`，但不会用其中元数据进行路由或认证。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Opening the Logical Stream"
msgstr "打开逻辑流"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "The current outbound uses one fixed logical stream ID:"
msgstr "当前出站使用固定的逻辑 stream ID："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "It sends:"
msgstr "它会发送："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"SYN(stream=1, data=\"\")\n"
"PSH(stream=1, data=SocksAddr(destination))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"SYN(stream=1, data=\"\")\n"
"PSH(stream=1, data=SocksAddr(destination))\n"
"```"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "The inbound enforces ordering and identity:"
msgstr "入站会强制检查顺序和 stream ID 一致性："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "a `SYN` must arrive before the destination `PSH`;"
msgstr "必须先收到 `SYN`，才能收到携带目标地址的 `PSH`；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "repeated `SYN` is tolerated only for the same stream ID;"
msgstr "只有 stream ID 相同时才允许重复 `SYN`；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "the destination `PSH` must use the selected stream ID;"
msgstr "目标地址 `PSH` 必须使用已选定的 stream ID；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "early `FIN` or `ALERT` aborts the handshake;"
msgstr "过早出现 `FIN` 或 `ALERT` 会中止握手；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "malformed destination bytes abort the handshake."
msgstr "目标地址字节格式错误会中止握手。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Although the wire header contains a 32-bit stream ID and the protocol is "
"structurally multiplexable, **the current Chimera outbound creates one "
"logical AnyTLS stream with ID 1 per underlying connection**. Do not document "
"current Chimera as performing multi-stream multiplexing merely because the "
"field exists."
msgstr ""
"虽然线协议帧头包含 32 位 stream ID，协议结构上具备多路复用能力，但 **当前 "
"Chimera 出站每条底层连接只创建一个 ID 为 1 的 AnyTLS 逻辑流**。不能仅因为存在"
"该字段就把当前 Chimera 描述为进行了多流复用。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Destination Encoding"
msgstr "目标地址编码"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The destination carried in the first `PSH` uses `SocksAddr`, the same "
"address tuple used by other Clash-family protocol implementations."
msgstr ""
"首个 `PSH` 携带的目标地址使用 `SocksAddr`，与其他 Clash 系协议实现使用的地址"
"元组一致。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Encoding"
msgstr "编码方式"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "IPv4 bytes + port"
msgstr "IPv4 字节 + 端口"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "length + domain bytes + port"
msgstr "长度 + 域名字节 + 端口"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "IPv6 bytes + port"
msgstr "IPv6 字节 + 端口"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The address bytes are payload of an AnyTLS `PSH`; there is no SOCKS5 `VER/"
"CMD/RSV` envelope around them."
msgstr ""
"地址字节是 AnyTLS `PSH` 的负载，外层不存在 SOCKS5 的 `VER/CMD/RSV` 封装。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "TCP Data Relay"
msgstr "TCP 数据转发"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"After the initial destination has been accepted, application bytes are "
"transformed into `PSH` frames:"
msgstr "初始目标地址被接受后，应用数据会被转换为 `PSH` 帧："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current relay reads up to 16 KiB from its local in-process pipe for each "
"generated `PSH`. This is an implementation buffering choice, not a protocol "
"maximum; the frame format itself permits up to 65535 bytes."
msgstr ""
"当前转发器每次生成 `PSH` 时最多从本地进程内管道读取 16 KiB。这是实现层缓冲选"
"择，不是协议上限；帧格式本身允许最多 65535 字节。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Inbound response `PSH` data for the selected stream is written back to the "
"application-facing stream."
msgstr "所选逻辑流收到的入站响应 `PSH` 数据会写回面向应用的流。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "FIN and Half-close Behavior"
msgstr "FIN 与半关闭行为"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "When the application-facing write side reaches EOF, the outbound sends:"
msgstr "当面向应用的写方向到达 EOF 时，出站会发送："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "and flushes the TLS stream."
msgstr "随后刷新 TLS 流。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"When a matching inbound `FIN` is received, the current outbound shuts down "
"the application-facing read side and cancels the relay tasks."
msgstr ""
"收到匹配的入站 `FIN` 后，当前出站会关闭面向应用的读方向并取消转发任务。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current implementation therefore treats `FIN` as logical-stream "
"termination rather than supporting a long independent multiplexed connection "
"containing other active stream IDs."
msgstr ""
"因此当前实现把 `FIN` 视为逻辑流终止，而不是在同一长期独立多路复用连接中继续保"
"留其他活跃 stream ID。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "ALERT Handling"
msgstr "ALERT 处理"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"A peer `ALERT` frame is interpreted as UTF-8/lossy text for logging. The "
"current outbound then shuts down the relay and cancels the connection tasks."
msgstr ""
"对端 `ALERT` 帧会按 UTF-8/有损文本解释并记录日志，随后当前出站关闭转发并取消"
"连接任务。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"There is no SOCKS-style numeric result mapping. An AnyTLS alert is an AnyTLS-"
"layer failure; a local SOCKS inbound may translate the resulting connection "
"failure into its own SOCKS response for the local application."
msgstr ""
"这里没有 SOCKS 风格的数字结果映射。AnyTLS alert 属于 AnyTLS 层错误；本地 "
"SOCKS 入站可能会把由此产生的连接失败转换为自己的 SOCKS 响应返回给本地应用。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md src/transports/httpupgrade.md
msgid "Handshake Timeout"
msgstr "握手超时"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current AnyTLS inbound allows 10 seconds for the TLS + password + "
"padding + `SYN/PSH(destination)` handshake sequence."
msgstr ""
"当前 AnyTLS 入站给 TLS + 密码 + 填充 + `SYN/PSH(destination)` 整个握手序列 "
"10 秒时间。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "A timeout closes the connection without dispatching a target session."
msgstr "超时会直接关闭连接，不会分发目标会话。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"This timeout is a current Chimera implementation policy, not a field encoded "
"into the AnyTLS wire format."
msgstr "该超时是当前 Chimera 的实现策略，不是编码在 AnyTLS 线协议中的字段。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "UDP over TCP v2"
msgstr "UDP over TCP v2"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current AnyTLS UDP implementation does not send native UDP packets to "
"the AnyTLS server. It creates a normal AnyTLS stream whose apparent "
"destination is a reserved magic hostname:"
msgstr ""
"当前 AnyTLS UDP 实现不会向 AnyTLS 服务端发送原生 UDP 包，而是建立一个普通 "
"AnyTLS 流，其表面目标地址是保留的 magic hostname："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"After that AnyTLS stream is established, it sends the UoT v2 connect header:"
msgstr "该 AnyTLS 流建立后，会发送 UoT v2 connect header："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "All of those bytes are still carried inside AnyTLS `PSH` frames."
msgstr "这些字节仍然全部承载在 AnyTLS `PSH` 帧内部。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "UoT Datagram Framing"
msgstr "UoT 数据报分帧"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "After the UoT connect header, each UDP payload is framed as:"
msgstr "UoT connect header 之后，每个 UDP 负载按以下格式分帧："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The selected destination is established once by the UoT connect header. "
"Individual datagrams therefore do not repeat a SOCKS address header in the "
"current connect-mode session."
msgstr ""
"目标地址由 UoT connect header 一次性建立，因此当前 connect-mode 会话中的单个"
"数据报不会重复携带 SOCKS 地址头。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The same 2-byte length-prefix form is used for responses delivered back "
"through the stream."
msgstr "通过该流返回的响应也使用相同的 2 字节长度前缀。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "UDP Session State"
msgstr "UDP 会话状态"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The current outbound creates one stream-backed datagram object tied to the "
"requested UDP destination. The inbound recognizes the magic hostname, "
"unwraps AnyTLS `PSH` frames into a byte stream, parses `isConnect=1` and the "
"real destination, and dispatches that stream as a UDP session."
msgstr ""
"当前出站会创建一个由流承载、绑定到所请求 UDP 目标的数据报对象。入站识别 "
"magic hostname 后，把 AnyTLS `PSH` 解包成字节流，解析 `isConnect=1` 与真实目"
"标地址，再把该流作为 UDP 会话分发。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"This is UDP tunneling over an ordered TCP/TLS stream. Consequences include:"
msgstr "这是通过有序 TCP/TLS 流隧道化 UDP，因此会带来："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "UDP datagrams inherit TCP ordering;"
msgstr "UDP 数据报继承 TCP 顺序；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"loss of one underlying TCP segment can delay later datagrams (head-of-line "
"blocking);"
msgstr "一个底层 TCP segment 的丢失可能延迟后续数据报（队头阻塞）；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "there is no native QUIC-style independent datagram delivery;"
msgstr "不存在 QUIC 风格的原生独立数据报投递；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"MTU behavior is transformed into stream framing rather than preserved as "
"original IP/UDP packet boundaries."
msgstr "MTU 行为会被转换成流分帧，而不是保留原始 IP/UDP 报文边界。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Current Inbound State Machine"
msgstr "当前入站状态机"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The transport can therefore fail at several distinct layers: TCP "
"reachability, TLS authentication, AnyTLS password authentication, frame "
"ordering, destination parsing, or target connection."
msgstr ""
"因此传输可能在多个独立层次失败：TCP 可达性、TLS 认证、AnyTLS 密码认证、帧顺"
"序、目标地址解析或目标连接。"

