"Frame has stream ID, but current Chimera uses one stream ID per connection"
msgstr "帧中有 stream ID，但当前 Chimera 每条连接只使用一个 stream ID"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Protocol has extra field; current implementation does not exploit full mux"
msgstr "协议多了该字段，但当前实现没有利用完整多路复用"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
