msgstr "错误报告"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Numeric SOCKS `REP`"
msgstr "数字 SOCKS `REP`"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "TLS errors, auth rejection, `ALERT`, close/logging"
msgstr "TLS 错误、认证拒绝、`ALERT`、关闭/日志"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"TLS verification and AnyTLS password authentication protect different "
"layers; do not treat one as a substitute for the other."
msgstr ""
"TLS 验证与 AnyTLS 密码认证保护不同层次，不能把其中一个当作另一个的替代。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"The on-wire token is `SHA256(password)`. Choose a high-entropy password "
"because a captured decrypted authentication token is deterministic for a "
"given password."
msgstr ""
"线上令牌是 `SHA256(password)`。应使用高熵密码，因为一旦得到解密后的认证令牌，"
"同一密码对应的令牌是确定不变的。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Keep `skip-cert-verify` disabled unless the trust consequences are "
"understood."
msgstr "除非明确理解信任后果，否则保持 `skip-cert-verify` 关闭。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Fallback targets receive decrypted TLS application bytes after an unknown "
"password; configure them intentionally and avoid exposing sensitive internal "
"services."
msgstr ""
"出现未知密码时，fallback 目标会收到解密后的 TLS 应用数据字节；应有意识地配置"
"该目标，避免暴露敏感内部服务。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"UDP-over-TCP can suffer head-of-line blocking and should not be described as "
"equivalent to native UDP or QUIC datagrams."
msgstr ""
"UDP-over-TCP 会遭受队头阻塞，不能描述成与原生 UDP 或 QUIC datagram 等价。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"Parsed-only idle/fingerprint options should not be relied upon for timeout, "
"fingerprinting, or resource-control guarantees."
msgstr ""
"不能依赖 Parsed-only 的 idle/fingerprint 选项来保证超时、指纹或资源控制行为。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "Debug AnyTLS from the outside inward:"
msgstr "排查 AnyTLS 时从外到内进行："

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "verify TCP reachability to the server;"
msgstr "确认服务端 TCP 可达；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "verify TLS SNI, certificate trust, ALPN, and optional mTLS material;"
msgstr "确认 TLS SNI、证书信任、ALPN 以及可选 mTLS 材料；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"verify both sides use the same password and that the server expects the "
"SHA-256 token form;"
msgstr "确认两端使用相同密码，并确认服务端期望 SHA-256 令牌形式；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"verify the first application packet contains the padding length and v2 "
"`SETTINGS`/`SYN`/`PSH` sequence expected by the peer;"
msgstr ""
"确认首个应用数据包包含对端期望的填充长度以及 v2 `SETTINGS`/`SYN`/`PSH` 序列；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid "for TCP, verify the destination `SocksAddr` is accepted;"
msgstr "对于 TCP，确认目标 `SocksAddr` 被接受；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"for UDP, verify `sp.v2.udp-over-tcp.arpa`, `isConnect=1`, the real "
"destination, and 2-byte datagram lengths;"
msgstr ""
"对于 UDP，确认 `sp.v2.udp-over-tcp.arpa`、`isConnect=1`、真实目标地址和 2 字"
"节数据报长度；"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"inspect `ALERT`, timeout, fallback, or target-connect logs before changing "
"unrelated DNS/rule settings."
msgstr ""
"在修改无关 DNS/规则设置前，先检查 `ALERT`、超时、fallback 或目标连接日志。"

#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"A successful TLS handshake only proves the TLS layer. It does not prove "
"AnyTLS password authentication or frame compatibility."
msgstr "TLS 握手成功只证明 TLS 层正常，并不能证明 AnyTLS 密码认证或帧兼容性。"

