#: src/protocols/anytls.md
msgid ""
"For portable interoperability, verify the selected peer against the current "
"AnyTLS protocol specification and implementation rather than assuming every "
"AnyTLS implementation uses the same optional settings or multiplexing policy."
msgstr ""
"为了获得可移植的互操作性，应针对当前 AnyTLS 协议规范和所选对端实现进行验证，"
"而不是假设所有 AnyTLS 实现都采用相同的可选设置或多路复用策略。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"Trojan is a TLS-based proxy protocol designed so that the outer connection "
"uses a normal TLS session while proxy authentication and destination "
"metadata are carried inside encrypted application data."
msgstr ""
"Trojan 是一种基于 TLS 的代理协议。其外层连接使用普通 TLS 会话，而代理认证信息"
"和目标元数据则封装在加密后的应用数据中。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The original Trojan protocol uses a pre-shared password, represented on the "
"wire as the hexadecimal SHA-224 digest of that password. Its request address "
"format is similar to SOCKS5 and supports both TCP `CONNECT` and UDP "
"association."
msgstr ""
"原始 Trojan 协议使用预共享密码，在报文中以该密码的 SHA-224 摘要十六进制形式表"
"示。其请求地址格式与 SOCKS5 类似，同时支持 TCP `CONNECT` 和 UDP association。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The baseline protocol described here should be distinguished from additional "
"transport combinations exposed by individual proxy cores, such as WebSocket, "
"XHTTP, or other wrappers."
msgstr ""
"这里描述的是基础 Trojan 协议，应与各代理核心额外提供的 WebSocket、XHTTP 或其"
"他封装传输组合区分开。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md src/protocols/vless.md
#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Connection Flow"
msgstr "连接流程"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The client opens a TCP connection to the Trojan server."
msgstr "客户端与 Trojan 服务端建立 TCP 连接。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Client and server complete a normal TLS handshake."
msgstr "客户端与服务端完成普通 TLS 握手。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"Inside TLS application data, the client sends the password digest and Trojan "
"request header."
msgstr "在 TLS 应用数据中，客户端发送密码摘要和 Trojan 请求头。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The server validates the password and destination request."
msgstr "服务端验证密码和目标请求。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "For TCP, the server connects to the target and relays the stream."
msgstr "对于 TCP，服务端连接目标并转发字节流。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "For UDP, datagrams are framed inside the Trojan TLS stream."
msgstr "对于 UDP，数据报会被封装在 Trojan TLS 流中。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"Invalid traffic can be handled by a fallback service instead of exposing a "
"proxy-specific response."
msgstr ""
"无效流量可以交给 fallback 服务处理，而不是返回容易暴露代理特征的专用响应。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The detailed byte layout is documented in [Wire Format](./trojan/wire-"
"format.md). Fallback behavior is discussed in [Traffic Handling](./trojan/"
"traffic-handling.md)."
msgstr ""
"详细字节布局请参阅 [报文格式](./trojan/wire-format.md)。Fallback 行为请参阅 "
"[流量处理](./trojan/traffic-handling.md)。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Layer-by-Layer Exchange"
msgstr "逐层交互过程"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The easiest way to understand Trojan is to separate the ordinary network "
"layers from the Trojan control message itself:"
msgstr ""
"理解 Trojan 最直接的方法，是把普通网络层与 Trojan 自身的控制消息分开来看："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"This sequence is important when reading a packet capture. Before TLS is "
"decrypted, a passive capture shows the TCP and TLS handshakes but not the "
"Trojan password digest, destination address, command, or proxied application "
"data. Those fields are TLS application data."
msgstr ""
"这个顺序对分析抓包非常重要。在 TLS 未解密时，被动抓包只能看到 TCP 与 TLS 握"
"手，看不到 Trojan 的密码摘要、目标地址、命令或被代理的应用数据；这些字段都属"
"于 TLS Application Data。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Initial Trojan Request Wire Format"
msgstr "Trojan 初始请求线格式"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "After TLS has been established, the client sends one logical request:"
msgstr "TLS 建立后，客户端发送一个逻辑上的完整请求："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The first field is 56 ASCII hexadecimal characters because SHA-224 produces "
"28 bytes and hexadecimal encoding uses two characters per byte. It is "
"followed by the two bytes `0x0d 0x0a`."
msgstr ""
"第一个字段固定为 56 个 ASCII 十六进制字符，因为 SHA-224 输出 28 字节，而十六"
"进制编码每字节需要两个字符；其后紧跟两个字节 `0x0d 0x0a`。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The Trojan request itself is:"
msgstr "Trojan Request 本身的格式为："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"Unlike a SOCKS5 request, there is no leading `VER` byte and no reserved "
"`RSV` byte. Authentication is also not negotiated with a method-selection "
"exchange; it has already been supplied as the password hash immediately "
"before the request."
msgstr ""
"与 SOCKS5 请求不同，Trojan 没有前置 `VER` 字节，也没有保留的 `RSV` 字节；认证"
"也不通过方法协商完成，而是在请求之前直接提供密码哈希。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "`CMD`"
msgstr "`CMD`"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The baseline Trojan protocol defines:"
msgstr "基础 Trojan 协议定义了："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Open a TCP connection to the destination."
msgstr "向目标建立 TCP 连接。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Enter Trojan's framed UDP relay mode."
msgstr "进入 Trojan 的分帧 UDP 转发模式。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"There is no Trojan equivalent of SOCKS5 `BIND` in the baseline protocol."
msgstr "基础 Trojan 协议没有与 SOCKS5 `BIND` 对应的命令。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "`ATYP` and Destination Encoding"
msgstr "`ATYP` 与目标地址编码"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan deliberately reuses the SOCKS5 address-type values:"
msgstr "Trojan 有意复用了 SOCKS5 的地址类型取值："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "`ATYP`"
msgstr "`ATYP`"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Address form"
msgstr "地址形式"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Exactly 4 address bytes."
msgstr "固定 4 个地址字节。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Domain name"
msgstr "域名"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "One length byte, followed by that many domain-name bytes."
msgstr "先是 1 字节长度，随后是对应数量的域名字节。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Exactly 16 address bytes."
msgstr "固定 16 个地址字节。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"`DST.PORT` is two bytes in network byte order, the same convention used by "
"SOCKS5."
msgstr "`DST.PORT` 固定为 2 字节网络字节序，与 SOCKS5 使用相同约定。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "For example, a domain target conceptually becomes:"
msgstr "例如，一个域名目标在逻辑上会编码为："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"03                     ATYP = DOMAIN\n"
"0b                     domain length = 11\n"
"65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65   \"example\"\n"
"2e 63 6f 6d            \".com\"\n"
"01 bb                  port 443\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"03                     ATYP = DOMAIN\n"
"0b                     域名长度 = 11\n"
"65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65   \"example\"\n"
"2e 63 6f 6d            \".com\"\n"
"01 bb                  端口 443\n"
"```"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The example is shown as logical bytes only; on the wire these bytes are "
"inside TLS application records."
msgstr ""
"上例只展示逻辑字节；实际在线路上传输时，这些字节位于 TLS Application Data 记"
"录内部。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Authentication: Trojan versus SOCKS5"
msgstr "认证：Trojan 与 SOCKS5 对比"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5 separates method negotiation, optional authentication, and proxy "
"command selection. Trojan collapses those phases behind TLS:"
msgstr ""
"SOCKS5 将认证方法协商、可选认证和代理命令选择拆成不同阶段；Trojan 则把这些阶"
"段压缩到 TLS 之后："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The consequences are significant:"
msgstr "这会带来几个重要差异："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan has no authentication-method negotiation byte sequence."
msgstr "Trojan 不存在认证方法协商的字节序列。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan has no username/password sub-negotiation equivalent to RFC 1929."
msgstr "Trojan 没有与 RFC 1929 等价的用户名/密码子协商阶段。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan authentication is protected by TLS before it is transmitted."
msgstr "Trojan 的认证数据在发送前已经受到 TLS 保护。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The destination request can be coalesced with initial application payload."
msgstr "目标请求可以与首段应用层负载合并发送。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The baseline protocol does not define a SOCKS5-style `REP` response frame "
"for a successful `CONNECT`."
msgstr "基础协议没有为成功的 `CONNECT` 定义类似 SOCKS5 `REP` 的响应帧。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The last point changes the client state machine: after sending a valid "
"Trojan request, the client normally proceeds by observing the resulting "
"relay behavior rather than waiting for a fixed `VER/REP/ATYP/BND.ADDR/"
"BND.PORT` success frame."
msgstr ""
"最后一点会直接改变客户端状态机：发送有效 Trojan 请求后，客户端通常根据后续转"
"发行为继续，而不是等待固定的 `VER/REP/ATYP/BND.ADDR/BND.PORT` 成功帧。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TCP `CONNECT` State Machine"
msgstr "TCP `CONNECT` 状态机"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "A useful client-side state machine is:"
msgstr "客户端可以建模为如下状态机："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The server side can be modeled as:"
msgstr "服务端可以建模为："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"A robust implementation must not assume that one TLS read returns the "
"complete 56-byte digest, both CRLF delimiters, the full variable-length "
"address, and the first payload. TLS records and the underlying TCP stream "
"may split or coalesce those bytes arbitrarily."
msgstr ""
"健壮的实现不能假设一次 TLS read 就会返回完整的 56 字节摘要、两个 CRLF 分隔"
"符、完整变长地址和首段负载。TLS Record 与底层 TCP 流都可能任意拆分或合并这些"
"字节。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "First Payload and Read-Ahead"
msgstr "首段负载与预读"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"Trojan allows application payload to immediately follow the second CRLF. "
"This reduces an avoidable application-level round trip:"
msgstr ""
"Trojan 允许应用层负载紧跟第二个 CRLF，从而减少一个可以避免的应用层往返："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"A server parser therefore has an important boundary condition: bytes already "
"read beyond the end of the Trojan header are not parser garbage. They are "
"the first bytes destined for the requested upstream connection and must be "
"retained and forwarded in order."
msgstr ""
"因此服务端解析器有一个重要边界条件：如果一次读取已经越过 Trojan 头部末尾，那"
"些多读出来的字节不是解析垃圾，而是应发往目标上游的第一段数据，必须保留并按顺"
"序转发。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"This is analogous to the boundary after a successful SOCKS5 `CONNECT`, "
"except SOCKS5 normally has an explicit server reply before ordinary "
"application data begins."
msgstr ""
"这与 SOCKS5 成功 `CONNECT` 后的边界概念类似，只是 SOCKS5 通常会先发送一个明确"
"的服务端响应，然后才进入普通应用数据阶段。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan UDP Framing"
msgstr "Trojan UDP 分帧"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"For `CMD = 0x03`, the TLS connection becomes a stream carrying a sequence of "
"framed UDP datagrams:"
msgstr ""
"当 `CMD = 0x03` 时，TLS 连接会变成承载一系列带边界 UDP 数据报帧的字节流："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"`Length` is an unsigned two-byte payload length in network byte order. The "
"address fields identify the destination associated with that individual UDP "
"datagram."
msgstr ""
"`Length` 是一个无符号 2 字节网络字节序负载长度；地址字段标识该单个 UDP 数据报"
"的目标。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The receiver must therefore parse the stream as repeated length-delimited "
"messages:"
msgstr "因此接收端必须把字节流解析成连续的、由长度字段定界的消息："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"TCP/TLS does not preserve UDP packet boundaries. The `Length` field is what "
"reconstructs each datagram boundary."
msgstr ""
"TCP/TLS 不保留 UDP 数据报边界，真正用于重建每个数据报边界的是 `Length` 字段。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "UDP Fragmentation Difference from SOCKS5"
msgstr "与 SOCKS5 的 UDP 分片差异"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5's UDP request header includes `RSV` and a `FRAG` byte. Trojan's "
"baseline UDP framing does **not** carry the SOCKS5 `FRAG` field; instead it "
"adds a 2-byte payload length plus CRLF because multiple datagrams are "
"serialized into one reliable TLS byte stream."
msgstr ""
"SOCKS5 的 UDP 请求头包含 `RSV` 和 `FRAG` 字节；基础 Trojan UDP 帧**没有** "
"SOCKS5 的 `FRAG` 字段，而是增加 2 字节负载长度和 CRLF，因为多个数据报被串行化"
"到同一个可靠 TLS 字节流中。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "That gives a useful design comparison:"
msgstr "由此可以得到一个很有价值的设计对比："

