msgstr "在没有 TLS 会话密钥时，抓包通常只能确认："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "DNS resolution for the Trojan server, if DNS is visible."
msgstr "Trojan 服务端的 DNS 解析过程（如果 DNS 可见）。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TCP connection establishment to the Trojan server."
msgstr "到 Trojan 服务端的 TCP 连接建立过程。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"TLS ClientHello metadata that is not encrypted by the negotiated TLS mode, "
"such as observable handshake characteristics and commonly SNI in traditional "
"TLS deployments."
msgstr ""
"当前 TLS 模式下未被加密的 ClientHello 元数据，例如可观察到的握手特征，以及传"
"统 TLS 部署中通常可见的 SNI。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TLS handshake success or failure."
msgstr "TLS 握手成功或失败。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Encrypted application-data records and their timing/size patterns."
msgstr "加密后的 Application Data 记录及其时序/大小模式。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TLS/TCP connection shutdown."
msgstr "TLS/TCP 连接关闭过程。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"It cannot directly reveal the Trojan `CMD`, `ATYP`, destination address, "
"password digest, or application payload merely from the encrypted records."
msgstr ""
"仅凭这些加密记录，不能直接获知 Trojan 的 `CMD`、`ATYP`、目标地址、密码摘要或"
"应用负载。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"With TLS key logging in a controlled development environment, the decrypted "
"logical sequence should line up with the request format above. Such key "
"logging must be treated as sensitive because it defeats the confidentiality "
"being tested."
msgstr ""
"在受控开发环境中，如果启用 TLS key log，解密后的逻辑字节序列应与上面的请求格"
"式一致。此类密钥日志必须按敏感信息处理，因为它会直接绕过正在验证的机密性。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Error and Closure Semantics"
msgstr "错误与关闭语义"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"The baseline Trojan specification is much less reply-oriented than SOCKS5. "
"This means implementations need explicit local policies for conditions such "
"as:"
msgstr ""
"基础 Trojan 规范不像 SOCKS5 那样以明确响应帧为中心，因此实现需要为以下情况定"
"义清晰的本地处理策略："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TLS authentication/certificate failure,"
msgstr "TLS 认证/证书失败，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "incomplete 56-byte password field,"
msgstr "56 字节密码字段不完整，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "missing CRLF delimiter,"
msgstr "缺少 CRLF 分隔符，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "unsupported `CMD`,"
msgstr "不支持的 `CMD`，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "invalid `ATYP`,"
msgstr "无效 `ATYP`，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "truncated domain/IPv6 address,"
msgstr "域名/IPv6 地址被截断，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "incomplete two-byte port,"
msgstr "2 字节端口字段不完整，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "upstream dial failure,"
msgstr "上游拨号失败，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "declared UDP `Length` larger than available buffered data,"
msgstr "UDP `Length` 声明长度大于当前可用缓冲数据，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "peer EOF in the middle of a UDP frame,"
msgstr "UDP 帧尚未完整时对端提前 EOF，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "idle timeout,"
msgstr "空闲超时，"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TLS `close_notify`, TCP FIN, or TCP RST."
msgstr "TLS `close_notify`、TCP FIN 或 TCP RST。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"For malformed or unauthenticated requests, the deployment's fallback policy "
"is part of externally observable behavior. For already authenticated relay "
"traffic, normal stream shutdown should preserve half-close semantics where "
"the runtime and upstream socket APIs support them instead of converting "
"every EOF into an immediate reset."
msgstr ""
"对于格式错误或未认证请求，部署中的 fallback 策略本身就是外部可观察行为的一部"
"分。对于已经认证的转发流量，如果运行时与上游 socket API 支持，正常流关闭应尽"
"量保留 half-close 语义，而不是把每次 EOF 都立即转换成 reset。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Configuration and Minimal Deployment Model"
msgstr "配置与最小部署模型"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "A practical deployment needs at least:"
msgstr "一个实际可用的部署至少需要："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "a TCP listening address and port,"
msgstr "TCP 监听地址和端口；"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid ""
"TLS certificate/key or another implementation-specific TLS termination path,"
msgstr "TLS 证书/密钥，或实现所支持的其他 TLS 终止方式；"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "one or more Trojan passwords,"
msgstr "一个或多个 Trojan 密码；"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "a fallback policy if camouflage behavior is desired,"
msgstr "如果需要伪装行为，还需要 fallback 策略；"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "and routing rules for outbound traffic."
msgstr "以及出站流量的路由规则。"

#: src/protocols/trojan.md
msgid "A conceptual client entry looks like:"
msgstr "概念性的客户端配置类似："

#: src/protocols/trojan.md src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md
#: src/protocols/vless.md src/transports/xhttp.md
