#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "`UDP ASSOCIATE` command and returned relay endpoint"
msgstr "`UDP ASSOCIATE` 命令以及返回的中继端点"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "No separate command; auth response advertises UDP capability"
msgstr "没有单独命令；认证响应直接声明 UDP 能力"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "UDP transport"
msgstr "UDP 传输"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Native UDP to SOCKS relay with SOCKS UDP header"
msgstr "通过原生 UDP 向 SOCKS 中继发送带 SOCKS UDP 头的数据报"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "QUIC DATAGRAM with Hysteria UDPMessage"
msgstr "承载 Hysteria UDPMessage 的 QUIC DATAGRAM"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "UDP session lifetime"
msgstr "UDP 会话生命周期"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Bound to TCP control connection"
msgstr "绑定到 TCP 控制连接"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Session ID plus server inactivity policy; no explicit close"
msgstr "由 Session ID 与服务端空闲策略管理；没有显式关闭命令"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "SOCKS UDP `FRAG` field; RFC recommends dropping if unsupported"
msgstr "SOCKS UDP 使用 `FRAG` 字段；若实现不支持分片，RFC 建议直接丢弃"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Explicit Packet ID + Fragment ID + Fragment Count reassembly"
msgstr "通过显式 Packet ID + Fragment ID + Fragment Count 完成重组"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Congestion control"
msgstr "拥塞控制"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Inherited independently from TCP/UDP transports"
msgstr "分别继承自底层 TCP/UDP 传输"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"QUIC connection congestion control shared by streams and DATAGRAMs, plus "
"receive-rate signaling"
msgstr "Stream 与 DATAGRAM 共享 QUIC 连接拥塞控制，并额外交换接收速率信号"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "TCP receive windows on each SOCKS TCP connection"
msgstr "每条 SOCKS TCP 连接各自使用 TCP 接收窗口"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"QUIC connection + per-stream flow control (`MAX_DATA`, `MAX_STREAM_DATA`)"
msgstr "QUIC 连接级 + 每 Stream 流控（`MAX_DATA`、`MAX_STREAM_DATA`）"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"No multiplexing in RFC 1928; normally one CONNECT per control connection"
msgstr "RFC 1928 不定义多路复用；通常每条控制连接只承载一个 CONNECT"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Many TCP proxy streams and UDP DATAGRAMs share one QUIC connection"
msgstr "多个 TCP 代理 Stream 与 UDP DATAGRAM 共享一条 QUIC 连接"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Failure scope"
msgstr "故障作用域"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS reply failure normally ends that requested relay; transport loss ends "
"the TCP control connection"
msgstr ""
"SOCKS 回复失败通常只终止该次请求的 relay；传输连接丢失则终止 TCP 控制连接"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"`TCPResponse` error is stream-local; QUIC connection errors affect every "
"proxy stream/session on that connection"
msgstr ""
"`TCPResponse` 错误只作用于当前 Stream；QUIC 连接错误会影响该连接上的所有代理 "
"Stream/会话"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Optional packet obfuscation"
msgstr "可选数据包混淆"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Salamander, optionally wrapped by Gecko before QUIC reaches the wire"
msgstr "Salamander；在 QUIC 数据到达线缆之前还可以再由 Gecko 包装"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"The conceptual correspondence is still recognizable: authentication precedes "
"proxy use, a TCP request names a destination and receives success/failure, "
"and UDP needs per-datagram destination metadata. Hysteria replaces SOCKS5's "
"small binary control protocol with HTTP/3 authentication plus QUIC-native "
"streams and datagrams, and adds connection-level multiplexing, encryption, "
"congestion control, and explicit UDP fragment identity."
msgstr ""
"两者在概念上的对应关系仍然清晰可见：使用代理前都要先完成认证；TCP 请求都会指"
"定目标并得到成功/失败结果；UDP 都需要逐数据报的目标元数据。Hysteria 用 HTTP/"
"3 认证、QUIC 原生流和 DATAGRAM 替代了 SOCKS5 的小型二进制控制协议，并额外加入"
"连接级多路复用、加密、拥塞控制以及显式 UDP 分片身份。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Boundary Conditions and Error Scope"
msgstr "边界条件与错误作用域"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"A robust implementation has to distinguish errors at three different layers:"
msgstr "健壮的实现必须区分三个不同层级的错误："

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"**HTTP/3 authentication:** any status other than `233` means Hysteria "
"authentication failed and the client disconnects. The server intentionally "
"does not need to expose a Hysteria-specific authentication error body."
msgstr ""
"**HTTP/3 认证：**任何不是 `233` 的状态都表示 Hysteria 认证失败，客户端应断开"
"连接。服务端有意不需要暴露 Hysteria 专用的认证错误 body。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"**Proxy stream:** `TCPResponse status=0x01` means the requested destination "
"failed; the server closes that QUIC stream, while unrelated streams can "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"**代理 Stream：**`TCPResponse status=0x01` 表示请求的目标连接失败；服务端关闭"
"该 QUIC Stream，但无关 Stream 可以继续工作。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"**QUIC transport:** malformed QUIC frames, DATAGRAM use without negotiated "
"support, or DATAGRAM frames beyond the advertised transport limit can be "
"connection-level protocol errors and therefore tear down every Hysteria flow "
"multiplexed on that QUIC connection."
msgstr ""
"**QUIC 传输：**畸形 QUIC frame、未协商支持就使用 DATAGRAM，或 DATAGRAM 超过已"
"声明的传输上限，都可能构成连接级协议错误，从而终止复用在该 QUIC 连接上的全部 "
"Hysteria 数据流。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Length-prefixed fields must be validated before allocation or slicing. QUIC "
"varints can represent values up to 62 bits, which is far larger than any "
"reasonable address, diagnostic string, or padding field. The wire type alone "
"is not a safe allocation bound. Servers should impose practical limits on "
"address, padding, message, fragment-reassembly, concurrent-stream, and UDP-"
"session state."
msgstr ""
"带长度前缀的字段必须先校验，再进行内存分配或切片。QUIC varint 可以表示最高 "
"62 位的值，远大于任何合理的地址、诊断字符串或 padding 字段。仅凭线格式类型本"
"身不能形成安全的分配上限。服务端应对地址、padding、消息、分片重组、并发 "
"Stream 以及 UDP 会话状态设置实际可执行的资源上限。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"The base Hysteria specification deliberately leaves some malformed "
"application-message handling to implementations. Defensive parsers should "
"fail closed on truncated varints, truncated fixed-width fields, impossible "
"fragment metadata, and address lengths larger than the remaining message "
"instead of trying to recover by scanning for a later boundary."
msgstr ""
"Hysteria 基础规范有意把一部分畸形应用消息的处理策略留给具体实现。防御性解析器"
"遇到被截断的 varint、被截断的定长字段、不可能成立的分片元数据，或大于消息剩余"
"长度的地址长度时，应直接失败并关闭当前处理路径，而不是通过扫描后续边界尝试恢"
"复。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Without QUIC decryption keys, a normal packet capture sees UDP packets "
"carrying QUIC rather than the `/auth`, TCPRequest, destination, or "
"UDPMessage fields. Useful observable phases are therefore:"
msgstr ""
"如果没有 QUIC 解密密钥，普通抓包只能看到承载 QUIC 的 UDP 数据包，而看不到 `/"
"auth`、TCPRequest、目标地址或 UDPMessage 字段。因此可观察的有效阶段主要是："

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"With endpoint-side QUIC/TLS secrets and suitable tooling, the investigator "
"can separate HTTP/3 authentication, individual stream IDs, and DATAGRAM "
"traffic. A standards-oriented trace of the QUIC handshake can also expose "
"transport parameters such as `max_datagram_frame_size` before 1-RTT "
"application data is decoded. Even then, remember that QUIC packet boundaries "
"are not TCPRequest message boundaries: STREAM frames can split or coalesce "
"application bytes."
msgstr ""
"如果能够获得端点侧 QUIC/TLS 密钥并使用合适工具，分析者可以区分 HTTP/3 认证、"
"各个 Stream ID 与 DATAGRAM 流量。按照标准解析 QUIC 握手时，还可以在解码 1-"
"RTT 应用数据之前看到 `max_datagram_frame_size` 等传输参数。即便如此也必须记"
"住：QUIC packet 边界并不等于 TCPRequest 消息边界，STREAM frame 仍可能拆分或合"
"并应用层字节。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"For TCP, a decrypted stream begins with the varint value `0x401`, then the "
"length-prefixed destination and padding, followed by a `TCPResponse`, then "
"raw proxied bytes. For UDP, the DATAGRAM Data begins with the 8-byte fixed "
"Hysteria header (`Session ID`, `Packet ID`, `Fragment ID`, `Fragment Count`) "
"before its address-length varint. Those are useful dissector anchors after "
"decryption, not plaintext signatures visible to a normal on-path capture."
msgstr ""
"对于 TCP，解密后的 Stream 首先出现 varint 值 `0x401`，随后是带长度前缀的目标"
"地址和 padding，再之后是 `TCPResponse`，最后进入原始代理字节流。对于 UDP，"
"DATAGRAM Data 会先出现 8 字节固定 Hysteria 头（`Session ID`、`Packet ID`、"
"`Fragment ID`、`Fragment Count`），然后才是地址长度 varint。这些字段适合作为"
"解密后的 dissector 锚点，但不是普通链路抓包可以直接看到的明文特征。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Congestion Control and Bandwidth Information"
msgstr "拥塞控制与带宽信息"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Hysteria 2 allows peers to communicate receive-rate information during the "
"authentication exchange. Depending on configuration and the values "
"exchanged, the implementation can use explicit bandwidth information or rely "
"on a normal congestion-control algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Hysteria 2 允许双方在认证阶段交换接收速率信息。根据配置和交换值，实现可以使用"
"显式带宽信息，也可以依赖常规拥塞控制算法。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Do not treat configured upload/download values as guaranteed throughput. "
"They influence transport behavior; the real path is still limited by RTT, "
"packet loss, server capacity, ISP shaping, and the congestion-control "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"不要把配置的上传/下载数值理解为保证吞吐量。它们会影响传输行为，但真实链路仍"
"受 RTT、丢包、服务端容量、ISP 限速以及拥塞控制实现限制。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "HTTP/3 Masquerading"
msgstr "HTTP/3 伪装"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"An unauthenticated Hysteria endpoint is expected to behave like an HTTP/3 "
"service rather than immediately exposing a proxy-specific protocol response. "
"Deployments can serve ordinary content or reverse-proxy to another site for "
"non-Hysteria requests."
msgstr ""
"未认证的 Hysteria 端点预期表现得像普通 HTTP/3 服务，而不是立即返回代理协议专"
"用响应。对于非 Hysteria 请求，部署可以提供普通内容或反向代理到其他站点。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"This is an operational behavior, not a reason to neglect normal TLS and "
"server hardening. A Hysteria server remains a public UDP service and should "
"be patched, rate-limited where appropriate, and protected from credential "
"leakage."
msgstr ""
"这只是运行层面的行为，并不意味着可以忽视正常 TLS 和服务端安全加固。Hysteria "
"服务端依然是公开 UDP 服务，应及时更新补丁、按需要限速，并防止凭据泄漏。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Optional Obfuscation"
msgstr "可选混淆"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Obfuscation is an outer packet transform below QUIC. It does not replace "
"QUIC TLS, Hysteria authentication, or proxy framing."
msgstr ""
"混淆是位于 QUIC 下方的一层外部数据包变换。它不会替代 QUIC TLS、Hysteria 认证"
"或代理封装。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Salamander"
msgstr "Salamander"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Salamander prepends an 8-byte random salt to every QUIC packet and XORs the "
"QUIC packet bytes with a repeating 32-byte BLAKE2b-256-derived mask:"
msgstr ""
"Salamander 会在每个 QUIC packet 前添加 8 字节随机 salt，并使用由 BLAKE2b-256 "
"派生、以 32 字节周期重复的 mask 对 QUIC packet 字节执行 XOR："

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"The receiver derives the same mask from the configured pre-shared key and "
"the received salt, reverses the XOR, and passes the recovered packet to "
"QUIC. This is traffic obfuscation, not an independent authenticated-"
"encryption layer; QUIC TLS remains responsible for confidentiality and "
"integrity of Hysteria traffic."
msgstr ""
"接收方根据配置的预共享密钥和收到的 salt 派生相同 mask，逆转 XOR，再把恢复出的"
"数据包交给 QUIC。这属于流量混淆，而不是独立的认证加密层；Hysteria 流量的机密"
"性与完整性仍由 QUIC TLS 负责。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Gecko"
msgstr "Gecko"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"The current upstream specification also defines Gecko as a wrapper around "
"Salamander. Gecko only changes the treatment of QUIC packets with the long-"
"header bit set. Short-header packets go directly through Salamander. A long-"
"header packet is split into between 2 and 8 chunks, and every chunk is "
"wrapped before Salamander processing:"
msgstr ""
"当前上游规范还定义了作为 Salamander 外层包装的 Gecko。Gecko 只改变 long-"
"header 位被置位的 QUIC packet 的处理方式；short-header packet 直接进入 "
"Salamander。一个 long-header packet 会被拆成 2 到 8 个 chunk，每个 chunk 都先"
"由 Gecko 包装，再交给 Salamander 处理："

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"`chunkIdx` must be smaller than `totalChunks`, and `totalChunks` is in the "
"range 2 through 8. All chunks of one original QUIC packet carry the same "
"`msgID` and count. The receiver first reverses Salamander, groups Gecko "
"fragments by source address and message ID, validates consistent metadata, "
"concatenates chunks in index order, and only then gives the reconstructed "
"long-header packet to QUIC. Reassembly state needs per-source and global "
"bounds plus a TTL to avoid turning handshake camouflage into an allocation "
"attack surface."
msgstr ""
"`chunkIdx` 必须小于 `totalChunks`，而 `totalChunks` 的取值范围是 2 到 8。同一"
"个原始 QUIC packet 的所有 chunk 都携带相同的 `msgID` 和 count。接收方首先逆"
"转 Salamander，然后按源地址和 message ID 对 Gecko 分片分组，校验元数据一致"
"性，按索引顺序拼接 chunk，最后才把重建出的 long-header packet 交给 QUIC。重组"
"状态必须具有按源地址的上限、全局上限以及 TTL，避免握手伪装机制本身变成内存分"
"配攻击面。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"The practical capture consequence is significant. Without obfuscation, QUIC "
"long-header structure is visible even though its payload is encrypted. With "
"Salamander, the UDP payload no longer parses as ordinary QUIC. With Gecko, "
"one QUIC handshake packet can additionally appear as several independently "
"padded UDP datagrams. Client and server must agree on the obfuscation mode "
"and key before QUIC itself can establish a connection."
msgstr ""
"这会显著改变抓包表现。未开启混淆时，即使 QUIC payload 已加密，long-header 结"
"构仍然可见；开启 Salamander 后，UDP payload 将不再能按普通 QUIC 解析；再加上 "
"Gecko 后，一个 QUIC 握手 packet 还可能表现为多个分别带随机 padding 的 UDP "
"datagram。客户端与服务端必须在 QUIC 自身建立连接之前就对混淆模式和密钥达成一"
"致。"

