"This is a compatibility-oriented example, not a promise that every field "
"name is accepted by every Chimera core version. Use the schema of the "
"selected core as the source of truth."
msgstr ""
"这是面向兼容性的示例，并不承诺每个 Chimera 核心版本都接受所有字段名称。应以当"
"前选中核心的配置 schema 作为权威来源。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Server Deployment Checklist"
msgstr "服务端部署检查清单"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "A Hysteria 2 server needs:"
msgstr "Hysteria 2 服务端需要："

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "UDP reachability on the selected listening port,"
msgstr "所选监听端口具有 UDP 可达性；"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "valid TLS identity/configuration expected by the client,"
msgstr "符合客户端预期的有效 TLS 身份/配置；"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "an authentication policy,"
msgstr "认证策略；"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "sufficient UDP socket buffers for the target workload,"
msgstr "能够满足目标负载的 UDP socket buffer；"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "appropriate firewall rules,"
msgstr "适当的防火墙规则；"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "and a decision about ordinary HTTP/3 fallback/masquerade behavior."
msgstr "以及对普通 HTTP/3 fallback/伪装行为的明确选择。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"If a cloud provider, home router, or enterprise firewall blocks UDP, "
"changing Hysteria settings will not fix the underlying reachability problem."
msgstr ""
"如果云服务商、家庭路由器或企业防火墙阻断 UDP，修改 Hysteria 参数无法解决底层"
"可达性问题。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Native TCP and UDP proxying on top of QUIC."
msgstr "在 QUIC 之上原生提供 TCP 与 UDP 代理。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Independent QUIC streams reduce cross-stream interference compared with one "
"monolithic reliable stream."
msgstr ""
"相较于单一大型可靠字节流，独立 QUIC Stream 可以降低不同流之间的相互干扰。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"QUIC connection behavior can perform well on lossy or high-latency paths."
msgstr "QUIC 在高丢包或高延迟链路上可能具有较好表现。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "UDP relay maps naturally to QUIC datagrams."
msgstr "UDP 转发可以自然映射到 QUIC Datagram。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"HTTP/3-facing authentication/fallback behavior provides a normal service "
"path for unauthenticated requests."
msgstr "面向 HTTP/3 的认证/fallback 行为可以为未认证请求提供普通服务路径。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Requires usable UDP connectivity from client to server."
msgstr "要求客户端到服务端之间具有可用的 UDP 连通性。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Networks may block, throttle, or degrade QUIC independently of TCP/HTTPS."
msgstr "网络可能独立于 TCP/HTTPS 对 QUIC 进行阻断、限速或降级。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "MTU problems can cause disproportionately confusing UDP failures."
msgstr "MTU 问题可能造成非常难以定位的 UDP 故障。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Aggressive bandwidth settings can create loss rather than improve throughput."
msgstr "过于激进的带宽设置可能增加丢包，而不是提高吞吐量。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Optional obfuscation adds configuration and interoperability complexity."
msgstr "可选混淆会增加配置与互操作复杂度。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Keep certificate verification enabled for normal deployments."
msgstr "正常部署应保持证书验证开启。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Use high-entropy authentication credentials and rotate them when clients are "
"retired."
msgstr "使用高熵认证凭据，并在客户端停用后及时轮换。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Do not expose authentication values in URLs, screenshots, or debug logs."
msgstr "不要在 URL、截图或调试日志中暴露认证值。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Treat HTTP/3 fallback content as a real public service and patch it normally."
msgstr "应把 HTTP/3 fallback 内容当作真实公网服务正常维护和打补丁。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Rate limiting and abuse controls may be appropriate on publicly reachable "
"servers."
msgstr "对于公网可访问服务端，可以按需要配置限速和滥用防护。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Hysteria 2 is listed as a current client-core capability. Validate the exact "
"accepted configuration schema and optional features against the current "
"`Chimera_Client` branch before assuming full parity with Hysteria's "
"reference implementation or Mihomo."
msgstr ""
"Hysteria 2 当前被列为客户端核心已有能力。在假定与 Hysteria 参考实现或 Mihomo "
"完全一致之前，应根据当前 `Chimera_Client` 分支验证实际接受的配置 schema 和可"
"选功能。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Chimera stores and generates profile/runtime configuration but does not "
"itself implement Hysteria 2 transport logic."
msgstr ""
"Chimera 负责保存和生成配置/运行时配置，本身并不实现 Hysteria 2 传输逻辑。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"The current server capability map includes Hysteria 2 inbound work, and the "
"server documentation lists a Hysteria example configuration. Treat that as a "
"stronger signal than a purely planned feature, while still validating TCP, "
"UDP, authentication, and optional transport behavior separately."
msgstr ""
"当前服务端能力地图包含 Hysteria 2 入站实现，服务端文档也列出了 Hysteria 示例"
"配置。这比单纯的计划功能更能说明已有实现，但仍应分别验证 TCP、UDP、认证和可选"
"传输行为。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"The current Server interoperability index records an ignored external E2E "
"case, "
"`xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs::xray_client_can_proxy_tcp_and_udp_through_chimera_hysteria2_with_xray_defaults`, "
"that starts a real Xray client against Chimera Server and exercises both TCP "
"and UDP proxying through the Hysteria 2 implementation."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 互操作索引记录了一项标记为 ignored 的外部 E2E 用例："
"`xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs::xray_client_can_proxy_tcp_and_udp_through_chimera_hysteria2_with_xray_defaults`。"
"该用例启动真实的 Xray 客户端连接 Chimera Server，并通过 Hysteria 2 实现分别测"
"试 TCP 和 UDP 代理。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Because this is an explicit process-level external test, it is strong "
"evidence for the covered path. It does not automatically prove every "
"congestion-control, obfuscation, masquerading, or version-specific option "
"described on this page. See [Test Evidence and Interoperability Matrix](../"
"test-evidence.md)."
msgstr ""
"这是明确的进程级外部测试，因此是所覆盖路径的有力证据；但它并不能自动证明本页"
"所述的所有拥塞控制、混淆、伪装或版本特定选项均已验证。详见[测试证据与互操作矩"
"阵](../test-evidence.md)。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Cannot connect at all"
msgstr "完全无法连接"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Confirm the hostname resolves to the intended server."
msgstr "确认主机名解析到了预期服务器。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Verify UDP reachability to the configured port."
msgstr "确认配置端口的 UDP 可达性。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Check firewall/security-group rules on both ends."
msgstr "检查两端防火墙/安全组规则。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Verify TLS name/certificate expectations."
msgstr "确认 TLS 名称/证书符合预期。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Check the authentication value."
msgstr "检查认证值。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "TCP works but UDP fails"
msgstr "TCP 正常但 UDP 失败"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Confirm the server advertises/supports UDP relay."
msgstr "确认服务端声明并支持 UDP 转发。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Test small UDP packets first."
msgstr "先测试较小的 UDP 数据包。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Check MTU and fragmentation behavior."
msgstr "检查 MTU 与分片行为。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Check NAT/firewall timeout behavior."
msgstr "检查 NAT/防火墙超时行为。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Disable optional obfuscation temporarily to reduce variables."
msgstr "临时关闭可选混淆以减少变量。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Poor throughput"
msgstr "吞吐量较差"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Measure packet loss and RTT before changing bandwidth values."
msgstr "修改带宽参数前先测量丢包率和 RTT。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Compare with a TCP-based protocol to determine whether the path is "
"specifically hostile to UDP/QUIC."
msgstr "与基于 TCP 的协议对比，以判断链路是否专门对 UDP/QUIC 不友好。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Avoid over-reporting available bandwidth."
msgstr "避免把可用带宽配置得明显高于实际水平。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Check server CPU, socket-buffer limits, and uplink capacity."
msgstr "检查服务端 CPU、socket buffer 限制和上行容量。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Inspect whether a VPN, ISP, or enterprise firewall is rate-limiting QUIC."
msgstr "检查 VPN、ISP 或企业防火墙是否正在限制 QUIC。"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Hysteria 2 protocol specification: <https://v2.hysteria.network/docs/"
"developers/Protocol/>"
msgstr ""
"Hysteria 2 协议规范：<https://v2.hysteria.network/docs/developers/Protocol/>"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "QUIC, RFC 9000: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9000>"
msgstr "QUIC，RFC 9000：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9000>"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "QUIC Datagram, RFC 9221: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9221>"
msgstr "QUIC Datagram，RFC 9221：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9221>"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"Using TLS to Secure QUIC, RFC 9001: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9001>"
msgstr "使用 TLS 保护 QUIC，RFC 9001：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9001>"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid ""
"QUIC Loss Detection and Congestion Control, RFC 9002: <https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9002>"
msgstr ""
"QUIC 丢包检测与拥塞控制，RFC 9002：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002>"

#: src/protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "HTTP/3, RFC 9114: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9114>"
msgstr "HTTP/3，RFC 9114：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9114>"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC is a standardized proxy protocol for relaying TCP and UDP traffic over "
"a multiplexed secure transport. The current protocol specification is "
"version `0x05` and is designed primarily around QUIC, although the protocol "
"model itself is expressed in terms of a multiplexable TLS-encrypted stream "
"rather than being hard-wired to one implementation."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 是一种标准化代理协议，用于通过可多路复用的安全传输转发 TCP 和 UDP 流量。"
"当前协议规范版本为 `0x05`，主要围绕 QUIC 设计；不过协议模型本身以可多路复用"
"的 TLS 加密流来描述，而不是强制绑定某一种具体实现。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC focuses on low-latency task startup, TCP/UDP multiplexing, connection-"
"bound authentication, and flexible UDP relay behavior."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 重点关注低延迟任务启动、TCP/UDP 多路复用、与连接绑定的认证以及灵活的 "
"UDP 转发行为。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A typical QUIC deployment looks like:"
msgstr "典型 QUIC 部署可以理解为："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The current upstream specification also defines an `Authenticate` command "
"used to authenticate the multiplexed connection."
msgstr ""
"当前上游规范还定义了 `Authenticate` 命令，用于对这条多路复用连接进行认证。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC v5 authentication is connection-bound. The client identifies itself "
"with a UUID and derives an authentication token from the current TLS session "
"using the TLS Keying Material Exporter and the configured password."
msgstr ""
"TUIC v5 的认证与连接绑定。客户端使用 UUID 标识自身，并结合当前 TLS 会话的 "
"TLS Keying Material Exporter 与已配置密码派生认证 token。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"This matters operationally because authentication is tied to the secure "
"session rather than being a reusable clear-text token sent independently of "
"TLS."
msgstr ""
"这一点在运维上很重要，因为认证绑定在安全会话本身，而不是独立于 TLS 发送一个可"
"复用的明文 token。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The protocol allows authentication and relay-task setup to overlap. An "
"implementation can receive task headers before authentication completes, but "
"it should not process those tasks until the connection has been "
"authenticated."
msgstr ""
"协议允许认证过程与转发任务建立过程重叠。实现可以在认证完成前接收任务头，但在"
"连接通过认证之前不应真正处理这些任务。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Common Command Wire Format"
msgstr "通用命令线格式"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC v5 uses one common envelope for all application commands. All fixed-"
"width multi-byte fields are encoded in big-endian order unless the "
"specification says otherwise:"
msgstr ""
"TUIC v5 为所有应用层命令使用统一封装。除非规范另有说明，所有定长多字节字段都"
"使用大端序编码："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"`VER` is `0x05` for the current protocol version. `TYPE` selects the command:"
msgstr "当前协议版本的 `VER` 为 `0x05`，`TYPE` 用来选择命令类型："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TYPE"
msgstr "TYPE"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`Authenticate`"
msgstr "`Authenticate`"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Authenticate the multiplexed connection"
msgstr "认证整个多路复用连接"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`Connect`"
msgstr "`Connect`"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Start one TCP relay task"
msgstr "启动一个 TCP 中继任务"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`Packet`"
msgstr "`Packet`"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Carry one UDP packet or fragment"
msgstr "承载一个 UDP 数据包或其分片"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`Dissociate`"
msgstr "`Dissociate`"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Destroy one UDP association"
msgstr "销毁一个 UDP association"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`Heartbeat`"
msgstr "`Heartbeat`"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Keep the QUIC connection active"
msgstr "保持 QUIC 连接活跃"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"`OPT` is not a TLV block with its own generic length. Its layout is "
"determined entirely by `TYPE`, so a parser must know the command type before "
"it can know how many bytes belong to the command header."
msgstr ""
"`OPT` 不是一个带通用长度字段的 TLV 区块；它的布局完全由 `TYPE` 决定，因此解析"
"器必须先知道命令类型，才能确定命令头还需要读取多少字节。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"This differs from SOCKS5 in an important way. SOCKS5 has several distinct "
"message layouts (`METHOD`, authentication sub-negotiation, request, reply, "
"UDP header), while TUIC starts each application command with the same two-"
"byte `VER | TYPE` discriminator and then switches to a command-specific "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"这与 SOCKS5 有一个重要区别：SOCKS5 拥有多种彼此独立的消息布局（`METHOD`、认证"
"子协商、request、reply、UDP header），而 TUIC 的每个应用命令都先以统一的两字"
"节 `VER | TYPE` 判别头开始，再切换到对应命令自己的结构。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Exact `Authenticate` Frame"
msgstr "精确的 `Authenticate` 帧"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The `Authenticate` command-specific data is fixed length:"
msgstr "`Authenticate` 命令的专用数据是固定长度："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Including the common command bytes, the logical command is therefore:"
msgstr "把通用命令头也算进去后，逻辑上的完整命令为："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The client opens a QUIC unidirectional stream and sends this command. The "
"UUID is the client's 128-bit identity. The 256-bit token is derived from the "
"current TLS session using the TLS exporter interface, with the client UUID "
"as the exporter label and the raw password as exporter context."
msgstr ""
"客户端打开一个 QUIC 单向流并发送该命令。UUID 是客户端的 128 位身份标识；256 "
"位 TOKEN 通过当前 TLS 会话的 TLS exporter 接口派生，其中客户端 UUID 作为 "
"exporter label，原始密码作为 exporter context。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The important property is session binding: knowledge of a previously "
"observed token is not equivalent to knowledge of the raw password because a "
"newly established TLS session produces a new exporter context. TLS 1.3 keeps "
"the exporter interface while deriving exporter values through its HKDF-based "
"key schedule."
msgstr ""
"关键属性是会话绑定：知道之前观察到的 TOKEN 并不等价于知道原始密码，因为新建立"
"的 TLS 会话会产生新的 exporter 上下文。TLS 1.3 保留了 exporter 接口，但 "
"exporter 值通过其基于 HKDF 的密钥调度派生。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"There is no TUIC application-level `AUTH OK` frame. Successful "
"authentication changes server-side connection state. Authentication failure "
"is handled by the implementation, commonly by ignoring work or closing the "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 没有应用层的 `AUTH OK` 帧。认证成功只是改变服务端连接状态；认证失败如何"
"处理由实现决定，常见方式包括忽略任务或关闭连接。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Authentication State Machine"
msgstr "认证状态机"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC explicitly permits authentication and relay setup to overlap. A server "
"that sees `Connect` or `Packet` before `Authenticate` should accept enough "
"of the task to pause it, but should not process the relay until "
"authentication has completed."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 明确允许认证与中继任务建立过程重叠。服务端若在 `Authenticate` 之前先看"
"到 `Connect` 或 `Packet`，应读取足够的任务头并暂停处理，但在认证完成前不能真"
"正执行中继。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC uses a SOCKS-like variable-length address structure, but its type "
"values are different from RFC 1928:"
msgstr ""
"TUIC 使用一种与 SOCKS 类似的变长地址结构，但地址类型取值与 RFC 1928 不同："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The address types are:"
msgstr "地址类型如下："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC TYPE"
msgstr "TUIC TYPE"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Address bytes"
msgstr "地址字节"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`0xff`"
msgstr "`0xff`"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "No address; used by later UDP fragments"
msgstr "无地址；用于后续 UDP 分片"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Domain/FQDN"
msgstr "域名/FQDN"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "1-byte length followed by domain bytes"
msgstr "1 字节长度，后跟域名字节"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "4 bytes"
msgstr "4 字节"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`PORT` is a 16-bit big-endian integer."
msgstr "`PORT` 是一个 16 位大端序整数。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "For example, `example.com:443` is conceptually:"
msgstr "例如，`example.com:443` 在概念上的编码如下："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "SOCKS5 uses almost the same structural idea but different ATYP values:"
msgstr "SOCKS5 使用几乎相同的结构思想，但 ATYP 取值不同："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The TUIC-only `0xff None` value exists because a fragmented UDP packet does "
"not need to repeat the target address in every fragment."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 特有的 `0xff None` 用于 UDP 分片场景，因为同一个 UDP 数据包的后续分片不"
"需要重复携带目标地址。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TCP Relay"
msgstr "TCP 转发"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TCP relaying uses a `Connect` command on a bidirectional stream:"
msgstr "TCP 转发在双向 Stream 上使用 `Connect` 命令："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The client opens a bidirectional stream."
msgstr "客户端打开一条双向 Stream。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The client sends the target address in a `Connect` command."
msgstr "客户端通过 `Connect` 命令发送目标地址。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The client can begin sending stream data without waiting for a separate "
"application-level success response."
msgstr "客户端无需等待额外的应用层成功响应，就可以开始发送 Stream 数据。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The server opens the requested TCP connection."
msgstr "服务端建立所请求的 TCP 连接。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Once available, the server relays data between the destination socket and "
"the QUIC stream."
msgstr "连接可用后，服务端在目标 socket 与 QUIC Stream 之间转发数据。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "This design contributes to TUIC's low-startup-latency behavior."
msgstr "这种设计有助于实现 TUIC 较低的任务启动延迟。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Exact `Connect` Command"
msgstr "精确的 `Connect` 命令"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The command-specific part of `Connect` contains only the encoded target "
"address:"
msgstr "`Connect` 的命令专用部分只包含编码后的目标地址："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"On a QUIC bidirectional stream the byte sequence is therefore logically:"
msgstr "因此，在 QUIC 双向流中，逻辑字节序列为："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "There is no TUIC equivalent of SOCKS5's explicit success reply:"
msgstr "TUIC 没有与 SOCKS5 显式成功响应对应的帧："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The TUIC server opens the requested TCP connection after parsing the "
"`Connect` header. The client is allowed to send application payload "
"immediately after the header without waiting for target-dial completion. A "
"server implementation must therefore be prepared to buffer or naturally "
"backpressure that QUIC stream while the outbound TCP dial is pending."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 服务端解析 `Connect` 头后才去建立目标 TCP 连接。客户端允许在命令头之后立"
"即发送应用数据，而无需等待目标拨号完成，因此服务端在出站 TCP 仍处于连接阶段"
"时，必须能够缓存这些数据，或通过 QUIC 流的自然背压限制发送。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"If the target cannot be reached, TUIC v5 defines no universal error reply. "
"An implementation may reset/close the QUIC bidirectional stream, close the "
"whole QUIC connection, or otherwise apply implementation-defined behavior."
msgstr ""
"如果目标不可达，TUIC v5 没有定义统一错误响应。实现可以 reset/关闭该 QUIC 双向"
"流、关闭整个 QUIC 连接，或者采用其他实现自定义行为。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TCP Relay State Machine"
msgstr "TCP 中继状态机"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Each proxied TCP flow gets its own QUIC bidirectional stream. Loss affecting "
"one stream does not force the application data of unrelated TUIC streams "
"into one single ordered byte sequence, although all streams still share the "
"QUIC connection's congestion-control and path state."
msgstr ""
"每个被代理的 TCP 流都拥有独立的 QUIC 双向流。某一个流上的丢包不会把其他无关 "
"TUIC 流的应用数据强行串入同一个全局有序字节序列，但所有流仍共享同一 QUIC 连接"
"的拥塞控制和路径状态。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "UDP Relay"
msgstr "UDP 转发"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC uses an association identifier to keep UDP traffic for a logical "
"session on a corresponding server-side UDP socket."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 使用 association identifier，把一个逻辑会话中的 UDP 流量关联到服务端对应"
"的 UDP socket。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A UDP packet can be carried using:"
msgstr "UDP 数据包可以通过以下方式承载："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "a QUIC unidirectional stream for reliable delivery,"
msgstr "使用 QUIC 单向 Stream 进行可靠传输；"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "or a QUIC datagram for native unreliable delivery."
msgstr "或使用 QUIC Datagram 进行原生不可靠传输。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The first packet for an association determines the reply mode for that "
"association in the reference protocol flow."
msgstr ""
"在参考协议流程中，一个 association 的第一个数据包会决定该 association 的响应"
"模式。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC also defines packet identifiers and fragment fields so oversized UDP "
"packets can be split and reassembled."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 还定义了数据包标识与分片字段，使过大的 UDP 数据包可以拆分并重新组装。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"When the client no longer needs a UDP association, it can send a "
"`Dissociate` command so the server releases the corresponding UDP socket."
msgstr ""
"当客户端不再需要某个 UDP association 时，可以发送 `Dissociate` 命令，让服务端"
"释放对应 UDP socket。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Exact `Packet` Header"
msgstr "精确的 `Packet` 头"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A TUIC UDP packet or fragment uses:"
msgstr "TUIC 的 UDP 数据包或分片使用以下格式："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Prepending the common command header gives:"
msgstr "在前面加上通用命令头后得到："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Fields mean:"
msgstr "各字段含义如下："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`ASSOC_ID`: 16-bit UDP association identifier generated by the client."
msgstr "`ASSOC_ID`：由客户端生成的 16 位 UDP association 标识。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"`PKT_ID`: 16-bit identifier shared by all fragments of one original UDP "
"datagram."
msgstr "`PKT_ID`：同一个原始 UDP 数据报的所有分片共享的 16 位标识。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`FRAG_TOTAL`: number of fragments in that original UDP datagram."
msgstr "`FRAG_TOTAL`：该原始 UDP 数据报的分片总数。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`FRAG_ID`: index identifying this fragment."
msgstr "`FRAG_ID`：当前分片的索引。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`SIZE`: byte length of this fragment's UDP payload."
msgstr "`SIZE`：当前分片 UDP payload 的字节长度。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"`ADDR`: destination address for client-to-server traffic, or source address "
"for server-to-client traffic."
msgstr "`ADDR`：客户端到服务端方向表示目标地址；服务端到客户端方向表示源地址。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`PAYLOAD`: exactly `SIZE` bytes belonging to this packet fragment."
msgstr "`PAYLOAD`：恰好 `SIZE` 字节，属于当前数据包分片。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Later fragments can encode `ADDR.TYPE = 0xff` (`None`) rather than repeating "
"the same address. This makes the first fragment important to reassembly "
"metadata."
msgstr ""
"后续分片可以把 `ADDR.TYPE` 编码为 `0xff`（`None`），从而无需重复相同地址。这"
"也意味着首个分片对重组元数据尤其重要。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Association Semantics"
msgstr "Association 语义"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Both peers maintain an association table scoped to one QUIC connection:"
msgstr "通信双方都需要为每条 QUIC 连接维护一张 association 表："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"When the server receives the first `Packet` for a new `ASSOC_ID`, it "
"allocates a UDP socket and stores the mapping. Reusing that association ID "
"causes later client packets to leave through the same server-side UDP "
"socket. That property is what gives the protocol its Full Cone-style UDP "
"behavior in the reference flow."
msgstr ""
"服务端第一次收到某个新 `ASSOC_ID` 的 `Packet` 时，会分配一个 UDP socket 并保"
"存映射。之后继续使用相同 association ID 的客户端数据包，会从同一个服务端 UDP "
"socket 发出；这正是参考流程中 TUIC 实现 Full Cone 风格 UDP 行为的基础。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Unlike SOCKS5, there is no separate `UDP ASSOCIATE` request/reply "
"transaction before the first UDP payload. The first TUIC `Packet` can "
"implicitly create the association."
msgstr ""
"与 SOCKS5 不同，TUIC 不要求在第一个 UDP payload 之前先完成独立的 `UDP "
"ASSOCIATE` 请求/响应事务；首个 TUIC `Packet` 本身就可以隐式创建 association。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Native vs Reliable UDP Modes"
msgstr "Native 与可靠 UDP 模式"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC defines two carriage choices for `Packet` commands:"
msgstr "TUIC 为 `Packet` 命令定义了两种承载方式："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"UDP relay mode \"quic\"\n"
"  Packet command -> QUIC unidirectional stream\n"
"  reliable delivery semantics\n"
"\n"
"UDP relay mode \"native\"\n"
"  Packet command -> QUIC DATAGRAM\n"
"  unreliable delivery semantics\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"UDP 转发模式 \"quic\"\n"
"  Packet 命令 -> QUIC 单向 Stream\n"
"  可靠传输语义\n"
"\n"
"UDP 转发模式 \"native\"\n"
"  Packet 命令 -> QUIC DATAGRAM\n"
"  不可靠传输语义\n"
"```"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The server uses the same mode for return traffic that the client used for "
"the first packet of that association."
msgstr "服务端对返回流量使用与该 association 首个客户端数据包相同的模式。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"This is a major difference from Hysteria 2. Hysteria 2's UDP data path is "
"specified around QUIC DATAGRAM, whereas TUIC explicitly permits either a "
"reliable QUIC stream or an unreliable QUIC datagram for UDP packet carriage. "
"QUIC DATAGRAM frames themselves are not retransmitted by QUIC."
msgstr ""
"这是 TUIC 与 Hysteria 2 的重要差异。Hysteria 2 的 UDP 数据路径围绕 QUIC "
"DATAGRAM 定义，而 TUIC 明确允许 UDP 数据包既可以使用可靠 QUIC stream，也可以"
"使用不可靠 QUIC datagram。QUIC DATAGRAM 帧本身不会由 QUIC 重传。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Fragmentation and Reassembly"
msgstr "分片与重组"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"If one UDP datagram is too large for the chosen transport unit, TUIC can "
"split it into several `Packet` commands. Every fragment of one original "
"datagram uses the same `PKT_ID`; `FRAG_TOTAL` and `FRAG_ID` identify the "
"reassembly set and position."
msgstr ""
"如果一个 UDP 数据报超过所选承载单元允许的大小，TUIC 可以把它拆成多个 "
"`Packet` 命令。同一原始数据报的所有分片使用相同 `PKT_ID`，而 `FRAG_TOTAL` 与 "
"`FRAG_ID` 用来标识重组集合和分片位置。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A receiver needs reassembly state conceptually keyed by at least:"
msgstr "接收端至少需要按以下维度维护重组状态："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "and should enforce bounds for:"
msgstr "并且应对以下资源设置上限："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "maximum fragment count,"
msgstr "最大分片数量，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "maximum aggregate packet size,"
msgstr "重组后的最大数据包大小，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "duplicate fragment handling,"
msgstr "重复分片处理，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "reassembly timeout,"
msgstr "重组超时，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "number of simultaneously incomplete packets."
msgstr "同时处于未完成状态的数据包数量。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Those limits are important because the base specification defines the wire "
"fields but does not define a universal resource-management policy."
msgstr ""
"这些限制很重要，因为基础规范只定义了线上的字段，并没有规定统一的资源管理策"
"略。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The close command for a UDP association is compact:"
msgstr "用于关闭 UDP association 的命令非常紧凑："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The client sends it on a QUIC unidirectional stream. The server removes that "
"association from its table and releases the corresponding UDP socket."
msgstr ""
"客户端通过 QUIC 单向流发送该命令；服务端随后从 association 表中删除对应记录，"
"并释放关联的 UDP socket。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"This is more explicit than Hysteria 2, whose protocol does not provide an "
"explicit UDP-session close message, and structurally different from SOCKS5, "
"where the UDP association lifetime is tied to the accompanying TCP control "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"这比 Hysteria 2 更显式：Hysteria 2 没有协议层的 UDP 会话关闭消息；同时它也不"
"同于 SOCKS5，后者的 UDP association 生命周期绑定在配套 TCP 控制连接上。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "0-RTT Considerations"
msgstr "0-RTT 注意事项"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC is designed to support very early relay-task setup and markets 0-RTT "
"TCP and UDP proxying as a core goal."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 设计上支持非常早地建立转发任务，并将 0-RTT TCP 与 UDP 代理作为核心目标之"
"一。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"0-RTT should be understood as a latency optimization, not a reason to ignore "
"replay and session-security considerations. Actual behavior depends on the "
"QUIC and TLS implementation, resumption state, server policy, and the "
"commands being processed."
msgstr ""
"0-RTT 应被理解为延迟优化，而不是忽略重放风险和会话安全问题的理由。实际行为取"
"决于 QUIC/TLS 实现、会话恢复状态、服务端策略以及正在处理的命令。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Heartbeats"
msgstr "心跳"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"When relay tasks are active, the protocol defines a heartbeat command "
"carried through QUIC datagrams to keep the connection alive."
msgstr ""
"当存在活动转发任务时，协议定义了通过 QUIC Datagram 承载的 heartbeat 命令，用"
"于维持连接。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Long-lived mobile or NATed deployments should still account for operating-"
"system power management, NAT timeouts, and network transitions; application "
"heartbeats cannot guarantee that an external network preserves state "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"长期运行的移动网络或 NAT 部署仍需考虑操作系统省电机制、NAT 超时和网络切换；应"
"用层心跳不能保证外部网络无限期保留状态。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The logical heartbeat is simply:"
msgstr "逻辑上的 Heartbeat 很简单："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"with no command-specific body. In the reference QUIC flow it is periodically "
"sent through a QUIC DATAGRAM while relay tasks are active."
msgstr ""
"它没有命令专用 body。在参考 QUIC 流程中，只要仍有中继任务存在，客户端就会周期"
"性通过 QUIC DATAGRAM 发送该命令。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Error and Close Semantics"
msgstr "错误与关闭语义"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC v5 deliberately does not define a response for every command. The "
"specification states that invalid commands, authentication failure, and "
"target connection errors have implementation-defined handling."
msgstr ""
"TUIC v5 有意没有为每种命令定义响应。规范明确指出，无效命令、认证失败和目标连"
"接错误的处理方式由实现自行决定。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "That has several consequences for client implementations:"
msgstr "这会给客户端实现带来几个直接后果："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Absence of a reply is normal for `Authenticate`, `Connect`, `Packet`, "
"`Dissociate`, and `Heartbeat`; a client must not wait for a SOCKS-style "
"success frame that will never arrive."
msgstr ""
"对 `Authenticate`、`Connect`、`Packet`、`Dissociate` 和 `Heartbeat` 来说，没"
"有响应是正常现象；客户端不能等待一个永远不会出现的 SOCKS 风格成功帧。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"A reset/close of one bidirectional stream can be used by an implementation "
"to signal failure of one TCP relay without necessarily closing the whole "
"QUIC connection."
msgstr ""
"实现可以通过 reset/关闭某一个双向流来表示单个 TCP 中继失败，而不必关闭整个 "
"QUIC 连接。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Authentication failure can cause connection close or silent rejection, "
"depending on the implementation."
msgstr "认证失败可能导致连接关闭，也可能被静默拒绝，具体取决于实现。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"UDP `Packet` commands do not have per-packet acknowledgements at the TUIC "
"layer. Reliable-stream mode relies on QUIC stream reliability; native mode "
"deliberately accepts datagram loss."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 层不会为 UDP `Packet` 提供逐包确认。可靠 stream 模式依赖 QUIC stream 的"
"可靠性；native 模式则有意接受数据报丢失。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"`Dissociate` is advisory protocol state transition rather than a request "
"that receives a standardized acknowledgement."
msgstr "`Dissociate` 表示协议状态迁移，而不是一个会收到标准化确认响应的请求。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"A robust implementation therefore needs to distinguish QUIC transport "
"errors, stream reset, application timeout, UDP loss, and explicit "
"association teardown rather than mapping every failure to one generic "
"\"proxy rejected\" error."
msgstr ""
"因此，一个健壮实现必须区分 QUIC 传输错误、stream reset、应用超时、UDP 丢包和"
"显式 association teardown，而不能把所有失败都粗暴映射为统一的“proxy "
"rejected”。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Without QUIC session keys, a normal packet capture sees approximately:"
msgstr "在没有 QUIC 会话密钥时，普通抓包大致只能看到："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The TUIC command bytes are encrypted inside QUIC application data. With QUIC "
"keys available to a dissector, the mapping becomes easier to reason about:"
msgstr ""
"TUIC 命令字节被加密在 QUIC 应用数据中。如果分析器能够获得 QUIC 密钥，就可以更"
"清楚地建立协议映射："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"A QUIC STREAM frame boundary is not a TUIC command boundary. Stream data can "
"be split across QUIC frames or delivered from multiple frames to one "
"application read. Parsers must accumulate exactly the fixed and variable "
"fields required by the command before treating subsequent bytes as payload."
msgstr ""
"QUIC STREAM 帧边界并不是 TUIC 命令边界。流数据可以被拆到多个 QUIC frame 中，"
"也可能由多个 frame 合并成一次应用层读取。解析器必须先完整累积命令所需的定长和"
"变长字段，才能把后续字节视为 payload。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"For `Connect`, parser read-ahead is especially important: bytes obtained in "
"the same read after the variable-length `ADDR` are already proxied "
"application data and must not be discarded as command padding."
msgstr ""
"对 `Connect` 来说，parser read-ahead 尤其重要：在同一次读取中、位于变长 "
"`ADDR` 之后的字节已经属于被代理的应用数据，不能被当作命令 padding 丢弃。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Client and Server Connection State"
msgstr "客户端与服务端连接状态"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A useful implementation-oriented connection state machine is:"
msgstr "一个面向实现的连接状态机可以表示为："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The server additionally needs per-stream and per-association state, because "
"one QUIC connection can contain many simultaneous TCP tasks and UDP "
"associations."
msgstr ""
