#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "What TUIC Reuses from the SOCKS5 Mental Model"
msgstr "TUIC 从 SOCKS5 思维模型中复用了什么"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The same basic proxy operations are still present:"
msgstr "最基本的代理操作仍然存在："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC also retains the familiar variable-length `address type + address + "
"port` idea. This makes its `Connect` target structurally closer to SOCKS5 "
"than Hysteria 2's textual `host:port` field."
msgstr ""
"TUIC 还保留了熟悉的变长 `address type + address + port` 思路，因此它的 "
"`Connect` 目标在结构上比 Hysteria 2 的文本 `host:port` 字段更接近 SOCKS5。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "What TUIC Replaces"
msgstr "TUIC 替换了什么"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC replaces several SOCKS5 control transactions:"
msgstr "TUIC 替换了 SOCKS5 中的若干控制事务："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"METHOD negotiation becomes connection-bound TLS-exporter authentication."
msgstr "METHOD 协商被替换为与连接绑定的 TLS-exporter 认证。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5 `CONNECT request -> REP success` becomes a one-way `Connect` header "
"followed immediately by payload."
msgstr ""
"SOCKS5 的 `CONNECT request -> REP success` 被替换为单向 `Connect` 头，后面可"
"以立即跟 payload。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"`UDP ASSOCIATE request -> relay endpoint reply` becomes an implicitly "
"created `ASSOC_ID` mapping."
msgstr ""
"`UDP ASSOCIATE request -> relay endpoint reply` 被替换为隐式创建的 "
"`ASSOC_ID` 映射。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"one TCP control connection no longer represents one proxy task; QUIC streams "
"multiplex many tasks inside one secure connection."
msgstr ""
"一条 TCP 控制连接不再代表一个代理任务；QUIC streams 会在一条安全连接中多路复"
"用多个任务。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "What TUIC Adds"
msgstr "TUIC 新增了什么"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC adds concepts with no direct SOCKS5 equivalent:"
msgstr "TUIC 新增了许多 SOCKS5 中没有直接对应物的概念："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TLS-exporter-bound authentication token,"
msgstr "与 TLS exporter 绑定的认证 token，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "QUIC stream multiplexing,"
msgstr "QUIC stream 多路复用，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "QUIC connection migration and shared connection-level congestion state,"
msgstr "QUIC 连接迁移以及共享的连接级拥塞状态，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "selectable reliable/unreliable UDP carriage,"
msgstr "可选择可靠或不可靠的 UDP 承载方式，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "explicit UDP association IDs,"
msgstr "显式 UDP association ID，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "packet IDs and protocol-level UDP fragmentation,"
msgstr "packet ID 与协议级 UDP 分片，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`Dissociate`,"
msgstr "`Dissociate`；"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "application heartbeat over QUIC DATAGRAM,"
msgstr "通过 QUIC DATAGRAM 承载的应用层 heartbeat，"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "possible overlap between authentication and relay-task creation."
msgstr "认证与中继任务创建可以重叠。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"These are the main reasons TUIC should be understood as a complete secure, "
"multiplexed proxy transport rather than simply \"SOCKS5 over QUIC\"."
msgstr ""
"正因为这些新增机制，TUIC 更应该被理解为一套完整的、安全的、多路复用代理传输协"
"议，而不是简单的“SOCKS5 over QUIC”。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Conceptual Configuration"
msgstr "概念性配置"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A Clash-family TUIC node commonly contains information similar to:"
msgstr "Clash 系 TUIC 节点通常包含类似下面的信息："

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "tuic-example"
msgstr "tuic-example"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "tuic"
msgstr "tuic"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vless.md src/transports/xhttp.md
#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "uuid"
msgstr "uuid"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md src/protocols/vless.md src/transports/xhttp.md
#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555"
msgstr "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Additional fields may select congestion control, UDP relay mode, ALPN, and "
"heartbeat/timeout behavior. Use the schema of the selected core rather than "
"copying options blindly between Mihomo, ClashRS, sing-box, or another "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"其他字段可能用于选择拥塞控制、UDP 转发模式、ALPN 以及 heartbeat/timeout 行"
"为。应以当前所选核心的 schema 为准，不要在 Mihomo、ClashRS、sing-box 或其他实"
"现之间盲目复制选项。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TCP and UDP relay in one multiplexed secure connection."
msgstr "在一条多路复用安全连接中同时转发 TCP 与 UDP。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Designed for low relay-task startup latency."
msgstr "面向低转发任务启动延迟设计。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Native QUIC advantages such as multiplexing and connection migration."
msgstr "具备 QUIC 原生优势，例如多路复用和连接迁移。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"UDP can use unreliable QUIC datagrams or reliable stream-based delivery."
msgstr "UDP 可以使用不可靠 QUIC Datagram，也可以使用可靠的 Stream 传输。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Connection-bound authentication using TLS exporter material."
msgstr "使用 TLS exporter material 实现与连接绑定的认证。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Explicit UDP association lifecycle and fragmentation support."
msgstr "提供明确的 UDP association 生命周期与分片支持。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Requires a network path that handles QUIC/UDP reliably for the common "
"deployment model."
msgstr "常见部署模式要求网络路径能够可靠承载 QUIC/UDP。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Different TUIC protocol versions are not guaranteed to interoperate."
msgstr "不同 TUIC 协议版本之间不保证能够互操作。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Configuration names and optional behavior differ between implementations."
msgstr "不同实现之间的配置名称和可选行为存在差异。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"QUIC fingerprinting, UDP throttling, and MTU issues can still affect real "
"deployments."
msgstr "QUIC 指纹识别、UDP 限速以及 MTU 问题仍可能影响实际部署。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Very aggressive congestion-control tuning can hurt fairness and stability."
msgstr "过于激进的拥塞控制调优可能损害公平性和稳定性。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Keep certificate verification enabled unless a controlled development setup "
"explicitly requires otherwise."
msgstr "除非受控开发环境明确需要，否则应保持证书验证开启。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Use unique UUID/password credentials per user or deployment where practical."
msgstr "条件允许时，应为不同用户或部署使用独立 UUID/密码凭据。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Treat 0-RTT as an optimization with security trade-offs, not as a universal "
"fast path."
msgstr "应把 0-RTT 视为带有安全权衡的优化，而不是通用快速路径。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"Protect server configuration files because the raw password participates in "
"authentication-token derivation."
msgstr "应妥善保护服务端配置文件，因为原始密码会参与认证 token 的派生。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Keep server and client on compatible protocol versions."
msgstr "确保客户端与服务端使用兼容的协议版本。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"TUIC is currently listed in this Wiki under **planned client support**, not "
"in the current client capability list. Do not present a TUIC profile as "
"supported by `chimera_client` until the relevant implementation is enabled "
"and validated in the client repository."
msgstr ""
"当前 Wiki 将 TUIC 列在 **计划中的客户端支持** 下，而不是当前客户端能力列表"
"中。在客户端仓库中的相关实现真正启用并通过验证之前，不应把 TUIC 配置描述为 "
"`chimera_client` 已支持。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The GUI can only expose TUIC if the selected proxy core supports it. A "
"profile accepted by Mihomo or another core does not automatically imply "
"support by `chimera_client`."
msgstr ""
"只有当前选中的代理核心支持 TUIC 时，GUI 才能暴露相应能力。Mihomo 或其他核心能"
"接受某个配置，并不自动意味着 `chimera_client` 也支持。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The server capability map includes TUIC-related inbound parsing/handling "
"work. That should be treated as implementation scope rather than a blanket "
"guarantee of TUIC v5 interoperability, UDP modes, 0-RTT behavior, or every "
"client option."
msgstr ""
"服务端能力地图包含 TUIC 相关入站解析/处理实现。这里应被视为实现范围，而不是"
"对 TUIC v5 互操作性、UDP 模式、0-RTT 行为或所有客户端选项的全面保证。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"The current Server tree contains in-repository TUIC E2E coverage in `handler/"
"tuic/e2e_tests.rs::udp_stream_and_datagram_roundtrips_record_stats`. It "
"exercises UDP stream relay, QUIC datagram relay, and traffic-stat accounting "
"through the implemented handler."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 代码库包含 TUIC E2E 测试 `handler/tuic/"
"e2e_tests.rs::udp_stream_and_datagram_roundtrips_record_stats`，覆盖 UDP 流中"
"继、QUIC 数据报中继，以及通过已实现处理器统计流量。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
msgid ""
"This is strong evidence for the covered Chimera data path, but it is **not** "
"external TUIC interoperability evidence with an independent client. Keep "
"that distinction visible until such a test is added. See [Test Evidence and "
"Interoperability Matrix](../test-evidence.md)."
msgstr ""
"对于已覆盖路径，这是很有力的 Chimera 数据路径证据，但**不是与独立客户端进行的"
"外部 TUIC 互操作证据**。在此类测试补齐前，应明确保留这一区别。详见[测试证据与"
"互操作矩阵](../test-evidence.md)。"

#: src/protocols/tuic.md
