"TLS Exported Authenticators / exporter background, RFC 5705: <https://"
"www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5705>"
msgstr "TLS exporter 背景，RFC 5705：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5705>"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"VMess is an encrypted proxy protocol from the V2Ray/Xray ecosystem. It "
"carries client identity, a proxy command, a destination, and encrypted TCP- "
"or UDP-style payloads. In current Xray-core, new VMess sessions use the "
"**VMess AEAD** request header design; older pre-AEAD authentication formats "
"should be treated as legacy protocol history rather than the wire format to "
"implement for a current Xray-compatible peer."
msgstr ""
"VMess 是 V2Ray/Xray 生态中的加密代理协议。它承载客户端身份、代理命令、目标地"
"址以及加密的 TCP/UDP 风格 payload。当前 Xray-core 的新 VMess 会话使用 "
"**VMess AEAD** 请求头设计；更早的 pre-AEAD 认证格式应视为历史兼容协议，而不是"
"当前 Xray 兼容端应实现的线格式。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"VMess is a proxy-protocol layer. Xray can place its ordered byte stream "
"inside other transport methods such as RAW/TCP, WebSocket, or HTTP-oriented "
"transports, and can additionally wrap those transports in TLS where "
"supported. Those outer layers do not replace the VMess authentication, "
"command, destination, or body record format described here."
msgstr ""
"VMess 位于代理协议层。Xray 可以把它的有序字节流放入 RAW/TCP、WebSocket 或 "
"HTTP 导向的其他传输方式中，并可在支持时继续用 TLS 包装这些传输。那些外层并不"
"会替代本文所述的 VMess 认证、命令、目标地址或正文记录格式。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "A useful layer model is:"
msgstr "可以用下面的分层模型理解："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Current Versus Legacy VMess"
msgstr "当前 VMess 与旧版 VMess"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The official Project X protocol page still documents historical VMess "
"fields, including the original timestamp-derived authentication hash and "
"older body security choices. Current Xray-core has moved further:"
msgstr ""
"Project X 官方协议页仍记录了一些历史 VMess 字段，包括最初基于时间戳派生的认证"
"哈希与旧正文安全选项。当前 Xray-core 已进一步演进："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "the inbound decoder first tries the 16-byte **AEAD AuthID** path;"
msgstr "入站解码器首先尝试 16 字节的 **AEAD AuthID** 路径；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"current VMess account security types are AES-128-GCM and ChaCha20-Poly1305, "
"with `auto` resolving to one of those on the client;"
msgstr ""
"当前 VMess 账户正文安全类型为 AES-128-GCM 与 ChaCha20-Poly1305，客户端的 "
"`auto` 会解析为其中一种；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "the old `alterId` model is not part of current VMess AEAD sharing;"
msgstr "旧 `alterId` 模型不属于当前 VMess AEAD 分享格式；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"current Xray configuration no longer offers VMess `none/zero/plain` body "
"security."
msgstr "当前 Xray 配置已不再提供 VMess `none/zero/plain` 正文安全模式。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The logical command header remains recognizably derived from VMess version "
"1, so the legacy specification is still useful for field meanings. The "
"important implementation rule is to distinguish that **logical plaintext "
"command layout** from the current **AEAD envelope** that protects it on the "
"wire."
msgstr ""
"逻辑命令头仍明显继承自 VMess version 1，因此旧规范对于理解字段含义仍有价值。"
"实现时最重要的是把这个**逻辑明文命令布局**与当前在线路上保护它的 **AEAD 外层"
"封装**区分开。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "End-to-End Connection Flow"
msgstr "端到端连接流程"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "A current VMess connection can be read as this state sequence:"
msgstr "当前 VMess 连接可以按以下状态顺序理解："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"There is no SOCKS5-style method-selection round trip. The first VMess "
"protocol bytes already contain an authenticated user/time token and the "
"encrypted proxy request. There is also no SOCKS5-style `REP` byte: "
"destination or dispatch failure is normally observed as a failed/closed "
"VMess exchange rather than a portable numeric VMess result code."
msgstr ""
"VMess 没有 SOCKS5 风格的方法选择往返。首批 VMess 协议字节已经包含经过认证的用"
"户/时间 token 与加密代理请求。它也没有 SOCKS5 风格的 `REP` 字节：目标或 "
"dispatch 失败通常表现为 VMess 交换失败/关闭，而不是一个可移植的数字结果码。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "User Identity and Command Key"
msgstr "用户身份与命令密钥"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The configured VMess user ID resolves to a 16-byte UUID value. Current Xray "
"also allows short custom strings in configuration by deterministically "
"mapping them to UUID form; the wire authentication still operates on the "
"resulting account identity and its derived command key."
msgstr ""
"配置的 VMess 用户 ID 最终解析为 16 字节 UUID。当前 Xray 也允许在配置中使用较"
"短的自定义字符串，并确定性地映射到 UUID 形式；线级认证仍基于最终得到的账户身"
"份及其派生 command key。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The UUID itself is **not sent as 16 plaintext bytes at the front of a "
"current VMess AEAD request**. Xray derives a 16-byte command key from the "
"account ID. That key is used to construct and validate the AEAD AuthID and "
"to derive the request-header AEAD keys."
msgstr ""
"UUID 本身**不会以 16 字节明文放在当前 VMess AEAD 请求最前面发送**。Xray 会从"
"账户 ID 派生 16 字节 command key，用于构造/校验 AEAD AuthID，并派生请求头 "
"AEAD 密钥。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"This differs from VLESS, whose baseline header places its 16-byte user "
"identity inside the VLESS request. It also differs from SOCKS5 RFC 1929, "
"where username and password are sent in an explicit authentication sub-"
"negotiation."
msgstr ""
"这与 VLESS 不同：VLESS 基础头会把 16 字节用户身份直接置于请求中；也与 SOCKS5 "
"RFC 1929 不同，后者会在显式认证子协商中发送用户名和密码。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "AEAD AuthID: Exact 16-Byte Plaintext Before Encryption"
msgstr "AEAD AuthID：加密前精确的 16 字节明文"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Current Xray creates a 16-byte AuthID plaintext:"
msgstr "当前 Xray 会构造如下 16 字节 AuthID 明文："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Those 16 bytes are encrypted as one AES block using a key derived from the "
"user's command key. The resulting 16-byte ciphertext is the first VMess AEAD "
"field visible on the protocol stream."
msgstr ""
"这 16 字节会使用由用户 command key 派生的密钥，作为一个 AES block 整体加密。"
"得到的 16 字节密文就是协议字节流上可见的第一个 VMess AEAD 字段。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Server validation performs several distinct checks:"
msgstr "服务端验证包含多个彼此独立的检查："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "try the configured users' AuthID decoders;"
msgstr "尝试已配置用户的 AuthID decoder；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "decrypt the candidate AuthID;"
msgstr "解密候选 AuthID；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "verify the CRC32 over the first 12 plaintext bytes;"
msgstr "校验前 12 字节明文的 CRC32；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "reject negative/invalid timestamps;"
msgstr "拒绝负数或无效时间戳；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"require the timestamp to be within 120 seconds of the server's current Unix "
"time;"
msgstr "要求时间戳与服务端当前 Unix 时间相差不超过 120 秒；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "reject an AuthID already present in the anti-replay filter."
msgstr "拒绝已经存在于 anti-replay filter 中的 AuthID。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"This is why VMess documentation warns that client and server UTC clocks must "
"be synchronized. Time zone is irrelevant; Unix time freshness is what "
"matters."
msgstr ""
"这就是 VMess 文档强调客户端与服务端 UTC 时钟必须同步的原因。时区本身无关紧"
"要，真正重要的是 Unix 时间的新鲜度。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The AuthID anti-replay filter and the later request-body session-history "
"check protect different values. Passing AuthID validation is necessary but "
"is not the last replay-related check performed by the current server."
msgstr ""
"AuthID anti-replay filter 与后续 request-body session-history 检查保护的是不"
"同值。通过 AuthID 验证只是必要条件，并不是当前服务端最后一次重放相关检查。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "VMess AEAD Request Header Envelope"
msgstr "VMess AEAD 请求头封装"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"After creating AuthID, current Xray generates an independent random 8-byte "
"`connectionNonce` and AEAD-protects both the logical request-header length "
"and the logical request header."
msgstr ""
"创建 AuthID 后，当前 Xray 会独立生成随机 8 字节 `connectionNonce`，并分别用 "
"AEAD 保护逻辑请求头长度和逻辑请求头本身。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "On the wire:"
msgstr "在线路上："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The length plaintext is a big-endian `uint16`; AES-GCM adds its 16-byte tag, "
"so that field occupies 18 bytes. The request-header ciphertext similarly "
"adds 16 bytes to the logical header length."
msgstr ""
"长度明文是大端 `uint16`；AES-GCM 增加 16 字节 tag，因此该字段在线路上占 18 字"
"节。请求头密文同样比逻辑头长度多 16 字节。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Both AEAD operations use keys/nonces derived from:"
msgstr "两个 AEAD 操作都使用由以下材料派生的密钥/nonce："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "the VMess user's command key,"
msgstr "VMess 用户的 command key；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "the 16-byte AuthID,"
msgstr "16 字节 AuthID；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "the 8-byte connection nonce,"
msgstr "8 字节 connection nonce；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "and fixed VMess KDF labels."
msgstr "以及固定 VMess KDF label。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The AuthID is also supplied as AEAD associated data. Consequently, changing "
"the AuthID, encrypted length, connection nonce, or protected header without "
"the correct user key causes authentication failure before the destination is "
"parsed."
msgstr ""
"AuthID 还会作为 AEAD associated data。因而在没有正确用户密钥的情况下篡改 "
"AuthID、加密长度、connection nonce 或受保护请求头，都会在目标地址被解析之前导"
"致认证失败。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Incremental parsing boundary"
msgstr "增量解析边界"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The request is carried over an ordered stream. A parser must therefore read:"
msgstr "请求承载在有序字节流上，因此解析器必须依次读取："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "exactly 16 bytes of AuthID;"
msgstr "精确 16 字节 AuthID；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "exactly 18 bytes of encrypted length;"
msgstr "精确 18 字节加密长度；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "exactly 8 bytes of connection nonce;"
msgstr "精确 8 字节 connection nonce；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "decrypt the length;"
msgstr "解密长度；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "then read exactly `L + 16` bytes of encrypted request header."
msgstr "再精确读取 `L + 16` 字节加密请求头。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"A single TCP/QUIC/WebSocket read is not a VMess message boundary. "
"Conversely, one transport read can contain the whole header plus the start "
"of the encrypted body; read-ahead bytes must be preserved for the body "
"decoder."
msgstr ""
"一次 TCP/QUIC/WebSocket read 并不等于一个 VMess 消息边界。反过来，一次传输层"
"读取也可能同时包含完整请求头以及加密正文开头；超前读取的字节必须保留给正文解"
"码器。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Logical Request Header Layout"
msgstr "逻辑请求头布局"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"After the AEAD envelope is opened, the current Xray logical header begins:"
msgstr "打开 AEAD 外层后，当前 Xray 的逻辑请求头按如下字段开始："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The first 38 bytes end with the command byte. Destination length is "
"variable, then `P` can add 0--15 random bytes, followed by the four-byte "
"FNV-1a checksum. The server validates that checksum **after** successfully "
"opening the outer AEAD header. AEAD integrity and the inner FNV checksum are "
"therefore separate validation layers."
msgstr ""
"前 38 字节以 command 字节结束。之后目标地址长度可变，`P` 可再加入 0--15 个随"
"机字节，最后是 4 字节 FNV-1a checksum。服务端会在成功打开外层 AEAD 请求头**之"
"后**再验证该 checksum。因此 AEAD 完整性与内层 FNV checksum 是两层独立校验。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray rejects an unresolved/unknown body security value after parsing "
"the logical header. `auto` is a client configuration choice; the client "
"resolves it to an actual on-wire security type before sending the request."
msgstr ""
"解析逻辑请求头后，当前 Xray 会拒绝无法解析或未知的正文安全值。`auto` 是客户端"
"配置选项；发送请求前客户端会把它解析为实际线级 security type。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Option bits"
msgstr "Option 位"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "The current common protocol definitions use these relevant bits:"
msgstr "当前公共协议定义使用以下相关 bit："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Bit"
msgstr "Bit"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "chunk stream"
msgstr "chunk stream"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"payload uses VMess chunk records; historical name is now marked deprecated "
"in code, but current VMess outbound still sets the bit"
msgstr ""
"payload 使用 VMess chunk record；这个历史名称目前在代码中已标记 deprecated，"
"但当前 VMess outbound 仍会设置该 bit"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "chunk masking"
msgstr "chunk masking"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "two-byte chunk lengths are XOR-masked with a SHAKE128-derived stream"
msgstr "两字节 chunk 长度使用 SHAKE128 派生流做 XOR masking"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "global padding"
msgstr "global padding"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"each chunk may have pseudo-random padding in addition to encrypted payload"
msgstr "每个 chunk 除加密 payload 外还可以带伪随机 padding"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "`0x10`"
msgstr "`0x10`"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "authenticated length"
msgstr "authenticated length"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "experimental AEAD protection for chunk-length fields"
msgstr "对 chunk 长度字段进行 AEAD 保护的实验机制"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"For current AES-GCM/ChaCha20-Poly1305 VMess, Xray enables chunk masking and "
"global padding by default. `AuthenticatedLength` remains an experiment that "
"must be compatible on both peers."
msgstr ""
"对当前 AES-GCM/ChaCha20-Poly1305 VMess，Xray 默认启用 chunk masking 与 "
"global padding。`AuthenticatedLength` 仍属于实验特性，通信双方必须具备兼容实"
"现。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"VMess encodes the destination in a different order from SOCKS5. Current "
"Xray's VMess address parser is configured with **port first**:"
msgstr ""
"VMess 编码目标地址的字段顺序与 SOCKS5 不同。当前 Xray 的 VMess 地址解析器配置"
"为**端口在前**："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Address payloads are:"
msgstr "各地址类型的 payload 为："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Address layout"
msgstr "地址布局"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "4 IPv4 bytes"
msgstr "4 字节 IPv4 地址"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "`uint8 length` + that many domain bytes"
msgstr "`uint8 length` + 对应数量的域名字节"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "16 IPv6 bytes"
msgstr "16 字节 IPv6 地址"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"For comparison, SOCKS5 uses `ATYP | DST.ADDR | DST.PORT`; VMess uses "
"`DST.PORT | ATYP | DST.ADDR`. A parser shared between the protocols must not "
"reuse the SOCKS5 field order accidentally."
msgstr ""
"作为对比，SOCKS5 使用 `ATYP | DST.ADDR | DST.PORT`，VMess 则使用 `DST.PORT | "
"ATYP | DST.ADDR`。若多个协议共用解析器，绝不能误用 SOCKS5 的字段顺序来解析 "
"VMess。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "The base VMess TCP/UDP commands are:"
msgstr "基础 VMess TCP/UDP 命令如下："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current common Xray definitions also have other internal request-command "
"values, but VMess interoperability documentation should not invent wire "
"semantics for a command unless both peers implement it."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 公共定义中还有其他内部 request-command 值，但 VMess 互操作文档不应"
"在双方都没有实现某命令时自行虚构其线级语义。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Request Body Record Format"
msgstr "请求正文记录格式"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"After the protected command header, VMess switches to independently "
"authenticated body chunks. In the ordinary current AEAD body modes the "
"logical record is:"
msgstr ""
"受保护命令头结束后，VMess 会切换到独立认证的正文 chunk。当前普通 AEAD 正文模"
"式中的逻辑记录如下："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The size value describes the encrypted payload plus any global padding. With "
"normal chunk masking, the two-byte big-endian value is XORed with successive "
"16-bit values from SHAKE128 seeded by the request-body IV. The same SHAKE "
"stream also produces the global-padding length modulo 64."
msgstr ""
"size 值描述加密 payload 加上 global padding 的总大小。普通 chunk masking 模式"
"下，两字节大端长度会与由 request-body IV 初始化的 SHAKE128 流连续产生的 16 位"
"值做 XOR。同一个 SHAKE 流还会通过模 64 产生 global-padding 长度。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Global padding is outside the AEAD ciphertext. It changes chunk size/shape "
"but does not become application bytes after decoding."
msgstr ""
"Global padding 位于 AEAD 密文之外。它会改变 chunk 的大小和形态，但解码后不会"
"成为应用数据。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"With the `AuthenticatedLength` experiment, the logical two-byte size is "
"itself AEAD-protected and therefore occupies 18 bytes. This adds integrity "
"to the record length rather than relying only on masking."
msgstr ""
"启用 `AuthenticatedLength` 实验后，逻辑上的两字节 size 自身也会受到 AEAD 保"
"护，因此在线路上占 18 字节。这样长度字段具备完整性保护，而不只是依赖 "
"masking。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "AES-128-GCM body mode"
msgstr "AES-128-GCM 正文模式"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The request's random 16-byte body key is used as the AES-128-GCM key. Each "
"record uses a direction-local increasing counter in its nonce construction "
"and adds a 16-byte authentication tag."
msgstr ""
"请求中的随机 16 字节 body key 直接作为 AES-128-GCM 密钥。每条记录构造 nonce "
"时使用本方向独立递增的计数器，并增加 16 字节认证 tag。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "ChaCha20-Poly1305 body mode"
msgstr "ChaCha20-Poly1305 正文模式"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Xray expands the 16-byte request body key into the 32-byte ChaCha20-Poly1305 "
"key using the VMess-defined MD5-based expansion. Record nonces follow the "
"same counter-plus-IV model and each record carries a 16-byte Poly1305 tag."
msgstr ""
"Xray 使用 VMess 定义的基于 MD5 的扩展方式，把 16 字节 request body key 扩展"
"为 32 字节 ChaCha20-Poly1305 密钥。记录 nonce 采用相同的计数器加 IV 模型，每"
"条记录携带 16 字节 Poly1305 tag。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray outbound configuration exposes `aes-128-gcm`, `chacha20-"
"poly1305`, and `auto`. As of the current implementation, `none` is not a "
"valid current VMess body security mode."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray outbound 配置提供 `aes-128-gcm`、`chacha20-poly1305` 和 `auto`。在"
"当前实现中，`none` 已不是有效的 VMess 正文安全模式。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "TCP Data Path"
msgstr "TCP 数据路径"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"For `command=0x01`, the destination in the request header is a TCP "
"destination. After user/header validation the server dispatches that target, "
"decodes VMess body records, and writes the recovered bytes to the "
"destination TCP stream. Bytes received from the target take the reverse path "
"through the VMess response header and response-body record encoder."
msgstr ""
"当 `command=0x01` 时，请求头中的目标是 TCP 目标。完成用户/请求头验证后，服务"
"端 dispatch 该目标，解码 VMess 正文记录，并把恢复出的字节写入目标 TCP 流。从"
"目标收到的字节则通过 VMess 响应头和响应正文记录编码器沿反方向返回。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"VMess body chunks are framing units, not application message boundaries. A "
"TCP application record can span multiple VMess chunks, and one VMess chunk "
"can contain bytes from multiple application writes. Implementations must "
"preserve byte order, not write-call boundaries."
msgstr ""
"VMess body chunk 是分帧单元，不是应用消息边界。一个 TCP 应用记录可以跨多个 "
"VMess chunk，一个 VMess chunk 也可以包含多次应用 write 的字节。实现必须保持字"
"节顺序，而不是保持 write 调用边界。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Flow control comes primarily from the selected outer reliable transport and "
"the server's destination socket. VMess chunk framing does not define a SOCKS-"
"like window-update command or independent stream credit."
msgstr ""
"流控主要来自所选外层可靠传输以及服务端目标 socket。VMess chunk framing 本身没"
"有定义类似 SOCKS 的 window-update 命令，也没有独立 Stream credit。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "UDP Data Path"
msgstr "UDP 数据路径"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"For base `command=0x02`, the request header names a UDP destination and body "
"handling switches to packet transfer semantics. Current Xray's "
"authentication writer preserves each packet buffer as one authenticated "
"VMess body record rather than concatenating packets into a TCP-style byte "
"stream."
msgstr ""
"在基础 `command=0x02` 模式下，请求头指定一个 UDP 目标，正文处理切换为 packet "
"传输语义。当前 Xray 的 authentication writer 会把每个 packet buffer 保持为一"
"条独立认证的 VMess 正文记录，而不是像 TCP 字节流那样把多个数据包拼接起来。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Base VMess UDP therefore differs from SOCKS5 UDP in two major ways:"
msgstr "因此，基础 VMess UDP 与 SOCKS5 UDP 有两个主要区别："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"the destination is established in the encrypted VMess request header rather "
"than repeated in every UDP relay datagram;"
msgstr ""
"目标地址在加密 VMess 请求头中一次确定，而不是在每个 UDP 中继数据报中重复携"
"带；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"the VMess client/server transport remains the selected reliable VMess "
"stream, rather than switching to the separate native UDP relay socket "
"defined by SOCKS5 `UDP ASSOCIATE`."
msgstr ""
"VMess 客户端/服务端之间仍使用所选的可靠 VMess 字节流，而不会切换到 SOCKS5 "
"`UDP ASSOCIATE` 所定义的独立原生 UDP relay socket。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Base VMess has no SOCKS5 `FRAG` byte and no Hysteria/TUIC-style packet ID "
"plus fragment count. If a deployment needs broader UDP association "
"semantics, current Xray can add XUDP over its Mux path. That is an extra "
"layer and should not be mistaken for the base `command=0x02` wire format."
msgstr ""
"基础 VMess 没有 SOCKS5 `FRAG` 字节，也没有 Hysteria/TUIC 风格的 packet ID + "
"fragment count。如果部署需要更广泛的 UDP association 语义，当前 Xray 可以在 "
"Mux 路径上增加 XUDP。这属于额外层，不能与基础 `command=0x02` 线格式混为一谈。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray outbound can, under its cone/XUDP policy, rewrite some UDP "
"flows to `command=0x03` with the Mux destination `v1.mux.cool` and then use "
"an XUDP packet writer. A capture/dissector must therefore determine whether "
"it is seeing base VMess UDP or VMess carrying Mux/XUDP before interpreting "
"packet boundaries."
msgstr ""
"在 cone/XUDP 策略下，当前 Xray outbound 可以把某些 UDP 流重写为 "
"`command=0x03`，目标设为 Mux 地址 `v1.mux.cool`，再使用 XUDP packet writer。"
"因此抓包/协议解析器在解释数据包边界前，必须先判断看到的是基础 VMess UDP，还是"
"承载 Mux/XUDP 的 VMess。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Response Header"
msgstr "响应头"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray derives response body key and IV values by SHA-256 hashing the "
"request body key and IV and taking the first 16 bytes. The response control "
"header is then AEAD-protected separately from the body."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 分别对 request body key 和 IV 做 SHA-256，并取前 16 字节作为 "
"response body key 与 IV。响应控制头随后使用独立于正文的 AEAD 保护。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Wire layout:"
msgstr "线格式布局："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "The decrypted response header is logically:"
msgstr "解密后的响应头逻辑布局如下："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The client checks `response_v`; a mismatch means the response is not valid "
"for that VMess session. There is no general success/failure status byte "
"comparable to SOCKS5 `REP`. A valid response header authenticates the "
"responding VMess peer at the protocol level, while target failures are "
"handled by stream/error behavior rather than a portable VMess result-code "
"table."
msgstr ""
"客户端会检查 `response_v`；不匹配表示该响应不属于有效的当前 VMess 会话。"
"VMess 没有可与 SOCKS5 `REP` 类比的通用成功/失败状态字节。有效响应头在协议层认"
"证响应 VMess 对端，而目标失败通过字节流/错误行为处理，不使用可移植的 VMess 结"
"果码表。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"After this header, response body chunks use the same selected body-security "
"algorithm, but with response-direction keys, IV, length-mask stream, nonces, "
"and padding state."
msgstr ""
"该响应头之后，响应正文 chunk 使用同一种已选择的正文安全算法，但改用响应方向自"
"己的密钥、IV、长度 mask 流、nonce 与 padding 状态。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Termination, Half-Close, and Error Scope"
msgstr "终止、半关闭与错误作用域"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Historically, chunked VMess sends a termination record when a direction has "
"no more payload. With AEAD body security, an empty plaintext packet is "
"represented by a record whose encrypted portion consists only of the AEAD "
"authentication overhead (plus any generated padding). The decoder recognizes "
"that shape as end-of-stream."
msgstr ""
"历史上，chunked VMess 在某个方向没有更多 payload 时会发送 termination "
"record。使用 AEAD 正文安全后，空明文 packet 会表示为一条加密部分仅包含 AEAD "
"认证开销（再加上可能生成的 padding）的记录；解码器会把这种形态识别为字节流结"
"束。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray also has a `NoTerminationSignal` experiment/behavior; the "
"outbound checks that setting before emitting the explicit empty body record. "
"Therefore a robust peer must also handle clean outer EOF according to the "
"negotiated/current implementation behavior."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 还存在 `NoTerminationSignal` 实验/行为；outbound 在发送显式空正文记"
"录前会检查该设置。因此健壮的对端还必须根据当前实现/双方行为正确处理干净的外"
"层 EOF。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Keep these error scopes separate:"
msgstr "应把以下错误作用域分开："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"**outer transport error**: TCP/WebSocket/TLS/etc. fails before VMess parsing;"
msgstr "**外层传输错误**：TCP/WebSocket/TLS 等在 VMess 解析之前失败；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"**AuthID error**: unknown user, timestamp outside the ±120-second window, "
"CRC mismatch, or AuthID replay;"
msgstr ""
"**AuthID 错误**：未知用户、时间戳超出 ±120 秒窗口、CRC 不匹配或 AuthID 重放；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "**request-header AEAD error**: encrypted length or payload tag fails;"
msgstr "**请求头 AEAD 错误**：加密长度或 payload tag 校验失败；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"**session replay error**: the tuple of VMess user + request body key + "
"request body IV is reused within the server's session-history window;"
msgstr ""
"**会话重放错误**：VMess 用户 + request body key + request body IV 这一元组在"
"服务端 session-history 窗口内被重复使用；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"**logical-header error**: checksum, address, command, or security is invalid;"
msgstr "**逻辑请求头错误**：checksum、地址、命令或 security 无效；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"**body-record error**: masked/authenticated size is malformed or an AEAD tag "
"fails;"
msgstr "**正文记录错误**：masked/authenticated size 畸形或 AEAD tag 校验失败；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"**destination/dispatch error**: VMess parsed correctly but the requested "
"target cannot be opened or routed;"
msgstr ""
"**目标/dispatch 错误**：VMess 已正确解析，但请求目标无法建立连接或路由；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "**response error**: response AEAD or `response_v` validation fails."
msgstr "**响应错误**：响应 AEAD 或 `response_v` 验证失败。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray keeps body-session replay history for several minutes and "
"separately keeps AuthID anti-replay state around the authentication "
"timestamp window. Do not merge those caches into one conceptual \"VMess "
"replay token\" when implementing diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 会保存数分钟的正文会话重放历史，并围绕认证时间戳窗口单独维护 "
"AuthID anti-replay 状态。实现诊断工具时，不要把这两个缓存合并成一个抽象"
"的“VMess replay token”。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"A VMess protocol error normally terminates the affected outer connection. If "
"Mux.Cool is layered above VMess, inner logical stream failures can have a "
"narrower scope than failure of the parent VMess/transport connection."
msgstr ""
"VMess 协议错误通常会终止受影响的外层连接。如果 VMess 之上又叠加 Mux.Cool，那"
"么内层逻辑 Stream 的故障作用域可以小于父 VMess/传输连接故障。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "State Machines"
msgstr "状态机"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Client"
msgstr "客户端"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The two data directions can run concurrently once the request has been sent. "
"The client does not wait for a SOCKS-style explicit success byte before it "
"can start sending proxied body data."
msgstr ""
"请求发出后，两个数据方向可以并发运行。客户端不需要等待 SOCKS 风格的显式成功字"
"节，就可以开始发送被代理正文数据。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Server"
msgstr "服务端"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray intentionally drains a behavior-derived amount of data on some "
"invalid-request paths before closing. That is an implementation-level "
"traffic analysis defense; clients must not interpret delayed close as "
"protocol success."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 在某些无效请求路径上会有意先 drain 一段由行为参数派生的数据量，再关"
"闭连接。这属于实现层面的流量分析防护；客户端绝不能把延迟关闭理解为协议成功。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Multiplexing and Flow Control"
msgstr "多路复用与流控"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Base VMess does not multiplex arbitrary independent TCP proxy requests "
"inside one VMess request. Normally each independent VMess TCP command is "
"associated with its own outer proxy stream/connection."
msgstr ""
"基础 VMess 不会在一个 VMess 请求内部复用任意多个独立 TCP 代理请求。通常每个独"
"立 VMess TCP 命令对应自己的一条外层代理 Stream/连接。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Xray's `command=0x03` hands the body to **Mux.Cool**, which is a separate "
"multiplexing protocol. XUDP can also ride that path. When diagnosing a "
"trace, keep the layers distinct:"
msgstr ""
"Xray 的 `command=0x03` 会把正文交给独立多路复用协议 **Mux.Cool**；XUDP 也可以"
"走这一路径。诊断抓包时必须区分这些层次："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"VMess itself has record sizes, masking, padding, and AEAD counters but no "
"independent per-logical-stream flow-control window. Mux flow control, HTTP/2 "
"or QUIC stream flow control in an outer transport, and TCP congestion "
"control are separate mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"VMess 自身具有记录大小、masking、padding 与 AEAD 计数器，但没有每逻辑 Stream "
"独立的 flow-control window。Mux 流控、外层传输中的 HTTP/2/QUIC Stream 流控以"
"及 TCP 拥塞控制都是彼此独立的机制。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "VMess directly on a clear outer byte stream"
msgstr "VMess 直接承载在可见外层字节流上"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"A current VMess AEAD request does **not** begin with a plaintext UUID, "
"command, or destination. A dissector sees approximately:"
msgstr ""
"当前 VMess AEAD 请求**不会**以明文 UUID、命令或目标地址开头。协议 dissector "
"大致会看到："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The first 16 bytes are deliberately not a stable user identifier. Because "
"the AuthID contains the current timestamp plus random data before block "
"encryption, two connections from the same user do not begin with the same 16-"
"byte prefix."
msgstr ""
"最前面的 16 字节有意设计成不是稳定用户标识。AuthID 在 block encryption 前包含"
"当前时间戳和随机数据，因此同一用户的两条连接不会拥有相同的 16 字节前缀。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The destination, TCP/UDP command, body IV/key, and selected body cipher are "
"all inside the encrypted request-header payload."
msgstr ""
"目标地址、TCP/UDP 命令、body IV/key 以及选定正文密码都位于加密 request-"
"header payload 内部。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "VMess inside TLS/WebSocket/HTTP transports"
msgstr "TLS/WebSocket/HTTP 传输内部的 VMess"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"With an outer encrypted transport, the passive capture first exposes that "
"layer:"
msgstr "存在加密外层传输时，被动抓包首先暴露的是该外层："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Without outer decryption keys or endpoint instrumentation, VMess fields "
"cannot be located simply by packet offsets. With decryption, remember that "
"WebSocket, HTTP, or QUIC frame boundaries still do not define VMess record "
"boundaries."
msgstr ""
"如果没有外层解密密钥或端点插桩，仅靠 packet offset 无法定位 VMess 字段。即使"
"完成解密，也必须记住 WebSocket、HTTP 或 QUIC frame 边界仍然不等于 VMess "
"record 边界。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Useful endpoint-side anchors"
msgstr "有用的端点侧分析锚点"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "For an instrumented implementation, useful checkpoints are:"
msgstr "对于可插桩的实现，有价值的检查点包括："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "first 16 bytes accepted as AuthID and mapped to a user;"
msgstr "最前面 16 字节被接受为 AuthID 并映射到用户；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "decrypted big-endian logical header length from the next 18 bytes;"
msgstr "从后续 18 字节解出的逻辑请求头大端长度；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "logical header version `0x01`;"
msgstr "逻辑请求头版本 `0x01`；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "command and `PORT | ATYP | ADDR` after opening the header;"
msgstr "打开请求头后得到 command 与 `PORT | ATYP | ADDR`；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "option/security byte and body IV/key;"
msgstr "option/security 字节与 body IV/key；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "two-byte masked lengths or 18-byte authenticated lengths in the body;"
msgstr "正文中的两字节 masked length 或 18 字节 authenticated length；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "16-byte AEAD tags per encrypted body record;"
msgstr "每条加密正文记录的 16 字节 AEAD tag；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"18-byte AEAD response-header length followed by the protected response "
"header."
msgstr "18 字节 AEAD 响应头长度，随后是受保护的响应头。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "SOCKS5 RFC 1928/1929"
msgstr "SOCKS5 RFC 1928/1929"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Current VMess AEAD"
msgstr "当前 VMess AEAD"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Outer connection"
msgstr "外层连接"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Selected ordered Xray transport; commonly backed by TCP, possibly with "
"additional framing/security"
msgstr "所选有序 Xray 传输；通常以 TCP 为底层，也可能叠加额外 framing/security"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"none; client/server configuration already selects VMess and body security"
msgstr "没有；客户端/服务端配置已经预先选择 VMess 与正文安全模式"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "optional method, e.g. RFC 1929 username/password"
msgstr "可选认证方法，例如 RFC 1929 用户名/密码"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"16-byte encrypted AuthID derived from user command key, timestamp and "
"randomness"
msgstr "由用户 command key、时间戳与随机量派生的 16 字节加密 AuthID"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Replay protection"
msgstr "重放保护"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "not defined by RFC 1928/1929"
msgstr "RFC 1928/1929 未定义"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"timestamp window + AuthID replay filter + request body key/IV session history"
msgstr ""
"时间戳窗口 + AuthID replay filter + request body key/IV session history"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Authentication round trip"
msgstr "认证往返"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "explicit method/auth response"
msgstr "显式 method/auth 响应"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "no separate auth reply; request header follows AuthID immediately"
msgstr "没有独立认证回复；AuthID 后立即跟随请求头"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "`CMD` after negotiation"
msgstr "协商完成后的 `CMD`"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "encrypted logical command byte (`0x01` TCP, `0x02` UDP, `0x03` Mux)"
msgstr "加密的逻辑命令字节（`0x01` TCP、`0x02` UDP、`0x03` Mux）"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Destination order"
msgstr "目标地址顺序"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "\\`ATYP"
msgstr "\\`ATYP"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "ADDR"
msgstr "ADDR"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Domain encoding"
msgstr "域名编码"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "one-byte length + domain"
msgstr "1 字节长度 + 域名"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "`REP=0x00` plus bound address"
msgstr "`REP=0x00` 加绑定地址"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"no SOCKS-equivalent status; authenticated response header carries "
"`response_v`, options, optional command"
msgstr ""
"没有 SOCKS 等价状态码；已认证响应头携带 `response_v`、options 与可选 command"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Failure reply"
msgstr "失败回复"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "standardized `REP` values"
msgstr "标准化 `REP` 值"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "mostly close/error behavior; no portable destination-error code table"
msgstr "主要表现为关闭/错误行为；没有可移植的目标错误码表"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "raw bytes after successful reply"
msgstr "成功回复后的原始字节"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "masked/padded AEAD body records"
msgstr "经过 masking/padding 的 AEAD 正文记录"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Payload confidentiality"
msgstr "Payload 机密性"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "none in base SOCKS5"
msgstr "基础 SOCKS5 中没有"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "AES-128-GCM or ChaCha20-Poly1305 body encryption in current Xray"
msgstr "当前 Xray 使用 AES-128-GCM 或 ChaCha20-Poly1305 正文加密"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "`UDP ASSOCIATE` on TCP control connection"
msgstr "TCP 控制连接上的 `UDP ASSOCIATE`"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"VMess `command=0x02` names a fixed UDP destination in the encrypted request"
msgstr "VMess `command=0x02` 在加密请求中指定一个固定 UDP 目标"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "UDP carrier"
msgstr "UDP 承载方式"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "separate native UDP relay with SOCKS UDP header"
msgstr "独立原生 UDP relay，加 SOCKS UDP 头"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"encrypted VMess body records on the selected VMess stream; XUDP/Mux may add "
"another model"
msgstr ""
"所选 VMess 字节流上的加密 VMess 正文记录；XUDP/Mux 可能再增加另一种模型"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "UDP per-packet destination"
msgstr "UDP 每包目标地址"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "present in every SOCKS UDP datagram"
msgstr "每个 SOCKS UDP 数据报都携带"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"not present in base VMess UDP body; destination comes from request header"
msgstr "基础 VMess UDP 正文中不携带；目标来自请求头"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "UDP fragmentation field"
msgstr "UDP 分片字段"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "SOCKS `FRAG`"
msgstr "SOCKS `FRAG`"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "no base VMess fragment ID/count field"
msgstr "基础 VMess 没有 fragment ID/count 字段"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "not defined in base SOCKS5"
msgstr "基础 SOCKS5 未定义"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "extra `command=0x03` Mux.Cool layer can multiplex logical streams"
msgstr "额外的 `command=0x03` Mux.Cool 层可复用逻辑 Stream"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Flow control"
msgstr "流控"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "inherited from TCP / UDP behavior"
msgstr "继承自 TCP / UDP 行为"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"inherited from outer transport plus destination; Mux/HTTP/QUIC layers may "
"add their own flow control"
msgstr "继承自外层传输与目标连接；Mux/HTTP/QUIC 层还可能加入自身流控"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "End of stream"
msgstr "字节流结束"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "TCP FIN/close anchors association"
msgstr "TCP FIN/close 锚定 association 生命周期"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "VMess termination record and/or outer EOF depending on current behavior"
msgstr "根据当前行为使用 VMess termination record 和/或外层 EOF"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The most important conceptual difference is that SOCKS5 separates "
"negotiation, authentication, command, reply, and then raw relay into visible "
"phases. VMess compresses user authentication and proxy dispatch into a "
"protected first-flight request and continues with authenticated record "
"framing. Mux.Cool, XUDP, WebSocket, TLS, and other transports are additional "
"layers rather than substitutes for that VMess request."
msgstr ""
"最重要的概念差异是：SOCKS5 把协商、认证、命令、回复以及后续原始转发拆成可见阶"
"段；VMess 则把用户认证与代理 dispatch 压缩进受保护的首批请求，并继续使用经过"
"认证的记录分帧。Mux.Cool、XUDP、WebSocket、TLS 与其他传输都是额外层，而不是 "
"VMess 请求本身的替代品。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Boundary Conditions and Defensive Parsing"
msgstr "边界条件与防御性解析"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "A compatible implementation should explicitly guard these cases:"
msgstr "兼容实现应显式防护以下情况："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "partial reads at every fixed or variable-length AEAD field;"
msgstr "任何固定或可变长度 AEAD 字段的 partial read；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "request-header length that exceeds a practical implementation bound;"
msgstr "请求头长度超过实现可接受的实际上限；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"stale or future AuthID timestamps outside the accepted 120-second window;"
msgstr "AuthID 时间戳过旧或过于超前，超出接受的 120 秒窗口；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "repeated AuthIDs;"
msgstr "重复 AuthID；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "repeated body key/IV session tuples;"
msgstr "重复 body key/IV 会话元组；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "unsupported logical header version;"
msgstr "不受支持的逻辑请求头版本；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "invalid security nibble;"
msgstr "无效 security nibble；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "truncated IPv4/IPv6/domain addresses;"
msgstr "被截断的 IPv4/IPv6/域名地址；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"zero-length or overlong domain fields according to the current address "
"parser;"
msgstr "按当前地址解析器规则判定的零长度或过长域名字段；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"odd behavior where a Mux command incorrectly includes ordinary destination "
"bytes;"
msgstr "Mux 命令错误携带普通目标地址字节等异常行为；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "padding length larger than remaining logical header bytes;"
msgstr "padding 长度大于逻辑请求头剩余字节；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "FNV checksum mismatch;"
msgstr "FNV checksum 不匹配；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "chunk-size decode underflow/overflow after masking/padding;"
msgstr "masking/padding 处理后 chunk-size 解码发生下溢/上溢；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "failed AEAD tags;"
msgstr "AEAD tag 校验失败；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "counter/nonce exhaustion;"
msgstr "counter/nonce 耗尽；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "clean termination record versus abrupt outer EOF;"
msgstr "干净 termination record 与突发外层 EOF 的区分；"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"slow readers that create unbounded buffering in outer transport or Mux "
"layers."
msgstr "慢速 reader 导致外层传输或 Mux 层出现无界缓冲。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Do not allocate directly from an untrusted encrypted-length value until the "
"length AEAD tag has been verified and a local upper bound has been applied. "
"Likewise, do not dispatch the destination until the complete logical header, "
"padding, and checksum have been validated."
msgstr ""
"在长度 AEAD tag 完成验证并应用本地上限之前，不要直接根据不可信的加密长度值分"
"配内存。同样，在完整逻辑请求头、padding 与 checksum 全部验证通过前，不要 "
"dispatch 目标地址。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Synchronize client and server UTC clocks. Current VMess AuthID validation "
"uses a 120-second freshness window."
msgstr ""
"同步客户端与服务端 UTC 时钟。当前 VMess AuthID 验证使用 120 秒新鲜度窗口。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Use high-entropy VMess user IDs and rotate credentials when clients are "
"retired."
msgstr "使用高熵 VMess 用户 ID，并在客户端停用后轮换凭据。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Do not publish UUIDs merely because the on-wire AuthID is encrypted; the "
"UUID is still shared authentication material."
msgstr "不要因为线路上的 AuthID 已加密就公开 UUID；UUID 仍然属于共享认证材料。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Prefer current VMess AEAD. Do not build new deployments around `alterId` or "
"legacy non-AEAD sharing formats."
msgstr ""
"优先使用当前 VMess AEAD。不要围绕 `alterId` 或旧式非 AEAD 分享格式构建新部"
"署。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray no longer offers VMess `none/zero/plain` body security; do not "
"write compatibility documentation that suggests those are current choices."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 已不再提供 VMess `none/zero/plain` 正文安全模式；兼容性文档不应把这"
"些描述成当前可用选项。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"VMess protocol encryption does not automatically make traffic look like "
"ordinary HTTPS. If censorship resistance or normal TLS server identity is a "
"deployment requirement, evaluate the appropriate outer transport/security "
"layer separately."
msgstr ""
"VMess 协议加密不会自动让流量看起来像普通 HTTPS。如果部署需要抗审查外观或正常 "
"TLS 服务端身份验证，应单独评估适当的外层传输/安全机制。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Bound invalid-request drain behavior, replay caches, body buffering, and Mux "
"state to avoid turning defensive behavior into a resource-exhaustion surface."
msgstr ""
"应限制无效请求 drain 行为、重放缓存、正文缓冲与 Mux 状态，避免防御机制本身变"
"成资源耗尽攻击面。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Logs may identify whether AuthID, header AEAD, checksum, body AEAD, or "
"dispatch failed, but remote error behavior should not reveal unnecessary "
"user/account information."
msgstr ""
"日志可以区分 AuthID、请求头 AEAD、checksum、正文 AEAD 或 dispatch 的具体失败"
"位置，但远程错误行为不应泄露不必要的用户/账户信息。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Minimal Current Xray-Style Configuration"
msgstr "最小当前 Xray 风格配置"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "A current outbound conceptually looks like:"
msgstr "当前 outbound 在概念上类似："

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "\"vmess\""
msgstr "\"vmess\""

#: src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "\"address\""
msgstr "\"address\""

