msgid "\"proxy.example.com\""
msgstr "\"proxy.example.com\""

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "\"5783a3e7-e373-51cd-8642-c83782b807c5\""
msgstr "\"5783a3e7-e373-51cd-8642-c83782b807c5\""

#: src/protocols/vmess.md src/protocols/vless.md src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "\"auto\""
msgstr "\"auto\""

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"`security: \"auto\"` is a client-side selection convenience. It resolves to "
"an actual supported body cipher; the server learns the selected cipher from "
"the protected logical VMess header. Current Project X documentation lists "
"AES-128-GCM and ChaCha20-Poly1305 as the explicit choices."
msgstr ""
"`security: \"auto\"` 是客户端侧的选择便利项。它会解析为实际受支持的正文密码；"
"服务端从受保护的 VMess 逻辑请求头得知所选密码。当前 Project X 文档把 AES-128-"
"GCM 与 ChaCha20-Poly1305 列为显式选项。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Transport settings belong outside this VMess account object and should be "
"tested independently from VMess AEAD correctness."
msgstr ""
"传输设置位于这个 VMess account 对象之外，应与 VMess AEAD 正确性分开测试。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The current Proxy Wiki capability page lists VMess under **Planned or "
"Targeted Support**, not under the client's currently available protocol set. "
"Treat VMess client configuration as a target capability until the "
"corresponding client implementation is present and verified."
msgstr ""
"当前 Proxy Wiki 能力页把 VMess 列在 **Planned or Targeted Support**，而不是客"
"户端当前可用协议集合中。在对应客户端实现存在并完成验证之前，应把 VMess 客户端"
"配置视为目标能力。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Chimera can eventually expose/store VMess profile fields without "
"implementing the VMess cryptography itself. UI/profile support and runtime "
"protocol support should be tracked independently."
msgstr ""
"Chimera 最终可以暴露/保存 VMess 配置字段，而不必自身实现 VMess 密码学。UI/"
"profile 支持与运行时协议支持应独立跟踪。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The current server capability map explicitly lists VMess inbound work. "
"Validate that implementation against the current AEAD-only Xray behavior "
"described here, including AuthID time/replay checks, current body-security "
"choices, TCP, UDP, and any Mux/XUDP behavior it claims to support."
msgstr ""
"当前服务端能力图明确列出了 VMess inbound 工作。应按照本文描述的当前 AEAD-"
"only Xray 行为验证该实现，包括 AuthID 时间/重放检查、当前正文安全选项、TCP、"
"UDP，以及其声称支持的任何 Mux/XUDP 行为。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"The current Wiki evidence index does not catalog an independent-client VMess "
"happy-path interoperability test for Chimera Server. The implementation-"
"status claim is therefore grounded primarily in the audited AEAD VMess "
"inbound source path rather than an external interop label."
msgstr ""
"当前 Wiki 测试证据索引尚未收录 Chimera Server 与独立客户端进行的 VMess 正向互"
"操作测试。因此，实现状态的判断主要依据经审计的 AEAD VMess 入站源码路径，而非"
"外部互操作测试标记。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Do not upgrade this page to “externally interoperable” based only on parser, "
"handler, or unrelated Xray-client tests. Add the exact peer and test "
"function to [Test Evidence and Interoperability Matrix](../test-evidence.md) "
"when external VMess coverage is introduced."
msgstr ""
"不能仅凭解析器、处理器或无关的 Xray 客户端测试，就将本页状态提升为“已通过外部"
"互操作验证”。引入外部 VMess 测试后，应将确切的对端和测试函数补充到[测试证据与"
"互操作矩阵](../test-evidence.md)。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Immediate rejection"
msgstr "立即被拒绝"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Verify the user ID on both peers."
msgstr "确认两端用户 ID 一致。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Check actual UTC time and keep skew well below 120 seconds."
msgstr "检查真实 UTC 时间，并把偏差保持在明显低于 120 秒的范围。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Confirm both peers implement current VMess AEAD rather than an incompatible "
"legacy/alterId mode."
msgstr "确认双方实现的是当前 VMess AEAD，而不是不兼容的 legacy/alterId 模式。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Check whether the outer transport is delivering a clean ordered byte stream."
msgstr "检查外层传输是否提供干净、有序的字节流。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Distinguish AuthID rejection from request-header AEAD/checksum rejection in "
"endpoint logs."
msgstr "在端点日志中区分 AuthID 拒绝与请求头 AEAD/checksum 拒绝。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Header succeeds but data fails"
msgstr "请求头成功但数据失败"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Confirm the body security selected by the client is AES-128-GCM or ChaCha20-"
"Poly1305 and is decoded as that exact security nibble."
msgstr ""
"确认客户端选择的正文安全模式是 AES-128-GCM 或 ChaCha20-Poly1305，并被服务端按"
"准确的 security nibble 解码。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Verify request body key/IV extraction and response key/IV derivation."
msgstr "验证 request body key/IV 提取与 response key/IV 派生。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Check chunk masking and global-padding state in both directions."
msgstr "检查两个方向的 chunk masking 与 global-padding 状态。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"If `AuthenticatedLength` is enabled, ensure both peers implement the same "
"experiment behavior."
msgstr "若启用 `AuthenticatedLength`，确保双方实现相同的实验行为。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Check AEAD nonce counters and packet/stream transfer mode."
msgstr "检查 AEAD nonce counter 以及 packet/stream 传输模式。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Determine whether the flow is base VMess UDP or Mux/XUDP."
msgstr "判断该流量属于基础 VMess UDP 还是 Mux/XUDP。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"For base VMess UDP, confirm `command=0x02` and the fixed destination in the "
"request header."
msgstr "对基础 VMess UDP，确认 `command=0x02` 以及请求头中的固定目标地址。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Preserve packet boundaries through the VMess body reader/writer."
msgstr "通过 VMess body reader/writer 保持 packet 边界。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid "Do not expect SOCKS5-style per-datagram destination headers or `FRAG`."
msgstr "不要期待 SOCKS5 风格的每数据报目标地址头或 `FRAG`。"

#: src/protocols/vmess.md
msgid ""
"Check outer transport buffering and any MTU/datagram constraints in the "
"layers surrounding VMess."
msgstr "检查外层传输缓冲，以及 VMess 周围各层的 MTU/datagram 限制。"

