#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"VLESS is a lightweight, stateless proxy protocol from the Xray ecosystem. "
"Its baseline request carries destination metadata and user identity. "
"Historically VLESS relied almost entirely on a separate TLS or REALITY layer "
"for confidentiality; current Xray also implements optional **VLESS "
"Encryption**, a protocol-layer encrypted wrapper that can protect the VLESS "
"request and body."
msgstr ""
"VLESS 是 Xray 生态中的轻量、无状态代理协议。它的基础请求承载目标元数据和用户"
"身份。过去 VLESS 的机密性几乎完全依赖独立的 TLS 或 REALITY 层；当前 Xray 还实"
"现了可选的 **VLESS Encryption**，作为协议层加密包装来保护 VLESS 请求与正文。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"A useful way to read an Xray-style configuration is to separate three layers:"
msgstr "理解 Xray 风格配置时，可以把它拆成三个层级："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Those layers can be combined only when the selected core supports the "
"combination."
msgstr "只有当前选中的核心支持相应组合时，这些层才能共同工作。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Identity and Authentication"
msgstr "身份与认证"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"VLESS users are identified by an `id`. A UUID is the common representation, "
"and current Xray versions can also map supported custom strings to a stable "
"UUID identity."
msgstr ""
"VLESS 用户通过 `id` 标识。UUID 是最常见的表示形式，当前 Xray 版本还可以把受支"
"持的自定义字符串映射为稳定的 UUID 身份。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Unlike VMess, VLESS does not rely on synchronized system time for its basic "
"user identity model."
msgstr "与 VMess 不同，VLESS 的基础用户身份模型不依赖系统时间同步。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The user identity is not itself encryption. Traditional deployments "
"therefore pair VLESS with TLS or REALITY. Current Xray can instead, or "
"additionally, use VLESS Encryption; that protects the VLESS payload but does "
"not by itself create the ordinary HTTPS appearance supplied by TLS or "
"REALITY."
msgstr ""
"用户身份本身并不是加密。因此传统部署会把 VLESS 与 TLS 或 REALITY 配合使用。当"
"前 Xray 可以改用或额外叠加 VLESS Encryption；它能保护 VLESS payload，但自身不"
"会产生 TLS 或 REALITY 所提供的普通 HTTPS 外观。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "At a high level:"
msgstr "从高层来看："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The client establishes the configured outer transport and, if configured, "
"TLS/REALITY."
msgstr "客户端先建立已配置的外层传输，并在启用时完成 TLS/REALITY。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"If VLESS Encryption is enabled, client and server complete its key-exchange "
"wrapper (or resume an accepted 0-RTT session)."
msgstr ""
"如果启用了 VLESS Encryption，客户端与服务端随后完成其密钥交换包装（或恢复一个"
"被接受的 0-RTT 会话）。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The client sends the VLESS request containing user identity, command, and "
"destination information through the resulting plain or encrypted body path."
msgstr ""
"客户端通过得到的明文或加密正文路径，发送包含用户身份、命令和目标信息的 VLESS "
"请求。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "The server validates the VLESS user and requested mode."
msgstr "服务端验证 VLESS 用户与所请求的模式。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "The server opens or dispatches the destination connection."
msgstr "服务端建立或分发目标连接。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Application traffic is relayed through the same layered path."
msgstr "应用流量继续通过同一套分层路径转发。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The byte-level framing below follows the current Xray-core `main` VLESS "
"encoder/decoder. Because VLESS is an implementation-defined Xray protocol "
"rather than an IETF standard, verify these details again when targeting a "
"materially different core version."
msgstr ""
"下面的字节级格式依据当前 Xray-core `main` 分支中的 VLESS 编码器/解码器。"
"VLESS 是由 Xray 实现定义的协议，而不是 IETF 标准，因此面向差异较大的 core 版"
"本时应重新核对这些细节。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS Encryption: Outer Handshake and Record Layer"
msgstr "VLESS Encryption：外层握手与记录层"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"VLESS Encryption is negotiated by configuration rather than by adding a new "
"method-selection field to the baseline VLESS header. The client `encryption` "
"and server `decryption` strings must describe compatible handshake and "
"traffic-appearance modes. Current official configuration uses "
"`mlkem768x25519plus` as the handshake method and exposes three appearances: "
"`native`, `xorpub`, and `random`."
msgstr ""
"VLESS Encryption 通过配置预先约定，而不是在基础 VLESS 头中增加新的方法选择字"
"段。客户端 `encryption` 与服务端 `decryption` 字符串必须描述兼容的握手与流量"
"外观模式。当前官方配置使用 `mlkem768x25519plus` 作为握手方式，并提供三种外"
"观：`native`、`xorpub` 和 `random`。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "A typical generated pair conceptually has this shape:"
msgstr "一组典型生成配置在概念上具有以下形态："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The authentication key block can use X25519 material or ML-KEM-768 material. "
"The ephemeral handshake itself combines ML-KEM-768 with X25519, so the "
"configured static authentication choice and the per-connection PFS exchange "
"are different concepts."
msgstr ""
"认证密钥块可以使用 X25519 材料或 ML-KEM-768 材料。临时握手本身会组合 ML-"
"KEM-768 与 X25519，因此配置中的静态认证选择和每条连接上的 PFS 交换是两个不同"
"概念。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "1-RTT client-to-server handshake layout"
msgstr "1-RTT 客户端到服务端握手布局"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The current `proxy/vless/encryption` implementation starts with a random 16-"
"byte IV followed by one or more **NFS relays** derived from the configured "
"static authentication keys. For a relay using X25519, the public-key "
"contribution is 32 bytes; for ML-KEM-768, the encapsulated ciphertext "
"contribution is 1088 bytes. When more than one configured relay "
"participates, 32-byte BLAKE3-derived linkage values bind the relay chain so "
"an intermediate relay cannot simply be replaced."
msgstr ""
"当前 `proxy/vless/encryption` 实现以随机 16 字节 IV 开始，随后是由已配置静态"
"认证密钥派生的一个或多个 **NFS relay**。使用 X25519 的 relay 中，公钥贡献为 "
"32 字节；使用 ML-KEM-768 时，封装密文贡献为 1088 字节。当多个已配置 relay 参"
"与时，会使用 32 字节、由 BLAKE3 派生的链接值绑定 relay 链，使中间 relay 不能"
"被简单替换。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"After the IV and NFS relay area, the normal 1-RTT client handshake sends:"
msgstr "在 IV 与 NFS relay 区域之后，普通 1-RTT 客户端握手继续发送："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Why `18` bytes for a two-byte length? The length itself is a big-endian "
"`uint16`, and the AEAD adds a 16-byte authentication tag. Likewise, the 1216-"
"byte hybrid client PFS public material becomes 1232 bytes after the tag. The "
"client can split the configured padding into multiple writes with delays; "
"those write boundaries are camouflage behavior and are not protocol-message "
"boundaries for a parser."
msgstr ""
"为什么两字节长度字段在线路上占 `18` 字节？长度本身是大端 `uint16`，AEAD 还会"
"增加 16 字节认证 tag。同理，1216 字节的客户端混合 PFS 公共材料加 tag 后变为 "
"1232 字节。客户端可以按配置把 padding 拆成多次写入并插入延迟；这些写入边界属"
"于伪装行为，并不是解析器可以依赖的协议消息边界。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The server first derives the NFS key from the relay area and uses it to open "
"the encrypted length. For the 1-RTT path it then decrypts the 1184-byte ML-"
"KEM-768 encapsulation key plus the 32-byte X25519 public key, creates its "
"own ML-KEM and X25519 contributions, and derives a 64-byte PFS secret (`32 "
"ML-KEM + 32 X25519`). That PFS secret is combined with the per-connection "
"NFS key to form the keying material used by the later record layer."
msgstr ""
"服务端首先从 relay 区域派生 NFS key，并用它解开加密长度。对 1-RTT 路径，随后"
"解密 1184 字节 ML-KEM-768 encapsulation key 与 32 字节 X25519 公钥，生成自身"
"的 ML-KEM 和 X25519 贡献，并派生 64 字节 PFS secret（`32 ML-KEM + 32 "
"X25519`）。该 PFS secret 再与本连接 NFS key 组合，形成后续记录层使用的密钥材"
"料。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "The 1-RTT server response begins with:"
msgstr "1-RTT 服务端响应以以下内容开始："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The first field is 1120 bytes of server PFS public/ciphertext material plus "
"a 16-byte tag. The ticket plaintext is 16 bytes and becomes 32 bytes with "
"its tag. The first two ticket bytes encode the accepted ticket lifetime. A "
"zero lifetime means there is no resumable 0-RTT session."
msgstr ""
"第一个字段由 1120 字节服务端 PFS 公共/密文材料加 16 字节 tag 构成。ticket 明"
"文为 16 字节，加 tag 后变为 32 字节。ticket 的前两字节编码服务端接受的有效"
"期；有效期为 0 表示不存在可恢复的 0-RTT 会话。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "0-RTT resumption and replay boundary"
msgstr "0-RTT 恢复与重放边界"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"When the client is configured for `0rtt`, has an unexpired cached ticket, "
"and the server allows resumption, it can avoid the full PFS exchange. It "
"still creates a fresh IV and NFS key, then sends:"
msgstr ""
"当客户端配置为 `0rtt`、持有尚未过期的缓存 ticket，且服务端允许恢复时，可以跳"
"过完整 PFS 交换。客户端仍会生成新的 IV 与 NFS key，然后发送："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The resumed traffic key combines the cached PFS secret with the **new** NFS "
"key, so each resumed connection still has fresh connection-specific "
"material. The server stores NFS-key use per ticket and rejects a repeated "
"key as a replay. If the ticket has expired, current server code sends random-"
"looking bytes so the client abandons the cached session and retries with a "
"new handshake rather than silently accepting old 0-RTT state."
msgstr ""
"恢复后的流量密钥由缓存 PFS secret 与**新的** NFS key 组合，因此每条恢复连接仍"
"拥有新的连接专用材料。服务端会按 ticket 记录 NFS key 的使用情况，并把重复 "
"key 视为重放而拒绝。如果 ticket 已过期，当前服务端代码会发送随机外观字节，让"
"客户端放弃缓存会话并重新进行握手，而不是静默接受旧 0-RTT 状态。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"0-RTT therefore reduces startup latency; it is not a promise that arbitrary "
"application actions become replay-safe. A caller should keep the same "
"security caution it would apply to any early-data mechanism."
msgstr ""
"因此 0-RTT 只是在降低启动延迟，并不保证任意应用操作都具备重放安全性。调用方应"
"像对待其他 early-data 机制一样保留相同的安全谨慎。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Encrypted application-record layout"
msgstr "加密应用记录布局"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"After either handshake path, the VLESS header and subsequent body are "
"carried through `CommonConn`. Current Xray splits writes into plaintext "
"chunks of at most 8192 bytes and wraps each chunk as:"
msgstr ""
"无论采用哪种握手路径，VLESS 头和后续正文都会通过 `CommonConn` 承载。当前 "
"Xray 会把写入拆成最多 8192 字节的明文块，并按以下格式包装每块："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The five-byte prefix intentionally has the shape of a TLS 1.3 application-"
"data record (`17 03 03`), but **VLESS Encryption is not TLS**. The header is "
"used as AEAD associated data. Receivers require a ciphertext length from 17 "
"through 16640 bytes; malformed headers, truncated records, or failed AEAD "
"tags terminate that encrypted stream."
msgstr ""
"五字节前缀有意采用 TLS 1.3 application-data record（`17 03 03`）的外形，但 "
"**VLESS Encryption 并不是 TLS**。该头部会作为 AEAD associated data。接收方要"
"求密文长度位于 17 到 16640 字节之间；头部异常、记录截断或 AEAD tag 校验失败都"
"会终止这条加密流。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Record keys are derived with BLAKE3 from the handshake key material and a "
"connection-specific context. Current code chooses AES-GCM when the endpoint "
"has appropriate AES-GCM hardware support and otherwise uses ChaCha20-"
"Poly1305; the server can detect the peer choice while opening the first "
"encrypted handshake length. Nonces increment independently by direction. The "
"implementation also has a rekey path if the 96-bit nonce counter reaches its "
"maximum rather than allowing nonce reuse."
msgstr ""
"记录密钥由握手密钥材料与连接专用上下文通过 BLAKE3 派生。当前代码在端点具备合"
"适 AES-GCM 硬件支持时选择 AES-GCM，否则使用 ChaCha20-Poly1305；服务端可以在解"
"开首个加密握手长度时识别对端选择。两个方向的 nonce 独立递增。若 96 位 nonce "
"计数器达到最大值，实现还会执行 rekey，而不是允许 nonce 复用。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "`native`, `xorpub`, and `random` capture appearance"
msgstr "`native`、`xorpub` 与 `random` 的抓包外观"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"These options change observable encoding, not the inner VLESS command format:"
msgstr "这些选项改变的是可观察编码，而不是内层 VLESS 命令格式："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"`native` leaves the key-exchange public/ciphertext material in its native "
"representation and retains the TLS-record-like five-byte data headers;"
msgstr ""
"`native` 保留密钥交换公共/密文材料的原生表示，并保留类似 TLS record 的五字节"
"数据头；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"`xorpub` masks the public/ciphertext portions of the NFS relay using a "
"BLAKE3-derived AES-CTR stream, reducing their native public-key appearance;"
msgstr ""
"`xorpub` 使用 BLAKE3 派生的 AES-CTR 流掩码 NFS relay 中的公共/密文部分，从而"
"降低其原生公钥外观；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"`random` additionally masks the five-byte record headers in each direction, "
"so the post-handshake stream no longer exposes the repeated `17 03 03` "
"record-header pattern."
msgstr ""
"`random` 还会额外掩码两个方向的五字节记录头，因此握手后的数据流不再暴露重复"
"的 `17 03 03` 记录头模式。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"If VLESS Encryption itself is carried inside real TLS or REALITY, an "
"ordinary on-path capture sees the outer TLS/REALITY layer first. The inner "
"appearance mode only becomes directly observable after removing that outer "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"如果 VLESS Encryption 本身承载在真实 TLS 或 REALITY 内部，普通链路抓包首先看"
"到的是外层 TLS/REALITY。只有移除该外层之后，内层 appearance 模式才会直接可"
"见。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Encryption state machine and failure scope"
msgstr "加密状态机与错误作用域"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"This introduces an error layer that baseline SOCKS5 does not have. A failed "
"ML-KEM/X25519 exchange or AEAD tag means the server has not yet reached the "
"VLESS UUID/command parser; changing a destination address or SOCKS-style "
"command cannot repair such a failure."
msgstr ""
"这引入了基础 SOCKS5 不具备的一层错误。ML-KEM/X25519 交换失败或 AEAD tag 失败"
"意味着服务端甚至尚未到达 VLESS UUID/命令解析器；修改目标地址或类似 SOCKS 的命"
"令无法修复这种故障。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Baseline Wire Format"
msgstr "基础线格式"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Request header"
msgstr "请求头"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"For a normal TCP or UDP request, current Xray-core serializes the VLESS "
"request header in this order:"
msgstr ""
"对于普通 TCP 或 UDP 请求，当前 Xray-core 按以下顺序序列化 VLESS 请求头："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The important point is that **VLESS writes the destination port before the "
"address**, unlike SOCKS5 and Trojan, which put the address before the port."
msgstr ""
"需要特别注意：**VLESS 先写目标端口，再写地址**；这与 SOCKS5 和 Trojan 先地"
"址、后端口的顺序不同。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray-core uses request version `0x00`. The next 16 bytes are the "
"binary user ID. A UUID string such as:"
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray-core 使用请求版本 `0x00`。之后的 16 字节是二进制用户 ID。例如以下 "
"UUID 字符串："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"is therefore not sent as 36 ASCII characters; the corresponding 128-bit "
"value is sent as 16 raw bytes."
msgstr ""
"在线路上不会以 36 个 ASCII 字符发送，而是把对应的 128 位值作为 16 个原始字节"
"发送。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Addons field"
msgstr "Addons 字段"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Immediately after the user ID comes one byte containing the length of the "
"serialized VLESS addons block:"
msgstr "用户 ID 之后紧接一个字节，用于表示序列化后的 VLESS addons 块长度："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"For the ordinary no-flow case, `AddonsLength` is `0x00` and no addon bytes "
"follow. For supported flow modes such as `xtls-rprx-vision`, current Xray-"
"core serializes the addons structure as protobuf and prefixes it with a "
"single-byte length."
msgstr ""
"普通的无 flow 情况下，`AddonsLength` 为 `0x00`，后面没有 addon 数据。对于 "
"`xtls-rprx-vision` 等受支持的 flow，当前 Xray-core 会把 addons 结构序列化为 "
"protobuf，并在前面放一个单字节长度。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"This is not analogous to SOCKS5 METHOD negotiation. The addons field is part "
"of the already-selected VLESS request format and carries optional VLESS/Xray "
"behavior for that request."
msgstr ""
"这与 SOCKS5 的 METHOD 协商不同。addons 字段属于已经确定的 VLESS 请求格式，用"
"于携带该请求可选的 VLESS/Xray 行为。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Command byte"
msgstr "命令字节"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Current Xray-core defines these request command values:"
msgstr "当前 Xray-core 定义了以下请求命令值："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Transfer model"
msgstr "传输模型"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "stream"
msgstr "流"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "packet"
msgstr "数据包"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Mux"
msgstr "Mux"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Reverse (`Rvs`)"
msgstr "反向（`Rvs`）"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"For TCP and UDP, a destination address follows the command. `Mux` and `Rvs` "
"are special internal stream commands; the encoder does not append an "
"ordinary network destination for those commands."
msgstr ""
"TCP 和 UDP 命令之后会跟目标地址。`Mux` 和 `Rvs` 是特殊的内部流命令；编码器不"
"会为这两个命令附加普通网络目标地址。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Destination address encoding"
msgstr "目标地址编码"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "For ordinary TCP/UDP requests, the on-wire order is:"
msgstr "普通 TCP/UDP 请求在线路上的顺序为："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"`Port` is a 16-bit network-order integer. Current Xray address-family values "
"are:"
msgstr "`Port` 是 16 位网络字节序整数。当前 Xray 的地址族取值为："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "The address body is:"
msgstr "地址主体格式为："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"A domain is therefore length-prefixed in the same general style as SOCKS5, "
"but VLESS uses a different type value for domains (`0x02` versus SOCKS5 "
"`0x03`) and places the two-byte port before `ATYP`."
msgstr ""
"因此域名同样采用类似 SOCKS5 的长度前缀形式，但 VLESS 的域名类型值不同"
"（`0x02`，而 SOCKS5 为 `0x03`），并且把两字节端口放在 `ATYP` 前面。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Example request header"
msgstr "请求头示例"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Ignoring transport security and using no addons, a TCP request to "
"`example.com:443` has the logical layout:"
msgstr ""
"忽略传输安全层且不使用 addons 时，到 `example.com:443` 的 TCP 请求逻辑布局如"
"下："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Read as:"
msgstr "可解读为："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"00        Version 0\n"
"UUID      16-byte identity\n"
"00        zero-length addons\n"
"01        TCP command\n"
"01 bb     port 443, big endian\n"
"02        domain address type\n"
"0b        domain length 11\n"
"...       \"example.com\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"00        版本 0\n"
"UUID      16 字节身份 ID\n"
"00        addons 长度为 0\n"
"01        TCP 命令\n"
"01 bb     端口 443，大端序\n"
"02        域名地址类型\n"
"0b        域名长度 11\n"
"...       \"example.com\"\n"
"```"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Application bytes can follow the header on the same underlying byte stream. "
"A server parser must therefore stop exactly at the end of the address and "
"retain any already-read application bytes."
msgstr ""
"应用数据可以在同一底层字节流中紧跟请求头。因此服务端解析器必须准确停在地址字"
"段末尾，并保留任何已经提前读取到的应用数据。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Server-Side Request Parsing State Machine"
msgstr "服务端请求解析状态机"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "A minimal inbound parser can be modeled as:"
msgstr "最小入站解析器可以建模为："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"An invalid request version, unknown user ID, malformed addons block, "
"unsupported command, invalid address type, truncated port, or truncated "
"address must abort normal VLESS request processing. Whether the outer "
"connection is simply closed, reset, or handled by another transport/fallback "
"path depends on the surrounding Xray transport and security configuration."
msgstr ""
"请求版本无效、用户 ID 未知、addons 块损坏、命令不受支持、地址类型无效、端口不"
"完整或地址不完整，都必须终止正常的 VLESS 请求处理。外层连接究竟直接关闭、重"
"置，还是交给其他传输/fallback 路径处理，取决于外围的 Xray 传输和安全配置。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The parser must use exact-length reads for fixed-size fields. TCP, TLS, "
"XHTTP, and other stream transports do not preserve VLESS header boundaries."
msgstr ""
"解析器对固定长度字段必须执行精确长度读取。TCP、TLS、XHTTP 等流式传输都不会保"
"留 VLESS 请求头边界。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"VLESS has a small server-to-client response header before downlink "
"application data. Current Xray-core writes:"
msgstr ""
"VLESS 在下行应用数据之前有一个很小的服务端到客户端响应头。当前 Xray-core 写"
"入："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The response version must equal the request version. In the common no-addon "
"case, the response begins:"
msgstr "响应版本必须与请求版本一致。在常见的无 addon 情况下，响应开头为："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"This is an important difference from SOCKS5. SOCKS5 returns a `REP` status "
"plus `BND.ADDR/BND.PORT`; baseline VLESS does **not** return an equivalent "
"fixed per-destination status code or bound-address tuple in this response "
"header."
msgstr ""
"这是 VLESS 与 SOCKS5 的重要差异。SOCKS5 会返回 `REP` 状态以及 `BND.ADDR/"
"BND.PORT`；基础 VLESS 的响应头中**没有**等价的固定目标状态码或绑定地址元组。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Consequently, a VLESS implementation normally learns about many destination "
"or transport failures through stream termination/reset and implementation "
"error handling rather than by parsing a SOCKS5-style `REP` byte."
msgstr ""
"因此，VLESS 实现通常通过流终止/重置以及实现自身的错误处理来获知很多目标或传输"
"失败，而不是解析 SOCKS5 风格的 `REP` 字节。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"For `Command=0x01`, once the server has accepted the request and dispatched "
"the destination, the remaining body is a byte stream:"
msgstr ""
"对于 `Command=0x01`，服务端接受请求并分发目标后，剩余 body 就是字节流："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"There is no per-record VLESS framing for ordinary TCP payload in the no-flow "
"case. The outer transport may of course add its own framing: TLS records, "
"XHTTP requests, WebSocket frames, HTTP/2 frames, and so on are separate "
"layers."
msgstr ""
"无 flow 的普通 TCP payload 没有逐记录 VLESS framing。外层传输当然可能增加自己"
"的 framing，例如 TLS record、XHTTP request、WebSocket frame、HTTP/2 frame "
"等，但它们属于不同层。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"This separation is useful when debugging. A packet boundary from the outer "
"transport is not a VLESS application-message boundary."
msgstr ""
"调试时必须保持这种分层意识：外层传输的数据包边界并不是 VLESS 应用消息边界。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "UDP Body Framing"
msgstr "UDP Body 分帧"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray-core handles `Command=0x02` differently from TCP. Each UDP "
"packet is serialized onto the VLESS body stream as:"
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray-core 对 `Command=0x02` 的处理不同于 TCP。每个 UDP 数据包都会按以下"
"格式序列化到 VLESS body 流中："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The two-byte length is big endian. The destination is supplied by the VLESS "
"request header; ordinary packets in that VLESS request therefore do not "
"repeat `ATYP + address + port` for every datagram."
msgstr ""
"两字节长度采用大端序。目标地址已经由 VLESS 请求头提供，因此同一 VLESS 请求中"
"的普通 UDP 数据包不需要为每个 datagram 重复 `ATYP + address + port`。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "This design is markedly different from SOCKS5 UDP relay:"
msgstr "这种设计与 SOCKS5 UDP relay 有明显区别："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"SOCKS5 sends each datagram over a real UDP socket and repeats the "
"destination in every SOCKS UDP header."
msgstr ""
"SOCKS5 通过真实 UDP socket 发送每个 datagram，并在每个 SOCKS UDP header 中重"
"复目标地址。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"VLESS can carry UDP packet semantics over a stream transport by restoring "
"packet boundaries with a two-byte length."
msgstr ""
"VLESS 可以在流式传输上用两字节长度重新建立数据包边界，从而承载 UDP packet 语"
"义。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Baseline VLESS body framing has no SOCKS5 `FRAG` byte. Fragmentation, MTU, "
"or packetization behavior introduced by the outer transport is a separate "
"concern."
msgstr ""
"基础 VLESS body framing 没有 SOCKS5 的 `FRAG` 字节。由外层传输引入的分片、"
"MTU 或 packetization 行为属于另一层问题。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"A receiver must first read exactly two bytes, decode the length, and then "
"read exactly that many payload bytes. Treating a single socket read as one "
"UDP packet will fail as soon as the underlying stream splits or combines "
"writes."
msgstr ""
"接收端必须先精确读取两个字节并解码长度，然后再精确读取指定数量的 payload 字"
"节。如果把一次 socket read 当作一个 UDP packet，只要底层流发生拆分或合并写入"
"就会出错。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Multiplexing Boundaries"
msgstr "多路复用边界"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"A normal VLESS TCP request represents one logical destination stream. VLESS "
"itself does not magically make every `Command=TCP` request multiplexed just "
"because the outer connection is HTTP/2, XHTTP, or another multiplex-capable "
"transport."
msgstr ""
"普通 VLESS TCP 请求表示一个逻辑目标流。即使外层连接使用 HTTP/2、XHTTP 或其他"
"支持多路复用的传输，VLESS 本身也不会自动让每个 `Command=TCP` 请求都变成多路复"
"用。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "There are two distinct places where multiplexing may appear:"
msgstr "多路复用可能出现在两个不同位置："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "the VLESS `Mux` command / Xray multiplexing layer; and"
msgstr "VLESS `Mux` 命令 / Xray 多路复用层；以及"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"the outer transport, which may itself provide multiple logical streams or "
"request flows."
msgstr "外层传输，它自身可能提供多个逻辑流或请求流。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Do not collapse these into one concept in implementation documentation. The "
"SOCKS5 baseline has neither feature: one SOCKS5 TCP control connection "
"becomes one CONNECT relay stream."
msgstr ""
"实现文档中不要把这两者混成一个概念。标准 SOCKS5 两者都没有：一个 SOCKS5 TCP "
"控制连接最终对应一个 CONNECT relay stream。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Connection Close and Error Semantics"
msgstr "连接关闭与错误语义"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"For baseline TCP relay, end-of-stream propagates through the selected outer "
"transport. With VLESS Encryption enabled, EOF/reset first crosses the "
"encrypted record wrapper and only then the baseline VLESS body. "
"Implementations need to distinguish:"
msgstr ""
"对基础 TCP 转发，流结束会沿所选外层传输传播。启用 VLESS Encryption 后，EOF/"
"reset 会先穿过加密记录包装，再到基础 VLESS 正文。实现需要区分："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "clean EOF after valid response/data,"
msgstr "有效响应/数据之后的正常 EOF；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS Encryption handshake failure,"
msgstr "VLESS Encryption 握手失败；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "expired or replayed 0-RTT ticket,"
msgstr "过期或被重放的 0-RTT ticket；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "malformed encrypted record header or failed AEAD tag,"
msgstr "畸形加密记录头或 AEAD tag 校验失败；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "transport reset,"
msgstr "传输层 reset；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "invalid VLESS request before dispatch,"
msgstr "分发前的无效 VLESS 请求；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "destination connection failure,"
msgstr "目标连接失败；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "timeout / idle expiration,"
msgstr "超时 / 空闲过期；"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "and outer TLS/REALITY/XHTTP failure before VLESS can even be parsed."
msgstr "以及在 VLESS 甚至尚未开始解析前发生的外层 TLS/REALITY/XHTTP 失败。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"Unlike SOCKS5, VLESS does not provide a fixed reply-code taxonomy equivalent "
"to `REP=connection refused`, `network unreachable`, or `address type "
"unsupported`. Logs and the transport's close/reset semantics therefore carry "
"more diagnostic weight."
msgstr ""
"与 SOCKS5 不同，VLESS 没有提供等价于 `REP=connection refused`、`network "
"unreachable` 或 `address type unsupported` 的固定回复码分类。因此日志以及传输"
"层 close/reset 语义在诊断中更重要。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"For UDP-over-stream, a truncated two-byte length or EOF before the declared "
"payload length is a malformed/incomplete packet, not a shorter valid "
"datagram."
msgstr ""
"对于 UDP-over-stream，两字节长度字段不完整，或在声明的 payload 长度读取完成前"
"遇到 EOF，都表示畸形/不完整数据包，而不是一个更短但有效的 datagram。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS over TLS/RAW"
msgstr "TLS/RAW 上的 VLESS"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Without decryption, a capture typically exposes only the outer layers:"
msgstr "无法解密时，抓包通常只能看到外层："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"With TLS keys or instrumentation below TLS, the next layer is either the "
"baseline VLESS request header or, when enabled, the VLESS Encryption "
"handshake. After a VLESS Encryption 1-RTT handshake, `native`/`xorpub` mode "
"commonly exposes five-byte inner record headers shaped as `17 03 03 <BE16 "
"length>`; `random` masks those headers as well. These are inner VLESS "
"Encryption records, not a second real TLS session."
msgstr ""
"拥有 TLS 密钥或能在 TLS 之下进行插桩时，下一层要么是基础 VLESS 请求头，要么在"
"启用时是 VLESS Encryption 握手。完成 VLESS Encryption 1-RTT 握手后，`native`/"
"`xorpub` 模式通常会显露形如 `17 03 03 <BE16 length>` 的五字节内层记录头；"
"`random` 还会掩码这些头部。这些是内层 VLESS Encryption 记录，而不是第二层真"
"实 TLS 会话。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS over REALITY"
msgstr "REALITY 上的 VLESS"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The capture first looks like the REALITY/TLS-facing handshake. VLESS fields "
"are inside the accepted secure session and are not visible as clear-text "
"UUID, command, or address fields on the network."
msgstr ""
"抓包首先看到的是 REALITY/TLS-facing 握手。VLESS 字段位于已接受的安全会话内"
"部，网络上看不到明文 UUID、命令或地址字段。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS over XHTTP"
msgstr "XHTTP 上的 VLESS"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"The packet capture sees HTTP-layer requests/responses or HTTP/2/HTTP/3 "
"transport frames first. VLESS is payload carried _inside_ those XHTTP flows. "
"Therefore:"
msgstr ""
"抓包首先看到 HTTP 层请求/响应或 HTTP/2、HTTP/3 传输帧。VLESS 是承载在这些 "
"XHTTP 流程_内部_的 payload。因此："

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid ""
"This layer ordering is essential when deciding where a failure occurred."
msgstr "判断故障发生在哪一层时，这种分层顺序至关重要。"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS Compared with SOCKS5"
msgstr "VLESS 与 SOCKS5 对比"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS / current Xray"
msgstr "VLESS / 当前 Xray"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
msgid "Selected Xray transport"
msgstr "所选 Xray 传输"

#: src/protocols/vless.md
