msgstr "\"followRedirect\""

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"A TCP client connecting to `127.0.0.1:11003` does not send a proxy "
"destination header. The Server already knows the target `example.com:80` "
"from configuration and forwards the client's first byte as target "
"application data."
msgstr ""
"TCP 客户端连接 `127.0.0.1:11003` 时不会发送代理目标地址头。Server 已从配置知"
"道目标 `example.com:80`，因此客户端第一个字节就会作为目标应用数据转发。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "The current TCP handler returns a direct forwarding result containing:"
msgstr "当前 TCP handler 返回一个直接转发结果，其中包含："

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "the selected remote location;"
msgstr "选定的远端位置；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "the same accepted byte stream;"
msgstr "同一条已接受字节流；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "no protocol-specific success response;"
msgstr "没有协议专属成功响应；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "a `dokodemo-door` traffic context carrying the inbound tag."
msgstr "携带 inbound tag 的 `dokodemo-door` traffic context。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"No bytes are consumed by a Dokodemo request parser because no such parser "
"exists."
msgstr "Dokodemo 不会有请求 parser 消耗任何字节，因为根本不存在这种 parser。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "`followRedirect` on TCP"
msgstr "TCP 上的 `followRedirect`"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"When `followRedirect` is enabled, the handler declares that it requires an "
"original destination in the TCP connection context."
msgstr ""
"启用 `followRedirect` 后，handler 会声明 TCP connection context 中必须存在 "
"original destination。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"On Linux, the listener obtains this using the socket original-destination "
"mechanism:"
msgstr "在 Linux 上，listener 通过 socket original-destination 机制取得它："

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"IPv4 uses the original-destination socket information exposed through the "
"Linux socket API;"
msgstr "IPv4 使用 Linux socket API 暴露的 original-destination socket 信息；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "IPv6 uses the corresponding IPv6 original-destination path;"
msgstr "IPv6 使用对应的 IPv6 original-destination 路径；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "the recovered IP and port become the Dokodemo forwarding target."
msgstr "恢复出的 IP 与端口成为 Dokodemo 转发目标。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"If the operating system does not provide an original destination, the TCP "
"handler rejects the flow with an address-not-available error instead of "
"falling back silently to the configured target."
msgstr ""
"如果操作系统没有提供原始目标地址，TCP handler 会用 address-not-available 错误"
"拒绝流量，而不是静默退回配置目标。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"On non-Linux platforms, the current Server rejects TCP `followRedirect` as "
"unsupported."
msgstr ""
"在非 Linux 平台上，当前 Server 会把 TCP `followRedirect` 作为不支持功能拒绝。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "Transparent Interception Is an OS Feature"
msgstr "透明拦截属于操作系统能力"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"`followRedirect` does not itself create firewall/NAT interception rules. The "
"operating system must first redirect traffic to the Dokodemo listener while "
"preserving enough original-destination metadata for the Server to recover it."
msgstr ""
"`followRedirect` 本身不会创建 firewall/NAT 拦截规则。操作系统必须先把流量重定"
