#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"A correct Dokodemo configuration cannot compensate for missing or incorrect "
"OS interception rules."
msgstr "正确的 Dokodemo 配置无法弥补缺失或错误的操作系统拦截规则。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "TCP Transport Wrappers"
msgstr "TCP 传输封装"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"For TCP mode, the current Server builder accepts these "
"`streamSettings.network` values:"
msgstr "TCP 模式下，当前 Server builder 接受以下 `streamSettings.network` 值："

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
