msgstr "空值 / `tcp`；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "`httpupgrade`;"
msgstr "`httpupgrade`；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "`grpc`."
msgstr "`grpc`。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"The normal security-layer builder can also wrap the TCP path where the "
"selected combination is valid."
msgstr ""
"当所选组合有效时，常规 security-layer builder 还可以进一步封装 TCP 路径。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"This means Dokodemo-door can be the **inner forwarding handler** behind "
"another transport. In that case, the wrapper consumes its own handshake "
"bytes first, and only the resulting inner raw stream is forwarded to the "
"configured/original target."
msgstr ""
"这意味着 Dokodemo-door 可以作为另一种传输之后的**内层转发 handler**。这种情况"
"下，外层封装先消费自己的握手字节，只有得到的内层原始流才转发到配置/原始目标。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
