msgstr ""
"当前 Server 的通用 UDP 入口路径在这一阶段支持 Dokodemo-door 和 Shadowsocks。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"For Dokodemo UDP, `streamSettings.security` must be `none`. Applying a "
"stream security layer to the UDP Dokodemo path is rejected during "
"configuration building."
msgstr ""
"对于 Dokodemo UDP，`streamSettings.security` 必须为 `none`。在 UDP Dokodemo "
"路径上应用 stream security layer 会在配置构建阶段被拒绝。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "Example: Fixed UDP Target"
msgstr "示例：固定 UDP 目标"

