msgid "\"dokodemo-door-udp\""
msgstr "\"dokodemo-door-udp\""

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"Each client datagram is ordinary application UDP payload. There is no "
"Dokodemo UDP header around it."
msgstr "每个客户端数据报都是普通应用 UDP 负载，外面没有 Dokodemo UDP 头。"

