msgid "Fixed-target UDP Resolution"
msgstr "固定目标 UDP 解析"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"When `followRedirect` is false, the Server resolves the configured target "
"once while starting the UDP inbound and stores the resulting socket address "
"for the relay path."
msgstr ""
"`followRedirect` 为 false 时，Server 在启动 UDP 入站时只解析一次配置目标，并"
"保存所得 socket address 供 relay 路径使用。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"The receive loop then treats every incoming datagram as payload for that "
"fixed target, subject to routing/outbound selection."
msgstr ""
"之后 receive loop 把每个入站数据报都视为该固定目标的负载，同时仍受 routing/"
"outbound 选择影响。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"This is different from SOCKS5 UDP, where each client datagram can carry its "
"own destination address."
msgstr "这与 SOCKS5 UDP 不同，后者每个客户端数据报都可以携带自己的目标地址。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "UDP Session Key"
msgstr "UDP Session Key"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"For direct/freedom forwarding, the current relay reuses an outbound UDP "
"session using a key composed of:"
msgstr ""
"对于 direct/freedom 转发，当前 relay 使用由以下字段组成的 key 复用出站 UDP "
"session："

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"Datagrams with the same tuple can therefore reuse the same outbound socket/"
"session."
msgstr "因此具有相同元组的数据报可以复用同一个出站 socket/session。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"The current session channel capacity is 64 queued payloads and the idle "
"timeout is 60 seconds. Successful sends and accepted responses reset the "
"idle timer."
msgstr ""
"当前 session channel 容量为 64 个排队负载，idle timeout 为 60 秒。成功发送和"
"被接受的响应都会重置 idle timer。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"These values are current Chimera runtime policies, not fields in a Dokodemo "
"wire format."
msgstr "这些数值是当前 Chimera 运行时策略，不是 Dokodemo 线格式字段。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "UDP Response Validation"
msgstr "UDP 响应验证"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"A direct UDP session accepts a response only when the source socket address "
"exactly matches the expected target address for that session."
msgstr ""
"direct UDP session 只有在响应源 socket address 与该 session 预期目标地址完全"
"一致时才接受响应。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"A response from an unexpected source is ignored rather than forwarded to the "
"original client."
msgstr "来自非预期源的响应会被忽略，而不是转发给原始客户端。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"Valid response bytes are written directly back to the client's socket "
"address without adding a Dokodemo or SOCKS header."
msgstr ""
"有效响应字节会直接写回客户端 socket address，不会添加 Dokodemo 或 SOCKS 头。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "UDP Routing and Blackhole"
msgstr "UDP 路由与 Blackhole"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"Before creating/reusing a direct UDP session, the Server applies its UDP "
"outbound selection using information including:"
msgstr ""
"创建/复用 direct UDP session 之前，Server 会使用以下信息执行 UDP outbound 选"
"择："

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "inbound tag;"
msgstr "inbound tag；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "client address;"
msgstr "客户端地址；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "target socket address;"
msgstr "目标 socket address；"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid "target logical location."
msgstr "目标逻辑位置。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"A rule can therefore route Dokodemo UDP traffic to a blackhole outbound. In "
"that case the payload is accounted for and dropped without creating the "
"target relay session."
msgstr ""
"因此规则可以把 Dokodemo UDP 流量路由到 blackhole outbound。此时会统计该负载后"
"直接丢弃，不创建目标 relay session。"

#: src/protocols/dokodemo-door.md
msgid ""
"The repository contains an Xray-compatible example specifically for Dokodemo "
"UDP routing to blackhole."
msgstr "仓库中包含专门演示 Dokodemo UDP 路由到 blackhole 的 Xray 兼容示例。"

