msgid ""
"Dokodemo-door does not authenticate a remote proxy user. If the listener is "
"reachable by an untrusted network and forwards to a fixed sensitive service, "
"it can effectively expose that service through the listener."
msgstr ""
"Dokodemo-door 不会认证远程代理用户。如果 listener 可被不可信网络访问并转发到"
