msgid ""
"For UDP, there is likewise no control channel announcing success; datagrams "
"are forwarded or dropped according to routing and runtime errors."
msgstr ""
"UDP 同样没有宣布成功的控制通道；数据报会根据路由和运行时错误被转发或丢弃。"

