#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray transport documentation allows XHTTP to be combined with "
"ordinary TLS or REALITY. The exact HTTP behavior and tuning options have "
"evolved over time, so the selected core version should be treated as the "
"source of truth."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 传输文档允许 XHTTP 与普通 TLS 或 REALITY 组合使用。具体 HTTP 行为和"
"调优选项会随版本演进，因此应以当前所选核心版本作为权威来源。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Why XHTTP Exists"
msgstr "为什么需要 XHTTP"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Long-lived raw TCP, WebSocket, and gRPC connections have different network "
"signatures and operational constraints. XHTTP provides another way to "
"express uplink and downlink traffic using HTTP-like exchanges and connection "
"reuse."
msgstr ""
"长连接 raw TCP、WebSocket 和 gRPC 具有不同的网络特征与运行约束。XHTTP 提供了"
"另一种方式，使用类似 HTTP 的交换和连接复用来组织上行与下行流量。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Typical reasons to evaluate XHTTP include:"
msgstr "通常会考虑 XHTTP 的原因包括："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "deployment behind HTTP-aware infrastructure,"
msgstr "需要部署在支持 HTTP 的基础设施之后；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "environments where WebSocket/gRPC behavior is unreliable,"
msgstr "WebSocket/gRPC 行为不稳定的环境；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "separate control over upload/download request patterns,"
msgstr "需要分别控制上传/下载请求模式；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "and compatibility with Xray's TLS/REALITY transport-security layer."
msgstr "以及需要与 Xray 的 TLS/REALITY 传输安全层组合。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"It should not be described simply as \"HTTP proxying\". A local HTTP proxy "
"and an XHTTP transport solve different problems."
msgstr ""
"不能简单把它描述为“HTTP 代理”。本地 HTTP 代理与 XHTTP 传输解决的是不同问题。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Layer Model"
msgstr "分层模型"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Both endpoints must agree on the XHTTP transport settings that affect "
"request routing and stream interpretation."
msgstr "两端必须对影响请求路由和数据流解释方式的 XHTTP 传输设置保持一致。"

