#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray also exposes fields that can materially change the **wire-"
"visible HTTP request shape**, including `sessionIDPlacement`, "
"`seqPlacement`, `uplinkDataPlacement`, `uplinkHTTPMethod`, "
"`xPaddingObfsMode`, `xPaddingPlacement`, `xPaddingMethod`, `sessionIDTable`, "
