#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "The path is one of the most important interoperability fields."
msgstr "path 是最重要的互操作字段之一。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Client and server need compatible path handling. If a reverse proxy is "
"present, it must route that path to the XHTTP backend without accidentally "
"serving a normal website response instead."
msgstr ""
"客户端与服务端需要兼容的 path 处理方式。如果链路中有反向代理，它必须把该 "
