#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Use a deliberate path and document it. Do not reuse a sensitive application "
"endpoint merely to make the traffic appear more realistic."
msgstr ""
"应明确选择并记录 path。不要仅为了让流量看起来更真实，就复用敏感应用端点。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`host` can participate in virtual-host routing through Nginx, Caddy, a CDN, "
"or another HTTP-aware frontend."
msgstr ""
"`host` 可以参与 Nginx、Caddy、CDN 或其他支持 HTTP 的前端的虚拟主机路由。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"When a reverse proxy chooses an upstream based on `Host`, a missing or "
"mismatched value can produce a perfectly valid HTTP response from the wrong "
"virtual host, which may look like a proxy protocol failure."
msgstr ""
"当反向代理根据 `Host` 选择上游时，缺失或不匹配的值可能让错误虚拟主机返回一个"
"完全有效的 HTTP 响应，看起来就像代理协议失败。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"XHTTP has multiple transport modes in current Xray implementations. `auto` "
"is a reasonable baseline because it allows the core to choose compatible "
"behavior without forcing a specialized upload strategy."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 实现中的 XHTTP 有多种传输模式。`auto` 是合理的基线，因为它允许核心"
"选择兼容行为，而无需强制指定特殊上传策略。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Only force a specific mode when:"
msgstr "只有在以下条件满足时才建议强制指定模式："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "both client and server versions support it,"
msgstr "客户端和服务端版本都支持；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "the HTTP version/path is understood,"
msgstr "已经明确理解 HTTP 版本/path 行为；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"and you have a concrete reason such as CDN behavior or upstream limitations."
msgstr "并且存在 CDN 行为或上游限制等明确理由。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Mode tuning should come after basic connectivity."
msgstr "Mode 调优应放在基础连通性验证之后。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"For current Xray-core, `auto` has concrete selection behavior rather than "
"being a fourth wire mode. The client starts from `packet-up`; when REALITY "
"is used it selects `stream-one`, or `stream-up` when REALITY is combined "
"with `downloadSettings`. Treat this as an implementation policy that can "
"evolve, not as a protocol constant that every XHTTP implementation must copy."
msgstr ""
"在当前 Xray-core 中，`auto` 有明确的选择逻辑，而不是第四种线级模式。客户端从 "
"`packet-up` 起步；使用 REALITY 时会选择 `stream-one`，若 REALITY 同时配置 "
"`downloadSettings` 则选择 `stream-up`。这应被视为可能演进的实现策略，而不是所"
"有 XHTTP 实现都必须照搬的协议常量。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Wire-Level Session Model"
msgstr "线级会话模型"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"XHTTP is unusual compared with SOCKS5 because the transport itself does not "
"carry a single fixed binary `CONNECT` request. The proxy protocol (for "
"example VLESS) produces an ordered byte stream, and XHTTP maps that byte "
"stream onto one or more HTTP requests and responses."
msgstr ""
"与 SOCKS5 相比，XHTTP 的特殊之处在于传输层本身并不承载一个固定的二进制 "
"`CONNECT` 请求。代理协议（例如 VLESS）产生有序字节流，而 XHTTP 将该字节流映射"
"到一个或多个 HTTP 请求与响应。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"At the server, current Xray-core reconstructs a connection roughly as "
"follows:"
msgstr "在服务端，当前 Xray-core 大致按以下方式重建一条连接："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"This distinction is fundamental: a VLESS request header can be split across "
"multiple XHTTP upload requests. Conversely, one HTTP upload request can "
"contain the VLESS header plus application payload. The proxy parser "
"therefore must not use HTTP request boundaries as proxy-message boundaries."
msgstr ""
"这一区分非常关键：一个 VLESS 请求头可以跨多个 XHTTP 上传请求；反过来，一个 "
"HTTP 上传请求也可以同时包含 VLESS 头与应用 payload。因此代理协议解析器绝不能"
"把 HTTP 请求边界当作代理消息边界。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Session creation and lifetime"
msgstr "会话创建与生命周期"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"For split modes, current Xray-core indexes server-side state by a Session "
"ID. The first request that references an unknown Session ID creates an "
"`httpSession` containing an upload queue. A newly created session has a 30-"
"second provisional lifetime while the downlink side has not connected. Once "
"the downlink GET is established, that provisional reap is cancelled; the "
"session then lives with the downlink request and is deleted when that "
"request finishes."
msgstr ""
"在 split 模式下，当前 Xray-core 以 Session ID 索引服务端状态。首次引用未知 "
"Session ID 的请求会创建一个包含上传队列的 `httpSession`。在下行尚未接入时，新"
"会话具有 30 秒的临时生命周期；一旦建立下行 GET，这个临时回收计时就会取消，此"
"后会话与下行请求共存，并在该请求结束时删除。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The Session ID is therefore an XHTTP transport identifier. It is not the "
"VLESS UUID, not a SOCKS5 authentication identity, and not the destination "
"address."
msgstr ""
"因此，Session ID 是 XHTTP 传输标识符。它不是 VLESS UUID，不是 SOCKS5 认证身"
"份，也不是目标地址。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Session ID and sequence placement"
msgstr "Session ID 与序号的放置位置"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Older XHTTP examples make the split-session URL look structurally fixed, for "
"example `/path/<session>/<seq>`. Current Xray-core no longer requires that "
"layout. `sessionIDPlacement` and `seqPlacement` independently accept:"
msgstr ""
"较旧的 XHTTP 示例会让 split 会话 URL 看起来具有固定结构，例如 `/path/"
"<session>/<seq>`。当前 Xray-core 已不再要求这种布局。`sessionIDPlacement` 与 "
"`seqPlacement` 可分别接受："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The defaults remain `path`. For non-path placement, the implementation uses "
"configurable keys; current defaults are:"
msgstr ""
"默认仍为 `path`。对于非 path placement，实现使用可配置 key；当前默认值为："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The same packet-up logical request can therefore appear in several "
"equivalent HTTP shapes:"
msgstr "因此，同一个 packet-up 逻辑请求可以表现为多种等价的 HTTP 形态："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The server reverses exactly the configured placement before looking up the "
"session and parsing the sequence number. Packet-capture tooling should "
"therefore extract **semantics from configuration**, not hard-code a path "
"regular expression."
msgstr ""
"服务端会严格按照配置的 placement 反向提取元数据，然后查找会话并解析序号。因此"
"抓包工具应从**配置中获取语义**，而不能把某个 path 正则表达式硬编码为协议格"
"式。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray can also generate Session IDs from a configurable ASCII "
"character table and length range (`sessionIDTable` / `sessionIDLength`). If "
"that mechanism is not configured, the implementation falls back to a UUID "
"string. The config builder rejects a custom table/length combination whose "
"total identifier space is too small, rejects non-ASCII tables, and requires "
"a positive lower length bound. This is an anti-collision/resource-isolation "
"property, not proxy-user authentication."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 还可以根据可配置的 ASCII 字符表与长度范围（`sessionIDTable` / "
"`sessionIDLength`）生成 Session ID。若未配置该机制，实现会回退为 UUID 字符"
"串。配置构建器会拒绝总标识空间过小的自定义字符表/长度组合、拒绝非 ASCII 字符"
"表，并要求长度下限为正值。这属于防碰撞与资源隔离属性，而不是代理用户认证。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Current Transport Modes"
msgstr "当前传输模式"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Current Xray-core distinguishes three important data-shaping models."
msgstr "当前 Xray-core 区分三种重要的数据整形模型。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "`stream-one`"
msgstr "`stream-one`"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`stream-one` keeps uplink and downlink on one HTTP exchange. There is no "
"split Session ID in the normal path: the request body is the reconstructed "
"upstream reader and the response body is the downstream writer."
msgstr ""
"`stream-one` 将上行与下行保持在同一次 HTTP 交换中。正常路径没有 split "
"Session ID：请求正文作为重建后的上行 reader，响应正文作为下行 writer。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"This is the closest XHTTP mode to a conventional full-duplex stream, "
"although actual duplex behavior still depends on the HTTP version and "
"intermediaries."
msgstr ""
"这是 XHTTP 中最接近传统全双工字节流的模式，但实际双工行为仍取决于 HTTP 版本和"
"中间节点。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "`stream-up`"
msgstr "`stream-up`"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`stream-up` separates a long-lived upload request from the downlink request. "
"The upload request body is pushed into the session's upload queue as a "
"reader, while a GET-like downlink response carries server-to-client bytes."
msgstr ""
"`stream-up` 将长连接式上传请求与下行请求分离。上传请求正文作为 reader 推入会"
"话上传队列，而类似 GET 的下行响应承载服务端到客户端的字节。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The server currently rejects a split streaming upload when an explicitly "
"configured mode does not permit `stream-up`."
msgstr ""
"当显式配置的模式不允许 `stream-up` 时，当前服务端会拒绝 split streaming "
"upload。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "`packet-up`"
msgstr "`packet-up`"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`packet-up` slices upstream bytes into independently delivered HTTP "
"requests. Each upload carries the Session ID plus a sequence number. The "
"server parses the sequence number as an unsigned integer and inserts the "
"payload into the session's upload queue, which is responsible for restoring "
"byte-stream order."
msgstr ""
"`packet-up` 将上行字节切分成独立交付的 HTTP 请求。每个上传请求携带 Session "
"ID 和序号。服务端把序号解析为无符号整数，并将 payload 插入会话上传队列，由该"
"队列恢复字节流顺序。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The important implementation consequence is that HTTP request completion "
"order need not be the proxy-stream order. Sequence metadata, not arrival "
"order, is the ordering authority."
msgstr ""
"一个重要的实现结论是：HTTP 请求完成顺序不必等于代理字节流顺序。决定排序的是序"
"号元数据，而不是到达先后。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Upload Data Placement"
msgstr "上行数据放置方式"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"In current Xray-core, packet-style uplink data can be transported in the "
"HTTP body, encoded into numbered HTTP headers, or encoded into numbered "
"cookies. `uplinkDataPlacement` accepts `auto`, `body`, `header`, and "
"`cookie`; header and cookie placement are valid only for `packet-up`. The "
"default normalized data path is the request body."
msgstr ""
"在当前 Xray-core 中，packet 风格上行数据可以放在 HTTP body 中，也可以编码进带"
"编号的 HTTP header 或 cookie。`uplinkDataPlacement` 接受 `auto`、`body`、"
"`header` 和 `cookie`；header 与 cookie placement 只对 `packet-up` 有效。规范"
"化后的默认数据路径是请求正文。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Header and cookie forms use **unpadded URL-safe Base64** before the server "
"restores the original bytes. One logical packet can be split across multiple "
"metadata fields. With a configured key such as `X-Data`, headers are "
"numbered:"
msgstr ""
"header 与 cookie 形式会先使用**无填充 URL-safe Base64** 编码，再由服务端恢复"
"原始字节。一个逻辑数据包可以拆分到多个元数据字段中。以配置 key `X-Data` 为"
"例，header 会按编号排列："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Cookie placement similarly uses names such as:"
msgstr "cookie placement 同样会使用类似下面的名称："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`uplinkChunkSize` controls the encoded chunk sizes. Current defaults are "
"sized differently for cookies and headers (roughly 2--3 KiB for cookies and "
"3--4 KB for headers), while body placement follows the normal packet-upload "
"size. The server's normalized maximum aggregate HTTP-header budget is 8192 "
"bytes unless `serverMaxHeaderBytes` overrides it. These limits are important "
"when a CDN or reverse proxy imposes a smaller header/cookie ceiling than "
"Xray itself."
msgstr ""
"`uplinkChunkSize` 控制编码后的分块大小。当前 cookie 与 header 使用不同默认范"
"围（cookie 约 2--3 KiB，header 约 3--4 KB），而 body placement 遵循普通 "
"packet upload 大小。除非由 `serverMaxHeaderBytes` 覆盖，服务端规范化后的 "
"HTTP header 总预算上限为 8192 字节。当 CDN 或反向代理的 header/cookie 上限比 "
"Xray 更小时，这些限制尤其重要。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The HTTP method is configurable through `uplinkHTTPMethod` and defaults to "
"`POST`. Current Xray permits `GET` only for `packet-up`, because the other "
"modes need streaming request-body semantics."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 方法可通过 `uplinkHTTPMethod` 配置，默认是 `POST`。当前 Xray 只允许 "
"`packet-up` 使用 `GET`，因为其他模式需要流式请求正文语义。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"This means a packet capture may show an apparently empty POST or GET while "
"the actual proxy bytes are carried in headers or cookies. Troubleshooting "
"should inspect `uplinkDataPlacement`, its key, chunk size, and the HTTP "
"method rather than assuming that all upstream data is in the HTTP body."
msgstr ""
"这意味着抓包中可能出现看似空的 POST 或 GET，而真实代理字节其实位于 header 或 "
"cookie 中。排障时应检查 `uplinkDataPlacement`、对应 key、分块大小与 HTTP 方"
"法，而不能假设所有上行数据都在 HTTP body。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The server also enforces configured upload and metadata limits. Oversized "
"request bodies can be rejected with HTTP `413 Request Entity Too Large`; "
"malformed encoded header/cookie data is rejected as a bad request."
msgstr ""
"服务端还会执行已配置的上传与元数据限制。过大的请求正文可能以 HTTP `413 "
"Request Entity Too Large` 拒绝；畸形的 header/cookie 编码数据会按 bad "
"request 拒绝。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "XPadding Placement and Obfuscation"
msgstr "XPadding 放置与混淆"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"XHTTP adds padding to vary request/response shape independently of the inner "
"proxy bytes. In current Xray, default normalized `xPaddingBytes` is "
"100--1000. Without obfuscation mode, the implementation uses a predictable "
"compatibility form: an `x_padding` query parameter embedded in the `Referer` "
"URL."
msgstr ""
"XHTTP 会加入 padding，以独立于内层代理字节改变请求/响应形态。在当前 Xray 中，"
"规范化后的默认 `xPaddingBytes` 为 100--1000。未开启混淆模式时，实现使用可预测"
"的兼容形式：把 `x_padding` 查询参数嵌入 `Referer` URL。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "With `xPaddingObfsMode` enabled, the placement becomes configurable:"
msgstr "开启 `xPaddingObfsMode` 后，placement 可以配置为："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`queryInHeader` means the padding is a query parameter inside a URL-valued "
"HTTP header; `xPaddingHeader` selects that header and `xPaddingKey` selects "
"the query key. The implementation can generate padding using:"
msgstr ""
"`queryInHeader` 表示 padding 是某个 URL 型 HTTP header 内的查询参数；"
"`xPaddingHeader` 选择该 header，`xPaddingKey` 选择查询 key。实现可以用以下方"
"式生成 padding："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "`repeat-x`: repeated `X` bytes, or"
msgstr "`repeat-x`：重复的 `X` 字节；或"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`tokenish`: randomized Base62-looking text whose HPACK/QPACK Huffman-encoded "
"length is adjusted toward the configured target."
msgstr ""
"`tokenish`：随机生成类似 Base62 的文本，并把其 HPACK/QPACK Huffman 编码长度调"
"整到接近配置目标。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"This matters at the wire level because HTTP/2 HPACK and HTTP/3 QPACK "
"compress header values. Counting source string characters is not necessarily "
"the same as counting compressed bytes. Current `tokenish` validation "
"explicitly measures HPACK Huffman length (with a small tolerance), while "
"`repeat-x` is chosen so its characters have a stable 8-bit Huffman code in "
"the shared HPACK/QPACK table."
msgstr ""
"在线级上这很重要，因为 HTTP/2 HPACK 与 HTTP/3 QPACK 会压缩 header value。源字"
"符串字符数并不必然等于压缩后的字节数。当前 `tokenish` 校验会显式测量 HPACK "
"Huffman 长度（允许小范围误差），而 `repeat-x` 选用的字符在 HPACK/QPACK 共享表"
"中具有稳定的 8 位 Huffman 编码。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Padding is camouflage/traffic-shaping metadata, **not authentication and not "
"cryptographic padding for VLESS payload security**. A server that requires "
"the configured padding shape validates it before accepting the request. A "
"mismatch can therefore fail at XHTTP with HTTP-level errors before VLESS "
"sees a UUID."
msgstr ""
"Padding 是伪装/流量整形元数据，**既不是认证，也不是用于保护 VLESS payload 的"
"密码学 padding**。要求特定 padding 形态的服务端会在接受请求前验证它。因此不匹"
"配可能直接在 XHTTP 层以 HTTP 错误失败，甚至早于 VLESS 看到 UUID。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Server Request State Machine"
msgstr "服务端请求状态机"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "A useful implementation-oriented server state machine is:"
msgstr "一个面向实现的服务端状态机可以表示为："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"A `404`, `400`, `409`, `413`, or `405` seen at this layer is therefore an "
"XHTTP transport/routing failure and should be diagnosed before changing the "
"VLESS UUID or destination command."
msgstr ""
"因此，在这一层看到 `404`、`400`、`409`、`413` 或 `405` 都意味着 XHTTP 传输/路"
"由故障，应先定位这一层，再去修改 VLESS UUID 或目标命令。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Downlink Flow and Buffering"
msgstr "下行流与缓冲"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"For the downlink response, current Xray-core writes `200 OK`, flushes the "
"response, and then writes proxy bytes to the HTTP response body. It also "
"sets `Cache-Control: no-store` and `X-Accel-Buffering: no`; unless disabled, "
"it uses an SSE-like `Content-Type` to discourage HTTP middleboxes from "
"buffering the stream."
msgstr ""
"对于下行响应，当前 Xray-core 写入 `200 OK` 后立即 flush，再把代理字节写入 "
"HTTP 响应正文。同时设置 `Cache-Control: no-store` 与 `X-Accel-Buffering: "
"no`；除非显式禁用，还会使用类似 SSE 的 `Content-Type`，以减少 HTTP 中间节点缓"
"冲数据流的可能。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"This is operationally important. A reverse proxy can accept every request "
"and still break XHTTP if it buffers the response body instead of forwarding "
"chunks promptly. In that case authentication and routing may be correct "
"while latency or apparent stalls occur at the HTTP transport layer."
msgstr ""
"这一点在实际运行中很重要。反向代理即使接受所有请求，只要缓冲响应正文而不是及"
"时转发分块，仍然可能破坏 XHTTP。此时认证与路由可能完全正确，但延迟或表面卡顿"
"发生在 HTTP 传输层。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "`downloadSettings`: separate physical downlink"
msgstr "`downloadSettings`：独立的物理下行路径"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray can construct the downlink side from a second `StreamConfig` "
"via `downloadSettings`. The client creates the normal XHTTP logical Session "
"ID, but the downlink request can then dial a **different destination, Host, "
"security configuration, XHTTP path, HTTP version, and HTTP connection pool** "
"from the uplink. The code explicitly logs this as a `stream-down` path and "
"creates a second HTTP/XMUX client when necessary."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 可以通过 `downloadSettings` 使用第二个 `StreamConfig` 构造下行侧。"
"客户端仍会创建普通 XHTTP 逻辑 Session ID，但下行请求随后可以拨号到与上行**不"
"同的目标、Host、安全配置、XHTTP path、HTTP 版本以及 HTTP 连接池**。代码会明确"
"把这一路径记录为 `stream-down`，并在需要时创建第二个 HTTP/XMUX 客户端。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The Session ID is the correlation point at the XHTTP server; it does not "
"imply that both directions use the same TCP connection, QUIC connection, IP "
"family, CDN edge, TLS/REALITY settings, or even HTTP version. A capture "
"taken on only one network path may therefore contain only half of a "
"logically healthy XHTTP session."
msgstr ""
"Session ID 是 XHTTP 服务端进行关联的锚点；它并不意味着两个方向使用同一条 TCP "
"连接、QUIC 连接、同一 IP 族、CDN edge、TLS/REALITY 设置，甚至不保证使用相同 "
"HTTP 版本。因此，只在一条网络路径上抓包时，完全可能只看到一个逻辑上健康 "
"XHTTP 会话的一半。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"This is an **extra transport layer** compared with SOCKS5. SOCKS5 `CONNECT` "
"turns one established TCP control connection into the relay; it has no "
"standard mechanism for routing the two byte-stream directions through "
"independently configured HTTP transports."
msgstr ""
"与 SOCKS5 相比，这是一个**额外的传输层能力**。SOCKS5 `CONNECT` 会把已经建立"
"的 TCP 控制连接转变为中继；它没有标准机制让字节流的两个方向分别通过独立配置"
"的 HTTP 传输路径。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2, and HTTP/3 Boundaries"
msgstr "HTTP/1.1、HTTP/2 与 HTTP/3 边界"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "XHTTP's logical session is above the HTTP transport version:"
msgstr "XHTTP 逻辑会话位于具体 HTTP 传输版本之上："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The current server supports HTTP/1.1 and unencrypted HTTP/2 on its TCP-side "
"HTTP server; when configured for HTTP/3 it listens on UDP/QUIC and serves "
"HTTP/3. TLS or REALITY can wrap the TCP-side listener according to stream "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"当前服务端在 TCP 侧 HTTP server 上支持 HTTP/1.1 与未加密 HTTP/2；配置为 HTTP/"
"3 时则在 UDP/QUIC 上监听并提供 HTTP/3。TCP 侧 listener 可以按 stream "
"settings 由 TLS 或 REALITY 包装。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Do not confuse HTTP multiplexing with XHTTP/XMUX logical multiplexing. HTTP/"
"2 and HTTP/3 can multiplex HTTP requests on one underlying connection; XHTTP "
"still has to correlate those requests into the correct reconstructed proxy "
"stream."
msgstr ""
"不要把 HTTP 多路复用与 XHTTP/XMUX 逻辑多路复用混为一谈。HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3 可以"
"在一条底层连接上复用 HTTP 请求；XHTTP 仍必须把这些请求关联到正确的重建代理字"
"节流。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "With TLS, a normal capture primarily exposes:"
msgstr "使用 TLS 时，普通抓包主要会暴露："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "For HTTP/3:"
msgstr "对于 HTTP/3："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "After TLS/QUIC decryption, debugging proceeds from the outside inward:"
msgstr "完成 TLS/QUIC 解密后，调试应从外向内进行："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "identify the HTTP request, method, Host, and base path,"
msgstr "识别 HTTP 请求、方法、Host 与基础 path；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"identify where Session ID and sequence metadata are configured to live "
"(`path`, `query`, `header`, or `cookie`),"
msgstr ""
"确认 Session ID 与序号元数据配置在何处（`path`、`query`、`header` 或 "
"`cookie`）；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"identify and validate XPadding placement separately from session metadata,"
msgstr "把 XPadding placement 与会话元数据分开识别和验证；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"determine whether packet-up data is in body/header/cookie and Base64-decode "
"metadata placement when required,"
msgstr ""
"确认 packet-up 数据位于 body/header/cookie 中的哪一处，并在需要时对元数据 "
"placement 做 Base64 解码；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "reconstruct XHTTP upload ordering,"
msgstr "重建 XHTTP 上传顺序；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "correlate a separately configured `downloadSettings` path if present,"
msgstr "若存在独立配置的 `downloadSettings` 路径，将其关联起来；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "only then parse the inner VLESS/Trojan bytes."
msgstr "最后才解析内层 VLESS/Trojan 字节。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"A single HTTP request is not necessarily a single proxy request, and a "
"single proxy request is not necessarily contained in one HTTP request."
msgstr ""
"一个 HTTP 请求不一定等于一个代理请求，一个代理请求也不一定完整包含在一个 "
"HTTP 请求中。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md src/transports/grpc-transport.md
#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "Proxy-Protocol Boundary"
msgstr "代理协议成功"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"XHTTP is not a replacement for a SOCKS5 or VLESS proxy handshake. It "
"reconstructs and delivers a byte stream to an inner proxy handler; that "
"handler owns client identity, destination address, and TCP/UDP semantics. "
"See [SOCKS5](../protocols/socks5.md) and [VLESS](../protocols/vless.md) for "
"those protocol-level messages."
msgstr ""

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"An XHTTP HTTP `200` confirms only that the transport request was accepted. "
"It does **not** confirm inner proxy authentication or destination "
"acceptance. Likewise, XHTTP session IDs, ordering metadata, and XPadding are "
"transport fields rather than proxy users, commands, or encryption keys."
msgstr ""

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Ordering, Flow Control, and Backpressure"
msgstr "排序、流控与背压"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "There are several independent flow-control domains:"
msgstr "这里存在多个彼此独立的流控域："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "the application/proxy byte stream,"
msgstr "应用/代理字节流；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "the XHTTP per-session upload queue,"
msgstr "XHTTP 每会话上传队列；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "HTTP request/stream flow control,"
msgstr "HTTP 请求/Stream 流控；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "TCP flow control for HTTP/1.1 or HTTP/2,"
msgstr "HTTP/1.1 或 HTTP/2 下的 TCP 流控；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "QUIC stream/connection flow control for HTTP/3,"
msgstr "HTTP/3 下的 QUIC Stream/连接流控；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "reverse-proxy/CDN buffering and request limits."
msgstr "反向代理/CDN 缓冲与请求限制。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"A stall can occur in any one of these domains. Increasing XMUX concurrency "
"does not fix a full server upload queue, and increasing HTTP/2 stream "
"concurrency does not fix a reverse proxy that buffers the downlink."
msgstr ""
"任意一个流控域都可能造成停顿。提高 XMUX 并发无法修复已经占满的服务端上传队"
"列，提高 HTTP/2 Stream 并发也无法修复会缓冲下行的反向代理。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"For packet uploads, bound the number and total size of buffered out-of-order "
"requests. Otherwise a peer that sends high sequence numbers while "
"withholding earlier chunks can consume memory without allowing the "
"reconstructed stream to advance."
msgstr ""
"对于 packet upload，应限制乱序请求的缓冲数量与总大小。否则，对端可以持续发送"
"较大的序号、同时扣住较早分块，从而消耗内存却不让重建字节流向前推进。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Close and Error Semantics"
msgstr "关闭与错误语义"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"XHTTP does not have one universal binary close command comparable to an "
"imaginary SOCKS `CLOSE` command (base SOCKS5 has none either). Lifetime is "
"expressed through the participating HTTP requests and underlying transport:"
msgstr ""
"XHTTP 没有统一的二进制关闭命令，也不存在可类比的 SOCKS `CLOSE`（基础 SOCKS5 "
"本身也没有）。生命周期由参与会话的 HTTP 请求与底层传输共同表达："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "ending the downlink request tears down the associated split session,"
msgstr "下行请求结束会拆除关联的 split 会话；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "cancelling a streaming upload ends that upload reader,"
msgstr "取消 streaming upload 会结束对应上传 reader；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"HTTP error responses reject malformed or incompatible transport requests,"
msgstr "HTTP 错误响应用于拒绝畸形或不兼容的传输请求；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"TCP FIN/RST, HTTP/2 stream reset, or QUIC/HTTP/3 stream/connection errors "
"can terminate individual transport paths,"
msgstr ""
"TCP FIN/RST、HTTP/2 Stream reset，或 QUIC/HTTP/3 Stream/连接错误都可能终止单"
"个传输路径；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"the inner proxy protocol may independently observe EOF/reset after XHTTP "
"reconstruction."
msgstr "XHTTP 重建后，内层代理协议还可能独立观察到 EOF/reset。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"When diagnosing closure, record **which layer closed first**. An HTTP `413` "
"is not a VLESS destination error; a QUIC connection close is not an XHTTP "
"sequence error; and a VLESS parser rejection is not necessarily an HTTP "
"routing error."
msgstr ""
"诊断关闭问题时，应记录**最先关闭的是哪一层**。HTTP `413` 不是 VLESS 目标错"
"误；QUIC connection close 不是 XHTTP 序号错误；VLESS 解析器拒绝也不一定是 "
"HTTP 路由错误。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "A robust XHTTP implementation should explicitly test:"
msgstr "健壮的 XHTTP 实现应显式测试："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Host and path mismatch handling,"
msgstr "Host 与 path 不匹配的处理；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "split Session ID creation and cleanup,"
msgstr "split Session ID 的创建与清理；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "provisional sessions that never obtain a downlink,"
msgstr "始终未获得下行连接的临时会话；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "duplicate, missing, delayed, and out-of-order packet sequence values,"
msgstr "重复、缺失、延迟和乱序的数据包序号；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "every supported Session ID / sequence placement and custom key,"
msgstr "每一种受支持的 Session ID / 序号 placement 与自定义 key；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "custom Session ID table/length entropy and collision handling,"
msgstr "自定义 Session ID 字符表/长度的熵与碰撞处理；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"body/header/cookie upload placement, chunk ordering, and Base64 decode "
"failures,"
msgstr "body/header/cookie 上传 placement、分块顺序以及 Base64 解码失败；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "configured body/header/chunk-size ceilings,"
msgstr "已配置的 body/header/chunk-size 上限；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"XPadding placement, method, compressed-length validation, and obfuscation "
"mode,"
msgstr "XPadding placement、method、压缩长度校验与混淆模式；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "allowed HTTP methods, especially GET restricted to packet-up,"
msgstr "允许的 HTTP 方法，尤其是仅限 packet-up 的 GET；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "partial inner-protocol headers spanning multiple HTTP uploads,"
msgstr "跨多个 HTTP upload 的不完整内层协议头；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "one upload containing multiple inner-protocol reads worth of data,"
msgstr "单个 upload 同时包含足够多、可供内层协议多次读取的数据；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "downlink flushing through direct and reverse-proxied paths,"
msgstr "直连与反向代理路径中的下行 flush 行为；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`downloadSettings` where uplink and downlink use different physical paths,"
msgstr "上行与下行使用不同物理路径的 `downloadSettings`；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2, and HTTP/3 connection-loss behavior,"
msgstr "HTTP/1.1、HTTP/2 与 HTTP/3 的连接丢失行为；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "queue/backpressure limits under a slow inner proxy consumer,"
msgstr "内层代理消费者较慢时的队列/背压上限；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "TLS and REALITY combinations independently from XHTTP session logic."
msgstr "将 TLS 与 REALITY 组合和 XHTTP 会话逻辑分开测试。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "XMUX and Connection Reuse"
msgstr "XMUX 与连接复用"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"XHTTP can maintain pools of HTTP connections and reuse them for multiple "
"proxy requests. Current Xray code exposes settings such as maximum "
"concurrency, connection counts, request reuse limits, and connection "
"lifetime controls."
msgstr ""
"XHTTP 可以维护 HTTP 连接池，并为多个代理请求复用连接。当前 Xray 代码提供最大"
"并发数、连接数量、请求复用限制和连接生命周期等设置。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Tuning these values changes server load and traffic shape. More concurrency "
"is not always faster: it can increase connection churn, memory usage, and "
"pressure on reverse proxies or CDNs."
msgstr ""
"调整这些值会改变服务端负载和流量形态。更高并发并不总是更快，它可能增加连接频"
"繁创建/销毁、内存使用以及反向代理或 CDN 压力。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Start with implementation defaults, collect latency/throughput data, and "
"tune one dimension at a time."
msgstr "应从实现默认值开始，收集延迟/吞吐数据，再一次只调整一个维度。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Reverse Proxy and CDN Considerations"
msgstr "反向代理与 CDN 注意事项"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "When placing XHTTP behind Nginx, Caddy, or a CDN, check:"
msgstr "把 XHTTP 放在 Nginx、Caddy 或 CDN 后面时，应检查："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "TLS termination location,"
msgstr "TLS 终止位置；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 support,"
msgstr "HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3 支持；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "request and response buffering,"
msgstr "请求与响应缓冲；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "maximum request body sizes,"
msgstr "最大请求体大小；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "idle and upstream timeouts,"
msgstr "空闲与上游超时；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "path rewriting,"
msgstr "path 重写；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Host/SNI routing,"
msgstr "Host/SNI 路由；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "and whether the provider permits the connection pattern."
msgstr "以及服务提供方是否允许这种连接模式。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"A connection that works directly against Xray but fails behind a reverse "
"proxy usually indicates an HTTP routing or timeout mismatch rather than a "
"VLESS user problem."
msgstr ""
"如果直连 Xray 时正常、放到反向代理后失败，通常说明 HTTP 路由或超时配置不匹"
"配，而不是 VLESS 用户身份问题。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "XHTTP + REALITY"
msgstr "XHTTP + REALITY"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Current Xray transport documentation supports XHTTP with REALITY."
msgstr "当前 Xray 传输文档支持 XHTTP 与 REALITY 组合。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Keep the layers separate during diagnosis:"
msgstr "排障时应保持各层分开检查："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Is the TCP/QUIC path reachable?"
msgstr "TCP/QUIC 路径是否可达？"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Does REALITY authenticate correctly?"
msgstr "REALITY 是否正确完成认证？"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Does the XHTTP path/mode match?"
msgstr "XHTTP 的 path/mode 是否匹配？"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Does the proxy protocol user identity match?"
msgstr "代理协议用户身份是否匹配？"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Does the reverse proxy/CDN route the request correctly?"
msgstr "反向代理/CDN 是否正确路由请求？"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Changing all of these at once makes failures difficult to localize."
msgstr "同时修改这些层会让故障难以定位。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"HTTP-oriented transport behavior suitable for HTTP-aware infrastructure."
msgstr "面向 HTTP 的传输行为，适合支持 HTTP 的基础设施。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Can be combined with TLS or REALITY in current Xray versions."
msgstr "在当前 Xray 版本中可以与 TLS 或 REALITY 组合。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Supports connection reuse and multiplex-oriented tuning."
msgstr "支持连接复用和面向多路复用的调优。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Can be deployed directly or behind reverse-proxy/CDN layers when configured "
"correctly."
msgstr "配置正确时既可直接部署，也可放在反向代理/CDN 之后。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Gives operators more control over upload/download transport behavior than a "
"single raw stream."
msgstr "相比单一 raw stream，可以让运维人员更细致地控制上下行传输行为。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "More configuration surface than raw TCP."
msgstr "配置项比 raw TCP 更多。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Path, Host, mode, reverse-proxy, and security settings must align."
msgstr "Path、Host、mode、反向代理和安全设置必须相互一致。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Advanced tuning changes between Xray versions and implementations."
msgstr "高级调优项会随 Xray 版本和实现变化。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"CDN/reverse-proxy policies can break otherwise valid direct connections."
msgstr "CDN/反向代理策略可能破坏原本可以直连工作的配置。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Incorrect multiplex tuning can reduce rather than improve performance."
msgstr "错误的多路复用调优可能降低而不是提升性能。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Use TLS or REALITY on untrusted networks unless the selected architecture "
"has another deliberate security layer."
msgstr ""
"在不可信网络中应使用 TLS 或 REALITY，除非当前架构明确配置了其他安全层。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Keep TLS certificate verification enabled."
msgstr "保持 TLS 证书验证开启。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Do not place authentication secrets in custom HTTP headers unless the "
"protocol explicitly requires it and the operational implications are "
"understood."
msgstr ""
"除非协议明确要求并且已经理解其运维影响，否则不要把认证秘密放入自定义 HTTP 请"
"求头。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Treat reverse-proxy access logs as potentially sensitive because paths, "
"headers, and connection metadata may be recorded."
msgstr ""
"应把反向代理访问日志视为潜在敏感数据，因为其中可能记录 path、header 和连接元"
"数据。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Keep Xray/core versions patched; XHTTP evolves actively and old examples can "
"become misleading."
msgstr ""
"应及时更新 Xray/核心版本；XHTTP 仍在积极演进，旧示例可能逐渐失去参考价值。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"XHTTP is listed as a current client-core capability. The important "
"compatibility question is not only \"does XHTTP exist?\" but which proxy "
"protocol, mode, security layer, and option names are currently implemented. "
"Validate the exact combination before copying a Mihomo/Xray profile "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"XHTTP 当前被列为客户端核心能力。兼容性问题不只是“有没有 XHTTP”，还包括当前究"
"竟实现了哪些代理协议、mode、安全层和配置字段。不要直接原样复制 Mihomo/Xray 配"
"置，应先验证确切组合。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Chimera can manage an XHTTP profile only through the schema accepted by the "
"selected core. A GUI field being present does not prove that every XHTTP "
"mode or XMUX option is supported by that core."
msgstr ""
"Chimera 只能按照当前所选核心接受的 schema 管理 XHTTP 配置。GUI 中存在某个字"
"段，并不能证明该核心支持所有 XHTTP mode 或 XMUX 选项。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The server capability map includes XHTTP-related parsing/transport work. "
"Treat basic XHTTP connectivity, TLS, REALITY, reverse-proxy behavior, and "
"advanced XMUX/download settings as separate compatibility dimensions."
msgstr ""
"服务端能力地图包含 XHTTP 相关解析/传输实现。应把基础 XHTTP 连通性、TLS、"
"REALITY、反向代理行为和高级 XMUX/download 设置视为彼此独立的兼容性维度。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"The Server has dedicated ignored Xray/Chimera XHTTP matrices rather than one "
"single happy-path test:"
msgstr ""
"Server 为 Xray/Chimera XHTTP 提供了专门的 ignored 测试矩阵，而非只有一个正向"
"用例："

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`xhttp_matrix_e2e.rs` covers transport modes, uplink methods, session/"
"sequence placement, data placement, padding, and selected header variants;"
msgstr ""
"`xhttp_matrix_e2e.rs` 覆盖传输模式、上行方式、会话/序列位置、数据位置、填充以"
"及部分请求头变体；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`xhttp_security_matrix_e2e.rs` covers none/TLS/REALITY security wrappers;"
msgstr "`xhttp_security_matrix_e2e.rs` 覆盖 none/TLS/REALITY 安全封装；"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`xhttp_protocol_matrix_e2e.rs` covers process-level behavior and negative "
"cases such as host/path rejection, padding validation, sequencing, body-size "
"limits, duplicate stream-up, and mode conflicts."
msgstr ""
"`xhttp_protocol_matrix_e2e.rs` 覆盖进程级行为及多种负向场景，例如拒绝不匹配"
"的 host/path、填充校验、序列处理、请求体大小限制、重复的 stream-up 和模式冲"
"突。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"These tests are the basis for the interoperability claims on this page. They "
"do not make rejected Xray-shaped fields implemented; keep the explicit field "
"boundaries in the implementation-status table and this page. See [Test "
"Evidence and Interoperability Matrix](../test-evidence.md)."
msgstr ""
"本页的互操作性结论以这些测试为依据。但这不意味着已实现被拒绝的 Xray 格式字"
"段；实现状态表和本页仍应明确列出字段边界。详见[测试证据与互操作矩阵](../test-"
"evidence.md)。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Immediate EOF / disconnect"
msgstr "立即 EOF / 断开"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Verify proxy user identity first."
msgstr "先检查代理用户身份。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Check transport security (TLS/REALITY)."
msgstr "检查传输安全（TLS/REALITY）。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Verify `path` on both ends."
msgstr "检查两端的 `path`。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Check `mode` compatibility."
msgstr "检查 `mode` 兼容性。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Remove custom headers and XMUX tuning."
msgstr "移除自定义 headers 和 XMUX 调优。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Works directly but not through Nginx/CDN"
msgstr "直连正常但经过 Nginx/CDN 后失败"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Check path rewriting."
msgstr "检查 path 重写。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Verify Host and SNI routing."
msgstr "检查 Host 与 SNI 路由。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Increase/inspect upstream and idle timeouts."
msgstr "调整并检查上游与空闲超时。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Check request buffering/body-size limits."
msgstr "检查请求缓冲/请求体大小限制。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Confirm HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 support on every hop."
msgstr "确认链路每一跳都支持所需的 HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Handshake works but throughput is poor"
msgstr "握手正常但吞吐较差"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Return XMUX/tuning to defaults."
msgstr "把 XMUX/调优参数恢复为默认值。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Compare direct and reverse-proxied paths."
msgstr "对比直连与反向代理路径。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Measure RTT/loss to the actual CDN edge or server."
msgstr "测量到实际 CDN 边缘节点或服务端的 RTT/丢包。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid "Check connection churn and upstream limits."
msgstr "检查连接频繁重建以及上游限制。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Tune only after identifying whether the bottleneck is transport, server, or "
"provider policy."
msgstr "只有在确认瓶颈来自传输层、服务端还是服务提供方策略之后，再进行调优。"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Xray XHTTP transport page: <https://xtls.github.io/en/config/transports/"
"xhttp.html>"
msgstr ""
"Xray XHTTP 传输页面：<https://xtls.github.io/en/config/transports/xhttp.html>"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Xray current XHTTP configuration implementation: <https://github.com/XTLS/"
"Xray-core/blob/main/infra/conf/transport_method.go>"
msgstr ""
"Xray 当前 XHTTP 配置实现：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/infra/"
"conf/transport_method.go>"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Xray-core XHTTP request/session encoding: <https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/"
"blob/main/transport/internet/splithttp/config.go>"
msgstr ""
"Xray-core XHTTP 请求/会话编码：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/"
"transport/internet/splithttp/config.go>"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Xray-core XHTTP dialer and split-downlink behavior: <https://github.com/XTLS/"
"Xray-core/blob/main/transport/internet/splithttp/dialer.go>"
msgstr ""
"Xray-core XHTTP 拨号器与 split-downlink 行为：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-"
"core/blob/main/transport/internet/splithttp/dialer.go>"

#: src/transports/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Xray-core XPadding implementation: <https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/"
"main/transport/internet/splithttp/xpadding.go>"
msgstr ""
"Xray-core XPadding 实现：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/"
"transport/internet/splithttp/xpadding.go>"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "gRPC Transport"
msgstr "gRPC 传输"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The gRPC transport documented here is an Xray-style transport wrapper "
"implemented by `Chimera_Server`. It is not the server's management gRPC API "
"and it is not itself a proxy protocol. It turns a bidirectional byte stream "
"for an inner protocol into gRPC messages over HTTP/2-compatible HTTP "
"serving. This page covers the gRPC wrapper only: inner identity and "
"destination semantics belong to the [Proxy Protocol Reference](../"
"protocol.md), while TLS/REALITY handshakes belong to [Transport Security](../"
"transport-security.md)."
msgstr ""
"这里记录的 gRPC 传输是 `Chimera_Server` 实现的 Xray 风格传输封装。它不是服务"
"端的管理 gRPC API，本身也不是代理协议；它把内层协议的双向字节流封装成运行于兼"
"容 HTTP/2 服务上的 gRPC 消息。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The current `Chimera_Client` outbound tree does not contain a matching gRPC "
"transport module, so this page primarily documents Server behavior and the "
"Xray interoperability surface exercised by Server E2E tests."
msgstr ""
"当前 `Chimera_Client` 出站树中没有匹配的 gRPC 传输模块，因此本页主要记录 "
"Server 行为，以及 Server E2E 测试覆盖的 Xray 互操作范围。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"A successful HTTP/gRPC exchange only proves the transport wrapper. The inner "
"proxy protocol can still reject authentication, destination fields, flow "
"mode, or other protocol state afterward."
msgstr ""
"HTTP/gRPC 交换成功只证明传输封装正常；之后内层代理协议仍可能因为认证、目标字"
"段、flow 模式或其他协议状态而拒绝连接。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
