"These fields should therefore not all be labeled equally as implemented."
msgstr "因此不能把这些字段全部标成同等程度的“已实现”。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Security Wrappers"
msgstr "安全封装"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The gRPC transport can currently sit behind three Server security modes:"
msgstr "当前 gRPC 传输可以位于以下三种 Server 安全模式之后："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Current behavior"
msgstr "当前行为"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Plain"
msgstr "明文"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "HTTP connection directly on accepted TCP."
msgstr "直接在已接受的 TCP 上运行 HTTP 连接。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Server terminates TLS before HTTP/gRPC; `h2` is added to ALPN if absent."
msgstr "Server 在 HTTP/gRPC 之前终止 TLS；若 ALPN 中没有 `h2`，会自动加入。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Server accepts a REALITY stream before handing it to the HTTP/gRPC server."
msgstr "Server 先接受 REALITY 流，再把它交给 HTTP/gRPC server。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"For TLS, certificate and private key material are required. The transport "
"builder ensures `h2` is present in the ALPN list because normal gRPC "
"transport relies on HTTP/2 semantics."
msgstr ""
"使用 TLS 时必须提供证书与私钥材料。传输 builder 会确保 ALPN 列表包含 `h2`，因"
"为常规 gRPC 传输依赖 HTTP/2 语义。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "HTTP Request Requirements"
msgstr "HTTP 请求要求"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The current request handler accepts a request only when all three conditions "
"hold:"
msgstr "当前 request handler 只有在以下三个条件全部满足时才接受请求："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "method is `POST`;"
msgstr "method 为 `POST`；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "URI path is exactly `/<serviceName>/Tun`;"
msgstr "URI path 必须精确为 `/<serviceName>/Tun`；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "`Content-Type` begins with `application/grpc`."
msgstr "`Content-Type` 以 `application/grpc` 开头。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"A request that fails these checks receives an HTTP 200 response carrying:"
msgstr "未通过这些检查的请求会收到 HTTP 200 响应，其中携带："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"This is gRPC's error model: the HTTP status can remain 200 while the gRPC "
"status reports the application/transport error."
msgstr ""
"这是 gRPC 的错误模型：HTTP status 可以保持 200，而由 gRPC status 报告应用/传"
"输错误。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "gRPC Message Envelope"
msgstr "gRPC 消息封装"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Each gRPC message starts with the standard 5-byte message prefix used by "
"this implementation:"
msgstr "每条 gRPC 消息都以当前实现使用的标准 5 字节消息前缀开始："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "The current Server requires:"
msgstr "当前 Server 要求："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Any non-zero compressed flag is rejected. Compressed gRPC Hunk messages are "
"therefore not currently supported."
msgstr ""
"任何非零 compressed flag 都会被拒绝，因此当前不支持压缩的 gRPC Hunk 消息。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "The current maximum encoded gRPC message size is 4 MiB."
msgstr "当前编码后的 gRPC 消息最大为 4 MiB。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Hunk Protobuf Payload"
msgstr "Hunk Protobuf 负载"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Inside the 5-byte gRPC envelope, Chimera expects one small protobuf message "
"whose field 1 carries the raw tunnel bytes."
msgstr ""
"在 5 字节 gRPC 封装内部，Chimera 期望一个小型 protobuf 消息，其中 field 1 承"
"载原始隧道字节。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"For field 1 with wire type `length-delimited`, the first protobuf byte is:"
msgstr ""
"对于 wire type 为 `length-delimited` 的 field 1，首个 protobuf 字节为："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "followed by a protobuf varint length and then the raw data bytes:"
msgstr "随后是 protobuf varint 长度，再后面是原始数据字节："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The current decoder rejects messages that do not begin with field 1 tag "
"`0x0a`, contain an invalid varint, or truncate the declared payload."
msgstr ""
"当前 decoder 会拒绝未以 field 1 tag `0x0a` 开始、包含无效 varint 或声明负载被"
"截断的消息。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Full Upload Wire Shape"
msgstr "完整上行线格式"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Putting the layers together, one client-to-server Hunk looks like:"
msgstr "把各层组合起来，一条客户端到服务端的 Hunk 形态如下："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"HTTP/2 can split these bytes across DATA frames. The current decoder buffers "
"body fragments until a complete gRPC message is available, so an HTTP/2 "
"frame boundary is not a gRPC Hunk boundary."
msgstr ""
"HTTP/2 可以把这些字节拆分到多个 DATA frame。当前 decoder 会缓存 body 片段直到"
"形成完整 gRPC 消息，因此 HTTP/2 frame 边界不等于 gRPC Hunk 边界。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Upload Stream to Inner Protocol"
msgstr "上行流到内层协议"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "The request body decoder performs this transformation:"
msgstr "request body decoder 执行以下转换："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"When the HTTP request body ends, the write side of the logical byte stream "
"is shut down. If unconsumed partial gRPC bytes remain, the decoder reports a "
"truncated gRPC message."
msgstr ""
"HTTP request body 结束时，逻辑字节流的写方向会关闭。如果还残留未消费的不完整 "
"gRPC 字节，decoder 会报告 gRPC 消息被截断。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Download / Response Stream"
msgstr "下行 / 响应流"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The inner protocol writes raw response bytes into the other side of the "
"duplex pipe. The transport wraps every non-empty read chunk as:"
msgstr ""
"内层协议把原始响应字节写入 duplex pipe 的另一端；传输层会把每个非空读取块封装"
"为："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"After the logical response stream ends, the Server emits response trailers "
"with:"
msgstr "逻辑响应流结束后，Server 会发送包含以下内容的 response trailer："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "The normal response headers include:"
msgstr "正常 response header 包括："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Single-stream Model"
msgstr "单流模型"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The current Server rejects `grpcSettings.multiMode = true`. The implemented "
"path maps one accepted gRPC request to one logical duplex byte stream and "
"one inner proxy handler invocation."
msgstr ""
"当前 Server 会拒绝 `grpcSettings.multiMode = true`。已实现路径把一个被接受的 "
"gRPC 请求映射为一条逻辑双向字节流和一次内层代理 handler 调用。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Do not infer Xray gRPC multi-mode parity from HTTP/2's own multiplexing "
"capability. HTTP/2 can multiplex requests at the transport layer, but the "
"currently implemented Chimera configuration/runtime model deliberately "
"supports the single-stream gRPC mode documented here."
msgstr ""
"不能因为 HTTP/2 本身有多路复用能力，就推断 Chimera 已与 Xray gRPC multi-mode "
"对齐。HTTP/2 可以在传输层复用请求，但当前 Chimera 配置/运行时模型明确只支持本"
"页记录的单流 gRPC 模式。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Flow Control"
msgstr "流量控制"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "There are multiple independent buffering/flow-control layers:"
msgstr "这里存在多个相互独立的缓冲/流控层："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "TCP flow control;"
msgstr "TCP 流量控制；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "HTTP/2 connection and stream flow control;"
msgstr "HTTP/2 连接与 stream 流量控制；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "HTTP body backpressure;"
msgstr "HTTP body 背压；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "the current 64 KiB in-process duplex pipe;"
msgstr "当前 64 KiB 的进程内 duplex pipe；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "inner protocol buffering and target TCP flow control."
msgstr "内层协议缓冲与目标 TCP 流量控制。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The parsed `initialWindowsSize` field is not currently applied by Chimera "
"Server, so users should not assume that setting changes the active HTTP/2 "
"window in the current implementation."
msgstr ""
"已解析的 `initialWindowsSize` 字段目前不会被 Chimera Server 应用，因此不能假"
"设该设置会改变当前实现实际使用的 HTTP/2 window。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Close and Error Behavior"
msgstr "关闭与错误行为"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Important failure points include:"
msgstr "重要失败点包括："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "TLS/REALITY handshake failure before HTTP;"
msgstr "HTTP 之前 TLS/REALITY 握手失败；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "wrong HTTP method/path/content type;"
msgstr "HTTP method/path/content type 错误；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "compressed gRPC message flag;"
msgstr "gRPC 消息 compressed flag 非零；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "message larger than 4 MiB;"
msgstr "消息大于 4 MiB；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "malformed/truncated Hunk protobuf;"
msgstr "Hunk protobuf 格式错误或被截断；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "truncated request body;"
msgstr "request body 被截断；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "inner proxy protocol failure;"
msgstr "内层代理协议失败；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "target forwarding failure."
msgstr "目标转发失败。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Transport validation errors can appear as gRPC status responses or as "
"connection/log errors depending on where failure occurs. Inner protocol "
"errors happen after the gRPC byte stream has already been established and "
"should be debugged separately."
msgstr ""
"传输验证错误会根据失败位置表现为 gRPC status 响应或连接/日志错误。内层协议错"
"误发生在 gRPC 字节流已经建立之后，应单独排查。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"With plain gRPC transport, a capture can show HTTP/2/gRPC metadata and "
"traffic sizes. With TLS or REALITY, those details are encrypted after the "
"outer security handshake."
msgstr ""
"使用明文 gRPC 传输时，抓包可以看到 HTTP/2/gRPC 元数据和流量大小；使用 TLS 或 "
"REALITY 时，这些细节会在外层安全握手之后被加密。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "After decrypting HTTP/2 DATA, useful anchors are:"
msgstr "解密 HTTP/2 DATA 后，有用的锚点包括："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The raw bytes after the Hunk protobuf belong to the inner protocol. For "
"example, VLESS parsing begins only after gRPC transport decoding has removed "
"both the gRPC and protobuf envelopes."
msgstr ""
"Hunk protobuf 之后的原始字节属于内层协议。例如，只有在 gRPC 传输解码移除 "
"gRPC 与 protobuf 两层封装后，才开始解析 VLESS。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "HTTP/2 vs gRPC vs Inner Protocol"
msgstr "HTTP/2、gRPC 与内层协议"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Keep these boundaries explicit:"
msgstr "应明确区分以下边界："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "层"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "HTTP/2"
msgstr "HTTP/2"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "multiplexed HTTP transport, DATA frames, flow control"
msgstr "多路复用 HTTP 传输、DATA frame、流量控制"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "gRPC envelope"
msgstr "gRPC 封装"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "compressed flag + 32-bit message length"
msgstr "compressed flag + 32 位消息长度"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Hunk protobuf"
msgstr "Hunk protobuf"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "length-delimited field containing tunnel bytes"
msgstr "包含隧道字节的 length-delimited 字段"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "inner proxy protocol"
msgstr "内层代理协议"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "authentication, destination, TCP/UDP semantics"
msgstr "认证、目标地址、TCP/UDP 语义"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"An HTTP/2 DATA frame is not equivalent to one proxy packet, and one Hunk "
"message is not necessarily one application request."
msgstr ""
"一个 HTTP/2 DATA frame 不等价于一个代理报文，一条 Hunk 消息也不一定等价于一次"
"应用请求。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "The strongest current transport-level interoperability evidence is:"
msgstr "当前最强的传输级互操作证据是："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_server_app/tests/xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs` → "
"`xray_client_can_proxy_tcp_through_chimera_grpc`, which starts Xray as the "
"VLESS/gRPC client and Chimera as the server;"
msgstr ""
"`chimera_server_app/tests/xray_client_proxy_e2e.rs` → "
"`xray_client_can_proxy_tcp_through_chimera_grpc`，它会把 Xray 作为 VLESS/"
"gRPC 客户端、Chimera 作为服务端启动；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_server_lib/src/beginning/grpc_transport.rs` unit tests for Hunk "
"round-trip encoding and incomplete-frame buffering."
msgstr ""
"`chimera_server_lib/src/beginning/grpc_transport.rs` 中针对 Hunk 往返编码与不"
"完整帧缓冲的单元测试。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Do **not** use `grpc_all_interfaces_e2e.rs`, `grpc_external_integration.rs`, "
"or `grpc_xray_compat_e2e.rs` as evidence for this proxy transport. Those "
"files test the Server's Xray-compatible **management gRPC API**, which is a "
"different control-plane subsystem despite sharing the word “gRPC”."
msgstr ""
"**不要**把 `grpc_all_interfaces_e2e.rs`、`grpc_external_integration.rs` 或 "
"`grpc_xray_compat_e2e.rs` 当作该代理传输的证据。这些文件测试的是 Server 兼容 "
"Xray 的**管理 gRPC API**；虽然同样使用“gRPC”一词，但它属于不同的控制平面子系"
"统。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Chimera_Client Status"
msgstr "Chimera_Client 状态"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"The current `Chimera_Client` outbound transport tree does not contain a gRPC "
"transport implementation. Therefore a Server gRPC feature must not be "
"presented as a current Chimera Client → Chimera Server end-to-end "
"combination unless a different compatible client is used."
msgstr ""
"当前 `Chimera_Client` 出站传输树中没有 gRPC 传输实现。因此除非使用其他兼容客"
"户端，否则不能把 Server 的 gRPC feature 描述为当前 Chimera Client → Chimera "
"Server 的端到端组合。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Unlike [SOCKS5](../protocols/socks5.md), gRPC transport does not negotiate a "
"proxy user, encode a target address, or send a proxy success reply. It maps "
"inner protocol bytes to HTTP/2, gRPC, and Hunk envelopes and back. A "
"successful HTTP/gRPC response verifies transport setup only; the selected "
"[inner protocol](../protocol.md) can still reject authentication, flow mode, "
"or destination handling."
msgstr ""

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Prefer TLS or REALITY for Internet-facing gRPC transport; plain gRPC exposes "
"HTTP metadata and inner ciphertext/plaintext according to the inner protocol."
msgstr ""
"面向互联网的 gRPC 传输优先使用 TLS 或 REALITY；明文 gRPC 会暴露 HTTP 元数据，"
"并根据内层协议暴露相应密文/明文特征。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Keep TLS certificate validation and key material correct; `h2` ALPN is part "
"of the active Server TLS setup."
msgstr ""
"保持 TLS 证书验证与密钥材料正确；`h2` ALPN 是当前 Server TLS 配置的一部分。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"A valid gRPC path is not authentication by itself. Security still depends on "
"the configured outer security and inner proxy protocol."
msgstr ""
"有效的 gRPC path 本身并不构成认证；安全性仍取决于配置的外层安全机制和内层代理"
"协议。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Do not rely on parsed-but-unused timeout/window fields for resource-control "
"guarantees."
msgstr "不要依赖已解析但未使用的 timeout/window 字段来保证资源控制。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"Bound message sizes and reject compression unless the implementation "
"explicitly supports it; decompression support would add a separate resource-"
"abuse surface."
msgstr ""
"应限制消息大小，并在实现未明确支持压缩时拒绝压缩；解压支持会额外引入资源滥用"
"攻击面。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "Check layers in this order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序检查各层："

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "TCP reachability;"
msgstr "TCP 可达性；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "TLS or REALITY handshake if configured;"
msgstr "若已配置，则检查 TLS 或 REALITY 握手；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "HTTP/2 negotiation, especially `h2` ALPN for TLS;"
msgstr "HTTP/2 协商，尤其是 TLS 下的 `h2` ALPN；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "exact `POST /<serviceName>/Tun` path;"
msgstr "精确的 `POST /<serviceName>/Tun` 路径；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "`Content-Type: application/grpc`;"
msgstr "`Content-Type: application/grpc`；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "compressed flag `0` and gRPC message length;"
msgstr "compressed flag 为 `0` 以及 gRPC 消息长度；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "protobuf field 1 (`0x0a`) and varint length;"
msgstr "protobuf field 1（`0x0a`）及 varint 长度；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "inner proxy authentication/destination;"
msgstr "内层代理认证/目标地址；"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid "target connection."
msgstr "目标连接。"

#: src/transports/grpc-transport.md
msgid ""
"A `grpc-status: 12` response usually points to method/path/content-type "
"mismatch, while successful gRPC transport followed by no proxy traffic "
"points lower in the inner protocol stack."
msgstr ""
"`grpc-status: 12` 通常表示 method/path/content-type 不匹配；若 gRPC 传输成功"
