#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md
msgid "HTTPUpgrade Transport"
msgstr "HTTPUpgrade 传输"

#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"HTTPUpgrade is an HTTP/1.1 transport wrapper implemented by "
"`Chimera_Server`. It uses an HTTP Upgrade-looking handshake to switch from "
"an HTTP request/response exchange into a raw bidirectional byte stream for "
"an inner proxy protocol. This chapter owns the upgrade preface and resulting "
"stream, not inner proxy authentication/destination semantics (see [Proxy "
"Protocols](../protocol.md)) or outer TLS/REALITY settings (see [Transport "
"Security](../transport-security.md))."
msgstr ""
"HTTPUpgrade 是 `Chimera_Server` 实现的 HTTP/1.1 传输封装。它通过看起来像 "
"HTTP Upgrade 的握手，把 HTTP 请求/响应交换切换为供内层代理协议使用的原始双向"
"字节流。"

#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md
msgid ""
"Despite the current header value `Upgrade: websocket`, this implementation "
"is **not a WebSocket transport**: it does not perform the WebSocket key/"
"accept handshake and it does not add WebSocket data frames after the `101 "
"Switching Protocols` response."
msgstr ""
"虽然当前头部使用 `Upgrade: websocket`，但该实现**不是 WebSocket 传输**：它不"
"会执行 WebSocket key/accept 握手，也不会在 `101 Switching Protocols` 响应后添"
"加 WebSocket 数据帧。"

#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md
msgid ""
"The current `Chimera_Client` outbound transport tree does not contain a "
"matching HTTPUpgrade module, so this page primarily documents Server-side "
"behavior and compatibility boundaries."
msgstr ""
"当前 `Chimera_Client` 出站传输树中没有匹配的 HTTPUpgrade 模块，因此本页主要记"
"录 Server 侧行为和兼容性边界。"

#: src/transports/httpupgrade.md
msgid ""
"The HTTP exchange is therefore a transport preface. Once the upgrade "
"succeeds, subsequent bytes belong directly to the inner handler."
msgstr ""
"因此 HTTP 交换只是传输前导。一旦 upgrade 成功，后续字节就直接属于内层 "
"handler。"

