#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Handshake Internals and On-Wire Authentication"
msgstr "握手内部机制与线级认证"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"REALITY deliberately keeps its authentication inside a TLS-looking "
"ClientHello instead of adding a SOCKS-like method negotiation or a VLESS-"
"like plaintext identity header before TLS. This means the first bytes "
"visible to a passive observer are ordinary TLS record/handshake bytes; the "
"REALITY-specific credentials are embedded into fields of the generated "
"ClientHello and protected with keys derived for that handshake."
msgstr ""
"REALITY 有意把认证放在看起来像 TLS 的 ClientHello 内部，而不是在 TLS 之前加"
"入 SOCKS 风格的方法协商或 VLESS 风格的明文身份头。因此，被动观察者首先看到的"
"是普通 TLS record/handshake 字节；REALITY 专用凭据被嵌入生成的 ClientHello 字"
"段，并由该次握手派生出的密钥保护。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The current Xray-core client constructs a 32-byte ClientHello legacy Session "
"ID. Before protection, the first 16 bytes carry REALITY metadata with this "
"logical layout:"
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray-core 客户端会构造一个 32 字节的 ClientHello legacy Session ID。在保"
"护之前，前 16 字节按以下逻辑布局承载 REALITY 元数据："

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The remaining 16 bytes of the 32-byte Session ID are used by the AEAD "
"result. This is an implementation-level wire detail, not a new TLS "
"extension: REALITY reuses the TLS ClientHello Session ID field so that the "
"outer message still has the shape of a normal TLS handshake."
msgstr ""
"32 字节 Session ID 的后 16 字节由 AEAD 结果占用。这是实现层面的线格式细节，而"
"不是新的 TLS 扩展：REALITY 复用 TLS ClientHello 的 Session ID 字段，使外层消"
"息仍保持普通 TLS 握手的形态。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Key derivation"
msgstr "密钥派生"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The client already has the server REALITY public key. During construction of "
"the TLS 1.3 ClientHello it also owns the private side of its ephemeral key "
"share. Current Xray-core computes an X25519 ECDH result between that "
"ephemeral key and the configured REALITY public key, then expands it with "
"HKDF-SHA256 using:"
msgstr ""
"客户端已经持有服务端 REALITY 公共值。在构造 TLS 1.3 ClientHello 时，它同时持"
"有本次临时 key share 的私有部分。当前 Xray-core 会用该临时密钥与配置的 "
"REALITY 公共值执行 X25519 ECDH，然后按下列参数使用 HKDF-SHA256 扩展："

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"IKM  = ECDH(client ephemeral private key, REALITY server public key)\n"
"salt = ClientHello.random[0..20]\n"
"info = \"REALITY\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"IKM  = ECDH(客户端临时私钥, REALITY 服务端公共值)\n"
"salt = ClientHello.random[0..20]\n"
"info = \"REALITY\"\n"
"```"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The resulting authentication key is used with an AEAD cipher. Current code "
"uses the last 12 bytes of the ClientHello random (`random[20..32]`) as the "
"nonce and the serialized ClientHello as associated data while sealing the "
"first 16 bytes of REALITY Session-ID metadata. The protected 32-byte value "
"is then written back into the fixed Session ID location of the ClientHello."
msgstr ""
"得到的认证密钥会交给 AEAD 密码使用。当前代码以 ClientHello random 的后 12 字"
"节（`random[20..32]`）作为 nonce，并把序列化后的 ClientHello 作为 associated "
"data，对 REALITY Session-ID 元数据前 16 字节进行封装。最终得到的受保护 32 字"
"节值会写回 ClientHello 中固定的 Session ID 位置。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"This explains why REALITY authentication is bound to the concrete TLS "
"handshake: a copied Session ID is not an independently reusable password "
"token. The ClientHello random, ephemeral key share, serialized hello, server "
"key, timestamp, and short ID all participate directly or indirectly in "
"validation."
msgstr ""
"这解释了为什么 REALITY 认证绑定到具体 TLS 握手：复制得到的 Session ID 并不是"
"可独立复用的密码 token。ClientHello random、临时 key share、序列化 hello、服"
"务端密钥、时间戳和 short ID 都直接或间接参与验证。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Server-side decision path"
msgstr "服务端判定路径"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Conceptually the REALITY listener has to make a decision before handing the "
"connection to the proxy protocol:"
msgstr ""
"从概念上看，REALITY listener 必须先完成判定，之后才能把连接交给代理协议："

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"`serverNames` and short IDs are therefore authentication/selection inputs at "
"the REALITY layer. A VLESS UUID is checked later, by VLESS, after REALITY "
"has successfully produced the protected transport. Keeping these checks "
"separate is important when diagnosing failures."
msgstr ""
"因此，`serverNames` 与 short ID 是 REALITY 层的认证/选择输入。VLESS UUID 会"
"在 REALITY 成功建立受保护传输之后，再由 VLESS 层检查。诊断故障时必须把这些检"
"查分开看待。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Certificate result and client verification state machine"
msgstr "证书结果与客户端验证状态机"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The protected Session ID authenticates the ClientHello to the REALITY "
"server, but the client also has to authenticate the server-side REALITY "
"result. Current Xray does that through the certificate flight rather than by "
"expecting an ordinary CA-issued certificate for the REALITY endpoint."
msgstr ""
"受保护 Session ID 用于向 REALITY 服务端认证 ClientHello，但客户端也必须验证服"
"务端侧的 REALITY 结果。当前 Xray 通过证书握手阶段完成这一点，而不是要求 "
"REALITY 端点提供普通 CA 签发证书。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "The client can conceptually reach three certificate outcomes:"
msgstr "客户端在概念上可能得到三种证书结果："

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"In the current Xray client implementation, a REALITY temporary certificate "
"is recognized through an Ed25519 public key and an HMAC-SHA512 value derived "
"from the connection's REALITY `AuthKey`. When configured, `mldsa65Verify` "
"adds an ML-DSA-65 verification step tied to the handshake transcript before "
"the client sets its internal `Verified` flag. This certificate is therefore "
"bound to the same handshake-derived authentication material as the protected "
"ClientHello; it is not a reusable conventional server certificate."
msgstr ""
"在当前 Xray 客户端实现中，REALITY 临时证书通过其中的 Ed25519 公钥以及由该连"
"接 REALITY `AuthKey` 派生的 HMAC-SHA512 值来识别。配置 `mldsa65Verify` 后，客"
"户端还会在设置内部 `Verified` 标志之前执行与握手 transcript 绑定的 ML-DSA-65 "
"验证。因此，该证书与受保护 ClientHello 使用同一套握手派生认证材料绑定，并不是"
"可重复使用的传统服务端证书。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"If the certificate instead validates as the genuine target site's normal "
"X.509 certificate, the TLS certificate itself can be valid while REALITY "
"`Verified=false`. That state means the client reached the target/fallback "
"path (or was redirected there) rather than the authenticated proxy path. "
"Current REALITY documentation describes this as entering the crawler/spider "
"behavior. An invalid certificate that satisfies neither path terminates the "
"handshake."
msgstr ""
"如果证书验证结果反而是目标站点真实的普通 X.509 证书，那么 TLS 证书本身可能有"
"效，但 REALITY 仍然是 `Verified=false`。这表示客户端到达了 target/fallback 路"
"径（或被重定向到那里），而不是进入已认证代理路径。当前 REALITY 文档把该状态描"
"述为进入 crawler/spider 行为。若证书两条验证路径都无法通过，则终止握手。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"This three-way distinction is useful during packet-level debugging: \"valid "
"TLS certificate\" and \"valid REALITY connection\" are not equivalent states."
msgstr ""
"这种三分状态对抓包级调试很重要：“TLS 证书有效”和“REALITY 连接有效”不是同一个"
"状态。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Without TLS key material, a normal capture should look approximately like:"
msgstr "没有 TLS 密钥材料时，普通抓包大致会呈现为："

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"A packet capture cannot identify the VLESS UUID or VLESS destination merely "
"by seeing the REALITY ClientHello. Those values are inside the protected "
"transport and belong to the next protocol layer."
msgstr ""
"仅仅看到 REALITY ClientHello，抓包无法识别 VLESS UUID 或 VLESS 目标地址。这些"
"值位于受保护传输内部，属于下一层协议。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Do not assume one TCP segment contains one ClientHello. TLS handshake bytes "
"may span TCP segments, and newer fingerprints can produce larger ClientHello "
"messages. A server implementation must parse a byte stream and TLS lengths, "
"not depend on packet boundaries or a single `read()` call."
msgstr ""
"不要假设一个 TCP segment 就包含一个完整 ClientHello。TLS 握手字节可能跨越多"
"个 TCP segment，更新的 fingerprint 也可能生成更大的 ClientHello。服务端实现必"
"须依据字节流与 TLS 长度解析，不能依赖数据包边界或单次 `read()`。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "Security and Proxy Authentication Are Different"
msgstr "身份与认证"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"REALITY validates a TLS-like **security-layer** handshake: key relation, "
"short ID, server name, and other configured constraints. It does not carry a "
"proxy destination request or authenticate a VLESS UUID. A valid REALITY "
"session may still fail when the inner [proxy protocol](../protocol.md) "
"checks its own identity or target rules."
msgstr ""

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"For example, [SOCKS5](../protocols/socks5.md) negotiates a method and then a "
"destination request, whereas REALITY has no SOCKS-style reply or UDP "
"ASSOCIATE command. Proxy request framing remains in the inner protocol after "
"the secure transport is established."
msgstr ""

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Parser, Timing, and Boundary Conditions"
msgstr "解析、时序与边界条件"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Treat ClientHello as a length-delimited TLS handshake carried over a TCP "
"byte stream; never assume TCP packet boundaries are message boundaries."
msgstr ""
"应把 ClientHello 视为承载在 TCP 字节流上的长度限定 TLS 握手；绝不能把 TCP 数"
"据包边界当作消息边界。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Validate timestamp freshness with the implementation's accepted clock "
"window. `maxTimeDiff` is expressed in milliseconds; large client/server "
"clock skew can make otherwise correct key material fail when a non-zero "
"limit is enforced."
msgstr ""
"应按照实现接受的时钟窗口验证时间戳新鲜度。`maxTimeDiff` 单位为毫秒；启用非零"
"限制时，较大的客户端/服务端时钟偏差可能让本来正确的密钥材料验证失败。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The 8-byte short-ID slot is configured as hexadecimal text. Current Xray "
"accepts at most 16 hex characters, requires an even number of characters, "
"and pads shorter values with trailing zero bytes. An empty client short ID "
"is only valid when the server explicitly accepts an empty entry."
msgstr ""
"8 字节 short-ID 槽位以十六进制文本配置。当前 Xray 最多接受 16 个十六进制字"
"符，字符数必须为偶数，较短值会在末尾补零字节。只有服务端显式接受空条目时，客"
"户端 short ID 才可以为空。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"`minClientVer` and `maxClientVer`, when configured, add version checks to "
"the REALITY authentication decision. They are separate from the inner VLESS "
"protocol version byte."
msgstr ""
"配置 `minClientVer` 和 `maxClientVer` 后，REALITY 认证判定会额外检查客户端版"
"本。它们与内层 VLESS 协议版本字节是彼此独立的概念。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"A fingerprint must provide a TLS 1.3-capable key share. Current Xray-core "
"rejects fingerprints that cannot supply the required ephemeral ECDH material."
msgstr ""
"fingerprint 必须能提供支持 TLS 1.3 的 key share。当前 Xray-core 会拒绝无法提"
"供所需临时 ECDH 材料的 fingerprint。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Authentication failure and target fallback are not equivalent to successful "
"proxy authentication. Seeing the target site's genuine certificate is a "
"strong clue that the connection did not enter the authenticated REALITY path."
msgstr ""
"认证失败并进入 target fallback 与代理认证成功不是同一件事。看到目标站点真实证"
"书，是连接没有进入已认证 REALITY 路径的重要线索。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"A server can accept a no-SNI ClientHello by including an empty string in "
"`serverNames`. Current Xray's client-side configuration uses a valid IP "
"string as the `serverName` placeholder to request this mode; packet analysis "
"should therefore not assume an SNI extension is always present."
msgstr ""
"服务端可在 `serverNames` 中加入空字符串，从而接受无 SNI 的 ClientHello。当前 "
"Xray 客户端配置使用一个有效 IP 字符串作为 `serverName` 占位值来请求这种模式，"
"因此抓包分析不能假设 SNI 扩展一定存在。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The TLS/uTLS implementation, REALITY implementation, target behavior, and "
"peer version form one interoperability surface. Changes to ClientHello "
"construction or the target site's TLS behavior can affect REALITY even when "
"VLESS configuration is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"TLS/uTLS 实现、REALITY 实现、target 行为以及对端版本共同构成一个互操作面。即"
"使 VLESS 配置没有变化，ClientHello 构造方式或目标站 TLS 行为的变化也可能影响 "
"REALITY。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Post-quantum additions in current Xray"
msgstr "当前 Xray 的后量子扩展"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray can use the hybrid `X25519MLKEM768` TLS key-exchange group when "
"the selected target supports it. This belongs to the TLS key-exchange "
"portion of the REALITY handshake and is negotiated based on current client/"
"target capability; it does not add a SOCKS-like command or a new proxy "
"destination field."
msgstr ""
"当所选 target 支持时，当前 Xray 可以使用混合 `X25519MLKEM768` TLS 密钥交换"
"组。这属于 REALITY 握手中的 TLS 密钥交换部分，会根据客户端/target 当前能力协"
"商；它不会增加 SOCKS 风格命令，也不会增加新的代理目标字段。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Separately, `mldsa65Seed` on the server and `mldsa65Verify` on the client "
"add an ML-DSA-65 signature check to the temporary REALITY certificate. "
"Because the post-quantum signature enlarges that certificate, the official "
"configuration guidance warns that the selected target should itself return a "
"sufficiently large certificate so the REALITY certificate flight does not "
"become an obvious size fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"另外，服务端 `mldsa65Seed` 与客户端 `mldsa65Verify` 会为 REALITY 临时证书增"
"加 ML-DSA-65 签名检查。由于后量子签名会增大该证书，官方配置说明特别提醒：所"
"选 target 自身也应返回足够大的证书，避免 REALITY 证书握手因为尺寸差异形成明显"
"指纹。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"These are optional hardening/interoperability features. A parser or "
"diagnostic tool should report whether hybrid key exchange and ML-DSA "
"verification were actually negotiated rather than assuming their presence "
"from the word \"REALITY\" alone."
msgstr ""
"这些都是可选的加固/互操作功能。解析器或诊断工具应报告混合密钥交换与 ML-DSA 验"
"证是否实际启用或协商，而不能仅凭“REALITY”这个名称就假定它们一定存在。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Key Material"
msgstr "密钥材料"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"REALITY uses an X25519 server private key and the corresponding public value "
"on the client. Current Xray names that client field `password`; `publicKey` "
"is the older alias. The rename is operationally important: although the "
"value is an X25519 public key mathematically, REALITY treats it as client-"
"held connection credential material rather than as something to publish "
"indiscriminately."
msgstr ""
"REALITY 使用服务端 X25519 私钥以及客户端对应的公共值。当前 Xray 把客户端字段"
"命名为 `password`，`publicKey` 是旧别名。这个改名在运维上很重要：虽然该值在数"
"学上确实是 X25519 公钥，但 REALITY 把它视为客户端持有的连接凭据材料，而不是应"
"当随意公开的信息。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Do not place a server private key in client profiles, screenshots, issue "
"reports, or public documentation examples. Treat the client `password` value "
"as sensitive deployment material as well, even though it is derived from the "
"server's public key."
msgstr ""
"不要把服务端私钥放进客户端配置、截图、Issue 报告或公开文档示例。客户端 "
"`password` 值即使源自服务端公钥，也应作为敏感部署材料处理。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"For Chimera_Server, the current Wiki documents an `x25519` helper in "
"`chimera_cli` for generating compatible key material."
msgstr ""
"对于 Chimera_Server，当前 Wiki 记录了 `chimera_cli` 中的 `x25519` 辅助命令，"
"可用于生成兼容密钥材料。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Short IDs"
msgstr "Short ID"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Short IDs add another server-validated value to REALITY sessions. A server "
"can accept one or more values, while a client selects a matching value."
msgstr ""
"Short ID 为 REALITY 会话增加了一个由服务端验证的值。服务端可以接受一个或多个"
"值，客户端选择其中匹配的一项。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"At the current Xray configuration boundary a short ID is 0 to 8 bytes, "
"encoded as 0 to 16 hexadecimal characters. Its textual length must be even; "
"shorter values are padded with zero bytes to fill the 8-byte Session-ID "
"metadata slot. This is why a value such as `aa1234` is valid while an odd-"
"length hexadecimal string is rejected."
msgstr ""
"在当前 Xray 配置边界上，short ID 为 0 到 8 字节，以 0 到 16 个十六进制字符编"
"码。文本长度必须为偶数；较短值会用零字节补足 8 字节 Session-ID 元数据槽位。因"
"此 `aa1234` 这类值有效，而奇数长度的十六进制字符串会被拒绝。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Treat short IDs as configuration/security material rather than decorative "
"labels. Client and server must use compatible values and formatting."
msgstr ""
"应把 short ID 视为配置/安全材料，而不是装饰性标签。客户端和服务端必须使用兼容"
"的值和格式。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Target and Server Names"
msgstr "Target 与 Server Name"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The server-side `target` identifies the service whose TLS-facing behavior is "
"used as part of the REALITY design and also receives traffic that does not "
"pass REALITY authentication in the current Xray model."
msgstr ""
"服务端 `target` 指定一个服务，其面向 TLS 的行为会被 REALITY 设计利用；在当前 "
"Xray 模型中，未通过 REALITY 认证的流量也会被发送到该 target。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "`serverNames` restrict which client server-name values are accepted."
msgstr "`serverNames` 限制客户端可以使用哪些 server-name 值。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "A practical target should:"
msgstr "实际使用的 target 应当："

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "be reachable reliably from the server,"
msgstr "能够被服务端稳定访问；"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "provide a TLS behavior compatible with the intended setup,"
msgstr "提供与预期部署兼容的 TLS 行为；"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "not expose sensitive internal infrastructure,"
msgstr "不能暴露敏感内部基础设施；"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "and not create an undesirable open-forwarding path."
msgstr "并且不能形成不希望出现的开放转发路径。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Current Xray documentation explicitly warns that a poorly chosen target can "
"turn the REALITY server into an unintended forwarder for traffic that fails "
"authentication. Current releases provide optional `limitFallbackUpload` and "
"`limitFallbackDownload` token-bucket controls for unauthenticated fallback "
"traffic, but the official guidance also notes that deterministic fallback "
"rate limits can themselves become a fingerprint. They are an abuse-control "
"tradeoff, not part of REALITY authentication."
msgstr ""
"当前 Xray 文档明确警告：选择不当的 target 可能让 REALITY 服务端变成未预期的认"
"证失败流量转发器。当前版本提供可选的 `limitFallbackUpload` 和 "
"`limitFallbackDownload` 令牌桶控制来限制未认证 fallback 流量，但官方说明也指"
"出，确定性的 fallback 限速本身可能形成指纹。这属于滥用控制上的权衡，而不是 "
"REALITY 认证的一部分。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "\"raw\""
msgstr "\"raw\""

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The example is intentionally minimal. Use real generated key material and a "
"server/target combination appropriate for the deployment."
msgstr ""
"该示例有意保持最小化。实际部署应使用真实生成的密钥材料，以及适合当前环境的 "
"server/target 组合。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "reality-example"
msgstr "reality-example"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "tcp"
msgstr "tcp"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "reality-opts"
msgstr "reality-opts"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "public-key"
msgstr "public-key"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "CLIENT-PUBLIC-KEY"
msgstr "CLIENT-PUBLIC-KEY"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "short-id"
msgstr "short-id"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "0123456789abcdef"
msgstr "0123456789abcdef"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Clash-family names are not the same as native Xray JSON field names. The "
"selected core's schema is authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Clash 系字段名称与原生 Xray JSON 字段名称并不相同。应以当前所选核心的 schema "
"为准。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "REALITY vs TLS"
msgstr "REALITY 与 TLS"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Both REALITY and ordinary TLS occupy the transport-security layer, but their "
"operational models differ."
msgstr "REALITY 和普通 TLS 都位于传输安全层，但两者的运行模型不同。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Ordinary TLS"
msgstr "普通 TLS"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Uses a certificate chain presented by the server."
msgstr "使用服务端提供的证书链。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Normally requires certificate issuance/renewal."
msgstr "通常需要证书签发与续期。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Client trust follows normal TLS certificate verification."
msgstr "客户端信任关系遵循普通 TLS 证书验证。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Uses REALITY key material and target-site handshake behavior."
msgstr "使用 REALITY 密钥材料和目标站点握手行为。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Does not use the deployment's own conventional public certificate in the "
"same way as a normal TLS server."
msgstr "不像普通 TLS 服务端那样直接使用部署自身的常规公有证书。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Relies on client/server REALITY compatibility and correct fingerprint/target "
"behavior."
msgstr "依赖客户端/服务端 REALITY 兼容性以及正确的 fingerprint/target 行为。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Do not describe REALITY simply as \"TLS without a certificate\"; that hides "
"the key validation, target forwarding, and implementation-specific handshake "
"logic that actually define the deployment."
msgstr ""
"不要简单把 REALITY 描述成“没有证书的 TLS”；这种说法会掩盖真正决定部署行为的密"
"钥验证、target 转发以及实现特定握手逻辑。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Avoids operating a conventional certificate for the REALITY endpoint itself."
msgstr "REALITY 端点本身无需按普通方式维护常规证书。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Integrates with Xray's supported proxy and transport combinations."
msgstr "可以与 Xray 支持的代理协议和传输组合集成。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Unauthenticated traffic can follow a normal target-service path instead of a "
"bespoke proxy response."
msgstr "未认证流量可以进入普通 target 服务路径，而不是得到专用代理响应。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Commonly paired with VLESS and XTLS Vision in modern Xray deployments."
msgstr "现代 Xray 部署中经常与 VLESS 和 XTLS Vision 配合使用。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Primarily an Xray-ecosystem mechanism rather than a general Internet "
"standard."
msgstr "它主要是 Xray 生态机制，而不是通用 Internet 标准。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Client fingerprint and server target behavior must be compatible."
msgstr "客户端 fingerprint 与服务端 target 行为必须兼容。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "A bad target choice can create reliability or abuse problems."
msgstr "错误的 target 选择可能造成可靠性或滥用问题。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Configuration has more moving parts than normal certificate-based TLS."
msgstr "相比普通基于证书的 TLS，配置涉及更多相互关联的部分。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Transport support is constrained by the selected Xray/core version."
msgstr "可用传输方式受所选 Xray/核心版本限制。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Never expose the REALITY server private key."
msgstr "绝不要暴露 REALITY 服务端私钥。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Keep public/private key pairs synchronized during rotation."
msgstr "轮换密钥时保持公私钥对同步。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Use controlled short IDs and remove values no longer needed."
msgstr "使用受控的 short ID，并删除已经不再需要的值。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Do not set a sensitive private endpoint as the fallback target."
msgstr "不要把敏感私有端点设为 fallback target。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Treat `allowInsecure`/certificate-style bypass options in surrounding "
"transports as debugging tools, not production defaults."
msgstr ""
"周边传输中的 `allowInsecure`/证书绕过类选项应被视为调试工具，而不是生产默认配"
"置。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Keep client fingerprint selection realistic and supported by the actual core."
msgstr "客户端 fingerprint 应选择真实合理、且由实际核心支持的值。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The current client overview lists **Reality + TCP** as a supported "
"combination. In current upstream Xray terminology, the corresponding base "
"transport is often called `RAW`; Clash-family configurations may still "
"expose it as `tcp`. This is a naming difference that should be accounted for "
"when translating profiles."
msgstr ""
"当前客户端总览把 **Reality + TCP** 列为受支持组合。在当前上游 Xray 术语中，对"
"应基础传输通常称为 `RAW`；Clash 系配置仍可能把它暴露为 `tcp`。转换配置时需要"
"考虑这种命名差异。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The exact supported proxy protocol underneath REALITY should be verified in "
"the current `Chimera_Client` implementation instead of assuming complete "
"Xray compatibility from the transport alone."
msgstr ""
"REALITY 下层实际支持哪些代理协议，应以当前 `Chimera_Client` 实现为准，而不能"
"仅凭传输层就假定完全兼容 Xray。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Chimera manages the profile and selected core. REALITY key/fingerprint "
"fields must be emitted in the schema expected by that core."
msgstr ""
"Chimera 负责管理配置文件和所选核心。REALITY 密钥/fingerprint 字段必须按该核心"
"所期望的 schema 生成。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"The server documentation includes a VLESS + REALITY example and an X25519 "
"key helper. This makes REALITY an important server target, but transport "
"combinations and Xray-version compatibility should still be tested "
"explicitly."
msgstr ""
"服务端文档包含 VLESS + REALITY 示例和 X25519 密钥辅助工具，说明 REALITY 是重"
"要服务端目标；但传输组合与 Xray 版本兼容性仍应显式测试。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Immediate handshake failure"
msgstr "握手立即失败"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Verify server public/private key pairing."
msgstr "检查服务端公私钥是否正确配对。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Check the short ID."
msgstr "检查 short ID。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Verify the client server name is permitted by `serverNames`."
msgstr "确认客户端 server name 被 `serverNames` 允许。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Confirm the target is reachable from the server."
msgstr "确认服务端能够访问 target。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Check client fingerprint support."
msgstr "检查客户端 fingerprint 支持情况。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Target site works but proxy does not"
msgstr "Target 站点正常但代理不可用"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"This often means the public listener and fallback path are reachable while "
"the REALITY authentication path is failing. Re-check keys, short ID, server "
"name, proxy user identity, and transport method."
msgstr ""
"这通常表示公网监听器和 fallback 路径可达，但 REALITY 认证路径失败。应重新检查"
"密钥、short ID、server name、代理用户身份以及传输方式。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Works in Xray but not another core"
msgstr "在 Xray 中可用但其他核心不可用"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Compare accepted field names."
msgstr "比较实际接受的字段名称。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Confirm the core supports the same proxy + transport + REALITY combination."
msgstr "确认核心支持相同的代理协议 + 传输方式 + REALITY 组合。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid "Check whether `tcp` and `raw` are translated correctly."
msgstr "检查 `tcp` 与 `raw` 是否被正确转换。"

#: src/transport-security/reality.md
msgid ""
"Remove optional Vision/XMUX/XHTTP tuning until the base handshake works."
msgstr "在基础握手正常前，先移除可选 Vision/XMUX/XHTTP 调优。"

